"You suffer from a respiratory disorder that makes breathing difficult.\n"
"An asthma attack can occur from time to time, so have your inhaler nearby."
msgstr ""
"Cierpisz na schorzenie układu oddechowego, które utrudnia oddychanie.\n"
"Od czasu do czasu może ci się przydarzyć atak astmy, więc miej w pobliżu "
"inhalator."

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Asthma, Heavy Asthma"
msgid "You can't breathe… asthma attack!"
msgstr "Nie możesz oddychać… atak astmy!"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Asthma, Heavy Asthma"
msgid "You're winded."
msgstr "Brak ci tchu."

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "crushed"
msgid "The ceiling collapses on you!"
msgstr "Dach zapada się na ciebie!"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Blood analysis description of effect type "valium"
msgid "Benzodiazepines"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "took_anticonvulsant_visible"
msgid "Took Anticonvulsant Drugs"
msgstr "Zażyty lek przeciw konwulsjom"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Took Anticonvulsant Drugs"
msgid ""
"You took anticonvulsant drugs some time ago and you might still be under its "
"influence.\n"
"Prescription note says its effect duration may vary, so your estimate may be "
"inaccurate."
msgstr ""
"Zażyto leki przeciw konwulsjom jakiś czas temu i możesz być nadal pod ich "
"wpływem.\n"
"Ulotka mówiła, że czas działania może być zmienny, więc twoja ocena może być "
"nieprecyzyjna."

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Blood analysis description of effect type "Took Anticonvulsant Drugs"
msgid "Anticonvulsants"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "relax_gas"
msgid "Relaxation Gas"
msgstr "Gaz rozweselający"

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Relaxation Gas"
msgid ""
"You are thoroughly relaxed and don't feel like moving.  Fighting?  Too much "
"effort."
msgstr ""
"Jesteś na wskroś zrelaksowany i nie masz ochoty się ruszać. Walczyć? Za dużo "
"zachodu."

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Relaxation Gas"
msgid "You inhale sweetish gas."
msgstr "Wdychasz słodkawy gaz."

#: data/json/effects.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Relaxation Gas"
msgid "The slackness leaves your muscles."
msgstr "Ospałość opuszcza twe mięśnie."

