msgstr[2] "KMB-ów Augmentacja mięśni"
msgstr[3] "KMB-a Augmentacja mięśni"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Muscle Augmentation CBM"
msgid ""
"A set of myomer fibers that enhance the user's muscular system, granting a +2 "
"bonus to strength."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Autonomous Surgical Scalpels CBM"
msgid_plural "Autonomous Surgical Scalpels CBMs"
msgstr[0] "KMB Autonomiczne skalpele chirurgiczne"
msgstr[1] "KMB-y Autonomiczne skalpele chirurgiczne"
msgstr[2] "KMB-ów Autonomiczne skalpele chirurgiczne"
msgstr[3] "KMB-a Autonomiczne skalpele chirurgiczne"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Autonomous Surgical Scalpels CBM"
msgid ""
"A system of surgical-grade scalpels that is implanted in the user's fingers.  "
"They allow for automated precise cuts and can be used as a high-quality "
"butchering tool."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Anti-Glare Compensators CBM"
msgid_plural "Anti-Glare Compensators CBMs"
msgstr[0] "KMB Kompensatory blasku"
msgstr[1] "KMB-y Kompensatory blasku"
msgstr[2] "KMB-ów Kompensatory blasku"
msgstr[3] "KMB-a Kompensatory blasku"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Anti-Glare Compensators CBM"
msgid ""
"A set of quick-reacting transition lenses that are installed over the user's "
"eyes.  They negate glare penalties, partially protect from bright flashes, "
"and protect the eyes when welding."
msgstr ""
"Zestaw chirurgicznie wszczepianych nad oczami użytkownika fotochromowych "
"soczewek ochronnych szybkiego reagowania, które negują efekty oślepienia i "
"częściowo chronią przed jasnymi rozbłyskami światła, a także chronią oczy "
"podczas spawania."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Synthetic Lungs CBM"
msgid_plural "Synthetic Lungs CBMs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Synthetic Lungs CBM"
msgid ""
"Highly efficient synthetic lungs which replace the user's own.  After "
"installation the user's cardio fitness will be greatly increased and will not "
"need regular exercise to maintain but the user will need continuous power to "
"remain breathing.  Further, they will weaken the user's immune system "
"somewhat."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Targeting System CBM"
msgid_plural "Targeting System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "KMB System celowniczy"
msgstr[1] "KMB-y System celowniczy"
msgstr[2] "KMB-ów System celowniczy"
msgstr[3] "KMB-a System celowniczy"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Targeting System CBM"
msgid ""
"A bionic module that contains rangefinders and synchronizes the movement of "
"the user's eyes with their arms, to a degree.  Shots they fire will be much "
"more accurate, particularly at long ranges."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Super Stun Gun CBM"
msgid_plural "Super Stun Gun CBMs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Super Stun Gun CBM"
msgid ""
"A bionic stun gun which implants into the hand.  It is highly powerful, able "
"to easily cause electrical burns and cardiac arrest in targets.  The "
"electricity it generates arcs through the air over short distances, making it "
"nearly impossible to miss, but it still requires the user to be nearly "
"adjacent to their target."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Teleportation Unit CBM"
msgid_plural "Teleportation Unit CBMs"
msgstr[0] "KMB Moduł teleportacji"
msgstr[1] "KMB-y Moduł teleportacji"
msgstr[2] "KMB-ów Moduł teleportacji"
msgstr[3] "KMB-a Moduł teleportacji"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Teleportation Unit CBM"
msgid ""
"A highly experimental unit that folds space over short distances, instantly "
"transporting the user's body up to 25 feet in a random direction at the cost "
"of much power.  Note that prolonged or frequent use may have dangerous side "
"effects."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Time Dilation CBM"
msgid_plural "Time Dilation CBMs"
msgstr[0] "KMB Rozciągacz czasu"
msgstr[1] "KMB-y Rozciągacz czasu"
msgstr[2] "KMB-ów Rozciągacz czasu"
msgstr[3] "KMB-a Rozciągacz czasu"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Time Dilation CBM"
msgid ""
"At the cost of all stored bionic power, the user may increase their body "
"speed and reactions dramatically, essentially freezing time.  Violent or "
"rapid movements may cause damage due to friction."
msgstr ""
"Kosztem poboru całej zmagazynowanej energii, użytkownik może drastycznie "
"zwiększyć prędkość swego ciała i reakcji, niejako wstrzymując upływ czasu. "
"Nagłe gwałtowne ruchy mogą spowodować obrażenia z uwagi na tarcie."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Integrated Multitool CBM"
msgid_plural "Integrated Multitool CBMs"
msgstr[0] "KMB Zintegrowane narzędzie wielofunkcyjne"
msgstr[1] "KMB-y Zintegrowane narzędzie wielofunkcyjne"
msgstr[2] "KMB-ów Zintegrowane narzędzie wielofunkcyjne"
msgstr[3] "KMB-a Zintegrowane narzędzie wielofunkcyjne"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Integrated Multitool CBM"
msgid ""
"A surgically-implanted set of compact tools and a welder which runs off the "
"user's power banks.  Includes screwdriving heads, a multi-purpose knife, a "
"low-power impact wrench and a nail prying tool."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Integrated Multimeter CBM"
msgid_plural "Integrated Multimeter CBMs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Integrated Multimeter CBM"
msgid ""
"A set of electrical leads to be embedded in the user's fingers, connected to "
"a multimeter unit in their hand.  Allows the user to measure voltage, "
"resistance, and current using their fingertips, and provides slight "
"protection against electric shocks."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Integrated Circuitry Toolset CBM"
msgid_plural "Integrated Circuitry Toolset CBMs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Integrated Circuitry Toolset CBM"
msgid ""
"A soldering iron, multimeter, and set of fine screwdrivers implanted in the "
"user's hands.  Contains all the tools required for manipulating bench-scale "
"electrical circuits, and provides slight protection against electric shocks."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Joint Torsion Ratchet CBM"
msgid_plural "Joint Torsion Ratchet CBMs"
msgstr[0] "KMB Przekładnia zębata"
msgstr[1] "KMB-y Przekładnia zębata"
msgstr[2] "KMB-ów Przekładnia zębata"
msgstr[3] "KMB-a Przekładnia zębata"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Joint Torsion Ratchet CBM"
msgid ""
"A set of torsion ratchets that replace the user's joints to slowly generate "
"power when they move.  These can be toggled to generate more power, but "
"movement will require more effort."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Joint Servo CBM"
msgid_plural "Joint Servo CBMs"
msgstr[0] "KMB Serwo-stawy"
msgstr[1] "KMB-y Serwo-stawy"
msgstr[2] "KMB-ów Serwo-stawy"
msgstr[3] "KMB-a Serwo-stawy"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Joint Servo CBM"
msgid ""
"A set of servomotors installed on the leg joints to provide power-assisted "
"movement.  They are optimized for running, but walking also requires less "
"effort while this bionic is active.  However, when it's offline it will "
"hamper the user's movement."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Uncanny Dodge CBM"
msgid_plural "Uncanny Dodge CBMs"
msgstr[0] "KMB Niesamowity unik"
msgstr[1] "KMB-y Niesamowity unik"
msgstr[2] "KMB-ów Niesamowity unik"
msgstr[3] "KMB-a Niesamowity unik"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "Uncanny Dodge CBM"
msgid ""
"A set of bionic processors that augment the user's nervous system, allowing "
"them to dodge attacks beyond normal human capability."
msgstr ""

