msgstr[1] "pirackie strzelby dźwigniowe"
msgstr[2] "pirackich strzelb dźwigniowych"
msgstr[3] "pirackiej strzelby dźwigniowej"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Description of gun "bootleg lever-action shotgun"
#. ~ Description of "bootleg lever-action shotgun"
msgid ""
"A lever-action shotgun with a very short barrel and no stock, with room for 6 "
"rounds of 12 gauge shotshells.  Likely a bootlegged replica of a pre-1900 "
"firearm, it would pair nicely with a motorcycle jacket and a Harley Davidson, "
"and seems ready to terminate your cataclysmic adversaries."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "bootleg lever-action shotgun"
#. ~ Variant name of item "bootleg lever-action shotgun"
msgid "1887 bootleg shotgun"
msgid_plural "1887 bootleg shotguns"
msgstr[0] "piracka strzelba 1887"
msgstr[1] "pirackie strzelby 1887"
msgstr[2] "pirackich strzelb 1887"
msgstr[3] "pirackiej strzelby 1887"

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#. ~ Description of variant "bootleg lever-action shotgun" of gun "1887
#. bootleg shotgun"
#. ~ Description of variant "1887 bootleg shotgun" of item "bootleg lever-
#. action shotgun"
msgid ""
"One of the first commercially successful repeating shotguns, the Winchester "
"1887 was specifically made lever-action at Winchester's request.  Though "
"later overshadowed in success by pump designs, the 1887 remains popular "
"today.  This one has a very short barrel, no stock, and would pair nicely "
"with a motorcycle jacket and a Harley Davidson."
msgstr ""
"Jedna z pierwszych strzelb powtarzalnych, która odniosła sukces komercyjny. "
"Winchester 1887 został specjalnie wyprodukowany na życzenie Winchestera jako "
"broń o mechanizmie dźwigniowym. Choć później został przyćmiony przez systemy "
"typu pump action, 1887 pozostaje popularny do dziś. Ten egzemplarz ma bardzo "
"krótką lufę, nie ma kolby i świetnie komponuje się z kurtką motocyklową i "
"Harleyem Davidsonem."

#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/old_guns.json
