#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "hanging roper"
msgid ""
"What looks to be a loose mass of worm-like appendages reveals a solid body "
"beneath, a great maw of rows of serrated fangs taking up most of the body.  "
"It is either very lethargic or stalking prey, sitting in place without much "
"obvious motion."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "carrion grub"
msgid_plural "carrion grubs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "carrion grub"
msgid ""
"A wriggling brown grub of unnatural origin, slithering along the ground and "
"unnaturally pulsating.  As it moves along, it chews through any available "
"flesh with surprising speed."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "spearfisher"
msgid_plural "spearfishers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "spearfisher"
msgid ""
"A strange quadrupedal creature with long, lanky limbs and a gaping maw.  A "
"long sharp spike protrudes from it's back, which occasionally launches from "
"its' joint to stab prey before slinking back in."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "strange leech"
msgid_plural "strange leeches"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "strange leech"
msgid ""
"A very wet, snake-like creature which you estimate to be five feet long, "
"covered in slime and slithering about.  Occasionally, it will attach itself "
"to the flesh around it and begins to suck."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "eldritch huntsman"
msgid_plural "eldritch huntsmen"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "eldritch huntsman"
msgid ""
"Tall, partially armored, barely humanoid creature with a long appendage "
"growing out of its side.  Flexible spearlike rods protrude throughout its "
"body, seemingly holstered under the skin.  It feverishly darts and scouts the "
"surroundings, looking to rip its victims apart."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "eldritch huntsman"
msgid "huntsman's appendage hurls a sharp outgrowth out of its body!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Targeting sound of special attack of monster "eldritch huntsman"
msgid "rapid clicking, increasing in pitch!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ No ammo sound of special attack of monster "eldritch huntsman"
msgid "slow clicking."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "nether fish symbiote"
msgid_plural "nether fish symbiotes"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "nether fish symbiote"
msgid ""
"A small fish symbiote that resembles a deformed, eyeless piranha.  It swims "
"blindly in the yellow ichor, wriggling incessantly with malicious intent."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "veiled butterfly"
msgid_plural "veiled butterflies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "veiled butterfly"
msgid ""
"There is barely anything there, but you do notice hints of a faint, "
"translucent veiled creature that you can only describe as butterfly-like.  "
"While strangely alluring, it seems unsuited to the atmosphere and is slowly "
"falling apart."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "veiled butterfly"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s fades away into nothingness."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "writhing root"
msgid_plural "writhing roots"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "writhing root"
msgid ""
"A small chunk of curious looking roots, constantly trying to grow and expand "
"but failing miserably.  It has grown weak, as if incompatible with the very "
"soil it is in."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "eldritch stomper"
msgid_plural "eldritch stompers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "eldritch stomper"
msgid ""
"Mostly covered in wet-looking, long strands that remind you firmly of hair, "
"this abomination has a single but very pronounced leg.  It keeps its balance "
"with its odd hair on the rear.  Yet it seems to shrivel and die with each "
"gust of wind it is hit with."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "strange bug"
msgid_plural "strange bugs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "strange bug"
msgid ""
"This small, three legged bug-like creature curiously wriggles its 5 antennae. "
" Its body somewhat reminds you of a stink bug.  It looks like a fish out of "
"water and is getting weaker by the minute."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
