#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "artisan_docs"
msgid ""
"A collection of sketches and CAD designs marked up with a pencil.  They "
"depict a classic rifle and several diagrams of curved wooden maces.  The word "
"'OBREZ?' is written clearly on the front sheet.  There are two distinct sets "
"of handwriting making notes."
msgstr ""
"Zbiór szkiców i projektów CAD narysowanych ołówkiem. Przedstawiają klasyczny "
"karabin i kilka schematów zakrzywionych drewnianych maczug. Słowo „OBREZ?” "
"jest wyraźnie napisane na pierwszej stronie. Istnieją dwa odrębne zestawy "
"pisma odręcznego robiącego notatki."

#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "artisan_docs"
msgid ""
"A collection of sketches and CAD designs marked up with a pencil.  They "
"depict a large mace with an internal gas reservoir and venting holes between "
"the steel segments.  There are additional diagrams labeled 'IGNITION SYSTEM' "
"and 'TRIGGER?'.  There are two distinct sets of handwriting making notes."
msgstr ""
"Zbiór szkiców i projektów CAD narysowanych ołówkiem. Przedstawiają one dużą "
"maczugę z wewnętrznym zbiornikiem gazu i otworami wentylacyjnymi pomiędzy "
"stalowymi segmentami. Są też dodatkowe schematy oznaczone jako „UKŁAD "
"ZAPŁONOWY” i „SPUST?”. Istnieją dwa odrębne zestawy pisma odręcznego "
"robiącego notatki."

#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "artisan_docs"
msgid ""
"A collection of sketches and CAD designs marked up with a pencil.  They "
"depict a bladed weapon with some audio equipment implanted.  Doodles of hair "
"metal rock stars line the page, as well as the words 'LETS, HEAR IT FOR "
"FRANKY'.  There are two distinct sets of handwriting making notes."
msgstr ""
"Zbiór szkiców i projektów CAD narysowanych ołówkiem. Przedstawiają one broń z "
"ostrzem i wszczepionym sprzętem audio. Na stronie widnieją bazgroły gwiazd "
"hair metalowych, a także słowa „NIECH FRANKY TO USŁYSZY”. Istnieją dwa "
"odrębne zestawy pisma odręcznego robiącego notatki."

#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "artisan_docs"
msgid ""
"A collection of sketches and CAD designs marked up with a pencil.  They "
"depict a sledgehammer with a moving center.  There is a references doc for a "
"powder actuated nail gun stapled to the sheets.  There are two distinct sets "
"of handwriting making notes."
msgstr ""
"Zbiór szkiców i projektów CAD narysowanych ołówkiem. Przedstawiają one młot "
"kowalski z ruchomym środkiem. Do arkuszy dołączony jest dokument referencyjny "
"dla pistoletu na gwoździe z napędem proszkowym. Istnieją dwa odrębne zestawy "
"pisma odręcznego robiącego notatek."

#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "comest_stimulant"
msgid "The shadows are getting ever closer."
msgstr "Cienie są nawet bliżej niż wcześniej."

#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "comest_stimulant"
msgid "You have a bad feeling about this."
msgstr "Masz złe przeczucia."

#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "comest_stimulant"
msgid "A powerful sense of dread comes over you."
msgstr "Silne uczucie strachu ogarnia cię."

#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "comest_stimulant"
msgid "Your skin starts crawling."
msgstr "Masz gęsią skórkę."

#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "comest_stimulant"
msgid "They're coming to get you."
msgstr "Idą po ciebie."

#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "comest_stimulant"
msgid "This might've been a bad idea…"
msgstr "To był zły pomysł…"

#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "comest_stimulant"
msgid "You've really done it this time, haven't you?"
msgstr "Tym razem nawaliłeś na całego, czyż nie?"

#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "comest_stimulant"
msgid "You have to stay vigilant.  They're always watching…"
msgstr "Musisz być czujny. Oni zawsze obserwują…"

#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "comest_stimulant"
msgid "mistake mistake mistake mistake mistake"
msgstr "to błąd to błąd to błąd to błąd to błąd"

#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "comest_stimulant"
msgid "Just gotta stay calm, and you'll make it through this."
msgstr "Tylko spokojnie, a przebrniesz przez to."

#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "comest_stimulant"
msgid "You're starting to feel very jumpy."
msgstr "Stajesz się bardzo nerwowy."

#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "comest_stimulant"
msgid "Something is twitching at the edge of your vision."
msgstr "Coś się rusza na granicy twojego wzroku."

#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "comest_stimulant"
msgid "They know what you've done…"
msgstr "Wiedzą co zrobiłeś…"

#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "comest_stimulant"
msgid "You're feeling even more paranoid than usual."
msgstr "Czujesz większą paranoję niż zwykle."

#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "toxic_waste_corpse_disposal"
msgid ""
"A crumpled and dirty note containing some printed text.  The text contains "
"detailed instructions on how to dispose of \"experiments\" in remote areas."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "toxic_waste_corpse_disposal"
msgid ""
"You see a faded map, stained with unknown fluids and riddled with holes.  A "
"route is scribbled onto it.  The point of departure looks to be some kind of "
"odd research facility."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "toxic_waste_corpse_disposal"
msgid ""
"Some sheets of paper, folded, crinkled and wet due to exposure to the "
"environment.  It smells vile and there are faint smears of blood.  A map is "
"printed on it, depicting instructions on how to handle deceased "
"\"experiments\" and a route to some remote site.  You find it very odd that "
"the starting point of the route is a subway station."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "toxic_waste_corpse_disposal"
msgid ""
"This note has a chemical smell and a bloody thumbprint on it.  You see "
"directions to nearby isolated sites, mainly forests and fields.  The name of "
"the company(?) who printed this, XEDRA, sounds ominous."
msgstr ""

