"burn biodiesel or kerosene, though somewhat less efficiently."
msgstr ""
"Silnik spalinowy. Spala olej napędowy ze zbiornika w pojeździe. Może też "
"spalać biodiesel i naftę, choć nieco mniej efektywnie."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/combustion.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part ""
msgid "A combustion engine.  Burns gasoline fuel from a tank in the vehicle."
msgstr "Silnik spalinowy. Spala benzynę ze zbiornika w pojeździe."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/combustion.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part ""
msgid ""
"An advanced combustion engine.  Burns gasoline or diesel or aviation fuel "
"from a tank in the vehicle.  Can also burn kerosene, though somewhat less "
"efficiently.  Better power-to-weight ratio than a traditional engine, but "
"consumes more fuel."
msgstr ""
"Zaawansowany silnik spalinowy. Spala benzynę, olej napędowy lub paliwo "
"lotnicze ze zbiornika w pojeździe. Może również spalać naftę, choć nieco "
"mniej wydajnie. Lepszy stosunek mocy do masy niż w przypadku tradycyjnego "
"silnika, ale zużywa więcej paliwa."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/combustion.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "diesel_engine_i6"
msgid ""
"An inline 6-cylinder diesel engine.  Somewhat more powerful but much larger "
"than a V6, you might see an engine like this in a road roller or excavator."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/vehicleparts/combustion.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "diesel_engine_inline4"
msgid ""
"A four-cylinder diesel engine, commonly found in small passenger cars and "
"light trucks."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/vehicleparts/combustion.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "diesel_engine_inline1"
msgid "A single-cylinder diesel engine."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/vehicleparts/combustion.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "diesel_engine_v6"
msgid ""
"A powerful 6-cylinder diesel engine, typical of a bus, RV, large van, or "
"armored personnel carrier."
msgstr ""
"Mocny, 6-cylindrowy silnik wysokoprężny, typowy dla autobusu, kampera, dużej "
"furgonetki lub transportera opancerzonego."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/combustion.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "diesel_engine_v8"
msgid ""
"A large 8-cylinder diesel engine, powerful enough for a semi truck, armored "
"car, or Humvee."
msgstr ""
"Duży, 8-cylindrowy silnik wysokoprężny, wystarczająco mocny dla tira, pojazdu "
"opancerzonego lub Humvee."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/combustion.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "engine_1cyl"
msgid "A 50 cc gasoline engine, suitable for a lawnmower, golf cart or moped."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/vehicleparts/combustion.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "engine_1cyl_large"
msgid "A 200 cc engine, suitable for a dirt bike or scooter."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/vehicleparts/combustion.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "engine_1cyl_med"
msgid "A 150 cc engine, suitable for a dirt bike, scooter or generator."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/vehicleparts/combustion.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "engine_1cyl_diesel_large"
msgid "A 200 cc engine, suitable for a dirt bike, scooter, or generator."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/vehicleparts/combustion.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "engine_1cyl_small"
msgid ""
"A small 25 cc gasoline engine, suitable for a hedge trimmer or installing on "
"a bicycle."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/vehicleparts/combustion.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "engine_inline4"
msgid ""
"A 1600 cc four-cylinder gasoline engine, commonly found in small passenger "
"cars."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/vehicleparts/combustion.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "engine_v12"
msgid ""
"A massive 12-cylinder gasoline engine, with the kind of power you might need "
"in a sports car."
msgstr ""
"Masywny, 12-cylindrowy silnik benzynowy o mocy, jakiej można potrzebować w "
"samochodzie sportowym."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/combustion.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "diesel_engine_v12"
msgid "A massive 12-cylinder diesel engine, typical of a heavy cargo truck."
msgstr ""
"Masywny 12-cylindrowy silnik wysokoprężny, typowy dla ciężkich samochodów "
"ciężarowych."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/combustion.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "engine_v6"
msgid ""
"A powerful 6-cylinder gasoline engine strong enough for a pickup truck, SUV, "
"or full-size van."
msgstr ""
"Mocny, 6-cylindrowy silnik benzynowy, wystarczająco mocny dla pickupa, SUV-a "
"lub pełnowymiarowego vana."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/combustion.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "engine_v8"
msgid ""
"A heavy-duty 8-cylinder gasoline engine, like you might find in a fire truck, "
"ambulance, or tow truck."
msgstr ""
"Mocny, 8-cylindrowy silnik benzynowy, typowy dla wozu strażackiego, karetki "
"pogotowia lub samochodu holowniczego."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/combustion.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "engine_vtwin"
msgid "A 600 cc, two-cylinder, gas engine for a fast motorcycle or very small car."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/vehicleparts/combustion.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part ""
msgid ""
"A closed cycle, external combustion steam engine.  Burns coal or charcoal "
"from a bunker in the vehicle to produce steam."
msgstr ""
"Silnik parowy, zamkniętego obiegu, zewnętrznego spalania. Spala węgiel lub "
"węgiel drzewny z komórki w pojeździe by produkować parę."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/combustion.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "engine_turbine_small"
msgid ""
"A small gas turbine engine, suitable for powering a small one or two-seat "
"helicopter."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/vehicleparts/combustion.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "engine_turbine_medium"
msgid ""
"A heavy-duty gas turbine engine, like those typically found in a Medevac, "
"Apache, or Blackhawk helicopter."
msgstr ""
"Mocny, gazowy silnik turbinowy, taki jak te zazwyczaj spotykane w "
"helikopterach Medevac, Apache lub Blackhawk."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/combustion.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "engine_turbine_large"
msgid ""
"A huge gas turbine engine, used to lift large military helicopters such as "
"the V-22 Osprey."
msgstr ""
"Ogromny gazowy silnik turbinowy, używany do unoszenia dużych śmigłowców "
"wojskowych, takich jak V-22 Osprey."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/doors.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "door"
msgid "A door.  Has a window so you can see out of it, even when closed."
msgstr "Drzwi. Mają okno, więc widać przez nie nawet gdy są zamknięte."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/doors.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "cloth flap door"
msgstr "drzwi-klapa z tkaniny"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/doors.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "cloth flap door"
msgid "A cloth sheet that can be fastened into a closed position to act as a door."
msgstr ""
"Płachta materiału, która może być przymocowana w pozycji zamkniętej, aby "
"działać jak drzwi."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/doors.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "cloth curtain door"
msgstr "drzwi-kurtyna z tkaniny"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/doors.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "cloth curtain door"
msgid "A cloth sheet that can be slid into a closed position to act as a door."
msgstr ""
"Płachta materiału, którą można przesunąć do pozycji zamkniętej, aby działała "
"jak drzwi."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/doors.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "opaque door"
msgstr "matowe drzwi"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/doors.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "opaque door"
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "opaque wooden door"
msgid "A door.  Solid construction means you can't see through it when closed."
msgstr "Drzwi. Jednolita bryła powoduje że nie widać przez nie gdy są zamknięte."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/doors.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "heavy-duty door"
msgstr "wytrzymałe drzwi"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/doors.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "heavy-duty door"
msgid "A strong door.  Has a window so you can see out of it, even when closed."
msgstr "Mocne drzwi. Mają okno, więc widać przez nie nawet gdy są zamknięte."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/doors.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "heavy-duty opaque door"
msgstr "wytrzymałe nieprzezroczyste drzwi"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/doors.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "heavy-duty opaque door"
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "opaque hatch"
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "shutter door"
msgid "A strong door.  Solid construction means you can't see through it when closed."
msgstr "Mocne drzwi. Jednolita bryła powoduje że nie widać przez nie gdy są zamknięte."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/doors.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "internal door"
msgstr "wewnętrzne drzwi"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/doors.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "internal door"
msgid ""
"An interior door.  Solid construction means you can't see through it when "
"closed."
msgstr ""
"Wewnętrzne drzwi. Jednolita bryła powoduje że nie widać przez nie gdy są "
"zamknięte."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/doors.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "hatch"
msgstr "bagażnik hatchbacka"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/doors.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "hatch"
msgid "A strong door.  A window lets you see through it when closed."
msgstr "Mocne drzwi. Okno pozwala widzieć przez nie gdy są zamknięte."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/doors.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "opaque hatch"
msgstr "nieprzezroczysty bagażnik hatchbacka"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/doors.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "heavy-duty hatch"
msgstr "wytrzymały bagażnik hatchbacka"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/doors.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "heavy-duty hatch"
msgid "A very strong door.  A window lets you see through it when closed."
msgstr "Bardzo mocne drzwi. Mają okno, więc widać przez nie nawet gdy są zamknięte."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/doors.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "heavy-duty opaque hatch"
msgstr "wytrzymały nieprzezroczysty bagażnik hatchbacka"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/doors.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "heavy-duty opaque hatch"
msgid ""
"A very strong door.  Solid construction means you can't see through it when "
"closed."
msgstr ""
"Bardzo mocne drzwi. Jednolita bryła powoduje że nie widać przez nie gdy są "
"zamknięte."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/doors.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "wooden door"
msgstr "drewniane drzwi"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/doors.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "opaque wooden door"
msgstr "matowe drewniane drzwi"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/doors.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "trunk door"
msgstr "drzwi bagażnika"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/doors.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "trunk door"
msgid "A short door.  You can always see over it, open or closed."
msgstr ""
"Krótkie drzwi. Zawsze można widzieć ponad nimi, nieważne czy są otwarte czy "
"zamknięte."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/doors.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "heavy-duty trunk door"
msgstr "wytrzymałe drzwi bagażnika"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/doors.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "heavy-duty trunk door"
msgid "A strong, short door.  You can always see over it, open or closed."
msgstr ""
"Krótkie mocne drzwi. Zawsze można widzieć ponad nimi, nieważne czy są otwarte "
"czy zamknięte."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/doors.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "shutter door"
msgstr "drzwi rolety"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/doors.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "sliding door"
msgstr "przesuwne drzwi"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/doors.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "sliding door"
msgid "A door.  A window lets you see through it when closed."
msgstr "Drzwi. Okno pozwala widzieć przez nie gdy są zamknięte."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/engineering.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "suspending for butchering"
msgid_plural "suspending for butchering"
msgstr[0] "zawieszenie dla rzeźnika"
msgstr[1] "zawieszenia dla rzeźnika"
msgstr[2] "zawieszeń dla rzeźnika"
msgstr[3] "zawieszenia dla rzeźnika"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/engineering.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "boom crane"
msgstr "wysięgnik żurawia"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/engineering.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "boom crane"
msgid ""
"A rigid steel boom crane.  If it is in your line of sight and within two "
"tiles of another vehicle, you will automatically use it when you want to jack "
"up the other vehicle to change its wheels.  To use it to lift a heavy "
"component like an engine that you are installing or removing, the crane must "
"have line of sight to where it is going and it must be within four tiles of "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Toporny stalowy żuraw. Jeśli masz go w zasięgu wzroku i w odległości dwóch "
"pól od innego pojazdu, możesz automatycznie użyć go jako podnośnika gdy "
"chcesz wymienić koła w pojeździe. Jeśli chcesz unieść ciężką część, np, "
"silnik, którą instalujesz lub usuwasz, żuraw musi być w polu widzenia do "
"miejsca docelowego i musi być w odległości czterech pół od niego."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/engineering.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "internal boom crane"
msgstr "wewnętrzny żuraw"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/engineering.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "telescopic crane"
msgstr "teleskopowy żuraw"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/engineering.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "telescopic crane"
msgid ""
"An extendable cantilever crane.  If it is in your line of sight and within "
"two tiles of another vehicle, you will automatically use it when you want to "
"jack up the other vehicle to change its wheels.  To use it to lift a heavy "
"component like an engine that you are installing or removing, the crane must "
"have line of sight to where it is going and it must be within four tiles of "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Wysuwany żuraw na wsporniku. Jeśli masz go w zasięgu wzroku i w odległości "
"dwóch pól od innego pojazdu, możesz automatycznie użyć go jako podnośnika gdy "
"chcesz wymienić koła w pojeździe. Jeśli chcesz unieść ciężką część, np, "
"silnik, którą instalujesz lub usuwasz, żuraw musi być w polu widzenia do "
"miejsca docelowego i musi być w odległości czterech pół od niego."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/engineering.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "pallet lifter"
msgid ""
"A small pallet lifter.  If it is in your line of sight and within two tiles "
"of another vehicle, you will automatically use it when you want to jack up "
"the other vehicle to change its wheels.  To use it to lift a heavy component "
"like an engine that you are installing or removing, the crane must have line "
"of sight to where it is going and it must be within four tiles of it."
msgstr ""
"Mały podnośnik do palet. Jeśli masz go w zasięgu wzroku i w odległości dwóch "
"pól od innego pojazdu, możesz automatycznie użyć go jako podnośnika gdy "
"chcesz wymienić koła w pojeździe. Jeśli chcesz unieść ciężką część, np, "
"silnik, którą instalujesz lub usuwasz, żuraw musi być w polu widzenia do "
"miejsca docelowego i musi być w odległości czterech pół od niego."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/engineering.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "forklift arms"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/vehicleparts/engineering.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "forklift arms"
msgid ""
"A pair of forklift arms.  If it is in your line of sight and within two tiles "
"of another vehicle, you will automatically use it when you want to jack up "
"the other vehicle to change its wheels.  To use it to lift a heavy component "
"like an engine that you are installing or removing, the crane must have line "
"of sight to where it is going and it must be within four tiles of it."
msgstr ""
"Para ramion podnośnika palet. Jeśli masz go w zasięgu wzroku i w odległości "
"dwóch pól od innego pojazdu, możesz automatycznie użyć go jako podnośnika gdy "
"chcesz wymienić koła w pojeździe. Jeśli chcesz unieść ciężką część, np, "
"silnik, którą instalujesz lub usuwasz, żuraw musi być w polu widzenia do "
"miejsca docelowego i musi być w odległości czterech pół od niego."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/engineering.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "rockwheel"
msgid ""
"A large metal disc, powered by the vehicle's engines.  Use the vehicle "
"controls to turn it on or off.  When turned on, it will stop the vehicle "
"unless it has a strong engine.  When turned on, it will dig a shallow pit in "
"dirt.  Mount it on the edge of your vehicle."
msgstr ""
"Duży metalowy dysk, zasilany silnikiem pojazdu. Użyj kontroli pojazdu by go "
"włączyć lub wyłączyć. Włączony zatrzyma pojazd chyba że ma mocny silnik. "
"Włączony wykopie płytki dół w ziemi. Zamontuj na skraju pojazdu."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/engineering.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "air jack system"
msgstr "podnośnik pneumatyczny"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/engineering.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "motorcycle kickstand"
msgid ""
"A kickstand to keep the bike from falling over.  You could use this to lean "
"it forward or backward to change a tire."
msgstr ""
"Nóżka, która zapobiega upadkowi motocykla. Można jej użyć do nachylenia go w "
"przód lub w tył w celu zmiany opon."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/frames.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "frame"
msgstr "rama"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/frames.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "frame"
msgid ""
"A metal framework.  Other vehicle components can be mounted on it, and it can "
"be attached to other frames to increase the vehicle's size."
msgstr ""
"Metalowa rama. Inne komponenty pojazdu mogą być na niej montowane i można ją "
"łączyć z innymi ramami zwiększając rozmiar pojazdu."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/frames.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/vehicleparts/frames.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "foldable light frame"
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "foldable orichalcum frame"
msgid ""
"A light metal framework, designed to fold.  Other vehicle components can be "
"mounted on it.  If all the frames and components of a vehicle are foldable, "
"the vehicle can be folding into a small package and picked up as a normal "
"item."
msgstr ""
"Lekka metalowa rama zaprojektowana do składania się. Inne komponenty "
"samochodowe mogą być na niej montowane. Jeżeli wszystkie ramy i części "
"pojazdu są składane lub zrobione z glutów, pojazd można złożyć w małą paczkę "
"i podnieść jak zwykły przedmiot."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/frames.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "foldable wooden frame"
msgid ""
"A light wooden framework, designed to fold.  Other vehicle components can be "
"mounted on it.  If all the frames and components of a vehicle are foldable, "
"the vehicle can be folding into a small package and picked up as a normal "
"item."
msgstr ""
"Lekka drewniana rama zaprojektowana do składania się. Inne komponenty "
"samochodowe mogą być na niej montowane. Jeżeli wszystkie ramy i części "
"pojazdu są składane lub zrobione z glutów, pojazd można złożyć w małą paczkę "
"i podnieść jak zwykły przedmiot."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/frames.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "wooden frame"
msgid ""
"A wooden framework.  Other vehicle components can be mounted on it, and it "
"can be attached to other frames to increase the vehicle's size.  Wood and "
"nail construction means it can be constructed and added to the vehicle "
"without welding tools."
msgstr ""
"Drewniana rama. Inne komponenty pojazdu mogą być na niej montowane i można ją "
"łączyć z innymi ramami zwiększając rozmiar pojazdu."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/frames.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "skateboard deck"
msgid ""
"A light wooden skateboard deck.  Other skateboard components can be mounted "
"on it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/vehicleparts/frames.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "light wooden frame"
msgid ""
"A light wooden framework.  Other vehicle components can be mounted on it, and "
"it can be attached to other frames to increase the vehicle's size.  Wood and "
"rope constructions means it can be constructed and added to the vehicle "
"without welding tools or nails."
msgstr ""
"Lekka drewniana rama. Inne komponenty pojazdu mogą być na niej montowane i "
"można ją łączyć z innymi ramami zwiększając rozmiar pojazdu. Konstrukcja z "
"drewna i lin oznacza, że można je zbudować bez spawarki i gwoździ."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/frames.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "heavy-duty frame"
msgid ""
"A heavy metal framework.  Other vehicle components can be mounted on it, and "
"it can be attached to other frames to increase the vehicle's size.  Increased "
"mass makes it more resistant to damage in collisions."
msgstr ""
"Ciężka metalowa ram… Inne komponenty pojazdu mogą być na niej montowane i "
"można ją łączyć z innymi ramami zwiększając rozmiar pojazdu. Zwiększona masa "
"sprawia, że jest wytrzymalsza przy kolizjach."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/frames.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "extra light frame"
msgstr "ekstra lekka rama"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/frames.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "extra light frame"
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "foldable extra light frame"
msgid ""
"A light metal framework.  Other vehicle components can be mounted on it, and "
"it can be attached to other frames to increase the vehicle's size."
msgstr ""
"Lekka metalowa rama. Inne komponenty pojazdu mogą być na niej montowane i "
"można ją łączyć z innymi ramami zwiększając rozmiar pojazdu."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/frames.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "foldable extra light frame"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/vehicleparts/lights.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "aisle lights"
msgstr "światła przejścia"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/lights.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "atomic lamp"
msgid ""
"A bright light, self-powered by an atomic decay reaction that never stops.  "
"When turned on, it illuminates several squares inside the vehicle."
msgstr ""
"Jasne światło, o własnym zasilaniu z reakcji rozpadu atomowego, która nigdy "
"nie ustaje. Włączone oświetla kilka pól wewnątrz pojazdu."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/lights.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "atomic nightlight"
msgstr "atomowa lampka nocna"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/lights.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "atomic nightlight"
msgid ""
"A very dim light, self-powered by an atomic decay reaction that never stops.  "
"When turned on, it illuminates a single square inside the vehicle that isn't "
"suitable for crafting."
msgstr ""
"Wątłe światło, o własnym zasilaniu z reakcji rozpadu atomowego, która nigdy "
"nie ustaje. Włączone oświetla jedno pole wewnątrz pojazdu i nie nadaje się do "
"rzemiosła."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/lights.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "floodlight"
msgid ""
"A very bright, circular light that illuminates the area outside the vehicle "
"when turned on."
msgstr ""
"Bardzo jasne okrągłe światło, które oświetla teren na zewnątrz pojazdu gdy "
"jest włączone."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/lights.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "directed floodlight"
msgid ""
"A very bright, directed light that illuminates a half-circular area outside "
"the vehicle when turned on.  During installation, you can choose what "
"direction to point the light."
msgstr ""
"Jasne światło, które oświetla półokrągły stożek na zewnątrz pojazdu gdy jest "
"włączone. Podczas instalacji możesz wybrać kierunek padania światła."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/lights.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "headlight"
msgstr "reflektor"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/lights.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "headlight"
msgid ""
"A bright light that illuminates a narrow cone outside the vehicle when turned "
"on.  During installation, you can choose what direction to point the light, "
"so multiple headlights can illuminate the sides or rear, as well as the front."
msgstr ""
"Jasne światło, które oświetla wąski stożek na zewnątrz pojazdu gdy jest "
"włączone. Podczas instalacji możesz wybrać kierunek padania światła, zatem "
"kilka świateł może oświetlać tył, boki i przód."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/lights.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "motorcycle headlight"
msgid ""
"A small, lightweight, bright light that illuminates a narrow cone outside the "
"vehicle when turned on.  During installation, you can choose what direction "
"to point the light, so multiple headlights can illuminate the sides or rear, "
"as well as the front."
msgstr ""
"Małe, lekkie, jasne światło, które oświetla wąski stożek na zewnątrz pojazdu "
"gdy jest włączone. Podczas instalacji możesz wybrać kierunek padania światła, "
"zatem kilka świateł może oświetlać tył, boki i przód."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/lights.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "wide angle headlight"
msgstr "szerokokątny reflektor samochodowy"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/lights.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "wide angle headlight"
msgid ""
"A bright light that illuminates a wide cone outside the vehicle when turned "
"on.  During installation, you can choose what direction to point the light, "
"so multiple headlights can illuminate the sides or rear, as well as the front."
msgstr ""
"Jasne światło, które oświetla szeroki stożek na zewnątrz pojazdu gdy jest "
"włączone. Podczas instalacji możesz wybrać kierunek padania światła, zatem "
"kilka świateł może oświetlać tył, boki i przód."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/lights.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part ""
msgid ""
"Emergency lights, like a police car's or ambulance's, mounted on the "
"vehicle's roof.  Flashes between red and blue when turned on, attracting "
"attention without illuminating the area."
msgstr ""
"Światła pojazdu uprzywilejowanego, np. policyjnego lub ambulansu, montowane "
"na dachu. Błyskają na czerwono i niebiesko gdy są włączone, zwracając na "
"siebie uwagę bez oświetlania otoczenia."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/lights.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "blue light"
msgstr "niebieskie światło"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/lights.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "red light"
msgstr "czerwone światło"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/manual.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "foot pedals"
msgstr "pedały"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/manual.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "foot pedals"
msgid ""
"A set of bicycle-style foot pedals attached to a crank.  If mounted on the "
"same tile as a seat, they allow you to use your stamina to produce engine "
"power, using your legs.  Provides more power the stronger you are."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/vehicleparts/manual.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "hand rims"
msgstr "obręcz chwytna dla rąk"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/manual.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "hand rims"
msgid ""
"A set of wheelchair-style hoop hand rims, often attached directly to the "
"wheels.  If mounted on the same tile as seat, they allow you to use your "
"stamina to produce engine power, using your arms.  Provides more power the "
"stronger you are."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/vehicleparts/manual.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "hand paddles"
msgstr "wiosła ręczne"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/manual.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "reins and tackle"
msgstr "lejce i wędzidło"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/manual.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "reins and tackle"
msgid ""
"A set of leather bindings to control a creature pulling a vehicle, such as a "
"cart."
msgstr "Zestaw skórzanych wiązań do sterowania stworzeniem ciągnącym pojazd, np. wóz."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/mirrors.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "wing mirror"
msgstr "boczne lusterko"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/mirrors.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "wing mirror"
msgid ""
"A small mirror, mounted outside the vehicle.  If you see the mirror, your "
"vision is expanded as though you were standing where the mirror is."
msgstr ""
"Małe lustro montowane na zewnątrz pojazdu. Jeśli widzisz lustro, twoje pole "
"widzenia jest rozszerzone, tak jakby stać tam, gdzie jest lustro."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/mirrors.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "inboard mirror"
msgstr "wewnętrzne lusterko"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/mirrors.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "inboard mirror"
msgid ""
"A small mirror, mounted inside the vehicle.  If you see the mirror, your "
"vision is expanded as though you were standing where the mirror is."
msgstr ""
"Małe lustro montowane wewnątrz pojazdu. Jeśli widzisz lustro, twoje pole "
"widzenia jest rozszerzone, tak jakby stać tam, gdzie jest lustro."

