msgstr ""
"Zamocuj tę część do zwierzęcia pociągowego, aby umożliwić mu ciągnięcie "
"twojego pojazdu."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "reinforced yoke and harness"
msgid ""
"Attach this part to a beast of burden to allow it to pull your vehicle.  This "
"one is reinforced with heavy chains and steel."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
