msgstr "składane drewniane pudło"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "wood table"
msgstr "drewniany stół"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "flat-packable table"
msgstr "składany stół"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "wooden boat hull"
msgstr "drewniany kadłub łodzi"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "wooden boat hull"
msgid "A wooden board that keeps the water out of your boat."
msgstr "Drewniany kadłub zapobiega dostaniu się wody do środka łodzi."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "raft boat hull"
msgid "Logs tied together that will keep your boat out of the water."
msgstr "Związane ze sobą kłody, które utrzymają Twoją łódź na powierzchni wody."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "plastic boat hull"
msgid "A rigid plastic sheet that keeps water out of your boat."
msgstr "Sztywny plastikowy kadłub zapobiega dostaniu się wody do środka łodzi."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "metal boat hull"
msgstr "metalowy kadłub łodzi"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "metal boat hull"
msgid "A metal sheet that keeps the water out of your boat."
msgstr "Blaszany kadłub zapobiega dostaniu się wody do środka łodzi."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "carbon fiber boat hull"
msgid ""
"A light weight, advanced carbon fiber rigid sheet that keeps the water out of "
"your boat."
msgstr ""
"Lekki, zaawansowany kadłub z włókien węglowych zapobiega dostaniu się wody do "
"środka łodzi."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "controls"
msgstr "sterowanie"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "controls"
msgid "A steering wheel and accelerator and brake pedals."
msgstr "Kierownica i pedały gazu oraz hamowania."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "hand controls"
msgid ""
"A pair of adjustable rods with a simple trigger.  They easily can be easily "
"installed on top of vehicle controls and will allow a car or similar vehicle "
"to be driven by those who can't use their legs to do so, whether due to "
"disability or small stature.  These are designed for automobiles and will not "
"work on bicycle style foot pedals."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "pedal extenders"
msgid ""
"Thick rubber pads which can be easily clamped onto gas and brake pedals to "
"allow vehicle controls to be used even by people who are very short."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "makeshift pedal extenders"
msgid ""
"Blocks of wood, taped to the pedals to allow vehicle controls to be used even "
"by people who are very short."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "dashboard"
msgid "A frame containing some lights and controls."
msgstr "Ramka zawierająca kilka światełek i sterowanie."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "vehicle-mounted heater"
msgstr "grzejnik samochodowy"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "small vehicle-mounted heater"
msgstr "mały grzejnik samochodowy"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "small integrated heater"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "small integrated heater"
msgid ""
"Set of tubes, that move heat from the engine into the vehicle cabin, heating "
"it up."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "vehicle-mounted cooler"
msgstr "klimatyzator samochodowy"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "small integrated cooler"
msgid "Small set of mechanisms, that cool the vehicle out when turned on."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "electronics control unit"
msgid "Some switches and knobs to control the vehicle's electrical systems."
msgstr "Kilka przełączników i gałek do kontrolowania systemów elektrycznych pojazdu."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "muffler"
msgid ""
"A metal pipe that somewhat reduces engine noise.  Also vents heat from an "
"installed vehicle cooler."
msgstr ""
"Metalowa rura, która nieco redukuje hałas silnika. Odprowadza również ciepło "
"z zamontowanej klimatyzacji samochodowej."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "seatbelt"
msgstr "pasy bezpieczeństwa"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "seatbelt"
msgid "A belt, attached to a seat."
msgstr "Pas, przypięty do fotela."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "security system"
msgstr "system bezpieczeństwa"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "security system"
msgid ""
"A bunch of electronics that make it difficult to start the vehicle without "
"the proper key, and that will sound an alarm if you try.  The alarm can be "
"disabled."
msgstr ""
"Zestaw elektroniki, który utrudnia zapłon pojazdu bez kluczyków i włącza "
"alarm przy próbie. Alarm można wyłączyć."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "smart engine controller"
msgstr "inteligentny sterownik silnika"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "smart engine controller"
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Electronic module that automatically switches combustion and electric engines "
"on and off minimizing fuel consumption and optimizing power output and "
"battery charge rate.  Must be turned on to work.  Simplified ruleset: 1. When "
"throttling, maximize acceleration.  2. Keep battery at 90%.  3. Minimize fuel "
"consumption."
msgstr ""
"Moduł elektroniczny, który automatycznie włącza i wyłącza silniki spalinowe i "
"elektryczne, minimalizując zużycie paliwa i optymalizując moc wyjściową oraz "
"poziom naładowania akumulatora. Musi być włączony, aby działał. Uproszczony "
"zestaw zasad: 1. Podczas przyspieszania, maksymalizuj przyspieszenie. 2. "
"Utrzymuj baterię na poziomie 90%. 3. Minimalizuj zużycie paliwa."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "5-point harness"
msgid ""
"A series of straps attached to the seat, intended to fasten together after "
"going over your shoulders and hips and between your legs."
msgstr ""
"Zestaw pasów przypiętych do fotela, opracowanych by się zapinać po przejściu "
"wokół barków, bioder i między nogami."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "curtain"
msgstr "zasłona"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "curtain"
msgid "A sheet over a window."
msgstr "Płótno na oknie."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "aisle curtain"
msgstr "zasłona przejścia"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "aisle curtain"
msgid "A sheet across an aisle."
msgstr "Płótno w przejściu."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "water wheel"
msgid "A water wheel."
msgstr "Koło wodne."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "large water wheel"
msgid "A large water wheel with wooden supports."
msgstr "Duże koło wodne z drewnianymi wspornikami."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "solar panel"
msgid "A solar panel."
msgstr "Panel słoneczny."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "wind turbine"
msgid "A small wind turbine."
msgstr "Mała turbina wiatrowa."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "large wind turbine"
msgid ""
"A large wind turbine with stabilizing legs.  Will cause extra drag on the "
"vehicle."
msgstr ""
"Duża turbina wiatrowa z nogami stabilizującymi. Powoduje dodatkowy opór dla "
"pojazdu."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "reinforced solar panel"
msgid ""
"A solar panel.  Reinforced with armored glass to make it more resistant to "
"damage."
msgstr ""
"Panel słoneczny. Wzmocniony szkłem pancernym, dzięki czemu jest bardziej "
"odporny na uszkodzenia."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "advanced solar panel"
msgid "A high-performance solar panel."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "advanced reinforced solar panel"
msgid ""
"A high-performance solar panel.  Reinforced with armored glass to make it "
"more resistant to damage."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "advanced Stirling radioisotope generator"
msgid ""
"A military ASRG covered in heavy plating.  Provides constant albeit low power "
"to your car."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "water faucet"
msgid "A water faucet."
msgstr "Kran."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "wooden armor"
msgstr "drewniane opancerzenie"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "spiked plating"
msgid ""
"A spiked plate that will increase the damage delivered to someone else in "
"collisions."
msgstr ""
"Kolczasta płyta zwiększająca obrażenia trafianych przez nią istot podczas "
"kolizji."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "military composite armor plating"
msgstr "wojskowe opancerzenie kompozytowe"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "bicycle horn"
msgid ""
"A small horn.  Use the vehicle controls and select the honk option to make "
"noise."
msgstr ""
"Mały klakson. Użyj elementów sterujących pojazdem i wybierz opcję trąbienia, "
"by wydać dźwięk."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "car horn"
msgid "A horn.  Use the vehicle controls and select the honk option to make noise."
msgstr ""
"Klakson. Użyj elementów sterujących pojazdem i wybierz opcję trąbienia, by "
"wydać dźwięk."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "truck horn"
msgid ""
"A powerful truck horn.  Use the vehicle controls and select the honk option "
"to make noise."
msgstr ""
"Potężny klakson ciężarówki. Użyj elementów sterujących pojazdem i wybierz "
"opcję trąbienia, by wydać dźwięk."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "back-up beeper"
msgid ""
"An electronic noise maker.  It will automatically make noise when you drive "
"in reverse, alerting things behind you to move out of the way."
msgstr ""
"Elektroniczny brzęczyk. Automatycznie wydaje dźwięk przy cofaniu, ostrzegając "
"przechodniów, by się odsunęli."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "cargo space"
msgstr "przestrzeń ładunkowa"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "livestock stall"
msgstr "klatka dla bydła"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "livestock stall"
msgid ""
"A cargo space for carrying livestock.  'e'xamine it to capture an animal next "
"to you, or to release the animal currently contained.  When selecting an "
"animal to capture, choose its tile relative to you, not the part."
msgstr ""
"Przestrzeń ładunkowa do przewozu bydła. Zbadaj (domyślnie „e”), by umieścić w "
"niej pobliskie zwierzę lub wypuścić zwierzę w niej przebywające. Wybierając "
"zwierzę do umieszczenia wybierz pole w relacji do siebie, nie do klatki."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "animal compartment"
msgstr "przedział zwierzęcy"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "animal compartment"
msgid ""
"A large locker for transporting smaller animals.  'e'xamine it to capture an "
"animal next to you, or to release the animal currently contained.  When "
"selecting an animal to capture, choose its tile relative to you, not the part."
msgstr ""
"Przestrzeń ładunkowa do przewozu mniejszych zwierząt. Zbadaj (domyślnie „e”), "
"by umieścić w niej pobliskie zwierzę lub wypuścić zwierzę w niej "
"przebywające. Wybierając zwierzę do umieszczenia wybierz pole w relacji do "
"siebie, nie do klatki."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "recharging station"
msgid ""
"A device for recharging batteries.  When turned on, it charges any "
"rechargeable batteries (battery cells, lead-acid batteries, etc) placed "
"directly in the attached storage space, drawing power from the vehicle's "
"batteries."
msgstr ""
"Urządzenie służące do ładowania akumulatorków. Po włączeniu ładuje wszelkie "
"akumulatory (ogniwa, baterie kwasowo-ołowiowe itp.) umieszczone bezpośrednio "
"w dołączonym schowku, pobierając energię z akumulatorów pojazdu."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "battery charger"
msgid ""
"A small, low-power consumer device for recharging batteries.  It slowly "
"charges any rechargeable batteries (battery cells, lead-acid batteries, etc) "
"placed directly in the attached storage space, drawing power from the "
"vehicle's batteries."
msgstr ""
"Małe urządzenie konsumenckie o niskim poborze mocy służące do ładowania "
"akumulatorków. Powoli ładuje wszelkie akumulatory (ogniwa, baterie "
"kwasowo-ołowiowe itp.) umieszczone bezpośrednio w dołączonym schowku, "
"pobierając energię z akumulatorów pojazdu."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "stereo system"
msgid "A stereo system.  When turned on, it plays music, improving your mood."
msgstr "System stereo. Włączony gra muzykę poprawiając twój nastrój."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "chimes"
msgstr "kurant"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "chimes"
msgid ""
"A collection of electronic bells.  Use the vehicle's controls to turn it on "
"or off.  When turned on, it makes noise, attracting neighborhood children."
msgstr ""
"Zbiór elektronicznych dzwonków. Użyj elementów sterujących pojazdem by "
"włączać je i wyłączać. Po włączeniu wydają dźwięk, który przyciąga okoliczne "
"dzieci."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "jumper cable"
msgid ""
"Thick copper cable with leads on either end.  Attach one end to one vehicle "
"and the other to another, and you can transfer electrical power between the "
"two."
msgstr ""
"Gruby miedziany kabel z zaciskami na końcach. Połącz jeden koniec do "
"samochodu a drugi do innego i przetransferuj między nimi prąd elektryczny."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "extension cord"
msgid "A long orange extension cord for connecting appliances.  Currently plugged in."
msgstr "Długi pomarańczowy przedłużacz do podłączania urządzeń. Obecnie włączony."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "outdoor extension cord"
msgid ""
"An extra long 30 m orange extension cord for connecting outdoor appliances.  "
"Currently plugged in."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "heavy-duty jumper cable"
msgid ""
"Very thick copper cable with leads on either end.  Attach one end to one "
"vehicle and the other to another, and you can transfer electrical power "
"between the two."
msgstr ""
"Bardzo gruby miedziany kabel z zaciskami na końcach. Połącz jeden koniec do "
"samochodu a drugi do innego i przetransferuj między nimi prąd elektryczny."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "heavy-duty tow cable"
msgid ""
"A heavy-duty tow cable, if the other end was attached to another vehicle, it "
"could pull it."
msgstr ""
"Ciężki kabel holowniczy, jeśli drugi koniec był przymocowany do innego "
"pojazdu, mógł go pociągnąć."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "flimsy wooden seat"
msgstr "chwiejne drewniane siedzenie"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "flimsy wooden seat"
msgid "A place to sit, barely."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "wooden seat"
msgstr "drewniane siedzenie"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "wooden seat"
msgid "A place to sit."
msgstr "Miejsce do siedzenia."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "wooden bench"
msgid "A benchlike place to sit."
msgstr "Miejsce do siedzenia w kształcie ławki."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "wooden roof"
msgid "A wooden roof."
msgstr "Drewniany dach."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "chitin plating"
msgstr "chitynowe poszycie"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "biosilicified chitin plating"
msgstr "biokrzemionkowe chitynowe poszycie"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "door motor"
msgstr "silnik drzwi"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "door motor"
msgid ""
"A small electric motor.  Installed on the same frame as a door or curtain, it "
"will allow you to remotely open the door or curtain from the vehicle controls."
msgstr ""
"Mały motor elektryczny. Zainstalowany na tej samej ramie co drzwi lub "
"zasłona, pozwoli na zdalne otwieranie drzwi i zasłon z poziomu sterowania "
"pojazdem."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "drive by wire controls"
msgid ""
"A sophisticated set of electronic controls that allow you to control the "
"vehicle from a vehicle remote while you are not in it.  You can 'e'xamine the "
"tile to access the controls, or use the vehicle control key (default '^')."
msgstr ""
"Zaawansowany zestaw elektronicznych elementów sterujących, które umożliwiają "
"sterowanie pojazdem za pomocą pilota, gdy nie ma cię w pojeździe. Aby uzyskać "
"dostęp do elementów sterujących, można zbadać (domyślnie „e”) pole lub użyć "
"klawisza sterowania pojazdem (domyślnie „^”)."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "camera control system"
msgstr "system kontroli kamer"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "camera control system"
msgid ""
"An LCD attached to one or more cameras.  When turned on, it lets you see from "
"the cameras, but drains power from the vehicle's batteries.  You can "
"'e'xamine the tile to access the controls, or use the vehicle control key "
"(default '^')."
msgstr ""
"Wyświetlacz LCD podłączony do jednej lub więcej kamer. Gdy jest włączony, "
"umożliwia podgląd z kamer, ale pobiera energię z akumulatorów pojazdu. Możesz "
"zbadać pole (domyślnie „e”), aby uzyskać dostęp do elementów sterujących lub "
"użyć klawisza sterującego pojazdu (domyślnie „^”)."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "security camera"
msgid "A small camera.  Will relay what it can see to a camera control station."
msgstr "Mała kamera. Przekazuje obraz do stacji kontroli kamer."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "reinforced security camera"
msgid ""
"A small camera encased in a protective metal cage.  Will relay what it can "
"see to a camera control station."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "robot controls"
msgstr "sterowanie robota"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "robot controls"
msgid ""
"A set of controls to allow a vehicle to drive itself, or you to drive it "
"remotely using a controller."
msgstr ""
"Zestaw sterujący pozwalający pojazdowi na autonomiczną jazdę lub zdalne nim "
"sterowanie."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "makeshift clock"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "makeshift clock"
msgid "A clock, so you know what time it is."
msgstr "Zegar, który wskazuje upływ czasu."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "leather funnel"
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "birchbark funnel"
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "makeshift funnel"
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "funnel"
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "metal funnel"
msgid "A funnel that will collect rainwater into the tank beneath it."
msgstr "Lejek, który zbiera wodę do zbiornika pod nim."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "scoop"
msgstr "zgarniarka"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "scoop"
msgid ""
"A scoop.  Use the vehicle controls to turn it on or off.  When turned on, it "
"will scoop up loose items that it travels over until it's full."
msgstr ""
"Zbierak. Użyj elementów sterujących pojazdem, by go włączyć lub wyłączyć. "
"Włączony zbiera luźne przedmioty nad którymi się znajdzie, aż się nie zapełni."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "water purifier"
msgid ""
"A water purifier, powered by the vehicle's batteries.  You can use it to "
"purify water in a container or in the vehicle's tanks.  'e'xamine the tile "
"with the purifier to use it."
msgstr ""
"Oczyszczacz wody, zasilany elektryką pojazdu. Możesz go użyć do oczyszczenia "
"wody w pojemniku lub zbiornikach pojazdu. Zbadaj (domyślnie „e”) pole z "
"oczyszczaczem, by go użyć."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "plow"
msgid ""
"A plow.  Use the vehicle controls to turn it on or off.  When turned on, it "
"will create a furrow in any dirt it travels over, making it suitable for "
"planting seeds.  It should be placed in front of any seed drills on the "
"vehicle."
msgstr ""
"Pług. Użyj elementów sterujących pojazdem by go włączyć lub wyłączyć. Po "
"włączeniu tworzy bruzdę w dowolnej ziemi nad którą przejdzie, sprawiając, że "
"nadaje się ona do sadzenia nasion. Powinien być umieszczony przed wszelkimi "
"sadzarkami w pojeździe."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "seed drill"
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "advanced seed drill"
msgid ""
"A seed drill.  Use the vehicle controls to turn it on or off.  You can load "
"it with seeds by examining it.  When turned on, it will drop seeds as the "
"vehicle moves, or plant them in furrowed dirt.  It should be placed behind "
"any plows on the vehicle, and any wheels should be placed so they won't run "
"over the plants."
msgstr ""
"Sadzarka. Użyj elementów sterujących pojazdem by go włączyć lub wyłączyć. "
"Możesz ją załadować nasionami badając ją. Po włączeniu będzie wysypywać "
"nasiona w miarę poruszania się pojazdu lub sadzić je w bruzdowatej ziemi. "
"Powinna być umieszczona za pługami w pojeździe, a koła powinny być "
"umieszczone tak, aby nie przejeżdżały roślin."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "reaper"
msgid ""
"An automatic reaper.  Use the vehicle controls to turn it on or off.  When "
"on, it will cut down plants that it travels over.  It should be placed in "
"front of any plows in the vehicle for efficient operation.  It does not "
"include cargo space, so harvested plants will end up on the ground."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "advanced reaper"
msgid ""
"An automatic reaper.  Use the vehicle controls to turn it on or off.  When "
"on, it will cut down plants and store them in the vehicle's cargo.  It should "
"be placed in front of any plows in the vehicle for efficient operation.  It "
"has internal cargo space for collecting the harvest."
msgstr ""
"Automatyczna żniwiarka. Użyj elementów sterujących pojazdem, by ją włączyć "
"lub wyłączyć. Włączona, będzie ścinać rośliny i trzymać przechowywać je w "
"ładunku pojazdu. Powinna być umieszczona przed jakimikolwiek pługami w "
"pojeździe do sprawnego działania. Ma wewnętrzną przestrzeń ładunkową do "
"zbierania plonów."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "cargo lock"
msgstr "szafka ładunkowa"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "cargo lock"
msgid ""
"A set of locks.  Attached to a suitable cargo space, it will prevent other "
"people from accessing the cargo and taking your stuff."
msgstr ""
"Zestaw zamków. Wbudowany we właściwą przestrzeń ładunkową zapobiegnie "
"dostępowi osób postronnych do twoich gratów w bagażniku."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "turret mount"
msgid ""
"A rotating, universal mount for a weapon.  If your hands are empty, you can "
"stand on the same tile as a turret mount and 'f'ire the weapon."
msgstr ""
"Obrotowy, uniwersalny uchwyt na broń. Jeśli masz puste ręce, możesz stanąć na "
"tym samym polu, na którym stoi wieżyczka i strzelać („f”) z niej."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "door lock"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "door lock"
msgid ""
"A lock and latching mechanism.  If installed on a door, this can be used to "
"lock it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "turret control unit"
msgid ""
"A set of motor, camera, and an AI unit which allows for tracking targets, "
"friend-or-foe identification, and firing the connected turret in full "
"automatic mode.  When installed over the turret, it will enable auto "
"targeting mode for said turret."
msgstr ""
"Zestaw silnika, kamery i jednostki SI, który pozwala na śledzenie celów, "
"identyfikację przyjaciół i wrogów oraz strzelanie z podłączonej wieżyczki w "
"trybie pełnej automatyki. Po zainstalowaniu na wieżyczce, włącza tryb "
"automatycznego celowania dla tejże wieżyczki."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "aluminum boat hull"
msgid "An aluminum hull that keeps the water out of your boat."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "plugged 3-inch ordnance rifle"
msgstr "podłączony 3-calowy karabin maszynowy"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "plugged 3-inch ordnance rifle"
msgid ""
"Unfortunately, some responsible killjoy poured concrete in the barrel of this "
"historic cannon to make it safe for display."
msgstr ""
"Niestety, jakiś odpowiedzialny malkontent zalał lufę tej historycznej armaty "
"betonem, aby uczynić ją bezpieczną do ekspozycji."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vp_flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "ALTERNATOR"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When mounted on an engine and the engine is on it will provide up to "
"<color_green>%sW</color> of electrical power to the vehicle."
msgstr ""
"Jeśli zamontowane na silniku i silnik jest włączony, będzie zapewniać "
"<color_green>%sW</color> mocy elektrycznej pojazdowi."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vp_flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "AISLE"
msgid "You can move through this vehicle frame without being slowed down."
msgstr "Możesz poruszać się przez tę ramę pojazdu bez spowalniania."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vp_flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "AISLE_LIGHT"
msgid "A bright light that illuminates several squares inside the vehicle."
msgstr "Jasne światło, które oświetla kilka pól wewnątrz pojazdu."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vp_flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "ARMOR"
msgid ""
"Armor plate.  Will partially protect other components on the same frame from "
"damage from direct attacks but not from the shock damage of a distant "
"collision."
msgstr ""
"Opancerzenie. Częściowo ochroni inne składowe na tej samej ramie przed "
"uszkodzeniami od bezpośrednich ataków, ale nie od uszkodzeń od wstrząsu "
"dalekich zderzeń."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vp_flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "BED"
msgid "You can sleep here comfortably."
msgstr "Możesz tutaj spać komfortowo."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vp_flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "BELTABLE"
msgid ""
"You can install a seat belt or five part harness here to help keep you in "
"your seat during a collision."
msgstr ""
"Możesz zainstalować pasy bezpieczeństwa lub 5-punktową uprząż, by zatrzymać "
"cię w siedzeniu w czasie kolizji."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vp_flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "CABLE_PORTS"
msgid "You can connect electrical cables to this part."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vp_flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "CARGO"
msgid "You can store items here."
msgstr "Możesz tutaj składować przedmioty."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vp_flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "CTRL_ELECTRONIC"
msgid ""
"You can 'e'xamine the tile to access the electronic controls.  If there are "
"vehicle controls installed in the same spot, you can also use the vehicle "
"control key (default '^')."
msgstr ""
"Aby uzyskać dostęp do elektronicznych elementów sterujących, można zbadać "
"(domyślnie „e”) pole. Jeśli w tym samym miejscu zainstalowane są elementy "
"sterujące pojazdu, można również użyć przycisku sterowania pojazdem "
"(domyślnie „^”)."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vp_flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "CONTROLS"
msgid ""
"With a seat or saddle, you drive from here.  You can 'e'xamine the tile to "
"access the controls, or use the vehicle control key (default '^')."
msgstr ""
"Z siedzeniem lub siodłem, możesz stąd kierować. Możesz zbadać pole (domyślnie "
"„e”), by uzyskać dostęp do sterowania, albo użyć przycisku kontrolującego "
"pojazd (domyślnie „^”)."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vp_flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "SMART_ENGINE_CONTROLLER"
msgid "When active, turns engines on and off automatically."
msgstr "Gdy aktywne, włącza i wyłącza silniki automatycznie."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vp_flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "COVERED"
msgid "Illuminated items in this space will not illuminate nearby squares."
msgstr "Oświetlone przedmioty w tym miejscu nie będą oświetlać pobliskich pól."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vp_flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "CURTAIN"
msgid ""
"Closed, it prevents people from seeing through the curtain.  A door motor "
"allows you to remotely open or close it from the vehicle controls."
msgstr ""
"Zamknięta, zapobiega zaglądaniu przez zasłonę. Silnik drzwi pozwala zdalnie "
"ją zasunąć lub odsłonić z poziomu sterowania pojazdem."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vp_flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "DOOR"
msgid ""
"When open, this part lets you move from inside the vehicle to outside or vice "
"versa.  When closed, it prevents people from entering or leaving the vehicle."
msgstr ""
"Gdy są otwarte, ta część pozwala ci nie dostać się do lub wyjść z pojazdu. "
"Zamknięte zapobiegają wchodzeniu i wychodzeniu."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vp_flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "ENABLED_DRAINS_EPOWER"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When turned on, this device drains <color_red>%sW</color> from the vehicle's "
"batteries."
msgstr ""
"Po włączeniu to urządzenie zużywa <color_red>%s W</color> z akumulatorów "
"pojazdu."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vp_flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "SOLAR_PANEL"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Provides up to <color_green>%sW</color> of electrical power to the vehicle "
"when exposed to the sun.  Weather and clouds will affect power generation."
msgstr ""
"Zapewnia do <color_green>%sW</color> mocy elektrycznej pojazdowi wystawionemu "
"na słońce. Pogoda i zachmurzenie będą mieć wpływ na generację mocy."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vp_flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "ENGINE"
msgid ""
"Provides motive power to move the vehicle if the vehicle has sufficient "
"wheels.  Requires controls to turn on.  If it drains power, also requires a "
"charged battery to start."
msgstr ""
"Zapewnia moc napędową do poruszania pojazdu jeśli posiada on wystarczającą "
"liczbę kół. Wymaga układu sterowania by włączyć. Jeśli zużywa moc, wymaga "
"również naładowanego akumulatora, by wystartować."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vp_flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "E_ALTERNATOR"
msgid ""
"An alternator can be attached, and it will generate electrical power while "
"the engine is on at the cost of some motive power."
msgstr ""
"Alternator może być podłączony i będzie generować moc elektryczną w czasie "
"gdy silnik jest włączony, kosztem jakiejś mocy napędowej."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vp_flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "EXTRA_DRAG"
msgid "When turned on, it will stop the vehicle unless it has a strong engine."
msgstr "Po włączeniu zatrzyma pojazd, jeśli nie ma mocnego silnika."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vp_flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "FLOATS"
msgid ""
"Each boat hull will reduce the draft of your vehicle and increase the height "
"sealed against water.  If the draft is less than the sealed height, your "
"vehicle will float if placed in water."
msgstr ""
"Każdy kadłub łodzi zredukuje zanurzenie twojego pojazdu i zwiększy wysokość "
"zabezpieczoną przed dostępem wody. Jeżeli zanurzenie jest mniejsze niż "
"zabezpieczona wysokość, twój pojazd będzie unosił się na wodzie."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vp_flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "FURNITURE_TIEDOWN"
msgid "You can tie down a furniture here."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vp_flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "NO_LEAK"
msgid "Causes a boat hull to float even when damaged."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vp_flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "NONBELTABLE"
msgid ""
"There's no place to attach a seat belt, so you get thrown from the vehicle in "
"a crash."
msgstr ""
"Nie ma miejsca, by przyczepić pasy bezpieczeństwa, więc wypadek spowoduje "
"wyrzucenie cię z pojazdu."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vp_flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "ROOF"
msgid "Keeps the rain out of the interior of the vehicle."
msgstr "Zapobiega dostaniu się deszczu do środka pojazdu."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vp_flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "SEAT"
msgid "You need to be in a seat or saddle to operate vehicle controls."
msgstr "Musisz być na siedzeniu lub siodle, by sterować pojazdem i układami."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vp_flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "ENHANCED_VISION"
msgid "Can be used to <color_cyan>scout things far away</color> when seated."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vp_flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "SEATBELT"
msgid ""
"This part will help prevent you from being thrown from the vehicle in a "
"collision.  You will automatically enable this part when you move into a tile "
"with it."
msgstr ""
"Ta część pomoże ci uniknąć wyrzucenia z pojazdu podczas kolizji. "
"Automatycznie włączysz tę część, gdy wkroczysz na pole z nią."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vp_flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "SHOCK_ABSORBER"
msgid ""
"Armor plate.  Will partially protect other components on the same frame from "
"the shock damage of a distant collision but not from direct attacks."
msgstr ""
"Opancerzenie. Częściowo ochroni inne składowe na tej samej ramie przed "
"uszkodzeniami od wstrząsów dalekich zderzeń, ale nie bezpośrednich ataków."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vp_flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "STABLE"
msgid ""
"If your vehicle consists of a single tile, this wheel is enough to allow it "
"to move."
msgstr ""
"Jeśli twój pojazd składa się z pojedynczego pola, to koło jest wystarczające "
"by mógł się poruszać."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vp_flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "UNSTABLE_WHEEL"
msgid "This wheel requires another wheel to be installed to be functional."
msgstr "To koło wymaga zainstalowania innego koła do działania."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vp_flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "STEERABLE"
msgid "Your vehicle needs at least one set of steerable wheels to turn."
msgstr ""
"Twój pojazd potrzebuje przynajmniej jednego zestawu sterowalnych kół, by "
"skręcać."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vp_flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "TURRET"
msgid ""
"This weapon is mounted in a turret.  It can be fired from the vehicle "
"controls."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vp_flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "WHEEL"
msgid ""
"If the center of balance of your vehicle is between all the wheels, the "
"vehicle will be able to move, provided it has an active engine or motor with "
"enough power to move the vehicle."
msgstr ""
"Jeśli środek ciężkości pojazdu znajduje się pomiędzy wszystkimi kołami, "
"pojazd będzie mógł się poruszać, pod warunkiem, że ma aktywny silnik lub "
"motor o mocy wystarczającej do poruszenia pojazdu."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vp_flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "WIND_TURBINE"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Provides <color_green>%sW</color> of electrical power to the vehicle for "
"every 1 m/s of wind the vehicle is exposed to."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vp_flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "WATER_WHEEL"
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Provides up to <color_green>%sW</color> of electrical power to the vehicle "
"when built over shallow moving water."
msgstr ""
"Zapewnia do <color_green>%sW</color> mocy elektrycznej pojazdowi jeśli jest "
"zbudowany nad płytką ruchomą wodą."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vp_flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "FLAT_SURF"
msgid "This has a flat surface.  It would be a nice place to eat."
msgstr "To płaska powierzchnia. Może być dobrym miejscem na jedzenie."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vp_flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "WORKBENCH"
msgid "You can craft here."
msgstr "Możesz tu wytwarzać."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vp_flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "E_DIESEL_FUEL"
msgid ""
"Burns diesel or JP8 fuel from a tank in the vehicle.  Can also burn biodiesel "
"or kerosene, though somewhat less efficiently."
msgstr ""
"Spala olej napędowy lub JP8 ze zbiornika w pojeździe. Może też spalać "
"biodiesel i naftę, choć nieco mniej efektywnie."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vp_flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "LOCKABLE_DOOR"
msgid ""
"This can be locked if equipped with a locking mechanism, preventing access "
"from outside the vehicle."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vp_flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "VEH_TOOLS"
msgid ""
"You can 'e'xamine the tile to <color_cyan>connect tools</color> to the "
"vehicle's batteries and tanks."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vp_flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "CARGO_PASSABLE"
msgid "Items stored here won't get in the way of any passengers."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vp_flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "HUGE_OK"
msgid ""
"Even when roofed, this part is roomy enough to comfortably admit very large "
"creatures, like cows and horses."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vp_flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "NEED_LEG"
msgid "Operating this part will require at least one working leg."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/vehicleparts/vp_flags.json
#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "INOPERABLE_SMALL"
msgid "People who are very short may be unable to make use of this part."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/vehicleparts/wheel.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "wooden wheel mount"
msgid "A piece of wood with holes suitable for a bike or motorbike wheel."
msgstr "Kawałek drewna z dziurami odpowiednimi dla koła rowerowego lub motocyklowego."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/wheel.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "wooden wheel mount (steerable)"
msgstr "mocowanie koła drewnianego (sterowanego)"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/wheel.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "light wheel mount (steerable)"
msgstr "mocowanie lekkiego koła (sterowanego)"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/wheel.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "wheel hub assembly"
msgstr "zespół piasty koła"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/wheel.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "wheel hub assembly"
msgid ""
"Connection where wheels can be connected on.  This particular one is fit for "
"normal car wheels."
msgstr ""
"Przyłącze, do którego można przykręcić koła. Ten konkretny jest dopasowany do "
"normalnych kół samochodowych."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/wheel.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "wheel hub assembly (steerable)"
msgstr "zespół piasty koła (sterowanego)"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/wheel.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "heavy wheel hub assembly"
msgid ""
"Connection where wheels can be connected on.  This particular one is fit for "
"large car wheels."
msgstr ""
"Przyłącze, do którego można przykręcić koła. Ten konkretny jest dopasowany do "
"dużych kół samochodowych."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/wheel.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "heavy wheel hub assembly (steerable)"
msgstr "zespół piasty dużego koła (sterowanego)"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/wheel.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "rail wheel"
msgid ""
"A strong metal wheel.  A flange helps keep it on a rail, but makes it perform "
"terribly when not on a rail."
msgstr ""
"Mocne metalowe koło. Kołnierz pomaga utrzymać je na szynie, ale sprawia, że "
"zachowuje się fatalnie, gdy nie jest na szynie."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/wheel.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "rail wheel (steerable)"
msgstr "koło kolejowe (sterowalne)"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/wheel.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "pair of small rail wheels"
msgid ""
"A pair of small rail wheels.  It performs well when riding on a pair of small "
"rails.  It performs terribly when not on a rail.  Moreover, you can't steer "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Para małych kół kolejowych. Dobrze się spisują, gdy jeżdżą na dwóch małych "
"szynach. Działają fatalnie, gdy nie są na szynach. Co więcej, nie można nimi "
"sterować."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/wheel.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "roller drum"
msgstr "bęben obrotowy"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/wheel.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "roller drum"
msgid "A strong metal wheel."
msgstr "Wytrzymałe metalowe koło."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/wheel.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "wheel"
msgid "A wheel."
msgstr "Koło."

#: data/json/vehicleparts/wheel.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "racing slick"
msgstr "opona rajdowa"

#: data/json/vehicleparts/wheel.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "armored wheel"
