msgstr[3] ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cbms.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/cbms.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of "High-Voltage Battery System CBM"
#. ~ Description of bionic "High-Voltage Battery System"
msgid ""
"A high voltage battery port compatible with the power cartridges normally "
"used in military weaponry.  Intended to supplement internally installed power "
"generation and storage."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cbms.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/cbms.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Blood Neurology CBM"
msgid_plural "Blood Neurology CBMs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cbms.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/cbms.json
#. ~ Description of "Blood Neurology CBM"
msgid ""
"A radical nanite treatment that allows its host's circulatory system to "
"function as a secondary nervous system, greatly increasing their mental "
"acuity and allowing them to survive trauma that would otherwise be fatal.  A "
"cybernetic enhancement of this category is a rare find and could be easily "
"traded for significant favors and resources."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cbms.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/cbms.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Linguistic Coprocessor CBM"
msgid_plural "Linguistic Coprocessor CBMs"
msgstr[0] "KMB Koprocesor lingwistyczny"
msgstr[1] "KMB-y Koprocesor lingwistyczny"
msgstr[2] "KMB-ów Koprocesor lingwistyczny"
msgstr[3] "KMB-a Koprocesor lingwistyczny"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cbms.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/cbms.json
#. ~ Description of "Linguistic Coprocessor CBM"
msgid ""
"A microcomputer installed into the left hemisphere of your brain to increase "
"the speed that it processes language.  When installed, it provides a passive "
"boost to reading speed."
msgstr ""
"Mikrokomputer zainstalowany w lewej półkuli mózgu, aby zwiększyć szybkość "
"przetwarzania języka. Po zainstalowaniu zapewnia pasywny wzrost prędkości "
"odczytu."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cbms.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/cbms.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Archeotech Grav Chute CBM"
msgid_plural "Archeotech Grav Chute CBMs"
msgstr[0] "KMB Spadochron grawitacyjny Archeotech"
msgstr[1] "KMB-y Spadochron grawitacyjny Archeotech"
msgstr[2] "KMB-ów Spadochron grawitacyjny Archeotech"
msgstr[3] "KMB-a Spadochron grawitacyjny Archeotech"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cbms.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/cbms.json
#. ~ Description of "Archeotech Grav Chute CBM"
msgid ""
"Pre-Discontinuity bionic module that was implanted into elite drop troops who "
"could jump from their insertion vehicle during the radar disruption of "
"reentry.  While active, the field will prevent damage to your body from "
"severe impacts, at the cost of impaired movement."
msgstr ""
"Moduł bioniczny sprzed okresu Nieciągłości, wszczepiany elitarnym żołnierzom "
"zrzutowym, którzy mogli wyskoczyć ze swojego pojazdu transportowego podczas "
"radarowego zakłócenia powrotu do atmosfery. Podczas aktywności pole będzie "
"zapobiegać uszkodzeniom ciała w wyniku silnych uderzeń, ale kosztem "
"upośledzenia ruchów."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cbms.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/cbms.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Salvaged Power Storage"
msgid_plural "Several Salvaged Power Storage CBMs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cbms.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/cbms.json
#. ~ Description of "Salvaged Power Storage"
msgid ""
"A battered and used Compact Bionics Module that upgrades the user's power "
"capacity by 50 units.  Having at least one of these is a prerequisite to "
"using powered bionics.  The user will also need a power supply, found in "
"various CBMs."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cbms.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/cbms.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Dopamine Stimulators CBM"
msgid_plural "Dopamine Stimulators CBMs"
msgstr[0] "KMB Stymulatory dopaminy"
msgstr[1] "KMB-y Stymulatory dopaminy"
msgstr[2] "KMB-ów Stymulatory dopaminy"
msgstr[3] "KMB-a Stymulatory dopaminy"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cbms.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/cbms.json
#. ~ Description of "Dopamine Stimulators CBM"
msgid ""
"A set of tiny bionic nerve stimulators that install into the reward center of "
"your brain.  When run with bionic power, it periodically releases a hit of "
"dopamine and other reward chemicals, inducing a state of euphoria and "
"suppressing fear."
msgstr ""
"Zestaw maleńkich bionicznych stymulatorów nerwowych, które instalują się w "
"centrum nagrody twojego mózgu. Kiedy działa z mocą bioniczną, okresowo "
"uwalnia uderzenie dopaminy i innych chemikaliów nagradzających, włącznie ze "
"stanem euforii i tłumienia strachu."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cbms.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/cbms.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Counteractive Reflexes CBM"
msgid_plural "Counteractive Reflexes CBMs"
msgstr[0] "KMB Odruchy kontrreaktywne"
msgstr[1] "KMB-y Odruchy kontrreaktywne"
msgstr[2] "KMB-ów Odruchy kontrreaktywne"
