"Powerful and covert, the Mark V Shield is a military-grade shielding system "
"developed for use within UICA's special service branches.  Although much more "
"effective than anything that could be conceived with current technology, it "
"remains a pale imitation of the Hyperspace Age systems it was "
"reverse-engineered from.  A.\n"
"\n"
"Activating the shield will create an energy barrier capable of withstanding a "
"modest amount of melee and ranged damage."
