msgstr[3] ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Description of "raw alien liver"
msgid ""
"A porous hard organ.  Hazarding a guess from all the large blood vessels "
"going in and out, this is the liver.  It smells rancid."
msgstr ""
"Porowaty, twardy organ. Zgadując po wszystkich dużych naczyniach krwionośnych "
"wchodzących i wychodzących z niego, jest to wątroba. Pachnie jakby zjełczała."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cooked alien liver"
msgid_plural "cooked alien liver"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Description of "cooked alien liver"
msgid ""
"After some time cooking, the pores of the organ have shrunk, and it's much, "
"much softer - almost yogurt-like in its consistency.  It still smells awful."
msgstr ""
"Po pewnym czasie gotowania, pory organu skurczyły się i jest on dużo, dużo "
"bardziej miękki - w konsystencji prawie jogurtowy. Nadal jednak okropnie "
"pachnie."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "raw alien brains"
msgid_plural "raw alien brains"
msgstr[0] "surowy mózg obcego"
msgstr[1] "surowe mózgi obcego"
msgstr[2] "surowych mózgów obcego"
msgstr[3] "surowego mózgu obcego"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Description of "raw alien brains"
msgid ""
"A brain butchered from an alien organism.  It looks somewhat similar to its "
"earthly analogues, barring its light-blue coloration and gland riddled "
"frontal lobe."
msgstr ""
"Mózg wyjęty z obcego organizmu. Wygląda nieco podobnie do swoich ziemskich "
"odpowiedników, poza jasnoniebieskim ubarwieniem i płatem czołowym z "
"gruczołami."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cooked alien brains"
msgid_plural "cooked alien brains"
msgstr[0] "gotowany mózg obcego"
msgstr[1] "gotowane mózgi obcego"
msgstr[2] "gotowanych mózgów obcego"
msgstr[3] "gotowanego mózgu obcego"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Description of "cooked alien brains"
msgid ""
"Fried and scrambled, this doesn't look the most appetizing, but it's edible "
"(you hope)."
msgstr ""
"Usmażony i zabełtany, to nie wygląda najbardziej apetycznie, ale jest jadalne "
"(masz nadzieję)."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "raw alien kidney"
msgid_plural "raw alien kidney"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Description of "raw alien kidney"
msgid ""
"You are guessing here, but this is likely the kidney of the animal.  The "
"ammonia smell was the biggest hint."
msgstr ""
"Zgadujesz, ale to prawdopodobnie nerka zwierzęcia. Zapach amoniaku był "
"największą wskazówką."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "cooked alien kidney"
msgid_plural "cooked alien kidney"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Description of "cooked alien kidney"
msgid ""
"Thoroughly cooked and prepared, this alien organ has acquired the filthy "
"ammonia smell of a poorly mopped spaceship deck.  Even if it were safe to "
"eat, you are not sure you'd want to."
msgstr ""
"Ten obcy organ, dokładnie ugotowany i przygotowany, nabrał plugawego, "
"amoniakalnego zapachu niedokładnie wymytego pokładu statku kosmicznego. Nawet "
"gdyby można go było bezpiecznie zjeść, nie masz pewności, czy chcesz to "
"zrobić."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "raw alien sweetbread"
msgid_plural "raw alien sweetbread"
