#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
#. ~ Description of "Foodplace's Food-to-go™"
msgid ""
"Foodplace™ easy-storage Food-to-go™ the choice Food™ for the contemporary "
"Foodman™."
msgstr ""
"Foodplace™ łatwe do przechowywania Food-to-go™ to wybór Food™ dla "
"współczesnego Foodmana™."

