#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/medicine.json
#. ~ Description of "combat stim"
msgid ""
"A small, disposable injector filled with a cocktail of stimulants and "
"painkillers.  Will kick you from death's door into awareness, but it's not a "
"long-term solution."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/medicine.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/medicine.json
#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "combat stim"
msgid "You shove the stimpack against your chest."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/veggies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/comestibles/veggies.json
