#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/7.50mm.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/gun/7.50mm.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Wraitheon Vahagn 10XR"
#. ~ Description of "Wraitheon Vahagn 10XR"
msgid ""
"The legendary apex of smartgun technology, believed to be an urban legend by "
"most.  Bleeding-edge targeting systems allow it to track up 10 distinct "
"targets simultaneously, with every trigger pull delivering a burst of two "
"7.5mm microjet darts to each target with a precision that is best described "
"as supernatural.  One needs only to point the weapon in the general direction "
"of the enemy, and the Vahagn will do the rest.\n"
"\n"
"Prohibitive cost and complexity kept this weapon from ever seeing the light "
"of day, and only a handful of prototypes are believed to exist within the "
"black market.  Finding one here can only mean that corporate forces beyond "
"the ordinary have made Salus IV their battleground."
msgstr ""

