#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/zombies.json
#. ~ Description of monster "MoxPhore Tangler"
msgid ""
"A human stands here, several rust-colored limbs jutting out of its back, the "
"limbs moving around and grabbing at the air while the person looks blankly "
"around…"
msgstr ""

