#. ~ Job description of "Whately Cousin" NPC class
msgid "Our family has been through hard times before.  We know how to survive."
msgstr "Nasza rodzina wie, co to ciężkie czasy. Wiemy jak przetrwać."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/classes.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/classes.json
