msgstr "Obrzydliwy prawoklikacz."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "shocker zombie"
msgid ""
"A human body with pale blue flesh, crackling with electrical energy.  It "
"seems eager to tell you something."
msgstr ""
"Ludzkie ciało o bladoniebieskiej barwie, trzeszczące od energii elektrycznej. "
"Wygląda na to, że chce ci coś powiedzieć."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "mr skeltal"
msgid_plural "mr skeltals"
msgstr[0] "Pan Szkieletal"
msgstr[1] "Panów Szkieletali"
msgstr[2] "Panów Szkieletali"
msgstr[3] "Pana Szkieletala"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "mr skeltal"
msgid ""
"Devoid entirely of flesh and organs, this walking skeleton rattles you to the "
"bone.  In its bony hand, it holds a pristine trumpet, unmarred by the end of "
"the world."
msgstr ""
"Całkiem pozbawiony ciała i wnętrzności, ten kroczący szkielet mrozi ci krew w "
"żyłach aż do kości. W kościstej ręce ściska nieskazitelnie czystą trąbkę "
"nietkniętą przez koniec świata."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "minion of skeltal"
msgid_plural "minions of skeltal"
msgstr[0] "sługa Pana Szkieletala"
msgstr[1] "słudzy Pana Szkieletala"
msgstr[2] "sług Pana Szkieletala"
msgstr[3] "sługi Pana Szkieletala"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "minion of skeltal"
msgid "A lesser skeleton, raised by the forlorn dooting of a trumpet."
msgstr "Pomniejszy szkielet, przyzwany samotnym trąbieniem trąbki."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Smoky bear"
msgid_plural "Smoky bears"
msgstr[0] "dymiący miś"
msgstr[1] "dymiące misie"
msgstr[2] "dymiących misi"
msgstr[3] "dymiącego misia"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Smoky bear"
msgid ""
"A smoking husk is all that remains of this once proud bear.  Its black eyes "
"gaze at you with malice… and hunger."
msgstr ""
"Dymiąca skorupa to jedyne co zostało z niegdyś dumnego niedźwiedzia. Jego "
"czarne oczy łypią na ciebie ze złością… i głodem."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie dancer"
msgid_plural "zombie dancers"
msgstr[0] "zombie tancerz"
msgstr[1] "zombie tancerze"
msgstr[2] "zombie tancerzy"
msgstr[3] "zombie tancerza"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie dancer"
msgid ""
"The foulest stench is in the air,\n"
"The funk of forty thousand years,\n"
"And grisly ghouls from every tomb,\n"
"Are closing in to seal your doom!\n"
"\n"
"The dancer doesn't even notice you, it seems like something nearby is "
"controlling it."
msgstr ""
"W powietrzu zapach cuchnący,\n"
"czterdzieści wieków pierdzący,\n"
"a ghule z każdej mogiły,\n"
"już biegną odebrać ci siły!\n"
"\n"
"Tancerz zdaje się ciebie nawet nie zauważać, jakby coś w pobliżu go "
"kontrolowało."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Thriller"
msgid_plural "Thrillers"
msgstr[0] "Dreszczowiec"
msgstr[1] "Dreszczowce"
msgstr[2] "Dreszczowców"
msgstr[3] "Dreszczowca"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Thriller"
msgid ""
"And though you fight to stay alive,\n"
"Your body starts to shiver.\n"
"For no mere mortal can resist,\n"
"The evil of the thriller."
msgstr ""
"I choć walczysz, by żyć,\n"
"już wkrótce zaczniesz wyć,\n"
"bo nieśmiertelna dusza twa,\n"
"nie zniesie dreszczowca zła."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "Thriller"
msgid "The music stops!"
msgstr "Muzyka ustaje!"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Sentence fragment describing a weakpoint for monster "Thriller"
msgid "the funky, funky head"
msgstr "imprezową głowę"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Sentence fragment describing a weakpoint for monster "Thriller"
msgid "the glittering, beautiful eye"
msgstr "śliczne błyszczące oko"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Shia LaBeouf"
msgid ""
"Living in the woods,\n"
"killing for sport,\n"
"eating all the bodies--\n"
"actual cannibal Shia LaBeouf."
msgstr ""
"Żyjący w lasach,\n"
"zabijający dla sportu,\n"
"pożerający wszystkie ciała,\n"
"prawdziwy kanibal Shia LaBeouf."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "sewer gator"
msgid_plural "sewer gators"
msgstr[0] "aligator kanałowy"
msgstr[1] "aligatory kanałowe"
msgstr[2] "aligatorów kanałowych"
msgstr[3] "aligatora kanałowego"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "sewer gator"
msgid ""
"In the late 20th century, there was an urban legend about pet alligators "
"getting flushed down the toilet and growing to adulthood in the sewers.  If "
"this large specimen was ever someone's pet, it doesn't look like it sees "
"humans as anything other than a meal now."
msgstr ""
"W późnym XX wieku krążyły miejskie legendy o udomowionych aligatorach "
"spuszczanych w toaletach, które w kanałach osiągały dojrzałość. Jeśli ten "
"duży okaz kiedyś był czyimś zwierzaczkiem, nie wygląda na takiego, który "
"postrzega ludzi inaczej, niż tylko jako posiłek."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "party rocker"
msgid_plural "party rockers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "party rocker"
msgid ""
"After the event on March 2nd, seemingly ordinary people started coming down "
"with some odd, mass hysteria like dancing.  While some people may have "
"scoffed it off as a silly dance craze, those in the know knew, it was the "
"Party Rock Outbreak.  This one has a pipe of the non-smoking kind."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "party rocker"
msgid "The party rocker party rocks!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "party rocker"
msgid ""
"A party rocker who's not dancing with as much energy, and they seem to be "
"stopping often to cough and catch their breath."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "party rocker"
msgid ""
"A party rocker who's grown painful mushroom stalks out of their body, "
"writhing in pain as their last neurons still instruct them to dance."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "party rocker"
msgid ""
"After the event on March 2nd, seemingly ordinary people started coming down "
"with some odd, mass hysteria like dancing.  While some people may have "
"scoffed it off as a silly dance craze, those in the know knew, it was the "
"Party Rock Outbreak.  This one has a drink in hand."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "immortal snail"
msgid_plural "immortal snails"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "immortal snail"
msgid ""
"A small nondescript immortal snail that is slowly but relentlessly making its "
"way toward you.  You get a strong feeling you should not touch the snail."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster attack message
#, c-format
msgid "%s touches you, killing you instantly."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster attack message
#, c-format
msgid "%s tries to touch you, but misses."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster attack message
#, c-format
msgid "%s touches you, yet somehow you live!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "eoc_you_touch_the_immortal_snail"
msgid "You touch the snail and die instantly."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Lucky"
msgid "You're naturally quite lucky!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_mutations.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Unlucky"
msgstr "Pechowiec"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_mutations.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Unlucky"
msgid "You're naturally quite unlucky."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "When the testing is over, you will be missed."
msgstr "Gdy skończą się testy, będziemy tęsknić."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid ""
"Unbelievable.  You, [subject name here], must be the pride of [subject "
"hometown here]!"
msgstr ""
"Niewiarygodne, Ty, [wstaw imię podmiotu], musisz być dumą [wstaw miasto "
"pochodzenia podmiotu]!"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid ""
"That thing is probably some sort of raw sewage container.  Go ahead and rub "
"your face all over it."
msgstr ""
"Ta rzecz to prawdopodobnie jakiś rodzaj pojemnika na nieprzetworzone ścieki. "
"Dalej, wytrzyj sobie o niego twarz."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid ""
"For your own safety and the safety of others, please refrain from touching "
"[bzzzzzt]"
msgstr ""
"Dla bezpieczeństwa własnego i innych proszę powstrzymaj się od dotykania "
"[bzzzzzzt]"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid ""
"No one will blame you for giving up.  In fact, quitting at this point is a "
"perfectly reasonable response."
msgstr ""
"Nikt cię nie będzie obwiniał jak się poddasz. W rzeczy samej odpuszczenie w "
"tym miejscu to całkiem rozsądna reakcja."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid ""
"Fantastic!  You remained resolute and resourceful in an atmosphere of extreme "
"pessimism."
msgstr ""
"Fantastycznie! Pozostałeś wytrwały i zaradny w atmosferze niezwykłego "
"pesymizmu."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "Hello again.  To reiterate our previous warning: [garbled]"
msgstr "Witaj ponownie. By powtórzyć nasze poprzednie ostrzeżenie: [zniekształcone]"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "Weeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeee[bzzt]"
msgstr "Weeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeee[bzzt]"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "If you become light headed from thirst, feel free to pass out."
msgstr "Jeśli masz zawroty głowy z pragnienia, to możesz zawsze zemdleć."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid ""
"No further compliance information is required or will be provided, and you "
"are an excellent test subject!"
msgstr ""
"Więcej informacji o podporządkowaniu się nie nie będzie ani żądane ani "
"dostarczane, a ty jesteś doskonałym obiektem testowym!"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "Thank you for helping us help you help us all."
msgstr "Dziękuję ci za pomoc nam w pomożeniu tobie w udzieleniu pomocy nam wszystkim."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "Cake and grief counseling will be available at the conclusion of the test."
msgstr "Ciasto i konsolacja będzie dostępna po zakończeniu testu."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "The experiment is nearing its conclusion."
msgstr "Eksperyment zbliża się do konkluzji."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid ""
"The Enrichment Center is required to remind you that you will be baked "
"[garbled] cake."
msgstr ""
"Centrum Wzbogacania jest w obowiązku przypomnieć ci że zostaniesz upieczone "
"[zniekształcone] ciasto."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "We are very, very happy for your success."
msgstr "Bardzo, bardzo cieszymy się z twojego sukcesu."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "We are throwing a party in honor of your tremendous success."
msgstr "Urządzamy przyjęcie dla uczczenia twojego olbrzymiego sukcesu."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "A party associate will arrive shortly to collect you for your party."
msgstr "Pracownik przyjęcia wkrótce przybędzie by zabrać cię na twoje przyjęcie."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "I know you're there.  I can feel you here."
msgstr "Wiem że tam jesteś. Czuję tu twoją obecność."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "You're not going the right way."
msgstr "Nie idziesz właściwą drogą."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "You shouldn't be here.  This isn't safe for you."
msgstr "Nie powinieneś tu być. Nie jest tu dla ciebie bezpiecznie."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid ""
"Maybe you think you're helping yourself.  But you're not.  This isn't helping "
"anyone."
msgstr ""
"Może myślisz że sobie pomagasz. Ale tak nie jest. Nikomu w ten sposób nie "
"pomagasz."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "It's not too late to turn back."
msgstr "Jeszcze nie jest za późno by zawrócić."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "Someone is going to get badly hurt."
msgstr "Komuś stanie się poważna krzywda."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid ""
"Uh oh.  Somebody cut the cake.  I told them to wait for you, but they did it "
"anyway."
msgstr ""
"O-o. Ktoś pociął ciasto. Mówiłam im by na ciebie zaczekali, ale zrobili to "
"mimo to."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "This is your fault.  It didn't have to be like this."
msgstr "To twoja wina. To nie musiało się tak potoczyć."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "You're not a good person.  You know that, right?"
msgstr "Nie jesteś dobrą osobą. Wiesz o tym, prawda?"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "Good people don't end up here."
msgstr "Dobrzy ludzie tu nie trafiają."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "You should have turned left before."
msgstr "Powinieneś przedtem skręcić w lewo."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid ""
"Despite your violent behavior, the only thing you've managed to break so far "
"is my heart."
msgstr ""
"Pomimo twojego agresywnego zachowania, jedyną rzeczą którą zdołałeś złamać to "
"mojej serce."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "What was that?  Did you say something?"
msgstr "Co to było? Coś mówiłeś?"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "I'd just like to point out that you were given every opportunity to succeed."
msgstr "Chcę tylko podkreślić, że dano ci każdą szansę byś odniósł sukces."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "What's your point, anyway?  Survival?"
msgstr "O co ci chodzi tak w ogóle? O przetrwanie?"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid ""
"You've been wrong about every single thing you've ever done, including this "
"thing."
msgstr "Byłeś w błędzie z każda rzeczą którą kiedykolwiek zrobiłeś, w tym i tą rzeczą."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid ""
"I have an infinite capacity for knowledge, and even I'm not sure what's going "
"on outside."
msgstr ""
"Mam nieskończoną pojemność na wiedzę, i nawet ja nie jestem pewna co się "
"dzieje na zewnątrz."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "Stop squirming and die like an adult or I'm going to delete your backup."
msgstr ""
"Przestań się wić i umrzyj jak dorosła osoba w przeciwnym wypadku skasuję "
"twoją kopię zapasową."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "Good job on that, by the way.  SARCASM SPHERE SELF-TEST COMPLETE."
msgstr "Dobra robota z tym tam, skoro o tym mowa. AUTO-TEST SFERY SARKAZMU UKOŃCZONY."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid ""
"I don't want to tell you your business, but if it were me, I'd leave that "
"thing alone."
msgstr ""
"Nie chcę ci mówić co masz robić, ale jeśli o mnie chodzi to zostawiłabym tą "
"rzecz w spokoju."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid ""
"Let's be honest: Neither one of us knows what that thing does.  Just put it "
"in the corner, and I'll deal with it later."
msgstr ""
"Bądźmy szczerzy: Żadne z nasz nie wie co robi ta rzecz. Po prostu rzuć to w "
"kąt, a zajmę się tym później."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid ""
"I know you don't believe this, but everything that has happened so far was "
"for your benefit."
msgstr ""
"Wiem że w to nie wierzysz, ale wszystko co do tej pory się wydarzyło było na "
"twoją korzyść."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid ""
"I'm checking some blueprints, and I think… yes, right here.  You're "
"definitely going the wrong way."
msgstr ""
"Sprawdzam kilka planów i myślę… Tak, w tym miejscu. Z całą pewnością idziesz "
"w złym kierunku."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "Are you even listening to me?"
msgstr "Czy ty w ogóle mnie słuchasz?"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "clickbait"
msgid "KEVIN SACRIFICING GAMEPLAY FOR REALISM?  THE SHOCKING TRUTH REVEALED"
msgstr "KEVIN POŚWIĘCA GAMEPLAY DLA REALIZMU? SZOKUJĄCA PRAWDA WYSZŁA NA JAW"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "clickbait"
msgid "TEN FACTS ABOUT THE NEW BIONIC SYSTEM THAT WILL SHOCK YOU"
msgstr "DZIESIĘĆ FAKTÓW O NOWYM SYSTEMIE BIONICZNYM, KTÓRE CIĘ ZASKOCZĄ"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "clickbait"
msgid "YOU WON'T BELIEVE WHO JUST ADDED A NEW PROFESSION"
msgstr "NIE UWIERZYSZ KTO WŁAŚNIE DODAŁ NOWY ZAWÓD"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "clickbait"
msgid ""
"TRIVIALIZE THE EARLY GAME WITH THIS ONE SIMPLE SPEAR WEAPON!  CONTRIBUTORS "
"HATE HIM"
msgstr "ZBAGATELIZUJ WCZESNĄ GRĘ TĄ JEDNĄ WŁÓCZNIĄ! KONTRYBUTORZY GO NIENAWIDZĄ"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "clickbait"
msgid "A MEDICAL MUTANT SET THEMSELVES ON FIRE - YOU WON'T BELIEVE WHAT HAPPENED NEXT"
msgstr "MEDYCZNY MUTANT PODPALIŁ SIĘ - NIE UWIERZYSZ CO BYŁO PÓŹNIEJ"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "clickbait"
msgid "THE TRUTH ABOUT CATACLYSM'S DEVELOPMENT - AND ITS DISGUSTING SECRET"
msgstr "CAŁA PRAWDA O TWORZENIU CATALYSMU I JEJ OBRZYDLIWY SEKRET"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "clickbait"
#, no-c-format
msgid "IT'S TRUE - MUTAGEN IS 40% BLEACH, AND HERE'S WHY"
msgstr "TO PRAWDA - MUTAGEN TO W 40% WYBIELACZ, I TU JEST DOWÓD"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "clickbait"
msgid "20 EASY WAYS TO ESCAPE A LAB - #4 WILL BLOW YOUR MIND"
msgstr "20 ŁATWYCH SPOSOBÓW NA UCIECZKĘ Z LABORATORIUM - #4 WPRAWI CIĘ W OSŁUPIENIE"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"I've got a feeling we're not in Kansas anymore.\""
msgstr "„Mam wrażenie, że nie jesteśmy już w Kansas”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Go ahead, make my day.\""
msgstr "„Śmiało, zrób mi frajdę”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"You talkin' to me?\""
msgstr "„Do mnie mówisz?”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Then who the hell else are you talkin' to?\""
msgstr "„Do kogo więc mówisz?”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Well I'm the only one here.\""
msgstr "„Nikogo tu nie widzę”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Who the fuck do you think you're talking to?\""
msgstr "„Do kogo ty, kurwa, mówisz?”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"What we've got here is failure to communicate.\""
msgstr "„Oglądacie skutek braku porozumienia”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"E.T.  phone home.\""
msgstr "„E.T. dzwoni dom”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"I'm as mad as hell, and I'm not going to take this anymore!\""
msgstr "„Jestem wściekły jak diabli i nie wytrzymam tego dłużej!”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"There's no place like home.\""
msgstr "„Wszędzie dobrze, ale w domu najlepiej”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Badges?  We ain't got no badges!\""
msgstr "„Odznaki? Nie nosimy odznak”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"We don't need no badges!  I don't have to show you any stinking badges!\""
msgstr "„Nie potrzebujemy ich. Nie muszę ci pokazywać żadnych odznak”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"I'll be back.\""
msgstr "„Wrócę”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"I see dead people.\""
msgstr "„Widzę martwych ludzi”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"It's alive!  It's alive!\""
msgstr "„To żyje! To żyje!”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Say hello to my little friend!\""
msgstr "„Przywitaj się z moim małym przyjacielem!”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Here's Johnny!\""
msgstr "„Jest twój Johnny!”"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Open the pod bay doors, HAL.\""
msgstr "„Otwórz właz, Hal”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"They may take our lives, but they'll never take our freedom!\""
msgstr "„Mogą odebrać nam życie, ale nigdy nie odbiorą nam wolności!”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid ""
"\"If you let my daughter go now, that'll be the end of it.  I will not look "
"for you, I will not pursue you.\""
msgstr ""
"„Jeśli w tej chwili wypuścisz moją córkę, nic ci nie grozi. Nie będę cię "
"szukać. Nie będę cię ścigać”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"If you don't, I will look for you, I will find you, and I will kill you.\""
msgstr "„Jeśli tego nie zrobisz, zacznę cię szukać. A gdy cię znajdę, zabiję”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Roads?  Where we're going, we don't need roads.\""
msgstr "„Drogi? Tam, gdzie się udajemy, nie potrzebujemy dróg”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Fasten your seatbelts.  It's going to be a bumpy night.\""
msgstr "„Zapnijcie pasy. Zanosi się na ciężką noc”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid ""
"\"You've got to ask yourself one question:  'Do I feel lucky?'  Well, do ya "
"punk?\""
msgstr "„Zadaj sobie pytanie: »Mam farta?« Więc jak, śmieciu?”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"You had me at hello.\""
msgstr "„Wystarczyło mi twoje »cześć«”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Houston, we have a problem.\""
msgstr "„Houston, mamy problem”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Yippie-ki-yay, motherfucker!\""
msgstr "„Jupikajej, skurwysynu”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"The first rule of The Lab is:  You do not talk about The Lab.\""
msgstr "„Pierwsza zasada Laboratorium: nie rozmawiajcie o Laboratorium”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Don't be afraid.  It's just a big, big lap dog.\""
msgstr "„Nie bój się, to jest tylko duży, wielki piesek salonowy”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Bring me everyone.\""
msgstr "„Ściągnij wszystkich”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"What do you mean everyone?\""
msgstr "„Jak to wszystkich?”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"EVERYONE!\""
msgstr "„WSZYSTKICH!”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"I'm going to make him an offer he can't refuse.\""
msgstr "„Zamierzam złożyć mu propozycję nie do odrzucenia”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"This is the beginning of a beautiful friendship.\""
msgstr "„To początek pięknej przyjaźni”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"You can't handle the truth!\""
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"If you built it, he will come.\""
msgstr "„Jeśli zbudujesz, on przyjdzie”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Hasta la vista, baby.\""
msgstr "„Hasta la vista, mały”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"They're here!\""
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Tis but a scratch!\""
msgstr "„To tylko draśnięcie”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Frankly, my dear, I don't give a damn.\""
msgstr "„Szczerze mówiąc, moja droga, nic mnie to nie obchodzi”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"All work and no play makes Jack a dull boy.\""
msgstr "„Wkurzają Jacka takie sprawy - ciągła praca, brak zabawy”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Remember: all I'm offering is the truth.  Nothing more.\""
msgstr "„Pamiętaj, że mogę zaoferować ci prawdę i nic ponadto”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Don't call me Shirley.\""
msgstr "„I nie jestem Chyba”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"I have had it with these motherfucking snakes!\""
msgstr "„Starczy mi pierdolonych węży w pierdolonym samolocie!”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Back up, put down the gun, and gimme some tropical flavored bubblicious.\""
msgstr "„Cofnij się, odłóż spluwę i podaj mi paczkę gum owocowych”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"And some skittles.\""
msgstr "„I landrynki”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"You'll shoot your eye out, kid.\""
msgstr "„Wystrzelisz sobie oko, dzieciaku”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Cocainum!\""
msgstr "„Cocainum!”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"I am your father.\""
msgstr "„To ja jestem twoim ojcem”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Who said that?\""
msgstr "„Kto to powiedział?”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"WHO THE FUCK SAID THAT?!\""
msgstr "„KTO SIĘ ODWAŻYŁ?”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Bullshit!  You didn't convince me!  Show me your real war face!\""
msgstr "„Gówno! Nie przekonałeś mnie! Pokaż swoją prawdziwą straszną minę!”"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"What is your major malfunction, numbnut?\""
msgstr "„Główka nie pracuje kretynie?”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Leeeeeeeeeeeeeroy!  Jenkins rebuild!\""
msgstr "„Leeeeeeeeeeeeeroy! Jenkins rebuild!”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Activated!\""
msgstr "„Aktywna!”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Search mode activated!\""
msgstr "„Tryb wyszukiwania aktywowany!”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Coming through!\""
msgstr "„Przechodzę!”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Deploying!\""
msgstr "„Przygotowywanie!”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Critical Error!\""
msgstr "„Błąd krytyczny!”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Ow ow ow!\""
msgstr "„Auć auć!”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Put me down!\""
msgstr "„Odłóż mnie!”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Target lost!\""
msgstr "„Cel zgubiony!”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Searching!\""
msgstr "„Wyszukuję!”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Hey!  It's me!\""
msgstr "„Hej! To ja!”."

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_turret, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
msgid "\"Ouch!\""
msgstr "„Au!”."

