#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/modinfo.json
#. ~ Description of MOD "Defense Mode"
msgid ""
"This transforms the game into a horde-based wave defense mode.  Pick a "
"starting location, create your character, and defend your bastion against the "
"relentless waves of zombies, insects, aliens, you name it!  Complex "
"customizations allow the game to be tinkered with to your hearts content, and "
"extensive mod compatibility allows for your favorite additions to work "
"perfectly in the new game.  It's kill or be killed!"
msgstr ""

