#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/Perks/perks.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Ancient Vow"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/Perks/perks.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Ancient Vow"
msgid ""
"A lifetime ago you swore to protect your vanished homeland.  This oath binds "
"you still.\n"
"\n"
"You cannot flee from high danger enemies but gain increased damage and "
"stamina regeneration when fighting them."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/Perks/perks.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Power Drain"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/Perks/perks.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Power Drain"
msgid ""
"Your cybernetic implants are constantly losing power, but a quirk of their "
"design allows you regain power through murder.\n"
"\n"
"You lose bionic power every second, but melee kills restore power, scaling "
"with the danger level of your target."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/Perks/perks.json
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Archmagister of the Gloaming Tower"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/Perks/perks.json
#. ~ Description of mutation "Archmagister of the Gloaming Tower"
msgid ""
"You have spent long centuries poring over mouldering tomes and wresting "
"knowledge from spirits who dwell within the translunary spheres and have "
"forgotten more enchantments than some upstart conjurer will ever learn.\n"
"\n"
"When you pick up a ranged weapon, you will absorb its power into a new spell."
msgstr ""

