"You're pretty sure you saw this in a game somewhere.  You fire a short-range "
"cone of ice and cold."
msgstr ""
"Jesteś pewien, że widziałeś to gdzieś w jakiejś grze. Wystrzeliwujesz "
"krótkodystansowy stożek lodu i zimna."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "chilling_touch"
msgid "Chilling Touch"
msgstr "Mroźny dotyk"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "chilling_touch ( Chilling Touch )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Chilling Touch"
msgid "Freezes the touched target with intense cold."
msgstr "Zamraża dotknięty cel intensywnym zimnem."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "glide_ice"
msgid "Glide on Ice"
msgstr "Ślizg po lodzie"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "glide_ice ( Glide on Ice )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Glide on Ice"
msgid ""
"Encases your feet in a magical coating of ice, allowing you to glide along "
"smooth surfaces faster."
msgstr ""
"Otacza twoje stopy magiczną powłoką lodu, pozwalając ci szybko ślizgać się po "
"gładkich powierzchniach."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "glide_ice_plus"
msgid "Enhanced Glide on Ice"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "glide_ice_plus ( Enhanced Glide on Ice )"
msgid ""
"Encases your feet in a magical coating of ice, allowing you to glide along "
"smooth surfaces faster.  Now you know this spell like the back of your hand, "
"and have started to design your own version."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "hoary_blast"
