"Kelvinists.  You can use the rune as a catalyst for recipes."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "kelvinist_summon_flamesword"
msgid "Flamesword"
msgstr "Ognisty miecz"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "kelvinist_summon_flamesword ( Flamesword )"
msgid ""
"This spell ignites a wooden sword, creating a flaming blade able to burn, "
"bruise, and chop."
msgstr ""
"Zaklęcie to zapala drewniany miecz, tworząc płonące ostrze zdolne do palenia, "
"obijania i siekania."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "kelvinist_summon_flamesword_plus"
msgid "Enhanced Flamesword"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "kelvinist_summon_flamesword_plus ( Enhanced
#. Flamesword )"
msgid ""
"This spell ignites a wooden sword, creating a flaming blade able to burn, "
"bruise, and chop.  Now you know this spell like the back of your hand, and "
"have started to design your own version."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "kelvinist_flamebreath"
msgid "Flamebreath"
msgstr "Ognisty oddech"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "kelvinist_flamebreath ( Flamebreath )"
msgid ""
"This spell ignites dust scattered in the air, creating a cone of flame.  The "
"hot ashes can cling to targets, causing additional burns over time."
msgstr ""
"Zaklęcie to podpala pył rozproszony w powietrzu, tworząc stożek płomieni. "
"Gorący popiół może przylgnąć do celu, powodując z czasem dodatkowe oparzenia."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "freezing_touch"
msgid "Freezing Touch"
msgstr "Zamrażający dotyk"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "freezing_touch ( Freezing Touch )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Freezing Touch"
msgid ""
"Your hands freeze anything they touch at temperatures so cold it slows down "
"your foes."
msgstr ""
"Twoje ręce zamrażają wszystko, czego dotkną, w temperaturze tak niskiej, że "
"spowalnia to twoich przeciwników."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_power_effects.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Name of spell "kelvinist_anti_cold"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_kelvinist_anti_cold"
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_END_PSI_POWERS_SPECIFIC"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_pyrokinetic_cloak"
msgid "Cloak of Warmth"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "kelvinist_anti_cold ( Cloak of Warmth )"
msgid ""
"Heat the nearby air, keeping you warm and providing some protection against "
"ice and cold."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "kelvinist_anti_heat"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_kelvinist_anti_heat"
msgid "Cloak of Chill"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "kelvinist_anti_heat ( Cloak of Chill )"
msgid ""
"Cool the nearby air, keeping you cool and providing some protection against "
"heat and flame."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "kelvinist_persuasion_spell"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_kelvinist_flames_of_passion"
msgid "Flames of Passion"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "kelvinist_persuasion_spell ( Flames of Passion )"
msgid ""
"Like the bonfire gathers revelers around it, the kelvinist becomes the life "
"of the party, as their eyes shine with passion and their voice burns with the "
"heat of their conviction.  You will be more convincing while this spell is in "
"effect.  Before the Cataclysm, this was one of the most common spells that "
"apprentices were desperate to learn and master mages were reluctant to teach."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "kelvinist_extinguish_fire_spell ( Extinguish )"
msgid ""
"Just as the kelvinist can start a fire, they can extinguish it, by "
"transmuting the heat of the fire directly into cold and leaving nothing left "
"to continue the flames."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "kelvinist_summon_freezer_spell"
msgid "Freezer Field"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "kelvinist_summon_freezer_spell ( Freezer Field )"
msgid ""
"Summon a sphere of ice that will preserve anything placed inside while the "
"container lasts."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "kelvinist_no_emotion_spell"
msgid "The Rime-Covered Heart"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "kelvinist_no_emotion_spell ( The Rime-Covered Heart
#. )"
msgid ""
"Draw on the essence of ice to freeze out all emotion, rendering you "
"comfortably numb.  This spell used to get you on several lists if the "
"government learned that you knew it, back when there was a government to care "
"about that."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "kelvinist_firebolt"
msgid "Firebolt"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "kelvinist_firebolt ( Firebolt )"
msgid ""
"A simple spell that hurls a bolt of fire to the target location.  While not "
"as damaging as some more complex spells, it is quick to cast and will ignite "
"anything flammable at the target."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Sound description of spell "kelvinist_firebolt ( Firebolt )"
#. ~ Sound description of spell "pyrokinetic_eruption ( [Ψ]Fountain of Flames
#. )"
#. ~ Sound description of spell "pyrokinetic_flamethrower ( [Ψ]Flamethrower )"
#. ~ Sound description of spell "salamander_aoe_explosion ( Salamander AoE
#. Explosion )"
#. ~ Sound description of spell "salamander_make_fire ( Enkindle )"
#. ~ Sound description of spell "salamander_flame_punch_spell ( Blazing Blow
#. )"
#. ~ Sound description of spell "salamander_fire_breath ( Breath of the
#. Firedragon )"
#. ~ Sound description of spell "salamander_explosion_trap_spell_activated (
#. Salamander Trap Explosion )"
msgid "a crackle!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "kelvinist_heat_food"
msgid "Baking Hands"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "kelvinist_heat_food ( Baking Hands )"
msgid ""
"With the tiniest amount of heat, unfreeze an item of food or drink and heat "
"it up to a comfortable temperature."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "kelvinist_set_everyone_on_fire"
msgid "Flames of the Apocalypse"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/kelvinist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "kelvinist_set_everyone_on_fire ( Flames of the
#. Apocalypse )"
msgid ""
"Force a large amount of burning mana into every hostile target affected by "
"the spell, causing them to explode in flames.  Knowledge of this spell "
"required licensing and registration before the Cataclysm, but you're pretty "
"sure the ATF isn't going to be hassling you any time soon."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/lizardfolk_shaman.json
#. ~ Message of spell "spell_summon_crocodile ( Summon Crocodile )"
msgid "The shaman summons a crocodile!"
msgstr "Szaman przywołuje krokodyla!"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Name of spell "shadow_field"
msgid "Shadow Field"
msgstr "Pole cienia"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Description of spell "shadow_field ( Shadow Field )"
msgid "Shroud an area in intense shadows."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Name of spell "magic_missile"
msgid "Magic Missile"
msgstr "Magiczny pocisk"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "magic_missile ( Magic Missile )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Magic Missile"
msgid "I cast Magic Missile at the darkness!"
msgstr "Rzucam magiczny pocisk w ciemność!"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Name of spell "phase_door"
msgid "Phase Door"
msgstr "Fazowe drzwi"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Description of spell "phase_door ( Phase Door )"
msgid "Teleports you a short distance in a random direction."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Name of spell "dimension_door"
msgid "Dimension Door"
msgstr "Drzwi przez wymiary"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Description of spell "dimension_door ( Dimension Door )"
msgid "Teleports you randomly near a target location."
msgstr "Teleportuje cię losowo w pobliże wybranego celu."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Name of spell "gravity_well"
msgid "Gravity Well"
msgstr "Studnia grawitacyjna"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Description of spell "gravity_well ( Gravity Well )"
msgid ""
"Summons a well of gravity centered on the targeted location.  Dealing bashing "
"damage to all creatures in the affected area."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Name of spell "magus_mana_blast"
msgid "Mana Blast"
msgstr "Wybuch many"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "magus_mana_blast ( Mana Blast )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Mana Blast"
msgid "A blast of concentrated magical power that obliterates a large area."
msgstr "Podmuch skoncentrowanej mocy magicznej, który niszczy duży obszar."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Name of spell "magus_mana_bolt"
msgid "Mana Bolt"
msgstr "Pocisk many"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "magus_mana_bolt ( Mana Bolt )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Mana Bolt"
msgid "A bolt of magical power that only damages your foes."
msgstr "Pocisk magicznej mocy, który zadaje obrażenia tylko przeciwnikom."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Name of spell "magus_haste"
msgid "Haste"
msgstr "Przyspieszenie"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "magus_haste ( Haste )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Haste"
msgid ""
"This spell gives you an enormous boost of speed lasting a short period of "
"time."
msgstr "To zaklęcie daje ci ogromny wzrost prędkości na krótki okres czasu."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Description of spell "magus_slow ( Slow )"
msgid ""
"This spell weakens your target, resulting in a decrease of speed lasting a "
"short period of time."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Name of spell "magus_baleful_polymorph"
msgid "Baleful Polymorph"
msgstr "Złowroga przemiana"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "magus_baleful_polymorph ( Baleful Polymorph )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Baleful Polymorph"
msgid "Transform your enemies into frogs."
msgstr "Zmień swoich wrogów w żaby."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Name of spell "magus_mana_beam"
msgid "Mana Beam"
msgstr "Wiązka many"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "magus_mana_beam ( Mana Beam )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Mana Beam"
msgid "A beam of focused magical power that damages any foes in its path."
msgstr ""
"Wiązka skupionej magicznej mocy, która zadaje obrażenia wszystkim "
"przeciwnikom na swojej drodze."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Name of spell "magus_escape"
msgid "Escape"
msgstr "Ucieczka"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "magus_escape ( Escape )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Escape"
msgid ""
"Teleports you in a random direction a medium distance, to help escape your "
"foes in dangerous situations."
msgstr ""
"Teleportuje cię w losowym kierunku na średnią odległość, aby pomóc ci uciec "
"przed wrogami w niebezpiecznych sytuacjach."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Name of spell "create_rune_magus"
msgid "Magus Rune"
msgstr "Runa maga"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Description of spell "create_rune_magus ( Magus Rune )"
msgid ""
"This ritual forces small amounts of mana to crystallize out into intricate "
"patterns, making a rune attuned to Magi.  You can use the rune as a catalyst "
"for recipes."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "cats_grace"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "cats_grace"
msgid "Cat's Grace"
msgstr "Kocia gracja"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Description of spell "cats_grace ( Cat's Grace )"
msgid ""
"You align your senses to be closer to those of a cat, becoming more graceful, "
"agile, and coordinated."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "eagles_sight"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "eagles_sight"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Eagle's Sight"
msgstr "Wzrok orła"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "eagles_sight ( Eagle's Sight )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Eagle's Sight"
msgid "You gain the perception of an eagle."
msgstr "Zyskujesz percepcję orła."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "ogres_strength"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "ogres_strength"
msgid "Ogre's Strength"
msgstr "Siła ogra"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "ogres_strength ( Ogre's Strength )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Ogre's Strength"
msgid "You gain the strength of an ogre."
msgstr "Zyskujesz siłę ogra."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "foxs_cunning"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "foxs_cunning"
msgid "Fox's Cunning"
msgstr "Lisi spryt"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "foxs_cunning ( Fox's Cunning )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Fox's Cunning"
msgid "You become wily like a fox."
msgstr "Stajesz się przebiegły jak lis."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Name of spell "magus_force_jar"
msgid "Jar of Force"
msgstr "Słój mocy"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Description of spell "magus_force_jar ( Jar of Force )"
msgid "Summon a jar of force in which you can store liquids."
msgstr "Przywołaj słoik mocy, w którym możesz przechowywać płyny."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Name of spell "magus_summon_impact_sling"
msgid "Impact Sling"
msgstr "Proca przyłożenia"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Description of spell "magus_summon_impact_sling ( Impact Sling )"
msgid ""
"This spell infuses a sling with tremendous force, delivering devastating "
"pebble shots until the energy tears it apart."
msgstr ""
"To zaklęcie napełnia procę ogromną siłą, zapewniając niszczycielskie strzały "
"kamykami, dopóki energia nie rozerwie jej na strzępy."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Name of spell "magus_summon_impact_sling_plus"
msgid "Enhanced Impact Sling"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Description of spell "magus_summon_impact_sling_plus ( Enhanced Impact
#. Sling )"
msgid ""
"This spell infuses a sling with tremendous force, delivering devastating "
"pebble shots until the energy tears it apart.  Now you know this spell like "
"the back of your hand, and have started to design your own version."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Name of spell "focused_bolt"
msgid "Focused Bolt"
msgstr "Skupiony piorun"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Description of spell "focused_bolt ( Focused Bolt )"
msgid ""
"You focus your mana into a microscopically thin pulsed beam of pure energy, "
"capable of extreme range and precision; as well as unparalleled penetration, "
"provided proper skill.  Once the invention of a notorious assassin, this "
"spell has slain many a king and noble.  Passed on only through direct "
"descendants over the ages, though occasionally shared by them to others."
msgstr ""
"Skupiasz swoją manę w mikroskopijnie cienką pulsującą wiązkę czystej energii, "
"zdolną do ekstremalnego zasięgu i precyzji, a także do niezrównanej "
"penetracji, pod warunkiem posiadania odpowiednich umiejętności. Zaklęcie to, "
"będące niegdyś wynalazkiem osławionego zabójcy, zabiło niejednego króla i "
"szlachcica. Przez wieki przekazywane tylko przez bezpośrednich potomków, choć "
"czasem dzielone przez nich z innymi."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#. ~ Name of spell "magus_slowfall"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_magus_slowfall"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_telekinetic_slowfall"
msgid "Slowfall"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Description of spell "magus_slowfall ( Slowfall )"
msgid ""
"Reduce the velocity of your falls by a great amount, or to zero if at high "
"mastery."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "magus_spiderclimb"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_magus_spiderclimb"
msgid "Spider Climb"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Description of spell "magus_spiderclimb ( Spider Climb )"
msgid "Ascend even the most sheer wall with ease as you cling to surfaces."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Name of spell "magus_teleport_mark"
msgid "Magus's Mark"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Description of spell "magus_teleport_mark ( Magus's Mark )"
msgid "Mark a particular patch of ground to allow you to return to it later."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_MAGUS_MARK"
msgid ""
"As you make the gestures and recite the incantation, a brief glow fills your "
"surroundings."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Name of spell "magus_word_of_recall"
msgid "Word of Recall"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Description of spell "magus_word_of_recall ( Word of Recall )"
msgid ""
"Immediately return to the place you marked with Magus's Mark, no matter how "
"far away it is."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_MAGUS_RECALL"
msgid "You shout out the word of recall and suddenly you are somewhere else."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "magus_stop_attack_shield"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_magus_mageshield"
msgid "Mageshield"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Description of spell "magus_stop_attack_shield ( Mageshield )"
msgid ""
"A simple but powerful spell, Mageshield will render the caster immune to any "
"single attack.  It is indiscriminate: whether hit by an anti-tank missile or "
"the caster stubbing their toe, it will absorb all energy of the attack and "
"then fade."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Name of spell "magus_far_hand_pull"
msgid "Sorcerer's Hand"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Description of spell "magus_far_hand_pull ( Sorcerer's Hand )"
msgid "Pull a target or set of items to you."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "magus_ranged_increase"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_magus_ranged_increase"
msgid "Arrowflight"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Description of spell "magus_ranged_increase ( Arrowflight )"
msgid ""
"A popular military spell since ancient times, Arrowflight increases the range "
"of bows and, as it later turned out, firearms."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Name of spell "magus_diamond_imbuement"
msgid "Diamond Imbuement"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Description of spell "magus_diamond_imbuement ( Diamond Imbuement )"
msgid ""
"Magically infuse a melee weapon with the hardness and resilience of a diamond "
"as well as its industrial cutting capability, making it supremely sharp and "
"durable.  However, like a diamond, any damage the weapon suffers afterwards "
"cannot be repaired."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "magus_silence"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_magus_silence"
msgid "Silence"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Description of spell "magus_silence ( Silence )"
msgid ""
"Affect the air around the target and their vocal cords, preventing them from "
"making any noise whatsoever.  This makes them much more stealthy, but they "
"cannot cast any spells requiring speech."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "magus_light_target"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_magus_faerie_fire"
msgid "Faerie Fire"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Description of spell "magus_light_target ( Faerie Fire )"
msgid ""
"Cause the air around the target to glow slightly, revealing their location "
"and making it slightly harder for them to dodge attacks."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Name of spell "magus_permanent_light"
msgid "Imperishable Light"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Description of spell "magus_permanent_light ( Imperishable Light )"
msgid ""
"Enchant the air in a location to glow, producing a orb of soft light.  While "
"not particularly bright, the light will last years if you're not lucky and "
"millennia if you are."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "magus_cannot_move_attack_or_damage_target"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_magus_cannot_move_attack_or_damage_target"
msgid "Adamantine Gaol"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Description of spell "magus_cannot_move_attack_or_damage_target (
#. Adamantine Gaol )"
msgid ""
"Create an impenetrable shell of force around the target, preventing them from "
"moving or acting for the spell's duration.  The shell works in two directions "
"and the target is also immune to all harm.\n"
"\n"
"Adamantine Gaol <color_yellow>cannot be dispelled</color>."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Name of spell "magus_push_nearby_enemies_back"
msgid "Repulsion Wave"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/magus.json
#. ~ Description of spell "magus_push_nearby_enemies_back ( Repulsion Wave )"
msgid ""
"Unleash a wave of force, hurling all nearby targets away from you.  Heavier "
"targets are harder to affect."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/mana_upgrades.json
#. ~ Name of spell "mana_upgrade_efficiency_01"
msgid "First Circle: Lesser Mana Efficiency."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/mana_upgrades.json
#. ~ Description of spell "mana_upgrade_efficiency_01 ( First Circle: Lesser
#. Mana Efficiency. )"
msgid ""
"Perform a magical ritual to increase the efficiency by which your body "
"processes mana, granting you the Lesser Mana Efficiency trait.  The ritual "
"must end when the sun is in the sky and you are at least one story above the "
"ground.\n"
"\n"
"The chance of the ritual's success depends in your spell level and Spellcraft "
"skill."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/mana_upgrades.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SPELL_GRANT_MANA_ADD1_PART2"
#. in nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_SPELL_GRANT_MANA_ADD1"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SPELL_GRANT_MANA_ADD2_PART2"
#. in nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_SPELL_GRANT_MANA_ADD2"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SPELL_GRANT_MANA_REGEN1_PART2"
#. in nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_SPELL_GRANT_MANA_REGEN1"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SPELL_GRANT_MANA_REGEN2_PART2"
#. in nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_SPELL_GRANT_MANA_REGEN2"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SPELL_GRANT_MANA_MULT1_PART2"
#. in nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_SPELL_GRANT_MANA_MULT1"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SPELL_GRANT_MANA_MULT2_PART2"
#. in nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_SPELL_GRANT_MANA_MULT2"
msgid ""
"As you intone the final words of the spell, you wait for the change, but "
"nothing happens.  You must need more practice."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/mana_upgrades.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SPELL_GRANT_MANA_ADD1"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SPELL_GRANT_MANA_ADD2"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SPELL_GRANT_MANA_REGEN1"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SPELL_GRANT_MANA_REGEN2"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SPELL_GRANT_MANA_MULT1"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SPELL_GRANT_MANA_MULT2"
msgid ""
"You intone the final words of the spell, but without the proper conditions "
"being fulfilled it has no effect."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/mana_upgrades.json
#. ~ Name of spell "mana_upgrade_efficiency_02"
msgid "Second Circle: Mana Efficiency."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/mana_upgrades.json
#. ~ Description of spell "mana_upgrade_efficiency_02 ( Second Circle: Mana
#. Efficiency. )"
msgid ""
"Perform a magical ritual to increase the efficiency by which your body "
"processes mana, granting you the Mana Efficiency trait.  You must already "
"have the Lesser Mana Efficiency trait for the spell to take full effect.  The "
"ritual must end within one hour of noon and you are at least four stories "
"above the ground.\n"
"\n"
"The chance of the ritual's success depends in your spell level and Spellcraft "
"skill."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/mana_upgrades.json
#. ~ Name of spell "mana_upgrade_regeneration_01"
msgid "First Circle: Lesser Mana Regeneration."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/mana_upgrades.json
#. ~ Description of spell "mana_upgrade_regeneration_01 ( First Circle: Lesser
#. Mana Regeneration. )"
msgid ""
"Perform a magical ritual to increase the speed by which your body restores "
"its mana, granting you the Lesser Mana Regeneration trait.  The ritual must "
"be performed while standing in a river or a stream.\n"
"\n"
"The chance of the ritual's success depends in your spell level and Spellcraft "
"skill."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/mana_upgrades.json
#. ~ Name of spell "mana_upgrade_regeneration_02"
msgid "Second Circle: Mana Regeneration."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/mana_upgrades.json
#. ~ Description of spell "mana_upgrade_regeneration_02 ( Second Circle: Mana
#. Regeneration. )"
msgid ""
"Perform a magical ritual to increase the speed by which your body restores "
"its mana, granting you the Mana Regeneration trait.  You must already have "
"the Lesser Mana Regeneration trait for the spell to take full effect.  The "
"ritual must be performed while standing in a river.\n"
"\n"
"The chance of the ritual's success depends in your spell level and Spellcraft "
"skill."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/mana_upgrades.json
#. ~ Name of spell "mana_upgrade_sensitivity_01"
msgid "First Circle: Lesser Mana Sensitivity."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/mana_upgrades.json
#. ~ Description of spell "mana_upgrade_sensitivity_01 ( First Circle: Lesser
#. Mana Sensitivity. )"
msgid ""
"Perform a magical ritual to increase the sensitivity that your body has to "
"mana, granting you the Lesser Mana Sensitivity trait.  The ritual must take "
"place in a natural location away (at least 4 OM tiles) from buildings, roads, "
"or other evidence of civilization.\n"
"\n"
"The chance of the ritual's success depends in your spell level and Spellcraft "
"skill."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/mana_upgrades.json
#. ~ Name of spell "mana_upgrade_sensitivity_02"
msgid "Second Circle: Mana Sensitivity."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/mana_upgrades.json
#. ~ Description of spell "mana_upgrade_sensitivity_02 ( Second Circle: Mana
#. Sensitivity. )"
msgid ""
"Perform a magical ritual to increase the sensitivity that your body has to "
"mana, granting you the Mana Sensitivity trait.  You must already have the "
"Lesser Mana Sensitivity trait for the spell to take full effect.  The ritual "
"must take place in a natural location far away (at least 15 OM tiles) from "
"buildings, roads, or other evidence of civilization.\n"
"\n"
"The chance of the ritual's success depends in your spell level and Spellcraft "
"skill."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/manatouched.json
#. ~ Description of spell "manatouched_crystal ( Crystallize Mana )"
msgid ""
"Crystallizes mana into solid form.  Your physiological changes have made this "
"spell much more efficient and easier to cast."
msgstr ""
"Krystalizuje manę do postaci stałej. Twoje zmiany fizjologiczne sprawiły, że "
"zaklęcie to jest o wiele bardziej wydajne i łatwiejsze do rzucenia."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/manatouched.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_paths/manatouched.json
#. ~ Name of spell "manatouched_seeker_bolts"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Seeker Bolts"
msgstr "Pioruny szukające"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/manatouched.json
#. ~ Description of spell "manatouched_seeker_bolts ( Seeker Bolts )"
msgid ""
"Fires bolts of mana from your fingertips that home in on randomly selected "
"targets in range."
msgstr ""
"Wystrzeliwuje z palców pociski many, które trafiają w losowo wybrane cele w "
"zasięgu."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/manatouched.json
#. ~ Sound description of spell "manatouched_seeker_bolts ( Seeker Bolts )"
msgid "a zing"
msgstr "zing"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/monsterspells.json
#. ~ Sound description of spell "bear_trap ( Bear Trap )"
#. ~ Sound description of spell "forge_trap ( Forge Trap )"
msgid "\"It's a trap!\""
msgstr "„To pułapka!”."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/monsterspells.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "ethereal_grasp_monster ( Ethereal Grasp )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Ethereal Grasp"
msgid ""
"A mass of spectral hands emerge from the ground, slowing everything in range. "
" Higher levels allow a bigger AoE, and longer effect."
msgstr ""
"Masa widmowych rąk wyłania się z ziemi, spowalniając wszystko w zasięgu. "
"Wyższe poziomy pozwalają na większe obszary rażenia i dłuższy efekt."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/monsterspells.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_veggrasp_monster ( Vegetative Grasp Monster
#. )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Vegetative Grasp"
msgid ""
"This spell causes roots and vines to burst forth from the ground and grab "
"your foes, slowing them and doing a small amount of damage as they dig in."
msgstr ""
"To zaklęcie sprawia, że korzenie i pnącza wyrastają z ziemi i chwytają twoich "
"wrogów, spowalniając ich i zadając niewielkie obrażenia, gdy się w nich "
"zagłębiają."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "spell_ravenfolk_leap"
msgid "Wing Leap"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/mutation_spells.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effect_on_conditions/mutation_eocs.json
#. ~ Description of spell "spell_ravenfolk_leap ( Wing Leap )"
#. ~ value of variable 'message_success' in effect in EoC "EOC_RAVENFOLK_LEAP"
msgid "You launch yourself into a powerful wing-assisted leap."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "jolt"
msgid "Jolt"
msgstr "Wstrząs"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "jolt ( Jolt )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Jolt"
msgid "A short-ranged fan of electricity shoots from your fingers."
msgstr "Z twoich palców na krótki dystans wystrzeliwuje wachlarz elektryczności."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "shocking_lash"
msgid "Shocking Lash"
msgstr "Porażające uderzenie"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "shocking_lash ( Shocking Lash )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Shocking Lash"
msgid "A quick burst of electricity strikes a target and possibly one other nearby."
msgstr ""
"Szybki wybuch elektryczności uderza w cel i ewentualnie jeden inny cel w "
"pobliżu."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "lightning_bolt"
#. ~ Name of spell "sylph_call_lightning"
msgid "Lightning Bolt"
msgstr "Błyskawica"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "lightning_bolt ( Lightning Bolt )"
msgid ""
"The go-to spell for many Stormshapers, this iconic spell does just what you "
"expect: shoot lightning from your fingertips.  However, this lightning is "
"more directed than most lightning, and travels in a line through most "
"non-solid targets."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "windstrike"
msgid "Windstrike"
msgstr "Uderzenie wichru"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "windstrike ( Windstrike )"
msgid "A powerful blast of wind slams into anything in front of your body."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "windrun"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "enchant_windrun"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "enchant_windrun_monster"
msgid "Windrunning"
msgstr "Wietrzne bieganie"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "windrun ( Windrunning )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Windrunning"
msgid ""
"A magical wind pushes you forward as you move, easing your movements and "
"increasing speed."
msgstr "Magiczny wiatr popycha cię do przodu, ułatwiając ruchy i zwiększając prędkość."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "storm_hammer"
msgid "Call Stormhammer"
msgstr "Przyzwanie młota burz"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "storm_hammer ( Call Stormhammer )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Call Stormhammer"
msgid ""
"Creates a crackling magical warhammer full of lightning to smite your foes "
"with, and of course, smash things to bits!"
msgstr ""
"Tworzy iskrzący magiczny młot wojenny pełen błyskawic, którym możesz razić "
"swoich wrogów i oczywiście rozbijać rzeczy na kawałki!"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "storm_hammer_plus"
msgid "Enhanced Call Stormhammer"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "storm_hammer_plus ( Enhanced Call Stormhammer )"
msgid ""
"Creates a crackling magical warhammer full of lightning to smite your foes "
"with, and of course, smash things to bits!  Now you know this spell like the "
"back of your hand, and start to design your own version."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "create_rune_stormshaper"
msgid "Stormshaper Rune"
msgstr "Runa zaklinacza burz"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "create_rune_stormshaper ( Stormshaper Rune )"
msgid ""
"This ritual creates a rune attuned to Stormshapers, which looks similar to "
"what you'd expect lightning in a glass pebble to look like.  You can use the "
"rune as a catalyst for recipes."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "lightning_blast"
msgid "Lightning Blast"
msgstr "Wiązka błyskawic"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "lightning_blast ( Lightning Blast )"
msgid ""
"You fire a small concentrated ball of lightning at the target.  The "
"electricity diffuses rapidly, so it doesn't do much damage, but you're able "
"to fire off several ones quickly."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "lightning_storm ( Lightning Storm )"
msgid ""
"You call the power of the sky to strike the earth.  Several lightning blasts "
"fire from your finger tips to strike the target."
msgstr ""
"Wzywasz moc nieba, aby uderzyć w ziemię. Kilka błyskawic wystrzeliwuje z "
"twoich czubków palców, by uderzyć w cel."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "stormshaper_ionization"
msgid "Ionization"
msgstr "Jonizacja"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "stormshaper_ionization ( Ionization )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Ionization"
msgid ""
"By manipulating the charge in the air, you can conjure a sharp snap of "
"lightning over a wide area.  While its destructive potential is a far cry "
"from natural lightning, the light and thunderclap produced will leave your "
"foes reeling."
msgstr ""
"Manipulując ładunkiem w powietrzu, możesz wyczarować gwałtowne uderzenie "
"błyskawicy na dużym obszarze. Choć jej niszczycielski potencjał jest daleki "
"od naturalnych błyskawic, to światło i grzmoty sprawią, że twoi wrogowie będą "
"zdezorientowani."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "stormshaper_wall_of_fog"
msgid "Wall of Fog"
msgstr "Ściana mgły"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "stormshaper_wall_of_fog ( Wall of Fog )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Wall of Fog"
msgid ""
"Draws forth a broad wall of thick fog.  While the sudden force of air "
"pressure will floor any enemies caught in it, the conjuration is otherwise "
"harmless."
msgstr ""
"Wywołuje szeroką ścianę gęstej mgły. Gwałtowne ciśnienie powietrza może "
"przygnieść każdego złapanego w nią wroga, ale poza tym zaklęcie jest "
"nieszkodliwe."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Sound description of spell "thorns_zap ( Repelling Arc Aura )"
msgid "arcing electricity!"
msgstr "łuk elektryczny!"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "stormshaper_repelling_arc"
msgid "Repelling Arc"
msgstr "Odpychający łuk"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "stormshaper_repelling_arc ( Repelling Arc )"
msgid ""
"Manifests an aura of crackling electricity around you to strike attackers "
"with baleful lightning."
msgstr ""
"Manifestuje wokół siebie aurę trzaskającej elektryczności, która razi "
"napastników groźnymi błyskawicami."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "stormshaper_repelling_arc_plus"
msgid "Enhanced Repelling Arc"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "stormshaper_repelling_arc_plus ( Enhanced Repelling
#. Arc )"
msgid ""
"Manifests an aura of crackling electricity around you to strike attackers "
"with baleful lightning.  Now you know this spell like the back of your hand, "
"and start to design your own version."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/ethereal_items.json
#. ~ Name of spell "stormfist"
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Stormfist"
msgid_plural "Stormfists"
msgstr[0] "Pięść Burzy"
msgstr[1] "Pięści Burzy"
msgstr[2] "Pięści Burzy"
msgstr[3] "Pięści Burzy"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/ethereal_items.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "stormfist ( Stormfist )"
#. ~ Description of "Stormfist"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Stormfist"
msgid ""
"Encases your arm and hand in a sheath of crackling magical lightning, you can "
"punch and defend yourself with it in melee combat."
msgstr ""
"Otacza twoją rękę i dłoń płaszczem z iskrzących się magicznych błyskawic, "
"możesz nim zadawać ciosy i bronić się w walce w zwarciu."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "stormfist_plus"
msgid "Enhanced Stormfist"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "stormfist_plus ( Enhanced Stormfist )"
msgid ""
"Encases your arm and hand in a sheath of crackling magical lightning, you can "
"punch and defend yourself with it in melee combat.  Now you know this spell "
"like the back of your hand, and start to design your own version."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "create_electric_lighter"
msgid "Fire Spark"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "create_electric_lighter ( Fire Spark )"
msgid ""
"Summons a small electric spark, that doesn't harm anything.  You can use it "
"to ignite something flammable."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "storm_shipwrecker"
msgid "Shipwrecker"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "storm_shipwrecker ( Shipwrecker )"
msgid ""
"As the sound of the spell moves out of your mouth, it creates a crushing "
"shockwave that shatters everything in its path."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "explosive_decompression"
msgid "Explosive Decompression"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "explosive_decompression ( Explosive Decompression
#. )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Explosive Decompression"
msgid ""
"Create a high-pressure zone originating from the selected point.  Shortly "
"after, a massive pressure wave will crush everything inside, inflicting "
"barotraumatic injuries on everyone affected."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "vacuum_decompression"
msgid "Vacuum Decompression"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "vacuum_decompression ( Vacuum Decompression )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Vacuum Decompression"
msgid ""
"Create a high-pressure zone originating from the selected point.  Shortly "
"after, a massive pressure wave will crush everything inside, inflicting "
"barotraumatic injuries on everyone affected.  The pressure differential will "
"also pull unprepared creatures inside the zone before collapsing."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "air_bubble"
msgid "Air Bubble"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "air_bubble ( Air Bubble )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Air Bubble"
msgid ""
"Cover your head with an air bubble, allowing you to breathe underwater or "
"prevent breathing of toxic gases."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "storm_superconductor"
msgid "Superconductor"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "storm_superconductor ( Superconductor )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Superconductor"
msgid ""
"Create arcs of devastating electric charge in an area around you, roasting "
"everything within."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "shocking_dash"
msgid "Shocking Dash"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "shocking_dash ( Shocking Dash )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Shocking Dash"
msgid "Fill your legs with energy and quickly dash to a target destination."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "shocking_teleport"
msgid "Shocking Teleport"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "shocking_teleport ( Shocking Teleport )"
msgid ""
"Briefly become lightning to teleport to a chosen spot, ignoring all obstacles "
"in-between."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "toxtricity"
msgid "Toxtricity"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "toxtricity ( Toxtricity )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Toxtricity"
msgid ""
"Inject a corrosive electric energy into targets within the affected area, "
"weakening them and dealing huge damage over time."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "electric_eye"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "electric_eye"
msgid "Electric Eye"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "electric_eye ( Electric Eye )"
msgid ""
"Enhance your sight with your powers which allows you to see creatures of the "
"same energy around you.  This enhanced perception speed enables you to see "
"more attacks incoming, allowing for an additional block or dodge attempt."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "electric_waves"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "electric_waves"
msgid "Electric Waves"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "electric_waves ( Electric Waves )"
msgid ""
"Your hands start to store a vast amount of energy, which you release with "
"each attack.  You feel the spell will get stronger with a higher mastery."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "electric_arts"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "electric_arts"
msgid "Electric Arts"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "electric_arts ( Electric Arts )"
msgid ""
"A spell designed for scholars who have recently started to learn "
"stormshaping, allowing them to reduce the damage their often capricious new "
"abilities may cause to themselves."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "summon_teravolt"
msgid "Summon Teravolt"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "summon_teravolt ( Summon Teravolt )"
msgid ""
"Summon a Teravolt, a small, semi-intelligent spirit that homes in on hostile "
"creatures before exploding into a huge spark cloud."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/changeling_spells.json
#. ~ Name of spell "stormshaper_cloak_of_fog"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_cloak_of_fog"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_selkie_fog_cloak"
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of spell "selkie_fog_cloak_spell"
msgid "Cloak of Fog"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "stormshaper_cloak_of_fog ( Cloak of Fog )"
msgid ""
"Call out to the sky spirits for aid and ask them to conceal you from your "
"enemies.  The fog will hide your passage, but you do not have any special "
"ability to see through it yourself."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "stormshaper_heart_of_hurricane"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_heart_of_hurricane"
msgid "Heart of the Hurricane"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "stormshaper_heart_of_hurricane ( Heart of the
#. Hurricane )"
msgid ""
"Compress the fury of hurricane winds into a thin shell of raging air around "
"yourself.  This will make it harder for you to lose your footing or be "
"knocked down and occasionally throw attackers away from you, but the whirling "
"winds are loud."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Message of spell "stormshaper_heart_of_hurricane_throw ( Heart of the
#. Hurricane Throw )"
msgid "The winds lash out and hurl <npcname> away!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Name of spell "stormshaper_cloak_of_frog"
msgid "Cloak of Frog"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "stormshaper_cloak_of_frog ( Cloak of Frog )"
msgid ""
"Someone's personal notes were added to this spell.  You're positive that they "
"changed both the name and the function."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LOSE_CLOAK_OF_FROG_MUTATIONS"
msgid "It wasn't easy being green."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "stormshaper_loud_voice_spell"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_stormshaper_loud_voice"
msgid "Thundering Voice"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
#. ~ Description of spell "stormshaper_loud_voice_spell ( Thundering Voice )"
msgid ""
"Increase the volume of the caster's voice, allowing every word to resound "
"like a peal of thunder.  As a useful side effect, it makes the caster immune "
"to hearing damage caused by loud noises."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "bless"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_feral_technomancer_bless"
msgid "Bless"
msgstr "Błogosławieństwo"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "bless ( Bless )"
msgid "A blessing that gives you energy and boosts your abilities."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "invisibility"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "invisibility"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_photokin_invisibility"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_invisibility_magic_square"
msgid "Invisibility"
msgstr "Niewidzialność"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "invisibility ( Invisibility )"
msgid ""
"Creates a magical field that hides your visual presence to others.  "
"Colloquially known as invisibility, but without all the science mumbo jumbo.  "
"Attacking a target will break the invisibility."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Message of spell "invisibility ( Invisibility )"
msgid "To the outside world, your body fades away and you cease to exist!"
msgstr "Dla świata zewnętrznego twoje ciało zanika i przestajesz istnieć!"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "holy_blade"
msgid "Mage Blade"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "holy_blade ( Mage Blade )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Holy Blade"
msgid "This blade of light will cut through any evil it makes contact with!"
msgstr "To ostrze światła przebije każde zło, z którym się zetknie!"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "holy_blade_plus"
msgid "Enhanced Mage Blade"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "holy_blade_plus ( Enhanced Mage Blade )"
msgid ""
"This blade of light will cut through any evil it makes contact with!  Now you "
"know this spell like the back of your hand, and have started to design your "
"own version."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "spirit_armor"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_feral_technomancer_mage_armor"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_feral_high_technomancer_mage_armor"
msgid "Mage Armor"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "spirit_armor ( Mage Armor )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Spiritual Armor"
msgid "Evil will not make it through your defenses if your faith is strong enough!"
msgstr ""
"Zło nie przebije się przez twoją obronę, jeśli twoja wiara jest wystarczająco "
"silna!"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "spirit_armor_plus"
msgid "Enhanced Mage Armor"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "spirit_armor_plus ( Enhanced Mage Armor )"
msgid ""
"Evil will not make it through your defenses if your faith is strong enough!  "
"Now you know this spell like the back of your hand, and have started to "
"design your own version."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "create_atomic_lamp"
msgid "Lamp"
msgstr "Lampa"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "create_atomic_lamp ( Lamp )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Lamp"
msgid "Creates a magical lamp."
msgstr "Tworzy magiczną lampę."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "recover_bionic_power"
msgid "Manatricity"
msgstr "Manatryczność"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "recover_bionic_power ( Manatricity )"
msgid ""
"You have found a way to convert your mana into power you can use for your "
"bionics."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "create_rune_technomancer"
msgid "Technomancer Rune"
msgstr "Runa technomanty"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "create_rune_technomancer ( Technomancer Rune )"
msgid ""
"This ritual inscribes circuit-like ley-lines into a rune, attuned to "
"Technomancers.  You can use the rune as a catalyst for recipes."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "taze"
msgid "Taze"
msgstr "Porażenie"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "taze ( Taze )"
msgid "This spell arcs two small bolts of electricity into a target, shocking them."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "quantum_tunnel_lesser"
msgid "Lesser Quantum Tunnel"
msgstr "Mniejszy tunel kwantowy"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "quantum_tunnel_lesser ( Lesser Quantum Tunnel )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Lesser Quantum Tunnel"
msgid ""
"This spell manipulates some quantum something or other to tunnel you through "
"a short distance of space, and even matter, unfortunately there's that whole "
"uncertainty thing as to where you come out.  It leaves you a little dazed on "
"the other side as you reorient yourself."
msgstr ""
"To zaklęcie manipuluje jakimś kwantowym czymś lub coś w tym stylu, aby "
"przetransportować cię przez krótki dystans przestrzeni, a nawet materii, "
"niestety jest tu cała ta niepewność co do tego, gdzie wyjdziesz. Pozostawia "
"cię trochę oszołomionego po drugiej stronie, gdzie musisz się zorientować w "
"sytuacji."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "synaptic_stimulation"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "synaptic_stim"
msgid "Synaptic Stimulation"
msgstr "Stymulacja synaptyczna"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "synaptic_stimulation ( Synaptic Stimulation )"
msgid ""
"This spell stimulates the synapses in your brain beyond normal processing "
"speeds, giving you a large boost in mental processing capability.  It "
"enhances your reflexes, speed, and raw intellectual power.  Use responsibly!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "laze"
msgid "Laze"
msgstr "Laser"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "laze ( Laze )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Laze"
msgid ""
"You concentrate and release a focused beam of photons at a target, also known "
"as a laser."
msgstr ""
"Koncentrujesz i uwalniasz skupioną wiązkę fotonów w kierunku celu, znaną "
"również jako laser."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "animated_blade"
msgid "Animated Blade"
msgstr "Ożywione ostrze"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "animated_blade ( Animated Blade )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Animated Blade"
msgid ""
"This spell conjures flying animated blades that will cut your enemies down to "
"size.  Into small pieces that is."
msgstr ""
"To zaklęcie wyczarowuje latające ożywione ostrza, które potną twoich wrogów "
"na kawałki. Na małe kawałki, znaczy się."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "mirror_image"
msgid "Mirror Image"
msgstr "Lustrzane odbicie"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "mirror_image ( Mirror Image )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Mirror Image"
msgid ""
"This spell manipulates light into barely tangible duplicates of a living "
"being, a magical hologram in short."
msgstr ""
"To zaklęcie przetwarza światło w ledwie namacalne duplikaty żywej istoty, w "
"skrócie: magiczny hologram."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "summon_floating_disk"
msgid "Summon Floating Disk"
msgstr "Przywołanie latającego dysku"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "summon_floating_disk ( Summon Floating Disk )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Summon Floating Disk"
msgid "Summons a floating disk that is sworn to carry your burdens."
msgstr "Przywołuje unoszący się dysk, który jest gotów nieść twoje brzemię."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "summon_magic_motorcycle"
msgid "Summon Mojocycle"
msgstr "Przywołanie modżocykla"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "summon_magic_motorcycle ( Summon Mojocycle )"
msgid "You're not a cowboy, but on a steel horse you ride regardless."
msgstr "Nie jesteś kowbojem, choć na stalowym rumaku jeździsz."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "summon_magic_comcycle"
msgid "Summon Co-op cycle"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "summon_magic_comcycle ( Summon Co-op cycle )"
msgid "A bigger ride for bigger loot.  Or a second cowboy."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "overcharge_eyes"
msgid "Optical Sneeze Beam"
msgstr "Kichnięcie optyczną wiązką"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "overcharge_eyes ( Optical Sneeze Beam )"
msgid ""
"You overcharge your internal batteries to send a semi-directed beam from your "
"face.  The inventor of this spell must have had some weird sense of humor."
msgstr ""
"Przeładowujesz swoje wewnętrzne baterie, aby wysłać z twarzy półukierunkowany "
"promień. Wynalazca tego zaklęcia musiał mieć jakieś osobliwe poczucie humoru."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Sound description of spell "overcharge_eyes ( Optical Sneeze Beam )"
msgid "bzzzzzzt!"
msgstr "bzzzzzzt!"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Message of spell "overcharge_eyes ( Optical Sneeze Beam )"
msgid ""
"You overcharge your bionic energy through what ley lines you have left, and "
"channel it through the center of your face."
msgstr ""
"Przeładowujesz swoją bioniczną energię poprzez te linie energetyczne, które "
"ci jeszcze pozostały i przekierowujesz ją przez środek twarzy."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "x-ray"
msgid "X-ray Vision"
msgstr "Rentgenowski wzrok"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "x-ray ( X-ray Vision )"
msgid ""
"You fire a cone of X-rays that magically allows you to see that area for a "
"short time."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "knock"
msgid "Knock"
msgstr "Pukanie"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "knock ( Knock )"
msgid ""
"You channel magic into a force capable of opening doors.  This variant can "
"only open wooden doors."
msgstr ""
"Zamieniasz magię w moc zdolną do otwierania drzwi. Ten wariant może otworzyć "
"tylko drewniane drzwi."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "improved_knock"
msgid "Improved Knock"
msgstr "Ulepszone pukanie"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "improved_knock ( Improved Knock )"
msgid ""
"You channel magic into a force capable of opening doors.  This variant can "
"open any locked door."
msgstr ""
"Przekształcasz magię w moc zdolną do otwierania drzwi. Ten wariant może "
"otworzyć każde zamknięte drzwi."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "technomancer_knifeshot"
msgid "Knifeshot"
msgstr "Nożostrzał"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "technomancer_knifeshot ( Knifeshot )"
msgid ""
"This spell generates a magnetic field around a knife, before launching it at "
"high speed."
msgstr ""
"Zaklęcie to wytwarza pole magnetyczne wokół noża, po czym wystrzeliwuje go z "
"dużą prędkością."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "technomancer_knifeshot_superior"
msgid "Hypervelocity Knifeshot"
msgstr "Nadprędkościowy nożostrzał"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "technomancer_knifeshot_superior ( Hypervelocity
#. Knifeshot )"
msgid ""
"This spell goes even further beyond, launching a knife so fast it can pierce "
"through targets."
msgstr ""
"To zaklęcie idzie jeszcze dalej, wystrzeliwując nóż tak szybko, że może "
"przebić cele na wylot."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "technomancer_robot_shutdown"
msgid "Shutdown"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "technomancer_robot_shutdown ( Shutdown )"
msgid ""
"Overload the target, stunning it briefly.  Originally developed during the "
"Roman Empire to target out-of-control golems, this spell became significantly "
"more popular in modern times when it was discovered it also worked on robots "
"and machinery."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "technomancer_conjure_radio"
msgid "Speak through the Aether"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "technomancer_conjure_radio ( Speak through the
#. Aether )"
msgid ""
"One of the most widely-known pre-modern technomantic spells, this allows "
"technomancers to communicate at a distance.  Its use declined rapidly after "
"Guglielmo Marconi invented the radio and suddenly everyone could listen in to "
"their conversations."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "technomancer_conjure_ups"
msgid "Power Supply"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "technomancer_conjure_ups ( Power Supply )"
msgid ""
"For the technomancer with no enhancements, this spell summons a power supply "
"composed of pure mana that can be used to charge any compatible device.  Just "
"keep it on your person and it will continually recharge your electronic "
"devices until the duration expires."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "technomancer_welder"
msgid "Voltaic Touch"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "technomancer_welder ( Voltaic Touch )"
msgid ""
"Using the principles of what were once called \"voltaic arcs\", you can "
"electrically heat metal hot enough to weld it together."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "technomancer_recharge_vehicle"
msgid "Imbue with Lightning"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "technomancer_recharge_vehicle ( Imbue with
#. Lightning )"
msgid ""
"This fancifully-named spell actually restores power to a battery or power "
"grid.  An esoteric curiosity until electrical power became widespread, even "
"then the power efficiency of fossil fuels rendered it a niche spell."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "technomancer_gain_electronics_computer_spell"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_technomancer_gain_electronics_computer"
msgid "Machine Mind"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "technomancer_gain_electronics_computer_spell (
#. Machine Mind )"
msgid ""
"This spell grants the caster an intuitive understanding of electronics and "
"computers, making their use, repair, and construction much easier."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "technomancer_create_ups_connection"
msgid "Power Linkage"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "technomancer_create_ups_connection ( Power Linkage
#. )"
msgid ""
"Enchant an item so that it is capable of drawing power wirelessly through the "
"air from a compatible power source."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "technomancer_far_sight"
msgid "Zoom Lens"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "technomancer_far_sight ( Zoom Lens )"
msgid ""
"By etching tiny runes on a lens of great quality and infusing it with their "
"magic, the caster can use the lens to see further than even the finest "
"mundane binoculars.  Unfortunately, the arrangement is unstable and the lens "
"will disintegrate after a time."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "technomancer_far_sight_plus"
msgid "Enhanced Zoom Lens"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "technomancer_far_sight_plus ( Enhanced Zoom Lens )"
msgid ""
"This lens can see farther than ever!  Now you know this spell like the back "
"of your hand, and have started to design your own version."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "technomancer_pain_ignore"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_technomancer_pain_ignore"
msgid "The Body Mechanical"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/technomancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "technomancer_pain_ignore ( The Body Mechanical )"
msgid ""
"With a word of power, you spur your body to function as a machine would, "
"partially ignoring the effects of pain for a brief moment."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Alchemist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "alchemist_make_potion_starter"
msgid "Infuse water"
msgstr "Zaczaruj wodę"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Alchemist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "alchemist_make_potion_starter ( Infuse water )"
msgid ""
"Infuse water with ethanol from the air and your own mana to create some "
"potion starter.  Sometimes it might overreact and overflow."
msgstr ""
"Dodaj do wody etanol z powietrza i własną manę, aby stworzyć bazę mikstur. "
"Czasami może wejść w reakcję i się przelać."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Alchemist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "alchemist_make_potion_bomb"
msgid "Manafusion Bomb"
msgstr "Bomba manafuzyjna"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Alchemist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "alchemist_make_potion_bomb ( Manafusion Bomb )"
msgid "Oversaturates potion starter with mana to create a deadly mana explosion."
msgstr "Przesyca starter mikstur maną, tworząc śmiercionośną eksplozję many."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Alchemist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "alchemist_make_potion_trap"
msgid "Manafusion Trap"
msgstr "Pułapka manafuzyjna"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Alchemist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "alchemist_make_potion_trap ( Manafusion Trap )"
msgid ""
"Make a manafusion trap, stabilizing manafusion bombs and giving you some of "
"the excess mana."
msgstr ""
"Stwórz pułapkę manafuzyjną, stabilizującą bomby manafuzyjne i dającą ci część "
"nadmiaru many."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Artificer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "spy_wasp"
msgid "Spy Wasp"
msgstr "Osa szpieg"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Artificer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "spy_wasp ( Spy Wasp )"
msgid ""
"Sends out a partly magical, partly electronic spy drone shaped like a wasp "
"that reveals terrain in a line in front of you.  The wasp can travel through "
"walls."
msgstr ""
"Wysyła częściowo magicznego, częściowo elektronicznego drona szpiegowskiego w "
"kształcie osy, który ujawnia teren w linii przed tobą. Osa może podróżować "
"przez ściany."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Artificer.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "artificer's toolkit"
msgid_plural "artificer's toolkits"
msgstr[0] "przybornik sztukmistrza"
msgstr[1] "przyborniki sztukmistrza"
msgstr[2] "przyborników sztukmistrza"
msgstr[3] "przybornika sztukmistrza"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Artificer.json
#. ~ Description of "artificer's toolkit"
msgid ""
"This is a magical device that can take the shape of many tools.  When not in "
"use it looks like a simple screwdriver."
msgstr ""
"Jest to magiczne urządzenie, które może przybrać kształt wielu narzędzi. Gdy "
"nie jest używane, wygląda jak zwykły śrubokręt."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Artificer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "artificer_toolkit"
msgid "Artificer's Toolkit"
msgstr "Przybornik sztukmistrza"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Artificer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "artificer_toolkit ( Artificer's Toolkit )"
msgid ""
"Artificers have a special pocket dimension with a magical tool that can cover "
"a wide variety of tasks.  It is only a matter of temporarily summoning the "
"item for use."
msgstr ""
"Sztukmistrze posiadają specjalną kieszeń z magicznym narzędziem, które może "
"służyć do wielu różnych zadań. Jest to tylko kwestia czasowego przywołania "
"przedmiotu do użycia."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Biotek.json
#. ~ Name of spell "nitro_boost"
msgid "Nitro Boost"
msgstr "Nitrodopalanie"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Biotek.json
#. ~ Description of spell "nitro_boost ( Nitro Boost )"
msgid ""
"You overclock your flesh and bionics, charging so fast the friction can "
"ignite the air, to wind up for a skull-cracking punch."
msgstr ""
"Podkręcasz swoje ciało i bionikę, ładując się tak szybko, że tarcie może "
"zapalić powietrze, by wyprowadzić rozłupujący czaszkę cios."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Biotek.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biotek_healing"
msgid "Jury Rig"
msgstr "Improwizacja"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Biotek.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biotek_healing ( Jury Rig )"
msgid "Heals a little bit of damage on the target."
msgstr "Leczy nieco obrażeń u celu."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Blood_Mage.json
#. ~ Name of spell "banishment_greater"
msgid "Greater Banishment"
msgstr "Większe wygnanie"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Blood_Mage.json
#. ~ Description of spell "banishment_greater ( Greater Banishment )"
msgid ""
"A more advanced version of Banishment, which is a ritual spell that attempts "
"to banish a monster.  Being closely related to blood magic, the Blood Mage is "
"much more specialized to use a spell like this."
msgstr ""
"Bardziej zaawansowana wersja Wygnania, które jest rytualnym zaklęciem "
"próbującym wygnać potwora. Będąc blisko związanym z magią krwi, mag krwi jest "
"znacznie bardziej wyspecjalizowany w używaniu tego zaklęcia."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Blood_Mage.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Ixythyug the Destroyer's soul"
msgid_plural "Ixythyug the Destroyer's souls"
msgstr[0] "dusza Niszczyciela Ixythyug"
msgstr[1] "dusze Niszczyciela Ixythyug"
msgstr[2] "dusz Niszczyciela Ixythyug"
msgstr[3] "duszy Niszczyciela Ixythyug"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Blood_Mage.json
#. ~ Description of "Ixythyug the Destroyer's soul"
msgid "RIP AND TEAR"
msgstr "WALCZ, ZABIJAJ"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Blood_Mage.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/shapeshifter_mutations.json
#. ~ Name of spell "demonic_possession"
#. ~ Mutation name
msgid "Demonic Possession"
msgstr "Demoniczne opętanie"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Blood_Mage.json
#. ~ Description of spell "demonic_possession ( Demonic Possession )"
msgid ""
"You allow a demon to possess your body for a short time, giving you great "
"combat abilities.  You still retain control, though lose your spellcasting "
"abilities temporarily."
msgstr ""
"Pozwalasz, by demon opanował twoje ciało na krótki czas, dając ci wielkie "
"zdolności bojowe. Nadal zachowujesz kontrolę, ale tymczasowo tracisz zdolność "
"rzucania zaklęć."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Blood_Mage.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_DEMON_POSSESSION"
msgid "Your body fills with demonic power!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Blood_Mage.json
#. ~ Name of spell "demonic_possession_real"
msgid "Demonic Possession Real"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Blood_Mage.json
#. ~ Description of spell "demonic_possession_real ( Demonic Possession Real
#. )"
msgid "Grants the aura that gives the demon traits.  You're not supposed to see this."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Boreal_Mage.json
#. ~ Name of spell "auroral_wave"
msgid "Auroral Wave"
msgstr "Fala zorzy"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Boreal_Mage.json
#. ~ Description of spell "auroral_wave ( Auroral Wave )"
msgid ""
"A rippling wave of luminous energy spreads from your hands, a beautiful "
"torrent of magnetic force and chill wind."
msgstr ""
"Z twoich rąk rozchodzi się falująca fala świetlistej energii, piękny potok "
"magnetycznej siły i chłodnego wiatru."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Boreal_Mage.json
#. ~ Sound description of spell "auroral_wave ( Auroral Wave )"
msgid "a faint shimmering crackle"
msgstr "słaby, wibrujący trzask"

