msgid "Use the unstoppable force from a glacier to cause severe damage."
msgstr "Wykorzystaj niepowstrzymaną siłę lodowca, aby zadać poważne obrażenia."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Glacier_Mage.json
#. ~ Name of spell "frozen_winds"
msgid "Frozen Winds"
msgstr "Mroźne wichry"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Glacier_Mage.json
#. ~ Description of spell "frozen_winds ( Frozen Winds )"
msgid ""
"A gust of wind, colder than any Earthly mountaintop, spirals from your "
"fingers, damaging and pushing anything in its path."
msgstr ""
"Podmuch wiatru, zimniejszy niż jakikolwiek ziemski szczyt górski, rozchodzi "
"się spiralnie od twoich palców, raniąc i popychając wszystko na swojej drodze."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Golemancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "summon_golem_clay"
msgid "Summon Clay Golem"
msgstr "Przywołanie glinianego golema"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Golemancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "summon_golem_clay ( Summon Clay Golem )"
msgid ""
"Use a golem core as a focus to shape clay into a roughly humanoid shape and "
"animate it for some time."
msgstr ""
"Użyj rdzenia golema jako punktu skupienia, aby nadać glinie z grubsza "
"humanoidalny kształt i animować ją przez jakiś czas."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Golemancer.json
#. ~ Name of spell "golem_push"
msgid "Golem Push"
msgstr "Pchnięcie golema"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Golemancer.json
#. ~ Description of spell "golem_push ( Golem Push )"
msgid "You channel the strength of a golem to push an enemy backward."
msgstr "Przywołujesz siłę golema, aby odepchnąć przeciwnika do tyłu."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Gravity_Mage.json
#. ~ Name of spell "gravitymage_graviton"
msgid "Graviton Polarization"
msgstr "Polaryzacja grawitonowa"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Gravity_Mage.json
#. ~ Description of spell "gravitymage_graviton ( Graviton Polarization )"
msgid ""
"Changes and amplifies gravitational pull towards a point you choose, even "
"through walls.  Pulls in items and deals bashing damage in its center."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Gravity_Mage.json
#. ~ Sound description of spell "gravitymage_graviton ( Graviton Polarization
#. )"
msgid "a crack"
msgstr "trzask"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Gravity_Mage.json
#. ~ Name of spell "gravity_mage_leap"
msgid "Gravity Leap"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Gravity_Mage.json
#. ~ Description of spell "gravity_mage_leap ( Gravity Leap )"
msgid ""
"Decrease your weight to a minimum, and use a mana flow to jump to your "
"enemies from a long distance."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Gravity_Mage.json
#. ~ Name of spell "gravity_mage_melee"
msgid "Tactile Telekinesis"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Gravity_Mage.json
#. ~ Description of spell "gravity_mage_melee ( Tactile Telekinesis )"
msgid ""
"When you make contact with an object, it's way easier to manipulate its "
"gravity.  Control gravity around yourself to change your inertia in order to "
"make quick but heavy attacks."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Gravity_Mage.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "gravity_mage_melee"
msgid "Gravity Control"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Gravity_Mage.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Gravity Control"
msgid "Decreases mass of weapon on swing, increases the gravity on attack."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Gravity_Mage.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Gravity Control"
msgid "You cease your control over gravity."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Ice_Elemental.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/item_enchants.json
#. ~ Name of spell "summon_subzero_talons"
#. ~ Name of a enchantment
msgid "Subzero Talons"
msgstr "Zmrożone szpony"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Ice_Elemental.json
#. ~ Description of spell "summon_subzero_talons ( Subzero Talons )"
msgid ""
"Your fingers stiffen as condensation freezes into claws, intensifying your "
"naturally cold touch and protecting your hands from damage."
msgstr ""
"Twoje palce sztywnieją, gdy skropliny zamarzają w szpony, intensyfikując twój "
"naturalnie zimny dotyk i chroniąc dłonie przed uszkodzeniem."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Ice_Elemental.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "cold_heart"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "cold_heart_effect"
msgid "Cold Heart"
msgstr "Mroźne serce"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Ice_Elemental.json
#. ~ Description of spell "cold_heart ( Cold Heart )"
msgid ""
"Harshly drop the temperature inside of your enemies, slowing down their "
"bloodstreams or even shattering organs."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Ice_Elemental.json
#. ~ Name of spell "iceelemental_frostcrystal"
msgid "Form Everfrost"
msgstr "Uformuj wieczną zmarzlinę"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Ice_Elemental.json
#. ~ Description of spell "iceelemental_frostcrystal ( Form Everfrost )"
msgid ""
"Drawing upon the cold in your own blood and the power of your magic you form "
"a large piece of never-thawing ice."
msgstr ""
"Czerpiąc z zimna we własnej krwi i mocy swojej magii, tworzysz duży kawałek "
"nigdy nie zamarzającego lodu."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Illusionist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "spear_of_light"
msgid "Spear of Light"
msgstr "Włócznia światła"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Illusionist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "spear_of_light ( Spear of Light )"
msgid ""
"Shoot directed light from your fingertips that is so bright you can see "
"through the skin of the target for an instant."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Illusionist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "illusionist_hologram"
msgid "Battle Holograms"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Illusionist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "illusionist_hologram ( Battle Holograms )"
msgid ""
"Created to disrupt your enemies, they look exactly like you, and act like a "
"real person."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Illusionist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "illusionist_transposition"
msgid "Illusion Transposition"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Illusionist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "illusionist_transposition ( Illusion Transposition
#. )"
msgid ""
"Fool reality, and swap your position with any other creature in your line of "
"sight"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Magnetism_Mage.json
#. ~ Name of spell "railgun"
msgid "Railgun"
msgstr "Działo elektromagnetyczne"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Magnetism_Mage.json
#. ~ Description of spell "railgun ( Railgun )"
msgid ""
"Magnetize a bullet, and fire it at supersonic speeds by applying an opposite "
"magnetic force to the bullet.  Leaves a trail of sparks"
msgstr ""
"Namagnesuj pocisk i wystrzel go z prędkością naddźwiękową poprzez przyłożenie "
"do niego przeciwnej siły magnetycznej. Pozostawia ślad z iskier."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Magnetism_Mage.json
#. ~ Name of spell "magnetismmage_electrolaser"
msgid "Electrolaser"
msgstr "Elektrolaser"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Magnetism_Mage.json
#. ~ Description of spell "magnetismmage_electrolaser ( Electrolaser )"
msgid ""
"Creates a conductive channel from the caster's hand to the target by ionizing "
"air molecules using a high-powered laser beam, then sends a powerful half "
"million volt charge down the channel."
msgstr ""
"Tworzy przewodzący kanał od dłoni rzucającego aż do celu poprzez jonizację "
"cząsteczek powietrza za pomocą wiązki laserowej o dużej mocy, a następnie "
"wysyła wzdłuż kanału potężny ładunek o napięciu pół miliona woltów."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Magnetism_Mage.json
#. ~ Name of spell "robot_disabler_explosion"
msgid "Surge"
msgstr "Przepięcie"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Magnetism_Mage.json
#. ~ Description of spell "robot_disabler_explosion ( Surge )"
msgid ""
"Send a wave of high-frequency alternating pulses.  It can't hurt living "
"creatures, but is exceptional at stunning and destroying robots.  Even though "
"it isn't an EMP."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Overclocker.json
#. ~ Name of spell "overaccelerate"
msgid "Overaccelerate"
msgstr "Nadmierne przyspieszenie"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Overclocker.json
#. ~ Description of spell "overaccelerate ( Overaccelerate )"
msgid ""
"This drastically increases the target's metabolism to dangerous levels, "
"causing their body to tear itself apart."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Overclocker.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "overclocker_drive"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "overclocker_drive_effect"
msgid "Overdrive"
msgstr "Ponad limit"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Overclocker.json
#. ~ Description of spell "overclocker_drive ( Overdrive )"
msgid ""
"The power of mana flows into you, heightening your speed to supernatural "
"levels in a self-destructive way.  You are a blur amongst your enemies, "
"felling them with blows too swift to see."
msgstr ""
"Przepływa przez ciebie moc many, zwiększając twoją szybkość do "
"nadprzyrodzonego poziomu w autodestrukcyjny sposób. Jesteś jak smuga wśród "
"swoich wrogów, zadając im ciosy zbyt szybkie, by mogli je dostrzec."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Permafrost_Mage.json
#. ~ Name of spell "cold_energy"
msgid "Ice Fog"
msgstr "Lodowa mgła"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Permafrost_Mage.json
#. ~ Description of spell "cold_energy ( Ice Fog )"
msgid ""
"Using your mana, you began to accelerate ice particles inside a cold mist, "
"eroding everything inside."
msgstr ""
"Wykorzystując swoją manę, zaczynasz przyspieszać cząsteczki lodu wewnątrz "
"zimnej mgły, niszcząc wszystko, co się w niej znajduje."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Permafrost_Mage.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Ice Orbit"
msgid_plural "Ice Orbits"
msgstr[0] "Lodowa Orbita"
msgstr[1] "Lodowe Orbity"
msgstr[2] "Lodowych Orbit"
msgstr[3] "Lodowe Orbity"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Permafrost_Mage.json
#. ~ Description of "Ice Orbit"
msgid ""
"Small particles of ice orbit around your body, as a beacon for a giant field "
"of frozen energy."
msgstr ""
"Małe cząsteczki lodu krążą wokół twojego ciała, stanowiąc sygnał dla "
"gigantycznego pola zamrożonej energii."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Permafrost_Mage.json
#. ~ Name of spell "permafrost_mage_ice_age"
msgid "Ice Age"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Permafrost_Mage.json
#. ~ Description of spell "permafrost_mage_ice_age ( Ice Age )"
msgid ""
"Cool down every creature in range 'till their flesh cracks, bones shatter, "
"and armor fractures."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Radiation_Mage.json
#. ~ Name of spell "shortwave"
msgid "Shortwave"
msgstr "Krótkofalówka"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Radiation_Mage.json
#. ~ Description of spell "shortwave ( Shortwave )"
msgid "Cook nearby monsters (and yourself to an extent)."
msgstr "Upiecz pobliskie potwory (i siebie do pewnego stopnia)."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Radiation_Mage.json
#. ~ Name of spell "gamma_burst"
msgid "Gamma Burst"
msgstr "Wybuch gamma"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Radiation_Mage.json
#. ~ Description of spell "gamma_burst ( Gamma Burst )"
msgid ""
"Cause cell damage to everything in a wide area.  Fast to cast, but does "
"damage slowly."
msgstr ""
"Powoduje obrażenia komórkowe wszystkim na dużym obszarze. Szybko się rzuca, "
"ale obrażenia zadaje powoli."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Shaman.json
#. ~ Name of spell "butterfly_swarm"
msgid "Butterfly Swarm"
msgstr "Motyli rój"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Shaman.json
#. ~ Description of spell "butterfly_swarm ( Butterfly Swarm )"
msgid ""
"Summon a pack of butterflies with razor-sharp wings, to cut every creature in "
"your way."
msgstr ""
"Przywołaj stado motyli z ostrymi jak brzytwa skrzydłami, które przetną każde "
"stworzenie na twojej drodze."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Shaman.json
#. ~ Name of spell "summon_keeper_of_the_glades"
msgid "The Guardian of the Forest"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Shaman.json
#. ~ Description of spell "summon_keeper_of_the_glades ( The Guardian of the
#. Forest )"
msgid ""
"Summons a keeper of the glades, a powerful ancient forest spirit, to defend "
"you.  The keeper may be ridden and will unleash its fury on unnatural "
"enemies, but is much less powerful in the cities than in the forest."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Shapeshifter.json
#. ~ Name of spell "shapeshifter_alkahest"
msgid "Alkahest"
msgstr "Alkahest"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Shapeshifter.json
#. ~ Description of spell "shapeshifter_alkahest ( Alkahest )"
msgid ""
"Release a spray of mana-saturated bioactive solvent.  Your ley lines give you "
"a resistance to this acid due to your mana signature, but others beware!"
msgstr ""
"Wypuść spray z bioaktywnym rozpuszczalnikiem nasyconym maną. Twoje linie "
"energetyczne dają ci odporność na ten kwas dzięki twojej sygnaturze many, ale "
"inni uważaj!"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Shapeshifter.json
#. ~ Name of spell "biomechanic"
msgid "Biomechanic"
msgstr "Biomechanik"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Shapeshifter.json
#. ~ Description of spell "biomechanic ( Biomechanic )"
msgid ""
"Who said the human body is weak?  You just need to compress enough mana into "
"your flesh and bones in order to show them who is the deadliest animal in the "
"world."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Soulfire.json
#. ~ Name of spell "burn_at_both_ends"
msgid "Burn at Both Ends"
msgstr "Zapal na obu końcach"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Soulfire.json
#. ~ Description of spell "burn_at_both_ends ( Burn at Both Ends )"
msgid "A candle burns the most brightly at both ends, and yet it burns twice as fast."
msgstr ""
"Świeca pali się najjaśniej na obu końcach, a jednak spala się dwa razy "
"szybciej."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Soulfire.json
#. ~ Name of spell "soul_afterburner"
#. ~ Name of spell "soul_afterburner_real"
msgid "Soul Afterburner"
msgstr "Dopalacz dusz"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Soulfire.json
#. ~ Description of spell "soul_afterburner ( Soul Afterburner )"
msgid ""
"You burn a small portion of your soul to gain a large burst of speed.  You "
"will have to wait until your soul has healed before burning a part of it "
"again."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Soulfire.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_SOUL_AFTERBURNER"
msgid "You gain a sudden burst of speed!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Soulfire.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SOUL_AFTERBURNER"
msgid "Burning your soul before it healed only resulted in some damage to your body."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Soulfire.json
#. ~ Name of spell "soul_afterburner_cooldown_backlash"
msgid "Soul backlash"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Soulfire.json
#. ~ Name of effect type id "soul_burn"
msgid "Soul Burn"
msgstr "Palenie duszy"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Soulfire.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Soul Burn"
msgid ""
"A little of your soul has been burned away, leaving you in a weakened state.  "
"The soul heals quickly, but your body regenerates more slowly while the soul "
"is weak."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Storm_Elemental.json
#. ~ Name of spell "storm_chain_master"
msgid "Storm Chain"
msgstr "Łańcuch burz"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Storm_Elemental.json
#. ~ Description of spell "storm_chain_master ( Storm Chain )"
msgid ""
"You touch an unwilling subject and lightning dances from you to multiple "
"nearby enemies."
msgstr ""
"Dotykasz niechętnego obiektu, a błyskawice przeskakują od ciebie na wielu "
"pobliskich wrogów."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Storm_Elemental.json
#. ~ Name of spell "storm_elemental_electric_melee"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "eff_storm_elemental_electric_melee"
msgid "Galvanic"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Storm_Elemental.json
#. ~ Description of spell "storm_elemental_electric_melee ( Galvanic )"
msgid ""
"Fill your hands with high-voltage electricity, and deal additional electric "
"damage in melee."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Storm_Elemental.json
#. ~ Description of effect type "Galvanic"
msgid "You deal additional electric damage in melee."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Storm_Elemental.json
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Galvanic"
msgid "Electric energy is concentrated in your hands, and it's ready to go."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Storm_Elemental.json
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Galvanic"
msgid "Your hands turn back to normal condition."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Stormcaller.json
#. ~ Name of spell "electric_demon"
msgid "Electric Demon"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Stormcaller.json
#. ~ Description of spell "electric_demon ( Electric Demon )"
msgid "Summon a small electric imp - fast as lightning, and just as deadly."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Stormcaller.json
#. ~ Name of spell "electric_turret"
msgid "Thunder Pillar"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Stormcaller.json
#. ~ Description of spell "electric_turret ( Thunder Pillar )"
msgid ""
"Summon immovable pillars, that will attack your enemies with devastating "
"lightning bolts."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Sun_Mage.json
#. ~ Name of spell "solar_beam"
msgid "Solar Beam"
msgstr "Słoneczna wiązka"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Sun_Mage.json
#. ~ Description of spell "solar_beam ( Solar Beam )"
msgid ""
"Fire a blast of sunlight in a wide beam, blinding everything in its path and "
"leaving it bright enough for you to see for a few seconds."
msgstr ""
"Wystrzeliwuje szeroki strumień światła słonecznego, oślepiający wszystko na "
"swojej drodze i pozostawiający jasność wystarczającą, byś mógł widzieć przez "
"kilka sekund."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Sun_Mage.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/ethereal_items.json
#. ~ Name of spell "sunmage_pocket_sun"
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Pocket Sun"
msgid_plural "Pocket Suns"
msgstr[0] "Kieszonkowe Słońce"
msgstr[1] "Kieszonkowe Słońca"
msgstr[2] "Kieszonkowych Słońc"
msgstr[3] "Kieszonkowego Słońca"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Sun_Mage.json
#. ~ Description of spell "sunmage_pocket_sun ( Pocket Sun )"
msgid ""
"You create a stable portal in the fabric of reality to the sun, through which "
"you can draw on its light and temperature."
msgstr ""
"Tworzysz stabilny portal w tkance rzeczywistości do słońca, przez który "
"możesz czerpać z jego światła i temperatury."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Tundra_Mage.json
#. ~ Name of spell "cold_snap"
msgid "Cold Snap"
msgstr "Przymrozek"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Tundra_Mage.json
#. ~ Description of spell "cold_snap ( Cold Snap )"
msgid ""
"With a snap of your fingers, the target takes cold damage and freezes in "
"place."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Tundra_Mage.json
#. ~ Name of spell "summon_winter_wolf"
msgid "Winter Wolf's Call"
msgstr "Zew zimowego wilka"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Tundra_Mage.json
#. ~ Description of spell "summon_winter_wolf ( Winter Wolf's Call )"
msgid "Summon your personal pack of winter wolves to freeze and maul your foes."
msgstr ""
"Przywołaj swoją osobistą sforę zimowych wilków, które zamrożą i zmasakrują "
"twoich wrogów."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Void_Mage.json
#. ~ Name of spell "voidmage_final_grasp"
msgid "Final Grasp"
msgstr "Ostateczny uścisk"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Void_Mage.json
#. ~ Description of spell "voidmage_final_grasp ( Final Grasp )"
msgid ""
"In the end, everything succumbs to the grasp of nothingness and stasis.  This "
"spell gives the target a foretaste of that."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Void_Mage.json
#. ~ Name of spell "voidmage_horizon_vortex"
msgid "Horizon Vortex"
msgstr "Wir horyzontu"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Void_Mage.json
#. ~ Description of spell "voidmage_horizon_vortex ( Horizon Vortex )"
msgid ""
"Creates a chaotic energy field that disrupts enemies inside it.  It is rather "
"random, and its effects can range from almost nothing to killing all hostiles "
"in the area."
msgstr ""
"Tworzy chaotyczne pole energetyczne, które razi znajdujących się w nim "
"wrogów. Jest ono raczej losowe, a jego efekty mogą wahać się od prawie "
"niczego do zabicia wszystkich wrogów w okolicy."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Vulcanist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "lava_bomb_main"
msgid "Lava Bomb"
msgstr "Bomba lawy"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Vulcanist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "lava_bomb_main ( Lava Bomb )"
msgid ""
"You tear up the ground beneath you to fire a lava bomb: a globe of lava "
"surrounded by hot, solid rock.  It shatters upon impact, spraying shards of "
"rock and lava everywhere."
msgstr ""
"Wyrywasz ziemię pod sobą, by wystrzelić bombę lawy: kulę lawy otoczoną "
"gorącą, litą skałą. Przy uderzeniu roztrzaskuje się, rozrzucając wszędzie "
"odłamki skały i lawy."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Vulcanist.json
#. ~ Name of spell "vulcanist_pyroclastic_flow"
msgid "Pyroclastic Flow"
msgstr "Spływ piroklastyczny"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Vulcanist.json
#. ~ Description of spell "vulcanist_pyroclastic_flow ( Pyroclastic Flow )"
msgid ""
"Pulls up the heat of the Earth, along with considerable smoke mixed with "
"ashes."
msgstr "Wydobywa ciepło Ziemi, wraz z dużą ilością dymu zmieszanego z popiołem."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Wither_Mage.json
#. ~ Name of spell "assassin_strike"
msgid "Assassin Strike"
msgstr "Cios skrytobójcy"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Wither_Mage.json
#. ~ Description of spell "assassin_strike ( Assassin Strike )"
msgid "You strike a poisonous blow and disappear in a puff of toxic smoke."
msgstr "Zadajesz trujący cios i znikasz w kłębach toksycznego dymu."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Wither_Mage.json
#. ~ Name of spell "life_drain"
msgid "Life Drain"
msgstr "Drenaż życia"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Wither_Mage.json
#. ~ Description of spell "life_drain ( Life Drain )"
msgid ""
"This spell takes some of a target's life; part of it comes to you in a "
"less-potent form."
msgstr ""
"To zaklęcie odbiera celowi część jego życia; jego fragment wraca do ciebie w "
"mniej potężnej formie."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/achievements/mutations.json
#. ~ Name of achievement
msgid "Dragons don't have nightmares, nightmares have dragons!"
msgstr "Smoki nie mają koszmarów, koszmary mają smoki!"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/achievements/mutations.json
#. ~ Description of requirement of achievement "Dragons don't have nightmares,
#. nightmares have dragons!"
msgid "crossed black dragon mutation threshold"
msgstr "przekroczono próg mutacji czarnego smoka"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/achievements/spells.json
#. ~ Name of achievement
msgid "Would-be Wizard"
msgstr "Niedoszły czarodziej"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/achievements/spells.json
#. ~ Name of achievement
msgid "Wizard's Apprentice"
msgstr "Pomocnik czarodzieja"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/achievements/spells.json
#. ~ Name of achievement
msgid "Journeyman Wizard"
msgstr "Czarodziej czeladnik"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/achievements/spells.json
#. ~ Description of achievement "Journeyman Wizard"
msgid ""
"You have learned enough spells that in more reasonable times you would have "
"graduated from your apprenticeship."
msgstr ""
"Nauczyłeś się wystarczająco dużo zaklęć, że w bardziej rozsądnych czasach "
"ukończyłbyś naukę zawodu."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/achievements/spells.json
#. ~ Name of achievement
msgid "Archmage"
msgstr "Arcymag"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/achievements/spells.json
#. ~ Description of achievement "Archmage"
msgid ""
"You have learned a large number of spells, and would be qualified for the "
"Archmage title."
msgstr "Nauczyłeś się wielu zaklęć i zakwalifikowałbyś się do tytułu Arcymaga."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/achievements/spells.json
#. ~ Name of achievement
msgid "Master Archmage"
msgstr "Mistrz arcymag"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/achievements/spells.json
#. ~ Description of achievement "Master Archmage"
msgid ""
"You have learned so many spells, that you would have been a major source of "
"knowledge for many wizards.  Also known as a Sage, Master Archmages enjoy a "
"wide variety of perks due to their lifelong commitment to learning and "
"helping others learn."
msgstr ""
"Nauczyłeś się tak wielu zaklęć, że byłbyś głównym źródłem wiedzy dla wielu "
"czarodziejów. Znani również jako mędrcy, mistrzowie arcymagowie cieszą się "
"szeroką gamą korzyści ze względu na ich wieloletnie zaangażowanie w naukę i "
"pomaganie innym w nauce."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/achievements/spells.json
#. ~ Name of achievement
msgid "Senile Wizard"
msgstr "Podstarzały czarodziej"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/achievements/spells.json
#. ~ Name of achievement
msgid "Cast a Spell"
msgstr "Rzucone zaklęcie"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/achievements/spells.json
#. ~ Description of achievement "Cast a Spell"
msgid ""
"The first great milestone to becoming a full-fledged wizard is to cast a "
"spell.  Some mages simply study the spell in the spellbook until they think "
"they understand it as well as they can, but you can't beat practice over "
"theory."
msgstr ""
"Pierwszym wielkim kamieniem milowym do zostania pełnoprawnym czarodziejem "
"jest rzucenie zaklęcia. Niektórzy magowie po prostu studiują zaklęcie w "
"księdze zaklęć, aż myślą, że rozumieją je tak dobrze, jak tylko mogą, ale nie "
"można pokonać praktyki nad teorią."

