"attuned locations or teleport to it if it is attuned."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "Magic Circle"
msgstr "Magiczny Krąg"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "Magic Circle"
msgid ""
"This is a rough magic circle, carved into the ground and decorated with "
"blood, candles, and other small knick-knacks."
msgstr ""
"Jest to chropowaty magiczny krąg, wyrzeźbiony w ziemi i ozdobiony krwią, "
"świecami i innymi drobnymi bibelotami."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "Magic Circle"
msgid ""
"This is a rough magic circle, carved into the ground and decorated with "
"blood, candles, and other small knick-knacks.  It has been enhanced with "
"silver to channel more mana."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "large glowing boulder"
msgstr "duży świecący głaz"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "large glowing boulder"
msgid "Something about this doesn't look right."
msgstr "Coś w tym wszystkim nie wygląda tak jak powinno."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "enchanter's workbench"
msgstr "stół warsztatowy zaklinacza"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "enchanter's workbench"
msgid ""
"An ornate oak cabinet topped by a durable resin countertop resistant to most "
"alchemical spills and burns.  It has wired in electrical and gas fittings, "
"and has been decorated with several protection runes - mostly ornamental."
msgstr ""
"Ozdobna dębowa szafka zwieńczona trwałym żywicznym blatem odpornym na "
"większość alchemicznych wycieków i przypaleń. Posiada okablowanie elektryczne "
"i gazowe oraz kilka run ochronnych - głównie ozdobnych."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "standing alembic"
msgstr "stojący alembik"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "standing alembic"
msgid ""
"A large glass and copper alembic for distilling alchemical concoctions.  It "
"consists of a copper pot with rising spires of twisted glass draining into "
"various removable bottles."
msgstr ""
"Duży szklano-miedziany alembik do destylacji alchemicznych mikstur. Składa "
"się z miedzianego naczynia z wznoszącymi się iglicami z poskręcanego szkła, "
"odprowadzającymi ciecz do różnych wyjmowanych butelek."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/furniture.json
#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
msgid "orrery"
msgid_plural "orreries"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "orrery"
msgid ""
"This is a beautiful, non-scale model of the solar system.  A complex series "
"of gears allows the relative motions of the planets to be studied at the turn "
"of a crank.  This more modern version also has bluetooth and could have been "
"controlled with an app, if there was any power anymore."
msgstr ""
"Jest to piękny model Układu Słonecznego w niedużej skali. Skomplikowana seria "
"kół zębatych pozwala na badanie względnych ruchów planet po przekręceniu "
"korby. Ta bardziej nowoczesna wersja posiada również bluetooth i mogłaby być "
"sterowana za pomocą aplikacji, gdyby była jeszcze dostępna energia "
"elektryczna."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "huge mana crystal"
msgstr "wielki kryształ many"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "huge mana crystal"
msgid ""
"This is a mana crystal that juts from the ground as if it had sprouted up "
"like a weed.  It pulses with a delicate yellow energy, occasionally bursting "
"with flashes of pent-up light."
msgstr ""
"Jest to kryształ many, który wyrasta z ziemi, jakby kiełkował jak chwast. "
"Pulsuje on delikatną żółtą energią, od czasu do czasu wybuchając błyskami "
"skumulowanego światła."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Bashing failed sound
msgid "mana crackling!"
msgstr "trzaski many!"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "stone altar"
msgstr "kamienny ołtarz"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "stone altar"
msgid ""
"This is a big stone altar.  Most commonly used in morally questionable "
"rituals."
msgstr ""
"Jest to duży kamienny ołtarz. Najczęściej używany w wątpliwych moralnie "
"rytuałach."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/worldgen/overmap_terrain.json
#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Overmap terrain name
msgid "attunement altar"
msgstr "ołtarz dostrajania"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "attunement altar"
msgid ""
"An ancient stone plinth covered in symbols that appear to be combinations and "
"variations of the eight magic classes.  Eight depressions are on the top with "
"the original symbols of the classes, each look as though they can hold an "
"item."
msgstr ""
"Starożytny kamienny cokół pokryty symbolami, które wydają się być "
"kombinacjami i odmianami ośmiu magicznych klas. Na szczycie znajduje się "
"osiem wgłębień z oryginalnymi symbolami klas, każde z nich wygląda jakby "
"mogło pomieścić jakiś przedmiot."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/tools.json
#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
msgid "demon forge"
msgid_plural "demon forges"
msgstr[0] "demoniczna kuźnia"
msgstr[1] "demoniczne kuźnie"
msgstr[2] "demonicznych kuźni"
msgstr[3] "demonicznej kuźni"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "demon forge"
msgid ""
"This is a forge made of the chitin of a huge, red spider that has a penchant "
"for flames.  Custom made to withstand the heat from alumentum, this forge can "
"resmelt the magical metals into their workable, ingot form."
msgstr ""
"Jest to kuźnia wykonana z chityny ogromnego, czerwonego pająka, który ma "
"zamiłowanie do płomieni. Wykonana na zamówienie, aby wytrzymać żar alumentum, "
"kuźnia ta może przetapiać magiczne metale do praktycznej formy sztabek."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "candelabra of everlasting candles"
msgstr "kandelabr z wiecznych świec"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "candelabra of everlasting candles"
msgid ""
"A candelabra, strangely the candles never seem to burn down.  Smashing it "
"doesn't seem like it'd produce any worthwhile salvage."
msgstr ""
"Kandelabr, w którym o dziwo świece nigdy się nie wypalają. Wydaje się, że "
"rozbicie go nie przyniosłoby żadnych wartościowych łupów."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "everburning street lamp"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "everburning street lamp"
msgid ""
"A street lamp, strangely the candle never seems to burn down.  Smashing it "
"doesn't seem like it'd produce any worthwhile salvage."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "everburning brazier"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "everburning brazier"
msgid ""
"A raised metal dish in which to safely burn things.  This one seems to "
"contain a flame that burns endlessly without fuel."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "everfrost crystal"
msgstr "kryształ wiecznej zmarzliny"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "everfrost crystal"
msgid ""
"This massive mana crystal juts from the ground as if it had sprouted up like "
"a weed.  It pulses with an angry white light, occasionally flickering "
"brighter."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "flat boulder"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "flat boulder"
msgid ""
"Smooth, flat boulder.  You can use it both as a table and an anvil.  It "
"responds to your force, and you can easily move it."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Bashing sound
msgid "The boulder recedes into the ground."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/furniture.json
#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
msgid "everburning torch candelabra"
msgid_plural "everburning torch candelabras"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "everburning torch candelabra"
msgid ""
"A candelabra made of a half-dozen everburning torches attached to a wooden "
"support structure.  Plenty of light with no worries about power usage or "
"smoke.  Plus, how can you be a real wizard unless your tower is lit by the "
"flicking light of imperishable flames?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "statue of Valzain"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "statue of Valzain"
msgid "A massive solid gold statue of the Forge Lord himself."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "monolithic statue of Valzain"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "monolithic statue of Valzain"
msgid ""
"A truly monolithic statue of the Forge Lord siting lazily on a golden throne. "
" Meeting it's gaze sends chills down your spine."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "owlbear taxidermy"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "owlbear taxidermy"
msgid "An aggressive looking stuffed Owlbear stands here, menacingly."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "stone altar"
msgid "An ancient stone altar, moss-grown and weather-worn."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "standing stone"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "standing stone"
msgid ""
"A tall standing stone.  It is covered in carvings, but they are so worn by "
"wind and rain you can't make out what they might have been."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-plants.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "brambles"
msgid ""
"A thick wall of tangled brambles grows here.  Vicious thorns protrude from "
"the stems."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "Autodoc, Delta Class"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "Autodoc, Delta Class"
msgid ""
"A machine used for the installation and removal of bionics.  The name "
"'Autodoc' is something of a misnomer, as safe operation is only guaranteed "
"with a ritual circle of technomancers.  The entire surface is carved with "
"runes so fine that they look like spiraling circuitry from a distance."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_druid.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "glowing plant bulb"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_druid.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "glowing plant bulb"
msgid ""
"A small, round plant grows here, illuminating the surroundings, grown through "
"druidic magic."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_druid.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "gnarled bookcase"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_druid.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "gnarled bookcase"
msgid ""
"A set of shelves looking more like they were grown than built, all of a "
"single solid piece.  While designed for books, it does a decent job of "
"storing anything else that'll fit."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_druid.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "druidic bed"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_druid.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "druidic bed"
msgid ""
"A solid wooden frame in a single piece and covered in soft, spongy moss with "
"an ordinary sheet over it.  You probably wouldn't have wanted to sleep on it "
"before the Cataclysm, but nowadays any real bed is a luxury."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_druid.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/furniture.json
#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
msgid "gnarled chair"
msgid_plural "gnarled chairs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_druid.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/furniture.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "gnarled chair"
#. ~ Description of "gnarled chair"
msgid ""
"A simple wooden chair with four legs, a seat, and a back, all seemingly grown "
"out of a single solid piece of wood.  Despite the twisted lines, it still "
"looks extremely comfortable."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_druid.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "gnarled desk"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_druid.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "gnarled desk"
msgid ""
"A wooden desk, all formed of a single solid piece and covered in the whorls "
"of natural wood.  It even has a single leaf growing off a patch of bark on "
"the side."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_druid.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "gnarled wardrobe"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_druid.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "gnarled wardrobe"
msgid ""
"A large wooden cabinet, all grown from a single piece of wood but somehow "
"still containing doors that open.  You could store plenty of things in here."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_druid.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "gnarled table"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_druid.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "gnarled table"
msgid ""
"A knotted wooden table, looking more like it was grown rather than assembled. "
" You could sit down at it to eat like a civilized person."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_druid.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "gnarled wooden rack"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_druid.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "gnarled wooden rack"
msgid ""
"A wooden shelving unit with angled storage surfaces designed to show off "
"whatever is stored on it.  This one seems to be grown all from a single piece "
"of wood, gnarled and covered in bark.  There's even a bit of moss growing on "
"it."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_druid.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "gnarled sink"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_druid.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "gnarled sink"
msgid ""
"A water basin with a water tap and drain, but all made of wood except for the "
"piping.  Even the taps, however that works."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_druid.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "gnarled counter"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_druid.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "gnarled counter"
msgid ""
"A plain wooden countertop, all made of a single, solid piece of wood.  Makes "
"a decent surface for storage or crafting, even it's not completely level."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_druid.json
#. ~ Vehicle part name
msgid "awoken weaver shelter"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_druid.json
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "awoken weaver shelter"
msgid ""
"A shelter woven from wildwood weaver's webs.  It can be used to rest, and the "
"weaver provides assistance in any tailoring task."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_plants.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "platonic flower"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_plants.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "platonic flower"
msgid ""
"Small bush, that looks like a pair of dragon curves, with a flower in the "
"very center.  The branches of the plant can be used as a perfect ruler."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_plants.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "moonflower bush"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_plants.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "moonflower bush"
msgid ""
"A silver colored vine, whose luminescent flowers will only bloom during "
"night.\n"
"\n"
"Amazingly rare, it grows only in places where heroic deeds took place, or so "
"it's believed."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_plants.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/herbs_and_flowers.json
#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
msgid "kampuch"
msgid_plural "kampuches"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_plants.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "kampuch"
msgid ""
"The tiny and lethal rod flowers of the Kämpuch break the underbrush like "
"small ivory thorns."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_plants.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "olieribos"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_plants.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "olieribos"
msgid ""
"Dark colored leaves and bitter roots, firmly entrenched in untrodden earth.  "
"They can be used to ward against evil, or to attract it."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_plants.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "glowing mushrooms"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_plants.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "glowing mushrooms"
msgid ""
"A bioluminescent mushroom shaped like a small nest.  Motes of light "
"occasionally detach from its surface and float upwards before fading."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_plants.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "horn moss"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_plants.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "horn moss"
msgid ""
"A cluster of red moss, so called for the white capsules that it will grow "
"during spring."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_plants.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "golden reed"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_plants.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "golden reed"
msgid "Thin stalks colored deep yellow, crowned with blue feather-like leaves."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_plants.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "barnacle weed"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_plants.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "barnacle weed"
msgid ""
"A wooden pod kept aloft by a spiral stalk and the short, dagger-shaped leaves "
"growing at its base."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_plants.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "dragonails"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_plants.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "dragonails"
msgid ""
"A small tangle of old and crooked wood, completely covered with black "
"menacing thorns."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_plants.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "moly"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_plants.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "moly"
msgid ""
"A small herb with milk white flowers and pitch black roots.  Known since "
"Ancient Greece, it was brought to the New World by European druids long ago."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_plants.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "flowering fern"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_plants.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "flowering fern"
msgid "A seemingly normal fern, which has somehow produced a single red flower."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_plants.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "funnelcap"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_plants.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "funnelcap"
msgid ""
"A man-sized mushroom, with most of its bulk defined by a tall funnel shaped "
"pileus, which collects rainfall."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_plants.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "sojourner's palm"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_plants.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "sojourner's palm"
msgid ""
"A large magical palm tree, normally you would find it in the tropics, but "
"this plant also has the well documented ability to teleport randomly."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_plants.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "whiskflower bush"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_plants.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "whiskflower bush"
msgid ""
"A small plant with curled leaves and pink whisk-shaped flowers.  It has a "
"very strong alcoholic smell."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_pure_magic.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "imperishable light"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_pure_magic.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "imperishable light"
msgid "A glowing orb of light floats here, emitting a soft radiance."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_pure_magic.json
#. ~ Query message shown in a popup
msgid "Dismiss the imperishable light?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_stone.json
#. ~ Furniture name
msgid "rock troll statue"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_stone.json
#. ~ Description of furniture "rock troll statue"
msgid ""
"A massive block of stone in the shape of a rock troll, because it used to be "
"a rock troll."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "burnt tree"
msgstr "spalone drzewo"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "burnt tree"
msgid ""
"This tree looks like it has been burnt badly, but it is somehow still "
"standing."
msgstr "To drzewo wygląda na mocno spalone, ale jakoś nadal stoi."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "dry cocoon"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "dry cocoon"
msgid ""
"This is a large cocoon-like object that looks to be the vague shape of some "
"creature.  You don't want to know how long it stayed alive while being sucked "
"dry by these spiders."
msgstr ""
"To duży obiekt w kształcie kokonu przypominającego sylwetkę jakiejś istoty. "
"Nie masz ochoty wiedzieć jak długo pozostała przy życiu będąc wysysana do "
"sucha przez te pająki."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "webbing wall"
msgstr "ściana z pajęczyny"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "webbing wall"
msgid ""
"This wall seems to be made up of a combination of webbing, wood splinters, "
"detritus, and some kind of dark-colored resin."
msgstr ""
"Ta ściana wydaje się być zbudowana z połączenia pajęczyny, drzazg "
"drewnianych, odpadków i jakiegoś rodzaju ciemno zabarwionej żywicy."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "barren dirt"
msgstr "jałowy grunt"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "barren dirt"
msgid ""
"It's dirt.  The ground here is infertile.  Could also be dug out for "
"construction projects."
msgstr ""
"To jest brud. Tutejsza ziemia jest nieurodzajna. Może być również wykopana "
"pod budowę."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "glassteel vault wall"
msgstr "ściana skarbca ze staloszkła"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "glassteel vault wall"
msgid ""
"A barrier made of glassteel, it's nothing complicated, and looks extremely "
"fragile.  It is most definitely not fragile and it's probably alarmed in the "
"event that someone does break through it."
msgstr ""
"Bariera wykonana z staloszkła, nie jest niczym skomplikowanym i wygląda "
"niezwykle krucho. Z całą pewnością nie jest jednak krucha a w razie, gdyby "
"ktoś się przez nią przebił, prawdopodobnie włączy się alarm."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#. ~ Bashing sound
msgid "a cross between steel bending and glass shattering!"
msgstr "skrzyżowanie giętej stali z kruszonym szkłem!"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "concrete floor, everburning chandelier"
msgstr "betonowa podłoga, wiecznie płonący żyrandol"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "concrete floor, everburning chandelier"
msgid ""
"A bare and cold concrete floor with an elaborate chandelier above it filled "
"with everburning candles."
msgstr ""
"Goła i zimna betonowa podłoga, a nad nią misterny żyrandol wypełniony "
"wiecznie palącymi się świecami."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "magically reinforced concrete wall"
msgstr "magicznie wzmocniona ściana betonowa"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "magically reinforced concrete wall"
msgid ""
"An extremely resilient wall, filled with concrete and rebar and esoteric "
"ingredients.  Best suited for supporting multi-level buildings, only serious "
"explosives and high-speed impacts would be capable of damaging this wall."
msgstr ""
"Niezwykle odporna ściana, wypełniona betonem, prętami zbrojeniowymi i "
"ezoterycznymi składnikami. Najlepiej nadaje się do podtrzymywania "
"wielopoziomowych budynków, tylko silne materiały wybuchowe i uderzenia o "
"wielkiej prędkości byłyby w stanie uszkodzić tę ścianę."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "magically reinforced concrete floor"
msgstr "magicznie wzmocniona betonowa podłoga"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "magically reinforced concrete floor"
msgid ""
"Extremely resilient floor made from carefully placed rebar and poured "
"alchemical concrete, capable of providing protection from the elements.  As "
"for the matching roof, it still requires supporting walls, otherwise it may "
"very well cave in."
msgstr ""
"Ekstremalnie wytrzymała podłoga z alchemicznego żelbetu, zdolna zapewnić "
"ochronę przed warunkami zewnętrznymi. Jeśli chodzi o odpowiadający jej dach, "
"to nadal potrzebuje podtrzymujących go ścian, w przeciwnym wypadku może "
"równie dobrze się zapaść."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "vault vent"
msgstr "otwór wentylacyjny skarbca"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "vault vent"
msgid "This concrete flooring has a vent pouring fresh, clean air into the vault."
msgstr ""
"Betonowa podłoga posiada otwór wentylacyjny, przez który do skarbca wpływa "
"świeże, czyste powietrze."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_druid.json
#. ~ Terrain name
msgid "heartwood floor"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_druid.json
#. ~ Description of terrain "heartwood floor"
msgid "The living heartwood of the tree."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "owlbear gastrolith"
msgid_plural "owlbear gastroliths"
msgstr[0] "gastrolit sowoniedźwiedzia"
msgstr[1] "gastrolity sowoniedźwiedzia"
msgstr[2] "gastrolitów sowoniedźwiedzia"
msgstr[3] "gastrolitu sowoniedźwiedzia"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Description of "owlbear gastrolith"
msgid ""
"This strangely shaped rock was once a part of an owlbear's complex digestive "
"system, creating a link between owl throat and bear stomach.  It is possible "
"that it could serve a similar purpose in alchemy, helping to bind together "
"two disparate halves."
msgstr ""
"Ten dziwnie ukształtowany kamień był niegdyś częścią skomplikowanego układu "
"pokarmowego niedźwiedzia sowiego, tworząc połączenie między gardłem sowy a "
"żołądkiem niedźwiedzia. Możliwe, że mógłby służyć podobnemu celowi w "
"alchemii, pomagając połączyć dwie rozbieżne połówki."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "stone shell"
msgid_plural "stone shells"
msgstr[0] "kamienna skorupa"
msgstr[1] "kamienne skorupy"
msgstr[2] "kamiennych skorup"
msgstr[3] "kamiennej skorupy"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Description of "stone shell"
msgid ""
"The broken fragment of an owlbear egg.  With luck it might still contain some "
"of its former power, though if nothing else it's still a bit sharp."
msgstr ""
"Odłamany fragment jaja sowoniedźwiedzia. Przy odrobinie szczęścia może "
"jeszcze zawierać część dawnej mocy, choć jeśli nie, to wciąż jest nieco ostry."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "copper infusion bracelet"
msgid_plural "copper infusion bracelets"
msgstr[0] "nasycona miedziana bransoletka"
msgstr[1] "nasycone miedziane bransoletki"
msgstr[2] "nasyconych miedzianych bransoletek"
msgstr[3] "nasyconej miedzianej bransoletki"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Description of "copper infusion bracelet"
#. ~ Description of "silver infusion bracelet"
msgid ""
"This bracelet has runes engraved on it.  You sense a faint air of mysticism "
"when you look at it.  It would be useful for imbuing mana into material."
msgstr ""
"Na tej bransoletce wygrawerowane są runy. Gdy na nią patrzysz, wyczuwasz "
"lekki powiew mistycyzmu. Przydałaby się do nasycania materiału maną."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "silver infusion bracelet"
msgid_plural "silver infusion bracelets"
msgstr[0] "nasycona srebrna bransoletka"
msgstr[1] "nasycone srebrne bransoletki"
msgstr[2] "nasyconych srebrnych bransoletek"
msgstr[3] "nasyconej srebrnej bransoletki"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "copper circlet"
msgid_plural "copper circlets"
msgstr[0] "miedziany diadem"
msgstr[1] "miedziane diademy"
msgstr[2] "miedzianych diademów"
msgstr[3] "miedzianego diademu"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Description of "copper circlet"
msgid ""
"A wooden band with copper trimmings to be worn on the head.  Touching your "
"temples with it on makes you feel very calm."
msgstr ""
"Drewniana opaska z miedzianymi wykończeniami do noszenia na głowie. Poprzez "
"dotknięcie skroni mając ją na sobie można poczuć się bardzo spokojnie."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#. ~ Item name
