msgstr[0] "Ichaival"
msgstr[1] "Ichaival"
msgstr[2] "Ichaival"
msgstr[3] "Ichaival"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/archery.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Ichaival"
#. ~ Description of "Ichaival"
msgid ""
"Ichaival, the bow of Odin.  Rumored to fire 10 arrows with every pull of the "
"string.  It has gold and silver ornaments on it, as well as an ornate Raven."
msgstr ""
"Ichaival, łuk Odyna. Podobno wystrzeliwuje 10 strzał przy każdym naciągnięciu "
"cięciwy. Posiada złote i srebrne ornamenty, a także ozdobnego kruka."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/archery.json
#. ~ Description of "orichalcum arrow"
msgid ""
"An arrow composed of a sliver of orichalcum.  The arrow has a mysterious "
"glow.  Has a very high chance of staying intact when fired, however can only "
"be fired from Ichaival."
msgstr ""
"Strzała zbudowana z kawałka orichalcum. Strzała ma tajemniczą poświatę. Ma "
