"The red fox, an omnivorous canine and largest of the true foxes, it is a wily "
"hunter with a combative, suspicious temperament.  Sparks occasionally crackle "
"over its fur and its body distorts oddly as it moves, covering more ground "
"with each stride than the length of its legs would indicate."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "gremlin"
#, c-format
