#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/recipes/nether_attunement.json
#. ~ Description of recipe crafting "EOC_MATRIX_DRAIN_MEDITATION"
msgid ""
"That report indicated there was a way to channel the additional nether energy "
"from long-term psionic use into a focusing object.  All you need is a drained "
"matrix crystal and time."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/recipes/nether_attunement.json
