#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/recipes/research.json
#. ~ Description of recipe crafting "EOC_UNLOCK_RAD_POWERS"
msgid ""
"Study the plethora of documents and files found on the Project PHAVIAN USB.  "
"It has something to do with radiation; beyond that, you're not sure."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/recipes/research.json
#. ~ Custom name for recipe crafting "EOC_UNLOCK_RAD_POWERS"
msgid "study the Phavian USB documents"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/recipes/research.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_UNLOCK_RAD_POWERS" in result of
#. recipe crafting "EOC_UNLOCK_RAD_POWERS"
msgid ""
"There's a lot here, but you've discovered that it's organized into two main "
"tracks.  One has a lot of detailed scans of the body and health data and is "
"labeled HONEY BRAVO, and the other has a series of photos that seem oddly "
"distorted, charts with some kind of waveforms on them, and other documents "
"and is labeled RED SAFARI."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/recipes/research.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_UNLOCK_RAD_POWERS" in result
#. of recipe crafting "EOC_UNLOCK_RAD_POWERS"
msgid ""
"You can understand the technical principles but the actual processes make no "
"sense.  It must be some aspect of psionics that you don't possess or don't "
"fully grasp."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/recipes/research.json
#. ~ Description of recipe crafting "EOC_UNLOCK_RAD_POWERS_CLAIR"
msgid ""
"Study the plethora of documents and files found on the Project PHAVIAN USB "
"relating to RED SAFARI.  It has something to do with radiation detection; "
"beyond that, you're not sure."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/recipes/research.json
#. ~ Custom name for recipe crafting "EOC_UNLOCK_RAD_POWERS_CLAIR"
msgid "study the RED SAFARI documents"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/recipes/research.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_UNLOCK_RAD_POWERS_CLAIR" in result
#. of recipe crafting "EOC_UNLOCK_RAD_POWERS_CLAIR"
msgid ""
"This would have been so much easier if you had an actual tutor, but you "
"finally understand.  All the documents, the videos, the reports, they're "
"trying document a method of using clairsentience to detect radiation.  And "
"you're pretty sure you can do it now."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/recipes/research.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_UNLOCK_RAD_POWERS_CLAIR" in
#. result of recipe crafting "EOC_UNLOCK_RAD_POWERS_CLAIR"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_UNLOCK_RAD_POWERS_VITA" in
#. result of recipe crafting "EOC_UNLOCK_RAD_POWERS_VITA"
msgid ""
"There's a lot here.  Maybe you didn't understand it, or maybe your powers "
"aren't advanced enough.  You'll need to try again."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/recipes/research.json
#. ~ Description of recipe crafting "EOC_UNLOCK_RAD_POWERS_VITA"
msgid ""
"Study the plethora of documents and files found on the Project PHAVIAN USB "
"relating to HONEY BRAVO.  It has something to do with radiation treatment; "
"beyond that, you're not sure."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/recipes/research.json
#. ~ Custom name for recipe crafting "EOC_UNLOCK_RAD_POWERS_VITA"
msgid "study the HONEY BRAVO documents"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/recipes/research.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_UNLOCK_RAD_POWERS_VITA" in result of
#. recipe crafting "EOC_UNLOCK_RAD_POWERS_VITA"
msgid ""
"This would have been so much easier if you had an actual tutor, but you "
"finally understand.  All the documents, the videos, the reports, they're "
"trying document a method of using vitakinesis to cure radiation poisoning.  "
"And you're pretty sure you can do it now."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/recipes/research.json
#. ~ Description of recipe crafting "EOC_UNLOCK_EXTENDED_CHANNELING"
msgid ""
"There has to be an easier way of evoking your powers than frantically "
"concentrating and trying to get the energies out.  Maybe if you took more "
"time, you wouldn't have to concentrate so hard?  It wouldn't help you when a "
"zombie was trying to eat you but it would definitely be useful otherwise."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/recipes/research.json
#. ~ Custom name for recipe crafting "EOC_UNLOCK_EXTENDED_CHANNELING"
msgid "research extended channeling"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/recipes/research.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_UNLOCK_EXTENDED_CHANNELING" in
#. result of recipe crafting "EOC_UNLOCK_EXTENDED_CHANNELING"
msgid ""
"You've figured it out.  The concept of \"taking more time\" wasn't exactly "
"hard to grasp, but maintaining the images in your mind, keeping your focus on "
"a single train of thought, that was harder.  Now you've got it down, though.  "
"If you take meticulous care in channeling your powers, it will take much "
"longer but you'll be more likely to succeed."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/recipes/research.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_UNLOCK_EXTENDED_CHANNELING" in
#. result of recipe crafting "EOC_UNLOCK_EXTENDED_CHANNELING"
msgid ""
"There's just something you're not grasping.  You need more practice before "
"you can get it down."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/recipes/research.json
#. ~ Description of recipe crafting "EOC_UNLOCK_TORRENTIAL_CHANNELING"
msgid ""
"You have more of an understanding of the way the Nether ebbs and flows, "
"sometimes surging forth like a flood when you least expect it.  There has to "
"be a way to direct that more purposefully, to call forth more energy than you "
"need and direct it into your powers instead of letting it wash over you.  It "
"might be risky, sure, but you need every edge you can get in this "
"post-Cataclysmic world."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/recipes/research.json
#. ~ Custom name for recipe crafting "EOC_UNLOCK_TORRENTIAL_CHANNELING"
msgid "research torrential channeling"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/recipes/research.json
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_UNLOCK_TORRENTIAL_CHANNELING" in
#. result of recipe crafting "EOC_UNLOCK_TORRENTIAL_CHANNELING"
