#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets_new.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_file_biokinesis"
#. ~ Phavian designation for biokinetic study is BURNT NOVEMBER.  Designation
#. for use in combat is VERDANT HAND
msgid ""
"At 1756 (dive time), Sergeant Eric Collins's team came under attack by an "
"XE157 entity near the end of scheduled in-phase time.  Despite the "
"expenditure of most of their ordinance, XE157 suffered no significant damage "
"and continued its attack.  Despite the known combat capabilities of XE157 and "
"with no regard for his own safety, Sergeant Collins ordered his team to "
"retreat to the dive breachhead and engaged it in hand-to-hand combat, holding "
"it off for several minutes while his team exited the dive.  The aperture was "
"held open for an additional minute afterward, allowing just enough time for a "
"severely-injured Sergeant Collins to exit the dive and preventing the exit of "
"XE157.  Sergeant Collins suffered severe lacerations, the loss of two "
"fingers, and burns across fifty percent of his arms and upper body; he has "
"since volunteered to be a test subject for SMOKE USHER.  In lieu of a medal, "
"we have authorized a meritorious service bonus to be applied retroactive to "
"the beginning of the year."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/snippets/snippets_new.json
