#. find.
msgid ""
"Ye scuffers 'ere dolly walk through the mirror and butcher hook us and ours.  "
"Nevermind the enemy, do these pork loins as if'n the enemy'd nevermind them.  "
"Oy, they got their rust shirt and more comin'."
