#. They aren't on every world and the Exodii don't know why that is.
msgid ""
"Claret drinking brown bread, an' a crew of Renny's, on this mudball.  Us un's "
"can't tell if they're part of the enemy or parasites exposed when the enemy "
"rises.  Not on every mudball but definitely moar than enough to be a right "
"pain."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/rubik.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
