#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/snippets/e_logs.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ This is extending the vanilla snippets belonging to mostly work of random
#. people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos that people share, or
#. something they can film by themselves.
msgid ""
"hunternetvulfgar.mp4\n"
"The video cuts in as a montage of school security cameras in hallways, as a "
"young man and woman break into the school.  As they walk past each camera, "
"that image drops and the others rearrange larger, while a popular song from "
"the 90's begins playing.  The young adults enter a classroom and are clearly "
"flirting.\n"
"Awoo oooh, got you where I want you\n"
"plays over top of the video.  The man laughs at something the woman says, and "
"throws his head back laughing while she is clearly annoyed.  His face "
"elongates as his body grows, shredding the clothes he is wearing as limbs "
"change and sprout thick fur.  She has backed away from him and put the "
"students' and teacher's desks between them.  Fully transformed into a hideous "
"wolfman, he begins his approach towards his once date now prey, smashing "
"chairs and students' desks out of his way.  Suddenly the wolfcreature pauses "
"and its ears prick up.  It turns and looks at the wall of windows in the "
"classroom.  Glass erupts into the room as the darkness outside the window "
"shows the muzzle flare of at least a dozen different guns firing.  The "
"wolfcreature is hit more times than you can count in a span of seconds and "
"falls to the ground.\n"
"The song reaches a crescendo 'Got you where I want you, got you, yeahhhhh!' "
"as his date pulls a large caliber pistol out of the teachers desk, walks over "
"to the fallen beast and calmly puts three bullets in its skull.  The video "
"ends."
msgstr ""

