#. ~ Name of a gun
msgid "C8 carbine"
msgid_plural "C8 carbines"
msgstr[0] "karabinek C8"
msgstr[1] "karabinki C8"
msgstr[2] "karabinków C8"
msgstr[3] "karabinka C8"

#: data/mods/classic_zombies/items/guns.json
#. ~ Description of gun "C8 carbine"
#. ~ Description of "C8 carbine"
msgid ""
"A carbine variant of the C7A1, recently introduced by the Canadian armed "
"forces.  Though accurate, small, and lightweight, it is infamous for its "
"unreliability when not properly maintained.  It is chambered in 5.56x45mm and "
"accepts STANAG magazines."
msgstr ""
"Wariant karabinka C7A1, wprowadzony niedawno przez kanadyjskie siły zbrojne. "
"Choć jest celny, mały i lekki, słynie z zawodności, gdy nie jest odpowiednio "
"konserwowany. Posiada komorę na nabój 5,56 x 45 mm i przyjmuje magazynki "
"STANAG."

