msgstr[3] "Browning Hi-Power"

#: data/mods/classic_zombies/items/guns.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Browning Hi-Power"
#. ~ Description of "Browning Hi-Power"
msgid ""
"A licensed copy of the Browning Hi-Power, made by John Inglis and Company.  "
"Issued to officers and infantry in need of a weapon for confined spaces, this "
"is chambered in 9x19 Parabellum."
msgstr ""
"Licencjonowana kopia Browninga Hi-Power, wyprodukowana przez firmę John "
"Inglis and Company. Wydawana oficerom i piechocie, którzy potrzebowali broni "
"do walki w ciasnych pomieszczeniach, ta broń jest w kalibrze 9 x 19 "
"Parabellum."

#: data/mods/classic_zombies/items/guns.json
#. ~ Description of gun "M1911A1"
#. ~ Description of "M1911A1"
msgid ""
"This is a semi-automatic pistol, chambered in .45 ACP and accepting M1911 "
"magazines."
msgstr ""
"Jest to pistolet półautomatyczny, kalibru .45 ACP i akceptujący magazynki "
"M1911."

#: data/mods/classic_zombies/items/guns.json
#. ~ Variant name of gun "M1911A1"
