#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Boating License" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've trained in how to pilot marine craft, as well as general boating and "
"swimming safety."
msgstr ""
"Zostałeś przeszkolony w zakresie pilotowania jednostek morskich, a także "
"ogólnego bezpieczeństwa na łodzi i podczas pływania."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Driving License" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You got your driving license and know how to drive a car, change the oil and "
"tires, and other basics."
msgstr ""
"Masz prawo jazdy i wiesz, jak prowadzić samochód, wymieniać olej i opony oraz "
"znasz inne podstawowe zasady."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Simple Home Cooking" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've been living on your own long enough that you know how to cook basic "
"dishes and feed yourself."
msgstr ""
"Mieszkasz na własną rękę na tyle długo, że wiesz, jak ugotować podstawowe "
"potrawy i samemu się wyżywić."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Computer Literate" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Either through school, your job, or from your family, you've learned the "
"basics of how to use a computer."
msgstr "Dzięki szkole, pracy lub rodzinie nauczyłeś się podstaw obsługi komputera."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Social Skills" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've spent a significant portion of your life living among other people and "
"are familiar with social norms.  You know how to talk with other people, and "
"how to convey your emotions and understand those of others."
msgstr ""
"Spędziłeś znaczną część swojego życia żyjąc wśród innych ludzi i jesteś "
"zaznajomiony z normami społecznymi. Wiesz, jak rozmawiać z innymi ludźmi, jak "
"przekazywać swoje emocje i rozumieć emocje innych."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "High School Graduate" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've graduated from high school and thus know a little bit about applied "
"science and electronics."
msgstr ""
"Ukończyłeś szkołę średnią i wiesz co nieco o naukach stosowanych i "
"elektronice."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Mundane Survival" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've managed to survive modern life in a first world country.  Through your "
"ordeals you've learned how to treat scrapes and bruises, and how to assemble "
"basic furniture."
msgstr ""
"Udało ci się przetrwać współczesne życie w kraju pierwszego świata. Dzięki "
"swoim próbom nauczyłeś się, jak leczyć zadrapania i siniaki oraz jak składać "
"podstawowe meble."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Heroin Dependence" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The last thing you remember was meeting God behind the local Foodplace.  Then "
"people started eating each other.  This doesn't feel like a fever dream."
msgstr ""
"Ostatnia rzecz jaką pamiętasz to spotkanie z Bogiem za miejscowym "
"Foodplace’em. Następnie ludzie zaczęli się wzajemnie zjadać. Nie wygląda to "
"na zwykły sen w gorączce."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Nicotine Dependence" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your coworkers always muttered when you had to duck outside every hour for a "
"smoke, but it ended up saving your life when things got bad.  You'll need to "
"find a steady supply of nicotine if you want to keep the cravings at bay."
msgstr ""
"Twoi współpracownicy zawsze pomrukiwali, kiedy co godzinę musiałeś wychodzić "
"na zewnątrz, żeby zapalić, ale w końcu uratowało ci to życie, kiedy sprawy "
"przybrały zły obrót. Musisz znaleźć stałe źródło nikotyny, jeśli chcesz "
"utrzymać łaknienie na dystans."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Crack Cocaine Dependence" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Cocaine.  It is, indeed, a helluva drug.  You blew your money on some rocks, "
"and before you knew it you were turning tricks behind the local pharmacy just "
"to score a little more.  Where are you going to get your fix now?"
msgstr ""
"Kokaina. To rzeczywiście jest cholernie mocny narkotyk. Wydałeś pieniądze na "
"kilka porcji i zanim się zorientowałeś, kręciłeś się za lokalną apteką, żeby "
"zdobyć trochę więcej. Gdzie zamierzasz teraz zdobyć następną dawkę?"

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Amphetamine Dependence" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You're not entirely sure what happened last night, but you woke up on the "
"floor and everything has completely gone to shit.  The only thing running "
"through your head, though, is where you're gonna find your next hit."
msgstr ""
"Nie jesteś do końca pewien, co się stało ostatniej nocy, ale obudziłeś się na "
"podłodze i wszystko poszło w diabły. Jedyną rzeczą, która chodzi ci po "
"głowie, jest to, gdzie znajdziesz swój następny towar."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Painkiller Dependence" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"After a bad accident, you became hooked on the opiates prescribed to you for "
"the pain.  With the pharmacies shut down and your dealers turned undead, "
"satisfying those cravings just got a lot more difficult."
msgstr ""
"Po ciężkim wypadku uzależniłeś się od opiatów, które przepisano ci na ból. "
"Gdy apteki zostały zamknięte, a dilerzy stali się nieumarłymi, zaspokojenie "
"głodu stało się o wiele trudniejsze."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Alcohol Dependence" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"One drink became two, two became too many, and before long you were only able "
"to find solace at the bottom of a bottle.  God-damn, you need a drink."
msgstr ""
"Jeden drink stał się dwoma, dwa stały się zbyt wieloma, a po pewnym czasie "
"byłeś w stanie znaleźć ukojenie tylko na dnie butelki. Cholera jasna, musisz "
"się napić."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Sleeping Pill Dependence" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You'd been having trouble falling asleep, so you started taking prescription "
"sleep meds.  Now you can hardly seem to fall asleep at all without them, and "
"you'll need plenty of rest to face the days ahead."
msgstr ""
"Miałeś problemy z zasypianiem, więc zacząłeś brać leki nasenne na receptę. "
"Teraz trudno ci zasnąć bez nich, a będziesz potrzebował dużo odpoczynku, by "
"stawić czoła nadchodzącym dniom."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Caffeine Fiend" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Caffeine gave you life and without it you are nothing.  Your dependence upon "
"it was so extreme that you can barely function in its absence and you've done "
"lasting psychological harm to yourself.  You'd better find a steady supply, "
"and fast."
msgstr ""
"Kofeina dała ci życie i bez niej jesteś nikim. Twoje uzależnienie od niej "
"było tak skrajne, że ledwo możesz funkcjonować bez niej i wyrządziłeś sobie "
"trwałą szkodę psychiczną. Lepiej znajdź stałe źródło i to szybko."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Caffeine Dependence" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Coffee was your faithful companion every morning, and without it you feel "
"like a zombie.  Thanks to all the actual zombies shambling about, getting "
"your caffeine fix will be much harder now."
msgstr ""
"Kawa była twoją wierną towarzyszką każdego ranka, a bez niej czujesz się jak "
"zombie. Dzięki wszystkim prawdziwym zombie, które grasują po okolicy, "
"zdobycie kawy będzie teraz o wiele trudniejsze."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Cosplay" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You liked to make your own costumes and wear them to various conventions.  "
"Now that everyone is dead or dying, maybe this will be useful for something "
"else."
msgstr ""
"Lubiłeś robić własne kostiumy i nosić je na różnych konwentach. Teraz gdy "
"wszyscy nie żyją lub umierają, może to się przyda do czegoś jeszcze."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Lockpicking (Beginner)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Whether it was for fun, innocent utility, or criminal intent, you learned the "
"basics of how to silently pick locks.  Now, being able to get into secured "
"places just got a lot more useful."
msgstr ""
"Czy to dla zabawy, niewinnego wykorzystania lub przestępczych intencji, "
"nauczyłeś się podstaw jak cicho otwierać zamki. Teraz, możliwość dostania się "
"do zabezpieczonych miejsc stała się o wiele bardziej przydatna."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Lockpicking (Expert)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Maybe you're a certified locksmith, a career burglar, or an intense hobbyist. "
" Regardless, you've spent so long picking locks you could pop most open in "
"under a minute easy, with the right tools."
msgstr ""
"Może jesteś certyfikowanym ślusarzem, zawodowym włamywaczem lub zapalonym "
"hobbystą. Niezależnie od tego, spędziłeś tak dużo czasu na otwieraniu zamków, "
"że z odpowiednimi narzędziami mógłbyś otworzyć większość z nich w mniej niż "
"minutę."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Parkour" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've practiced parkour for many years, and made the world your playground.  "
"It wouldn't be a lie to say that running is your life.  Which is good, "
"because now that the end has come, you're running for your life."
msgstr ""
"Praktykowałeś parkour całe życie i uczyniłeś ze świata swój plac zabaw. Nie "
"byłoby kłamstwem powiedzieć, że bieganie to twoje życie. Co dobrze się "
"składa, bo po końcu świata uciekasz przed śmiercią."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Camping" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You enjoyed camping in the vast wilderness as a means of escaping the pace of "
"modern life.  The wilderness isn't filled with people, so it must be safe.  "
"Right?  It must be."
msgstr ""
"Uwielbiałeś kemping w rozległej dziczy jako sposób ucieczki od nowoczesnego "
"życia. Dzicz nie jest zatłoczona ludźmi, więc musi być bezpieczna. Racja? Tak "
"musi być."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Bushcraft" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You take camping to a whole new level.  You have spent nights and weekends "
"surviving in the wild with just a knife to aid you.  Maybe this skill for "
"self-sufficiency can keep you safe."
msgstr ""
"Wynosisz biwakowanie na zupełnie nowy poziom. Spędziłeś noce i weekendy na "
"przetrwaniu w dziczy, mając do pomocy tylko nóż. Może ta umiejętność "
"samowystarczalności zapewni ci bezpieczeństwo."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Piloting" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You're probably one of the last people alive who knows how to safely operate "
"a flying vehicle.  It remains to be seen whether you'll live long enough to "
"make use of that skill."
msgstr ""
"Prawdopodobnie jesteś jedną z ostatnich żyjących osób, które wiedzą, jak "
"bezpiecznie sterować pojazdem latającym. Nie wiadomo jednak, czy będziesz żył "
"wystarczająco długo, by wykorzystać tę umiejętność."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Reading" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You love reading, but you never seemed to have enough time.  Maybe the "
"Cataclysm is a blessing in disguise."
msgstr ""
"Uwielbiasz czytać, ale nigdy nie miałeś wystarczająco dużo czasu. Może "
"Kataklizm to szczęście w nieszczęściu."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Chemical Cooking" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Perhaps you produced illicit chemicals for your own consumption, or to sell "
"to others.  Or maybe you're just a real nerd about chemistry.  In any case, "
"you know your way around a Periodic Table."
msgstr ""
"Być może produkowałeś nielegalne chemikalia na własne potrzeby lub na "
"sprzedaż innym. A może po prostu jesteś prawdziwym kujonem w dziedzinie "
"chemii. W każdym razie znasz się na tablicy okresowej."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Archery (Beginner)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've used a bow before and maybe taken a class or two.  You won't be "
"pulling off any trick shots but at least you can usually get an arrow to fly "
"forward instead of spinning off to the side."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Archery (Intermediate)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You enjoy nocking back an arrow and hearing it whistle through the air.  If "
"you can get the proper gear together and stay on-target, you'll have a good, "
"quiet alternative to using guns."
msgstr ""
"Lubisz napinać strzałę i słyszeć jej gwizd w powietrzu. Jeśli uda ci się "
"skompletować odpowiedni sprzęt i trzymać się celu, będziesz miał dobrą, cichą "
"alternatywę dla broni palnej."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Archery (Expert)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You're a modern day Robin Hood and probably have hella back muscles.  Perhaps "
"you're an Olympic archer in training or maybe you're descended from the "
"longbowmen of old.  In either case, sniping zombie heads should be as easy as "
"pinning apples to trees for you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Swimming (Beginner)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You can swim.  Probably not very well, and you won't break any speed records, "
"but, you CAN swim."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Swimming (Intermediate)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You're a strong swimmer, and you're pretty sure zombies aren't.  You can't "
"swim forever, but it's certainly an advantage over the undead."
msgstr ""
"Jesteś dobrym pływakiem a jesteś pewien, że zombie nie są. Nie możesz pływać "
"wiecznie, ale to na pewno przewaga nad nieumarłymi."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Swimming (Expert)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You're an excellent swimmer and may be part fish.  Plus, all that swimming "
"has left you in great shape.  There aren't any zombie sharks in the water, "
"right?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Baseball (Beginner)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You used to play baseball, occasionally.  Maybe you were on your school team "
"growing up, but it was never a focus of yours.  Hopefully you can still "
"remember how to use a bat when your life depends on it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Baseball (Intermediate)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You got the stance, you got the grip, you got the game.  Swinging at a "
"zombie's head is close enough to swinging at a baseball… right?"
msgstr ""
"Masz postawę, masz przyczepność, masz grę. Zamachnięcie się na głowę zombie "
"jest wystarczająco podobne do zamachnięcia się na piłkę do baseballu… prawda?"

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Baseball Pitcher (Expert)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You're accustomed to striking out poor batters at the plate and can probably "
"throw a mean knuckleball.  Now you get to practice your fastball, but perhaps "
"with rocks or grenades this time."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Baseball (Expert)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You didn't quite make it into the big leagues, but you were close.  Now it's "
"time to go for the grand slam or you'll be dealing with worse than a strike "
"out."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Wrestling (Beginner)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Maybe you've taken a few classes at a gym somewhere, or used to be on the "
"youth team, or maybe you just liked to rough-house with your friends or "
"family growing up.  You're not entirely unused to grappling, but you're "
"hardly an expert."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Wrestling (Intermediate)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"While not the type of wrestler to use folding chairs as weapons, you have "
"experience wrasslin' and tusslin' with others out on the mat.  There's no "
"referees around to see, but hopefully your skills will help you avoid getting "
"pinned by the undead."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Wrestling (Expert)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were likely on the 100+ wins list back in school and maybe you're a "
"collegiate wrestler or you're using it as part of something like MMA.  "
"Considering how grabby those zombies are, you should get plenty of use out of "
"your skills."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Video Gaming" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You loved immersing yourself in virtual worlds through video games.  Now "
"you're faced with real survival horror, and no extra lives."
msgstr ""
"Uwielbiałeś zanurzać się w wirtualnych światach dzięki grom wideo. Teraz "
"czeka cię prawdziwy survival horror, i to bez dodatkowych żyć."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Trapping" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You liked to trap little wild animals such as mice and other rodents.  This "
"skill could be useful for working with more deadly devices, if you're "
"creative enough."
msgstr ""
"Lubiłeś łapać w pułapki małe dzikie zwierzęta, takie jak myszy i inne "
"gryzonie. Ta umiejętność może być przydatna w pracy z bardziej "
"śmiercionośnymi urządzeniami, jeśli będziesz wystarczająco kreatywny."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dodgeball" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Dodging fast-moving balls as though your life depended on it was fun.  "
"Dodging zombies isn't as fun, but your life certainly depends on it."
msgstr ""
"Unikanie szybko poruszających się piłek, jakby od tego zależało twoje życie, "
"było świetną zabawą. Unikanie zombie nie jest tak zabawne, ale twoje życie na "
"pewno od tego zależy."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Electronic Tinkering" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "You found unexpected solace while soldering components to circuit boards."
msgstr ""
"Znalazłeś nieoczekiwaną satysfakcję z lutowania komponentów do płytek "
"drukowanych."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "DIY Crafting (Intermediate)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "You spent much of your time making useful things out of bits and bobbles."
msgstr ""
"Spędzałeś większość czasu na tworzeniu użytecznych rzeczy z różnych "
"rozmaitych drobiazgów."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "DIY Crafting (Expert)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Whether due to circumstances forcing ingenuity or just an unhealthy "
"fascination with tinkering you're a certified MacGyver with a very wide range "
"of fabrication knowledge.  You could probably make a functioning cannon out "
"of a paper clip and some bubble gum."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Cooking (Beginner)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You can cook well enough that you didn't have to live on instant noodles and "
"takeout, but you've only really learned the bare minimum."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Cooking (Intermediate)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You enjoyed cooking for yourself and others.  The grocery stores are closed "
"for good, so you might need to start getting creative with your recipes."
msgstr ""
"Lubiłeś gotować dla siebie i innych. Sklepy spożywcze są zamknięte na dobre, "
"więc być może będziesz musiał zacząć kreatywnie podchodzić do swoich "
"przepisów."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Cooking (Expert)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You're an excellent chef capable of making delicious meals out of almost "
"anything and have a wide array of culinary knowledge.  Sadly, the undead "
"would rather eat you than your meals."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Cheesemaking" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The art of producing the finest quality cheeses has been passed down through "
"your family for generations.  How useful these skills will be in the "
"apocalypse remains to *brie* seen."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Home canning" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Whether it was something practiced in your family or something you took it up "
"to extend the shelf life of your groceries, you know how to preserve produce "
"and meat in cans or mason jars.  With the electricity down and refrigerators "
"dead, saying your skills could come in handy is an understatement."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Paintball" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Pretending to shoot at your friends has always been fun.  Now you can do it "
"for real."
msgstr ""
"Udawanie, że strzelasz do swoich przyjaciół zawsze było dobrą zabawą. Teraz "
"możesz to robić naprawdę."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Plinking" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You enjoyed target plinking with your airsoft pistol.  You're a good shot, "
"but you'll need a real gun for it to matter."
msgstr ""
"Podobało ci się strzelanie do celu z pistoletu na kulki. Jesteś dobrym "
"strzelcem, ale potrzebujesz prawdziwej broni, aby to miało znaczenie."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Skeet Shooting" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Where the skeet go, your shot follows.  Throw enough pellets downrange, and "
"you'll at least hit something."
msgstr ""
"Tam gdzie lecą rzutki, tam podąża twój strzał. Wystrzel wystarczająco dużo "
"śrutu na odległość, a na pewno coś trafisz."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Public Speaking" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You are an incredibly social individual, with the projection and vocabulary "
"to make people listen."
msgstr ""
"Jesteś niesamowicie towarzyską osobą, z prezencją i słownictwem, które "
"sprawiają, że ludzie cię słuchają."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Street Fighting (Intermediate)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've been in quite a few fights in the street.  You can throw and dodge a "
"punch better than most."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Street Fighting (Expert)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Maybe you're the muscle of some criminal gang, maybe you're a bouncer at a "
"club, or maybe you're just a huge asshole.  You've constantly been getting "
"into fights with strangers on the streets for most of your life, and somehow "
"you ain't dead yet, so you must be doing something right."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Knife Throwing" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You learned how to throw knives before the world ended, a skill that can be "
"deadly in the right situation."
msgstr ""
"Nauczyłeś się rzucać nożami przed końcem świata, umiejętność, która w "
"odpowiedniej sytuacji może być śmiercionośna."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Sewing (Intermediate)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You are quite good at sewing torn clothes back together, and have even made "
"your own clothes a few times."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Sewing (Expert)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Despite modern technology making career tailors obsolete you've spent much of "
"your life hand-making clothing of all sorts, whether for historical purposes "
"or to sell as artisanal goods.  Too bad you can't stitch the holes in reality "
"closed."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Fencing (Intermediate)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were in a fencing club, and you weren't too shabby with a saber.  If you "
"can get your hands on a real sword, you'll be a formidable fighter."
msgstr ""
"Byłeś członkiem klubu szermierczego i nieźle radziłeś sobie z szablą. Jeśli "
"dostaniesz w swoje ręce prawdziwy miecz, będziesz groźnym wojownikiem."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Fencing (Expert)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've spent so long practicing your fencing you wouldn't look out of place "
"in the Renaissance dueling with ne'er-do-wells and rapscallions.  En Garde!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Motorsports" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You're a big fan of cars and other things that go vroom, whether it's fixing "
"them or driving them.  You may not be a professional, but you know your way "
"around an engine."
msgstr ""
"Jesteś wielkim fanem samochodów i innych rzeczy, które robią brum, "
"niezależnie od tego, czy je naprawiasz, czy je prowadzisz. Może nie jesteś "
"profesjonalistą, ale znasz się na silnikach."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Racing" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You're a real speed demon in anything with an engine!  Pulling off hairpin "
"turns at high speeds is a difficult skill to master but you can drift with "
"the best of them."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Cardio Kickboxing" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've trained in non-combat kickboxing at a gym as a way to exercise.  While "
"you were taught the moves, you've never sparred or fought anything more "
"dangerous than a falling punching bag.  Whether you can remember your "
"training when push kick comes to jab is up to you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Martial Arts" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You have received some martial arts training at a local dojo.  You start with "
"your choice of Karate, Judo, Aikido, Tai Chi, Taekwondo, or Pankration."
msgstr ""
"Otrzymałeś szkolenie w sztukach walki w lokalnym dojo. Zaczynasz, według "
"wyboru z karate, judo, aikido, tai chi, taekwondo lub pankration."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Self-Defense" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You have taken some self-defense classes at a local gym.  You start with your "
"choice of Boxing, Kickboxing, Capoeira, Krav Maga, Muay Thai, Ninjutsu, Wing "
"Chun, or Zui Quan."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Shaolin Kung Fu" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You have studied the arts of the Shaolin monks.  You start with one of the "
"five animal fighting styles: Tiger, Crane, Leopard, Snake, or Dragon."
msgstr ""
"Studiowałeś sztukę mnichów Szaolin. Zaczynasz z jedną ze zwierzęcych sztuk "
"walki: Tygrys, Żuraw, Lampart, Wąż lub Smok."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Black Belt" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've been doing martial arts for years and have earned the coveted black "
"belt in a martial art of your choice."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Melee Training (Intermediate)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You have practiced fighting with weapons.  You start with your choice of "
"Barbaran Montante, Bōjutsu, Eskrima, Fencing, Fior Di Battaglia, Medieval "
"Swordsmanship, Niten Ichi-Ryu, Pencak Silat, or Sōjutsu."
msgstr ""
"Praktykowałeś walkę bronią białą. Zaczynasz według wyboru z barbaran "
"montante, bōjutsu, eskrima, szermierka, fior di battaglia, średniowieczne "
"władanie mieczem, niten ichi-ryu, pencak silat lub sōjutsu."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Melee Training (Expert)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Despite firearms making traditional melee weapons largely obsolete, you have "
"extensive experience fighting in hand-to-hand combat with tools of war.  "
"Maybe it was full-contact HEMA or SCA sparring, or maybe you're just a badass "
"commando with a machete.  You start with your choice of Barbaran Montante, "
"Bōjutsu, Eskrima, Fencing, Fior Di Battaglia, Medieval Swordsmanship, Niten "
"Ichi-Ryu, Pencak Silat, or Sōjutsu."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Fine Dining" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You loved going to all kinds of restaurants and experiencing everything the "
"world of culinary arts had to offer.  Nowadays, those chefs are all dead, so "
"it'll be up to you to recreate the joys of your past."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Competitive Eating" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were a professional eater before the Cataclysm and frequently "
"participated in eating contests.  Thanks to your training, you can eat huge "
"amounts of food without getting sick, and while eating forty hot dogs in ten "
"minutes might not be too useful in the apocalypse, your fortitude might help "
"you survive off food other survivors would pass over."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Marathon Running" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You ran the Boston Marathon every year.  That conditioning should make you "
"better equipped than most in avoiding the dead."
msgstr ""
"Co roku biegasz w Maratonie Bostońskim. To przygotowanie powinno sprawić, że "
"będziesz lepiej przygotowany niż większość by unikać trupów."

#: data/json/hobbies.json data/mods/innawood/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Book Hating" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Reading is for nerds!  You've managed to make hatred of the written word a "
"central part of your identity.  Or, perhaps, you have a barrier that makes "
"books additionally challenging and frustrating for you.  Whatever the reason, "
"boring books are more boring, and you can't have fun by reading books."
msgstr ""
"Czytanie jest dla nerdów! Udało ci się uczynić nienawiść do słowa pisanego "
"centralną częścią twojej tożsamości. A może masz barierę, która sprawia, że "
"książki są dla ciebie dodatkowo trudne i frustrujące. Bez względu na powód, "
"nudne książki są bardziej nudne i nie możesz się bawić czytając książki."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Butchering" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You absolutely love meat, and dislike eating fruits and vegetables.  Your "
"particular tastes have turned you into a decent amateur butcher."
msgstr ""
"Uwielbiasz mięso, a nie lubisz jeść warzyw i owoców. Twoje szczególne "
"upodobania uczyniły z ciebie przyzwoitego rzeźnika amatora."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Vegetarian Foraging" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You have been a vegetarian for so long that eating meat makes you feel sick.  "
"You like to supplement your diet with wild plants and mushrooms foraged in "
"the woods."
msgstr ""
"Od tak dawna jesteś wegetarianinem, że jedzenie mięsa przyprawia cię o "
"mdłości. Lubisz uzupełniać swoją dietę o dzikie rośliny i grzyby zbierane w "
"lesie."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Skating" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You are skilled in maneuvering on skates.  You suffer lower penalties to "
"dodging and are less likely to fall down if hit in melee combat while you're "
"wearing rollerskates or rollerblades."
msgstr ""
"Jesteś biegły w manewrowaniu na wrotkach lub łyżworolkach. Otrzymujesz "
"mniejsze kary za uniki i jest mniej prawdopodobne, że upadniesz, jeśli "
"zostaniesz uderzony w walce w zwarciu, gdy masz na sobie wrotki lub "
"łyżworolki."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Arts and Crafts" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You loved doing crafts at home.  Now, you might want to channel those skills "
"into making more practical things."
msgstr ""
"Uwielbiałeś wykonywać prace rękodzielnicze w domu. Teraz możesz chcieć "
"wykorzystać te umiejętności do tworzenia bardziej praktycznych rzeczy."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Car Restoration" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Spending time every weekend in your garage working on an old classic car was "
"your favorite pastime.  You never finished the car, but at least you learned "
"a little over the years."
msgstr ""
"Spędzanie czasu w każdy weekend w garażu, pracując nad starym klasycznym "
"samochodem, było twoją ulubioną rozrywką. Nigdy nie ukończyłeś samochodu, ale "
"przynajmniej nauczyłeś się trochę przez lata."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Practical Jokes" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Pranks and physical jokes are a passion of yours, from the setup right "
"through to playing innocent at the end."
msgstr ""
"Psikusy i żarty fizyczne to Twoja pasja, od przygotowania aż po odgrywanie "
"niewiniątka na końcu."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Modeling" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were deep into the fashion scene, keeping up on the latest trends and "
"even modeling clothes yourself.  Having style and good looks is just as, if "
"not more, important to you than practicality."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Pottery" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You're a master of throwing on the potter's wheel, able to shape clay into "
"whatever shape you need."
msgstr ""
"Jesteś mistrzem w robieniu na kole garncarskim, potrafisz nadać glinie "
"dowolny kształt."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Handloading" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You figured you could save money on ammo by learning to make your own.  Now "
"that the factories are shut down, your abilities just went from handy to "
"lifesaving."
msgstr ""
"Pomyślałeś, że możesz zaoszczędzić pieniądze na amunicji, ucząc się robić "
"własną. Teraz, gdy fabryki zostały zamknięte, twoje umiejętności zmieniły się "
"z przydatnych na ratujące życie."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Tabletop Gaming" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"As the Game Master, you've guided players' journeys through dungeons and "
"fortresses.  Now, you're the last member of your party."
msgstr ""
"Jako mistrz gry prowadziłeś graczy przez lochy i twierdze. Teraz jesteś "
"ostatnim członkiem swojej drużyny."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Ham Radio" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You whiled your nights away using, building, and repairing old ham radios.  "
"Now you have no one to talk to. But you won't give up hope, and maybe your "
"electronics knowledge can help you somehow."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Golf" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The backswing's a breeze, and your drive could get skulls into the green if "
"you tried."
msgstr "Powiew backswinga i twój zamach mogłyby posłać czaszki do dołka."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Cyclist (Beginner)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Whether through regular commuting, or just riding for the joy of it, you're "
"no stranger to bicycles."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Cyclist (Intermediate)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've shed gallons of sweat, and more than a little blood, riding the "
"streets and trails as a cyclist."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Cyclist (Expert)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've honed the fitness and form of a professional bicycle racer.  When "
"you're riding, your wheels are like an extension of your body."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Basketball (Beginner)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You used to shoot some b-ball outside of the school… at least, until a couple "
"of corpses who were up to no good started making trouble in your neighborhood."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Basketball (Intermediate)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "Your ability to play point or post will beat the undead in overtime."
msgstr "Twoja umiejętność gry w koszykówkę pozwoli pokonać nieumarłych w dogrywce."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Basketball (Expert)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You can sink 3-pointers all day, and dribble around the most determined "
"defenders."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Football (Beginner)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You'd occasionally play touch or flag football at the park, but never got too "
"serious about it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Football (Intermediate)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You're no stranger to throwing the ol' pigskin and taking a few tackles.  "
"Hopefully your skills in dodging defenders will help you charge through the "
"hordes of undead."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Football (Expert)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You played college ball, ya know.  You could have gone pro if the world "
"hadn't ended."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Soccer (Beginner)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You used to kick a ball around with your friends, having fun together.  "
"Though it may not be the case anymore."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Soccer (Intermediate)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your fondness for the beautiful game shows with your flairs, skills and "
"tackles.  Whether you can go past the backline of the undead is a question "
"yet to be answered."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Soccer (Expert)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were on trial at a professional club, ready to get a contract.  What a "
"great opportunity for you, if only your coaches were still alive."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Shooting (Beginner)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've been to a gun range once or twice and maybe took a firearm safety "
"class.  At the very least, you're confident you can point the gun in the "
"correct direction."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Shooting (Intermediate)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You liked going to the local gun range and shooting at some targets or "
"blasting cans off of fence posts with a variety of firearms.  Maybe if you "
"just imagine targets on those undead, this could help."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "First Aid" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've got training and some experience in dealing with urgent injuries.  In "
"the absence of any medical professionals, that'll have to do."
msgstr ""
"Masz przeszkolenie i pewne doświadczenie w radzeniu sobie z nagłymi urazami. "
"W przypadku braku jakichkolwiek specjalistów medycznych, to będzie musiało "
"wystarczyć."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Trap Shooting" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You loved the smell of gunsmoke and blowing ceramic discs out of the sky.  "
"Your future will likely involve shooting things a little fleshier than clay "
"pigeons."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Backyard Grilling" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You enjoyed inviting the neighborhood to a backyard cookout on the weekends.  "
"You, of course, were the grill master."
msgstr ""
"Lubiłeś zapraszać sąsiadów na podwórkowe gotowanie w weekendy. Ty, "
"oczywiście, byłeś mistrzem grilla."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Carpentry" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"With enough time and materials, you could make a boat from scratch.  These "
"undead can't swim, right?"
msgstr ""
"Przy odpowiedniej ilości czasu i materiałów, mógłbyś zrobić łódź od podstaw. "
"Ci nieumarli nie potrafią pływać, prawda?"

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Woodworking - Luthier" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've learned woodworking in the field of making musical instruments.  "
"You'll be able to create musical instruments in the Cataclysm."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Home Improvement" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You'd fix up any holes and appliances in your own home with nothing but your "
"two hands and some elbow grease.  You did it to save money on repairmen, but "
"now it seems you'll do it to save your life."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Fishing" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"A quiet day at the lake would be a welcome break from the hordes.  Though, "
"now that you think about it, the fish have been acting strangely vicious "
"lately too."
msgstr ""
"Spokojny dzień nad jeziorem byłby mile widzianą przerwą od tych hord. "
"Chociaż, teraz, gdy o tym myślisz, ryby też ostatnio stają się dziwnie "
"żarłoczne."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Home Gunsmithing" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You could have been the next Browning, if not for the those pesky corpses "
"walking around.  It's time to test for accuracy."
msgstr ""
"Mógłbyś być następnym Browningiem, gdyby nie te paskudne trupy chodzące po "
"okolicy. Czas sprawdzić celność."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Roller Derby" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Being able to body your way through the pack is always useful, whether your "
"opponent is living or rotting."
msgstr ""
"Zdolność przebicia się przez stado jest zawsze przydatna, niezależnie od "
"tego, czy przeciwnik jest żywy czy gnijący."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Roller Hockey" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your time in the rink has taught you that sometimes the best way forward is "
"straight through whoever's trying to block you."
msgstr ""
"Czas spędzony w ringu nauczył cię, że czasami najlepszą drogą do przodu jest "
"przejście prosto przez tego, kto próbuje cię zablokować."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Deep Frying" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "You'd have been a hit at the county fair, but you're cooking for one now."
msgstr "Byłbyś hitem na jarmarku, ale teraz gotujesz dla jednego."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Homebrewing" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your white lightning could knock out an elephant, but you're drinking alone "
"now."
msgstr "Twoja biała błyskawica mogłaby powalić słonia, ale teraz pijesz sam."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Sports Coaching" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"They tore apart your team, but you're determined to keep the team spirit "
"alive."
msgstr ""
"Rozdarli twoją drużynę, ale ty jesteś zdeterminowany, by utrzymać ducha "
"zespołu przy życiu."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Gardening" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "Your green thumb will come in handy when the grocery stores are overrun."
msgstr ""
"Posiadanie ręki do sadzenia roślin przyda się, gdy sklepy spożywcze są "
"oblężone."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Ropemaking" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "Your knots are strong, whether they're made from cloth or natural cordage."
msgstr ""
"Twoje węzły są mocne, niezależnie czy zrobione są z tkaniny, czy z "
"naturalnego powrózka."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Backpacking" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You enjoyed trekking on long trails in nature with all your necessities "
"strapped to your back."
msgstr ""
"Lubiłeś trekking po długich szlakach na łonie natury ze wszystkimi "
"niezbędnymi rzeczami przypiętymi do pleców."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Trivia" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You loved learning and sharing interesting facts about many different topics. "
" None of them are useful anymore, but your strong memory certainly is."
msgstr ""
"Uwielbiałeś uczyć się i dzielić ciekawymi faktami na wiele różnych tematów. "
"Żaden z nich nie jest już przydatny, ale Twoja dobra pamięć na pewno tak."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Scrap Art" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You spent hours welding discarded scrap into large and intricate designs.  "
"Some said you were just welding junk into bigger junk.  You call it art."
msgstr ""
"Spędzałeś godziny na spawaniu wyrzuconego złomu w duże i skomplikowane "
"projekty. Niektórzy mówili, że po prostu spawasz śmieci do innych większych "
"śmieci. Ty nazywasz to sztuką."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Moshing" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You went to loud concerts and spent your time in the mosh pits.  Now that "
"everything's gone to hell, the whole world is your mosh pit."
msgstr ""
"Chodziłeś na głośne koncerty i spędzałeś czas w mosh pitach. Teraz, kiedy "
"wszystko poszło w diabły, cały świat jest twoim mosh pitem."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Fire Performing" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Whether you twirled, spun, juggled, or ate it, your manipulation of flaming "
"objects was impressive and terrifying to behold."
msgstr ""
"Bez względu na to, czy kręciłeś, wirowałeś, żonglowałeś, czy połykałeś, twoja "
"manipulacja płonącymi przedmiotami była imponująca i przerażająca."

#: data/json/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Social Dancing" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You loved meeting new people on the dance floor.  These zombies aren't "
"terribly friendly, but they're ready to tango!"
msgstr ""
"Uwielbiałeś poznawać nowych ludzi na parkiecie. Te zombie nie są zbyt "
"przyjazne, ale są gotowe do tanga!"

#: data/json/hobbies.json data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Meditation" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You make a habit of clearing your thoughts and finding your center, even "
"amidst the chaos of the world."
msgstr ""
"Masz zwyczaj oczyszczania swych myśli i odnajdywania swojego centrum, nawet "
"pośród chaosu świata."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Vagabond" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Circumstance left you wandering the world, alone.  Now there is nothing to go "
"back to, even if you wanted to.  Perhaps your experience in fending for "
"yourself will prove useful in this new world."
msgstr ""
"Okoliczność zmusiła cię do wędrówki przez świat, samemu. Teraz nie ma już "
"niczego do czego można by wracać, nawet jakbyś chciał. Możliwe, że twoje "
"doświadczenie w dbaniu o siebie okaże się przydatne w tym nowym świecie."

#: data/json/professions.json data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/professions.json
#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Survivor" for male
#. ~ Description of profession "Paradox Survivor" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Some would say that there's nothing particularly notable about you, but "
"you've survived, and that's more than most could say right now."
msgstr ""
"Niektórzy powiedzieli by, że nie ma w tobie nic nadzwyczajnego. Ale ocalałeś, "
"a to więcej niż większość mogłaby teraz powiedzieć."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Video Blogger" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You made a career out of creating and commentating video content and posting "
"it on various platforms.  Now most of your fans are dead, alongside your "
"equipment.  Maybe you didn't cultivate the most practical skillset through "
"your career, but you have learned a thing or two about troubleshooting "
"software and getting people to listen to you."
msgstr ""
"Zrobiłeś karierę na tworzeniu i komentowaniu treści wideo oraz publikowaniu "
"ich na różnych platformach. Teraz większość twoich fanów nie żyje, podobnie "
"jak twój sprzęt. Być może nie zdobyłeś najbardziej praktycznych umiejętności "
"w swojej karierze, ale nauczyłeś się kilku rzeczy na temat rozwiązywania "
"problemów z oprogramowaniem i zachęcania ludzi do słuchania ciebie."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Sheltered Survivor" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"At the start of the Cataclysm, you hunkered down in a bomb shelter.  You've "
"spent the past months eating canned food, reading books, and tinkering.  Now "
"it is winter - time to face the world above."
msgstr ""
"Na początku Kataklizmu skryłeś się w schronie przeciwbombowym. Ostatnie "
"miesiące spędziłeś jedząc konserwy, czytając książki i majsterkując. Teraz "
"jest zima - czas stawić czoła światu."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Sheltered Militia" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"At the start of the Cataclysm, you hunkered down in a bomb shelter with your "
"collection of guns.  You've spent the past months eating canned food and "
"practicing your aim.  Now it is winter - time to face the world above."
msgstr ""
"Na początku Kataklizmu zaszyłeś się w schronie przeciwlotniczym z twoją "
"kolekcją broni. Spędziłeś ostatnie miesiące jedząc puszkowane jedzenie, "
"czytając książki i praktykując celność. Teraz nastała zima - czas stawić "
"czoła światu nad tobą."

#: data/json/professions.json data/mods/innawood/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Tailor" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Tailoring may not seem like the most useful skill when the world has ended.  "
"Most people wouldn't expect a simple tailor to live very long.  This is your "
"opportunity to prove them wrong."
msgstr ""
"Krawiectwo może nie wygląda na najlepszą umiejętność na koniec świata. "
"Większość ludzi nie spodziewałaby się, że zwykły krawiec przeżyje długo. To "
"twoja szansa, żeby udowodnić im, że się mylą."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Chef" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Bork bork!  Years in the kitchen have left you carrying a prodigious bulk, "
"but you managed to escape the carnage with your trusty butcher knife and only "
"a small collection of stains on your uniform."
msgstr ""
"Lata w kuchni sprawiły, że nosisz potężne cielsko, ale zdołałeś umknąć jatce "
"z twoim zaufanym nożem rzeźniczym i tylko niewielką kolekcją plam na twoim "
"ubiorze."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Butcher" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You spent most of your adult life in a butcher shop.  Your trusty knife has "
"seen many different creatures and you know how to butcher them."
msgstr ""
"Większość swojego dorosłego życia spędziłeś w sklepie mięsnym. Twój "
"niezawodny nóż widział wiele różnych stworzeń i wiesz, jak je zarżnąć."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Churl" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"What the deuyl?  Ye ne wist noo thing of this straunge plaas nor what wycked "
"enchauntment brought ye hidder.  Wyth this accoustrement ye must needs "
"underfongen to find newe lyflode in the most hidous Cataclysm man hath "
"witnessed sithen that deluge Noe rood out in his greet schippe."
msgstr ""
"Y cóż to za diabełstwo!? Ni rozumisz nyc z tygo dziwnego mijsca ni wisz tysz "
"co za czarostwo cie tu rzuciło. Z tym przyklyństwym mysisz znyleść nowe życie "
"w nyjstraszlifszym Kytyklyzmie jaku człek widzioł łot czasu potopu jkich żech "
"Noe przytrwoł ne sfej wilkiej łajbie."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Lab Technician" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Thanks to years of study and hard work in the lab, you're familiar with the "
"basics of scientific inquiry.  Only one question remains: can you undo the "
"very Cataclysm your colleagues helped create?"
msgstr ""
"Dzięki latom nauki i ciężkiej pracy w laboratorium, jesteś obeznany z "
"podstawami nauki. Pozostaje jedno tylko pytanie: czy możesz cofnąć Kataklizm, "
"który twoi koledzy pomogli stworzyć?"

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Chemical Engineer" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You know your way around the periodic table and can name ten different "
"industrial processes that involve any given chemical, but that did not "
"prevent the prospect of employment from looking bleak for you.  Fortunately, "
"the Cataclysm might just be the thing to save you from a dead end job."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Home Mechanic" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've always loved cars, and there's nothing like getting under the hood and "
"fixing it yourself.  You've kept ahold of some handy tools for the job, and "
"at least now you'll never want for parts."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Mechanical Engineer" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've always loved machines, and have extensively incorporated them into "
"your career.  Not long after receiving your degree, you seem to be the one "
"being subjected to a stress test, and it remains unclear if you will retain "
"your structural integrity."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Scoundrel" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your flexible outlook on the law, the scuffles you've been in (and avoided) "
"at the bar, and your impressive ability to weasel your way out of the "
"consequences of your actions - all these skills have helped ensure your "
"survival.  How much longer will they hold out?"
msgstr ""
"Twoje elastyczne podejście do prawa, szamotaniny w których brałeś udział (lub "
"których uniknąłeś) w barach i twoja zdolność wywijania się z konsekwencji "
"twoich czynów - wszystkie te zdolności pomogły ci przetrwać. Jak długo "
"jeszcze ci pomogą?"

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Beekeeper" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You used to be a professional apiarist, building and maintaining beehives.  "
"You had to abandon your precious bees when the Cataclysm struck, but at least "
"you managed to grab some utensils and honey."
msgstr ""
"Byłeś profesjonalnym pszczelarzem, budującym i utrzymującym ule. Musiałeś "
"porzucić swoje cenne pszczółki gdy uderzył Kataklizm, ale przynajmniej "
"zdołałeś zabrać ze sobą trochę sprzętu i miodu."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Baseball Player" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You played with the local team.  You're the only one left, but now you can "
"use your trusty bat for another purpose.  Home run!"
msgstr ""
"Grałeś w lokalnej drużynie. Tylko ty zostałeś, ale teraz możesz wykorzystać "
"swój niezawodny kij do innego celu. Biegiem do celu!"

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Basketball Player" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your first major game was abruptly canceled when zombies stormed the court.  "
"Quick feet and good reflexes meant you were among the lucky few to escape the "
"stadium alive."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Football Player" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your epic touchdown was ruined when your coach's guts were torn out by undead "
"fans.  Now you're first pick in the apocalypse draft."
msgstr ""
"Twoje epickie przyłożenie zostało zrujnowane, gdy flaki twojego trenera "
"zostały wyrwane przez nieumarłych fanów. Teraz jesteś pierwszym wyborem w "
"projekcie apokalipsy."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "True Foodperson" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You are the true Foodperson.  Some might think Foodperson is just a mascot, "
"but you know better.  The mask has become your face, you are real, and the "
"only thing standing between this world and oblivion is you."
msgstr ""
"Jesteś prawdziwym Foodpersonem. Niektórzy mogą pomyśleć, że Foodperson to "
"tylko maskotka, ale ty wiesz lepiej. Maska stała się twoją twarzą, jesteś "
"prawdziwy, a jedyną rzeczą stojącą między tym światem, a zapomnieniem jesteś "
"ty."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Professional Cyclist" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were a promising cyclist with a bright career in front of you before this "
"all happened.  Perhaps you'll never get to participate in the grand tours "
"now, but as the saying goes, life is like riding a bicycle: you've got to "
"keep moving."
msgstr ""
"Byłeś obiecującym kolarzem z błyskotliwą karierą przed tobą zanim to wszystko "
"się stało. Pewnie już nie weźmiesz udziału w Grand Tour, ale jak to mówią, "
"życie jest jak jazda na rowerze, trzeba pedałować dalej."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Major General" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You worked your way up through the ranks from a no-name private to a big shot "
"Major General, respected and decorated.  On the downside, years of desk duty "
"have left your shooting skills rusty, and all the medals in the world won't "
"protect you now."
msgstr ""
"Przeszedłeś przez szczeble kariery od nic nie znaczącego szeregowca do "
"poważanego generała dywizji, szanowanego i odznaczonego. Z drugiej strony, "
"lata pracy za biurkiem sprawiły, że twoje umiejętności strzeleckie "
"zardzewiały, a wszystkie medale świata nie są w stanie cię teraz obronić."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Marine Infantryman" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You are one of the few and the proud: a member of the US Marine Corps.  Now "
"that military command has collapsed in on itself as far as you can tell, you "
"suppose that it falls to you to carry the memory of the Corps forward into "
"the future.  Semper fi."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Navy Sailor" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You're a sailor of the US Navy, and spent the last few years working shipside "
"aboard an aircraft carrier.  Though you're trained in combat, maintenance of "
"the vessel has been your primary duty.  After some event beyond your "
"understanding, the carrier has become a floating graveyard in the middle of "
"nowhere.  This is going to take more than a cup of coffee and a monkey wrench "
"to fix."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Navy Diver" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were a member of a Naval Special Warfare diving group, a skilled soldier "
"adept at underwater infiltration and marine combat.  You were suiting up for "
"a practice dive when the aircraft carrier you were stationed on was somehow "
"flung from the Yellow Sea to who knows where.  You seem to be the only one "
"who survived with your sanity intact, but it's not safe to stay here.  At "
"least you're already dressed to abandon ship."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Military Veteran" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"After being discharged from the armed forces, you were sent to a veterans' "
"hospital for treatment.  Just when you thought you'd overcome your traumas "
"and readjusted to civilian life, the world has come to an end and your worst "
"nightmare has become a reality: life in an endless battlefield."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Military Recruit" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Joining the military has been your dream for years.  You finally got in, just "
"in time for your training to get interrupted by some sort of national "
"emergency.  As far as you can tell, military command abandoned you in this "
"hellhole when you missed the emergency evac."
msgstr ""
"Zaciągnęcie się do wojska było twoim marzeniem od lat. Gdy wreszcie się "
"dostałeś, twoje szkolenie przerwał stan wyjątkowy. Na tyle na ile się "
"orientujesz, dowództwo porzuciło cię w tej dziurze gdy spóźniłeś się do "
"punktu ewakuacji."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Combat Mechanic" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Early in your military career, you were hand-picked for extra training in the "
"mechanic's trade, keeping the armor running.  It's been years since you last "
"touched a rifle, and the dead men are marching again…"
msgstr ""
"Na początku swojej kariery wojskowej, zostałeś wybrany na dodatkowe szkolenie "
"w zawodzie mechanika, aby utrzymać czołgi w ruchu. Minęły lata, odkąd "
"ostatnio dotykałeś karabinu, a umarlaki znów maszerują…"

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Combat Engineer" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your job was simple: Keep the army moving.  You built bridges, you built "
"roads, you destroyed fortifications, and you cleared mines.  It has been "
"years since you last handled a rifle in basic training; now might be the time "
"to dust off those skills."
msgstr ""
"Twoja praca była prosta: Utrzymuj armię w ruchu. Budowałeś mosty, budowałeś "
"drogi, niszczyłeś umocnienia, usuwałeś miny. Minęły lata od odkąd ostatni raz "
"trzymałeś karabin w podstawowym szkoleniu, teraz może być dobry moment na "
"odświeżenie dawnych umiejętności."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Non-Commissioned Officer" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You're a veteran of several peacekeeping missions.  You led your squad as a "
"sort of parental figure, and they relied on you to give orders and keep them "
"alive.  You failed them.  And now you're alone."
msgstr ""
"Jesteś weteranem kilku misji pokojowych. Prowadziłeś swój oddział jak rodzic, "
"a żołnierze polegali na tobie w wydawaniu rozkazów i utrzymywaniu ich przy "
"życiu. Zawiodłeś ich. A teraz jesteś sam."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Rifleman" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"When you were young, you dreamed of being a soldier.  War is hell and hell is "
"war, but you never thought it would be this bad."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Navy SEAL Marksmen" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Recruited into the ranks of the US Navy's Special Warfare forces as a "
"designated sniper, your training in precision marksmanship and maritime "
"operations was extensive.  As a proficient soldier and combative in all "
"respects, you provided overwatch and long-range elimination services in the "
"line of duty.  Now, with naval command imploding and your spotter MIA, your "
"skills with a rifle and covert operations are the only things standing "
"between you and the Cataclysm."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Navy SEAL" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were a member of the SEALs; a key component of the US Navy's special "
"forces and a proficient combatant in both maritime and ground operations.  "
"'The only easy day was yesterday', and with the chain of command in ruins, "
"you may fulfill your final mission in any way you see fit."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Special Operator" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were the best of the best, the military's finest.  That's why you're "
"still alive, even after all your comrades fell to the undead.  As far as you "
"can tell, military command abandoned you in this hellhole when you missed the "
"emergency evac."
msgstr ""
"Byłeś najlepszym z najlepszych, szczyt wojskowych możliwości. Dlatego jeszcze "
"żyjesz, po tym jak twoi towarzysze polegli w walce z nieumarłymi. Na tyle na "
"ile się orientujesz, dowództwo porzuciło cię w tej dziurze gdy spóźniłeś się "
"do punktu ewakuacji."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Butler" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were hired to take care of the housekeeping for a wealthy family.  "
"Naturally, when things got bad, they all took off on a family vacation to "
"somewhere unknown, leaving you to your fate."
msgstr ""
"Zostałeś wynajęty do zajmowania się domem dla zamożnej rodziny. Oczywiście, "
"kiedy sprawy przybierały zły obrót, wszyscy wyruszali na rodzinne wakacje w "
"nieznane, zostawiając cię na pastwę losu."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Captive" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were following a road at night, trying to get away from the horrors of "
"the city, when you heard a voice calling out in the dark.  You followed, "
"hoping they were friendly, but suddenly felt a searing pain in your head and "
"blacked out.  You just woke up in this strange place… are you even on Earth "
"anymore?"
msgstr ""
"Jechałeś nocą drogą, próbując uciec od okropności miasta, kiedy usłyszałeś "
"głos wołający w ciemności. Podążałeś za nim, mając nadzieję, że to "
"przyjaciele, ale nagle poczułeś piekący ból w głowie i zemdlałeś. Właśnie "
"obudziłeś się w tym dziwnym miejscu… czy w ogóle jesteś jeszcze na Ziemi?"

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Rescuer" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were ready.  You went in determined to find and rescue your friends.  Now "
"the atmosphere in these twisting corridors grows heavy, and you don't feel "
"quite so confident anymore.  You might be the one in need of a rescue soon."
msgstr ""
"Byłeś gotowy. Wszedłeś zdeterminowany, by znaleźć i uratować swoich "
"przyjaciół. Teraz atmosfera w tych krętych korytarzach staje się ciężka i nie "
"czujesz się już tak pewnie. Możesz wkrótce sam potrzebować ratunku."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Medical Resident" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Fresh out of med school, you've got little in the way of practical experience "
"and just a handful of first-aid supplies.  You just hope it will be enough if "
"'physician, heal thyself' turns out to be more literal than you expected."
msgstr ""
"Prosto po szkole medycznej nie masz zbyt wiele praktycznego doświadczenia i "
"tylko trochę rzeczy do pierwszej pomocy. Masz tylko nadzieję, że wystarczy, "
"jak powiedzonko „lekarzu, ulecz się sam” okaże się bardziej dosłowne, niż się "
"spodziewałeś."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Doctor" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were a patient-facing doctor practicing general or specialized medicine.  "
"While your bedside manner might not get you far in this new world, your "
"medical skills will certainly help."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Pharmacist" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were a pharmacist working in a community pharmacy.  No simple "
"pill-pusher, you have a plethora of knowledge of drug preparation, "
"biochemistry, and biology.  With your trusty mortar and pestle, you hope to "
"grind the undead to a pulp."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Gangster" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The boss always said he could rely on you to pull through on the tough jobs.  "
"Shame he got himself smoked.  No problem; the world's always got a place for "
"someone with your kind of talents."
msgstr ""
"Szef zawsze powtarzał, że może na tobie polegać w załatwianiu trudnych zadań. "
"Szkoda, że sam tym razem się spalił. Bez problemu; na świecie zawsze znajdzie "
"się miejsce dla kogoś z twoimi talentami."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Security Guard" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You had a boring, underpaid job watching cameras and patrolling hallways, but "
"things have suddenly gotten a lot more dangerous.  You have some useful "
"equipment, but you've never had any call to use it until now."
msgstr ""
"Miałeś nudną, słabo płatną pracę, oglądając kamery i patrolując korytarze, "
"ale nagle sytuacja stała się o wiele bardziej niebezpieczna. Masz trochę "
"przydatnego sprzętu, ale do tej pory nie miałeś żadnego wezwania na którym "
"mógłbyś go użyć."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Landscaper" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You used to mow lawns and trim hedges for the wealthy.  Contract work was "
"getting scarce even before the zombies came, but now you've got nothing left "
"except your tools and expertise."
msgstr ""
"Kosiłeś trawniki i przycinałeś żywopłoty dla bogatych. Zleceń było coraz "
"mniej nawet zanim pojawiły się zombie, ale teraz nie masz już nic poza twoimi "
"narzędziami i wiedzą."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Nursing Assistant" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You went on providing in-home care for the elderly even as the whole world "
"fell apart around you.  You can only pray that you don't see your former "
"clients among the walking dead…"
msgstr ""
"Zapewniałeś opiekę domową osobom starszym, nawet gdy cały świat rozpadł się "
"wokół ciebie. Możesz się tylko modlić, abyś nie widział swoich byłych "
"klientów wśród żywych trupów…"

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Survivalist" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Living off the land, far from civilization, is nothing new to you.  The only "
"difference is all the monsters that suddenly want you dead.  Your equipment "
"is basic, but versatile… except that your canteen's run out!"
msgstr ""
"Życie z dóbr natury z dala od cywilizacji, nie jest niczym dla ciebie nowym. "
"Jedyną różnicą jest, że wszystkie potwory nagle chcą cię zabić. Twoje "
"wyposażenie jest proste, lecz wszechstronne… choć wyczerpała ci się menażka!"

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Hobo" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Society drove you to the fringes and left you with no home, no family, no "
"friends.  But for all the crap thrown your way, you're still breathing.  For "
"now."
msgstr ""
"Społeczeństwo zepchnęło cię na margines i zostawiło bez domu, bez rodziny, "
"bez przyjaciół. Ale mimo tego całego gówna rzuconego w twoją stronę, wciąż "
"oddychasz. Na razie."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Helicopter Pilot" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You got your pilot's license and earned a living ferrying businessmen and "
"tourists around.  The Cataclysm has grounded you for now, but the sky still "
"calls to you…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "K9 Officer" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You spent your career busting drug smugglers with your faithful canine "
"companion.  Now the world has ended, and none of that matters anymore.  Your "
"loyal dog is still at your side, though, ready to face the Cataclysm with you."
msgstr ""
"Swoją karierę spędziłeś na zwalczaniu przemytników narkotyków ze swoim "
"wiernym psim towarzyszem. Teraz świat się skończył i wszystko to jest bez "
"znaczenia. Twój lojalny pies jest wciąż przy tobie, gotowy stawić czoła "
"Kataklizmowi razem z tobą."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Mounted Police Officer" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You have spent many long years forging a bond with your equine companion, "
"from running down common thugs, to entertaining kids when you ride on by.  "
"The Cataclysm is upon you, but at least you have each other."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dog Lover" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You spent your days running around with your faithful dogs by your side.  "
"When the world ended, you grabbed your companions along with some of their "
"things to protect them.  The zombies could be nearby, but at least your "
"canine friends won't have to worry about the rain."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Crazy Cat Dude" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Everyone is dead?  Oh well, it doesn't matter; it's not like you got along "
"with people much anyway.  Your beloved cats are all the friends you need!"
msgstr ""
"Wszyscy są martwi? No cóż, to bez znaczenia; i tak nie dogadujesz się zbytnio "
"z ludźmi. Twoje ukochane koty są jedynymi przyjaciółmi, jakich potrzebujesz!"

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Police Officer" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Just a small-town deputy, you got the call and were ready to come to the "
"rescue.  Soon it was you who needed rescuing, and you were lucky to escape "
"with your life.  Who's going to respect your authority when the government "
"this badge represents might not even exist anymore?"
msgstr ""
"Byłeś gliną w małym miasteczku, gdy otrzymałeś wezwanie i ruszyłeś z pomocą. "
"Z tym, że wkrótce to ty potrzebowałeś pomocy - i cud że uszedłeś z życiem. "
"Kto teraz będzie respektował twoją władzę skoro rząd, który reprezentuje "
"twoja odznaka może już nawet nie istnieje?"

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Police Detective" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were on the brink of a major breakthrough in your latest homicide case "
"when the Cataclysm struck.  Now your prime suspect is dead.  Everyone's dead. "
" You could really use a smoke."
msgstr ""
"Byłeś na skraju ważnego odkrycia w sprawie ostatniego morderstwa, gdy uderzył "
"Kataklizm. Teraz twój główny podejrzany jest martwy. Wszyscy są martwi. "
"Naprawdę przydałby ci się papieros."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "SWAT Officer" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"As a member of the police force's most elite division, you are more than "
"adequately trained and equipped to survive the brutal onslaught of the "
"apocalypse.  Unfortunately, the chain of command has broken down; your only "
"mission now is to stay alive."
msgstr ""
"Jako członek elitarnej jednostki policyjnej jesteś bardziej niż adekwatnie "
"wytrenowany, by przetrwać brutalny najazd apokalipsy. Niestety łańcuch "
"dowodzenia się rozpadł; twoją jedyną misją jest teraz pozostanie przy życiu."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "SWAT CQC Specialist" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"As a member of the police force's most elite division, you were given special "
"training and became an expert in close-quarters combat.  Unfortunately, the "
"chain of command has broken down; your only mission now is to stay alive."
msgstr ""
"Jako członek elitarnej jednostki policyjnej jesteś bardziej niż adekwatnie "
"wytrenowany, by przetrwać brutalny najazd apokalipsy. Niestety łańcuch "
"dowodzenia się rozpadł; twoją jedyną misją jest teraz pozostanie przy życiu."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Police Sniper" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your skill as a sharpshooter served you well in the line of duty, protecting "
"the innocent with a single, well-placed bullet.  Now your own life is on the "
"line, and you can't afford to miss if you don't want to end up as something's "
"dinner."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Riot Control Officer" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The riots were brutal, even before the dead rose and started to devour the "
"living.  The line you were holding broke.  It was only through a bit of luck "
"and a lot of head-bashing that you got away in one piece, and the worst is "
"yet to come."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Motorized Police Officer" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Just a small-town deputy, you got the call and were ready to ride to the "
"rescue.  Soon it was you who needed rescuing, and you had to abandon your "
"motorcycle to escape.  Who's going to respect your authority when the "
"government this badge represents doesn't exist anymore?"
msgstr ""
"Jako małomiasteczkowy policjant, otrzymałeś wezwanie i byłeś gotów ruszyć na "
"ratunek. Wkrótce to ty potrzebowałeś ratunku i musiałeś porzucić swój "
"motocykl, aby uciec. Kto będzie szanował twój autorytet, gdy rząd, który "
"reprezentuje ta odznaka, już nie istnieje?"

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Used Car Salesman" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"They said you'd sell your own mother for a dollar.  How dare they!  You've "
"been around the block a few times, and you'd charge way more than a dollar - "
"and get it, too!"
msgstr ""
"Oskarżano cię o bycie osobą, która sprzeda własną matkę za dolara. Zawsze cię "
"to obrażało - siedzisz w tej robocie nie dzień ani dwa, więc zażądałbyś dużo "
"więcej forsy niż dolara - i byś ją dostał!"

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Modern Archer" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"A great fan of the archers of old, but at the same time a follower of the "
"latest trends in archery.  You always tried to keep up with the times, "
"acquiring a takedown bow as well as several accessories to complement it.  "
"You can only hope all the training you did with them can help you survive in "
"this trying times."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json data/mods/innawood/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Bow Hunter" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Ever since you were a child you loved hunting, and quickly developed a talent "
"for archery.  Why, if the world ended, there's nothing you'd want at your "
"side more than your trusty bow.  So, when it did, you made sure to bring it "
"along."
msgstr ""
"Od kiedy byłeś dzieckiem kochałeś polować, bardzo szybko odnajdując swój "
"talent do strzelania z łuku. Gdyby świat się skończył, nikomu nie zaufałbyś "
"tak bardzo jak swemu łuku. Dlatego kiedy naprawdę się skończył, upewniłeś "
"się, że wziąłeś go ze sobą."

#: data/json/professions.json data/mods/innawood/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Crossbow Hunter" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Ever since you were a child you loved hunting, and crossbow hunting was "
"always your favorite.  Why, if the world ended, there's nothing you'd want at "
"your side more than your trusty crossbow.  So, when it did, you made sure to "
"bring it along, though most of your bolts were lost during the escape."
msgstr ""
"Od kiedy byłeś dzieckiem kochałeś polować, szczególnie przy użyciu kuszy. "
"Gdyby świat się skończył, nikomu nie zaufałbyś tak bardzo jak właśnie kuszy. "
"Dlatego kiedy naprawdę się skończył, upewniłeś się, że wziąłeś ją ze sobą, "
"ale straciłeś większość bełtów podczas ucieczki."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Shotgun Hunter" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Ever since you were a child you loved hunting, and one year you got a shotgun "
"for your birthday.  Why, if the world ended, there's nothing you'd want at "
"your side more than your trusty shotgun.  So, when it did, you made sure to "
"bring it along."
msgstr ""
"Od dziecka uwielbiałeś polowania, a pewnego roku dostałeś strzelbę na "
"urodziny. Dlatego, gdyby świat się skończył, nie chciałbyś mieć po swojej "
"stronie nic bardziej niż zaufaną strzelbę. Więc kiedy to się stało, "
"koniecznie zabrałeś ją ze sobą."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Rifle Hunter" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Ever since you were a child you loved hunting, and you fancy yourself a crack "
"shot.  Why, if the world ended, there's nothing you'd want at your side more "
"than your trusty rifle.  So, when it did, you made sure to bring it along."
msgstr ""
"Od kiedy byłeś dzieckiem kochałeś polować, bardzo szybko odnajdując swój "
"talent do strzelania. Gdyby świat się skończył, nikomu nie zaufałbyś tak "
"bardzo jak swemu karabinowi. Dlatego kiedy naprawdę się skończył, upewniłeś "
"się, że wziąłeś go ze sobą."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Big-Bore Hunter" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You always harbored a passion for hunting and a particular fondness for "
"big-bore rifle calibers and affordable conversion kits.  Whether it was their "
"cost-effective nature or the simple, testosterone-amplifying notion that you "
"could retool your rifle to belt out .50-caliber bullets, you preferred them "
"for your hunting trips.  Now, with your converted rifle in hand, you fancy "
"that there isn't any game too large for you to take down."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Hillbilly" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You n' yer kin always figured shit would hit the fan some day, but never like "
"this!  When they turned on you, you grabbed yer gun and a six pack, and "
"hauled ass in the family truck."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Handy Man" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You used to work at a local hardware store, and you did plenty of home "
"renovations yourself.  Now you look out at the horizon of a ruined world, and "
"wonder - are your meager skills, and the few supplies you grabbed on the way "
"out, sufficient to help rebuild?"
msgstr ""
"Pracowałeś w lokalnym sklepie metalowym i przeprowadzałeś sam wiele domowych "
"renowacji i przeróbek. Teraz patrzysz na horyzont zrujnowanego świata i "
"myślisz - czy twoje ubogie umiejętności i garść wyposażenia, które wziąłeś "
"przed wyjściem wystarczą, by go odbudować?"

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Trucker" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You once ruled the road in your big rig.  When the riots hit, you hopped in "
"and drove it to safety.  Now it's just you and your truck against the world."
msgstr ""
"Byłeś królem szos w swoim tirze. Gdy rozpoczęły się zamieszki wsiadłeś doń i "
"odjechałeś w siną dal, ku bezpiecznym rejonom. Teraz pozostałeś ty i twój "
"dwunastokołowiec przeciw całemu światu."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Rideshare Driver" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You love driving, and decided to start making some money doing it.  On your "
"way to pick up a customer, a riot broke out around you.  You took a long "
"detour to safety, only to find yourself somewhere unfamiliar."
msgstr ""
"Uwielbiasz prowadzić i postanowiłeś zacząć zarabiać na tym pieniądze. W "
"drodze po klienta, wokół Ciebie wybuchły zamieszki. Wyruszyłeś w długi "
"objazd, aby zapewnić sobie bezpieczeństwo, tylko po to, aby znaleźć się w "
"nieznanym miejscu."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Paramedic Firefighter" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"On your way to respond to an emergency call, you nearly drove straight into a "
"riot in the city.  Turning off of the burning, debris-covered streets, you "
"took a long detour only to find yourself lost.  That call will have to wait - "
"you're in an emergency of your own now."
msgstr ""
"Jadąc na wezwanie, prawie wjechałeś w zamieszki w mieście. Zbaczając z "
"płonących, zasypanych gruzem ulic, wybrałeś długi objazd, by w końcu się "
"zgubić. To wezwanie będzie musiało poczekać - teraz masz własny nagły wypadek."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Serviceman" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Employed by a large company, you performed installation and troubleshooting "
"services at the homes of ungrateful luddites.  Driving back from your last "
"call, you were suddenly swarmed by what you believed to be angry rioters.  "
"You veered off onto an old, neglected side road to escape, only to find "
"yourself lost and low on gas."
msgstr ""
"Zatrudniony przez dużą firmę, wykonywałeś usługi instalacyjne i usuwania "
"usterek w domach niewdzięcznych luddystów. Kiedy wracałeś z ostatniej "
"rozmowy, nagle zostałeś zaatakowany przez coś, co uważałeś za wściekłych "
"buntowników. Żeby uciec, skręciłeś w starą, zaniedbaną boczną drogę, ale "
"okazało się, że się zgubiłeś i zabrakło ci benzyny."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Bus Driver" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You made a living driving kids to and from school, a career choice you "
"regretted almost every day.  None of the brats were at their normal stops, "
"and the noise of your bus quickly attracted hordes of zombies.  You escaped, "
"but now you've gotten lost.  At least you're getting a break from the hellish "
"screams of children, though you're starting to hear new ones…"
msgstr ""
"Zarabiałeś na życie wożąc dzieci do i ze szkoły, a wyboru kariery żałowałeś "
"niemal każdego dnia. Żaden z bachorów nie był na swoim typowym przystanku, a "
"hałas twojego autobusu szybko przyciągnął hordy zombie. Uciekłeś, ale teraz "
"się zgubiłeś. Przynajmniej odpoczniesz od piekielnych wrzasków dzieci, choć "
"zaczynasz już słyszeć nowe…"

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Police Interceptor" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"An on-duty officer, you received the call and were ready to respond to the "
"robbery.  It all went to shit, your backup got eaten, and you were lucky to "
"escape with your life and patrol car."
msgstr ""
"Jako oficer dyżurny, otrzymałeś wezwanie i byłeś gotowy do reakcji na napad. "
"Wszystko poszło w diabły, twoje wsparcie zostało zjedzone, a ty miałeś "
"szczęście, że udało ci się ujść z życiem i samochodem patrolowym."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Militia" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You and a group of like-minded individuals built a hideout in the woods from "
"which to launch looting raids in a jury-rigged pickup.  The last run went "
"bad, and now all your comrades are dead.  Every breath you take now is an act "
"of rebellion against the cruelty of this doomed world.  Do not let that flame "
"of hope perish inside you."
msgstr ""
"Wraz z grupą podobnych sobie osób zbudowałeś w lesie kryjówkę, z której "
"wyruszasz na plądrowanie w przerobionym pickupie. Ostatni wypad nie udał się "
"i teraz wszyscy twoi towarzysze nie żyją. Każdy twój oddech jest aktem buntu "
"przeciwko okrucieństwu tego skazanego na zagładę świata. Nie pozwól, by ten "
"płomień nadziei w tobie zgasł."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Park Ranger" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your days of patrolling the park and protecting people and wildlife from each "
"other have taught you many useful skills.  After finding a gruesome scene at "
"a campsite and getting no response when you radioed for help, you stockpiled "
"as many supplies as possible and set out in your pickup looking for answers."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Lumberjack" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You have your trusty wood axe, and you're okay.  You felled trees before the "
"world ended, and you suspect the undead aren't nearly as tough."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Fast Food Cook" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The diners at the fancy burger joint where you worked were even more "
"irritable and unreasonable than usual today.  You showed them the meaning of "
"fast food… by running for your life!"
msgstr ""
"Klienci eleganckiego baru z burgerami, w którym pracowałeś byli dziś jeszcze "
"bardziej drażliwi i niedorzeczni niż zwykle. Pokazałeś im, co to znaczy "
"szybkie żarcie… uciekając w popłochu!"

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Electrician" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Small businesses often hired you for electrical work.  You were halfway "
"through your latest job when the whole power grid went dead."
msgstr ""
"Małe biznesy często zatrudniały cię do prac elektrycznych. Byłeś w połowie "
"swojej ostatniej roboty, gdy cała sieć elektryczna padła."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Electrical Engineer" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Fresh out of college, you were quite eager to get some practical engineering "
"experience and leave your mark on the world, one solder joint at a time.  "
"Now, you are not even sure if the complete failure of the power grid makes "
"your field obsolete or all the more necessary."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Computer Hacker" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Caffeine pills and all-nighters in front of a computer screen made you an "
"expert at writing and cracking code.  The power's gone out, and suddenly your "
"elite skills seem significantly less useful.  At least there's no one "
"stopping you from your dream of breaking into a military mainframe now."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Backpacker" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"For the past few years you've been traveling the world, sightseeing and "
"living off your parents' trust fund.  You came home to find the world in "
"ruins, and the only thing between you and death is the open road and your "
"backpack."
msgstr ""
"Przez ostatnie lata zwiedzałeś świat, podróżując to tu to tam, finansując się "
"z funduszu powierniczego rodziców. Wróciłeś do domu zastając świat w ruinach, "
"a jedyną rzeczą stojącą pomiędzy tobą a śmiercią to otwarta droga i plecak."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Student" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Just an average student, you find yourself facing a test you never studied "
"for, and the stakes are a bit higher than geometry.  Maybe there'll be "
"something useful in one of these books you've been lugging around all year."
msgstr ""
"Jako zwykły student stajesz przed testem, do którego się nigdy nie uczyłeś, a "
"stawka jest większa niż geometria. Może znajdzie się coś przydatnego w tych "
"książkach, które taszczyłeś ze sobą cały rok."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Shower Victim" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You just stepped out of a nice, hot shower to find the world had ended.  "
"You've got some soap, along with the most massively useful thing ever… a "
"towel."
msgstr ""
"Właśnie wyszedłeś spod przyjemnego gorącego prysznica, by dowiedzieć się, że "
"świat się skończył. Na szczęście masz mydło i najużyteczniejszą rzecz pod "
"słońcem… ręcznik."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Biker" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You spent most of your life on a motorcycle, out on the open road with your "
"club.  Now they're all dead.  Time to ride or die."
msgstr ""
"Spędziłeś większość życia na motocyklu, na szerokiej drodze wraz z członkami "
"klubu. Teraz wszyscy nie żyją, więc jedź albo giń."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Ballroom Dancer" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Things got a little weird on your way to your weekly dance class.  Zombies "
"don't seem to know how to dance, but you're not about to let them step on "
"your toes."
msgstr ""
"Sprawy stały się nieco dziwaczne po drodze na cotygodniowe zajęcia taneczne. "
"Zombie nie wiedzą jak się tańczy, ale nie dasz sobie deptać po palcach."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Patient" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"When the diagnosis came back positive, you made a vow: to fight for your "
"life, and to never give in to despair.  Now is the time to renew that vow."
msgstr ""
"Gdy diagnoza okazała się pozytywna przysięgałeś sobie, że będziesz walczył o "
"życie i nie poddasz się rozpaczy. Czas najwyższy odnowić to przyrzeczenie."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Unwilling Mutant" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were a human guinea pig, used by laboratory technicians to understand the "
"immense power of mutation.  You are determined to live on, if only to spite "
"them for what they did to you."
msgstr ""
"Byłeś ludzką świnką morską, używaną przez techników laboratoryjnych by "
"zrozumieć niezmierne moce mutacji. Jesteś zdeterminowany, by nadal żyć, "
"choćby na przekór temu co ci zrobili."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Volunteer Mutant" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your dreams of becoming a mutant superhero through genetic alteration may "
"have fallen a bit short, but the scientists say you're ready.  It's time for "
"a field test."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Hitchhiker" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your house has been demolished and your planet destroyed, but at least you "
"still have your towel."
msgstr ""
"Twój dom wyburzono, planetę zniszczono, ale przynajmniej nadal masz swój "
"ręcznik."

#: data/json/professions.json data/mods/innawood/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Trapper" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You spent most of your life trapping with your father.  Both of you made a "
"decent living selling your catches and running trapping tutorials.  "
"Hopefully, your skills will come in useful against less conventional game."
msgstr ""
"Większość życia spędziłeś z ojcem na traperstwie. Oboje mieliście przyzwoite "
"życie ze sprzedaży zdobyczy i poradników traperstwa. Oby twoje umiejętności "
"przydały się przeciwko mniej konwencjonalnej zwierzynie."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Blacksmith" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You ran into trouble coming out of class at your community college's "
"metalsmithing program, but despite the havoc you've managed to keep ahold of "
"some of the equipment you were carrying."
msgstr ""
"Wpadłeś w kłopoty po zakończeniu zajęć z metalurgii w lokalnym technikum, ale "
"pomimo spustoszenia udało ci się zachować nieco sprzętu, który miałeś ze sobą."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Jeweler" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were an independent artisan, who made gorgeous rings and pendants for the "
"people who afforded your services.  You doubt the market for your work has "
"fared well after the end of the world, but perhaps your proficiency with fine "
"tools and metals will come in handy somehow."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Clown" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"All you ever wanted was to make people laugh.  Dropping out of school and "
"performing at kids' parties was a dream come true until the world ended.  "
"There are precious few balloon animals in your future now."
msgstr ""
"Wszystkiego czego w życiu chciałeś to wywoływać śmiech na twarzach ludzi. "
"Wypadnięcie ze szkoły i uczestnictwo w imprezach dla dzieci było spełnieniem "
"marzeń, aż świat się skończył. W twojej przyszłości jest kilka cennych "
"balonowych zwierząt."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Lost Submissive" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"In the rush to safety, you were separated from your master by cruel fate.  "
"Now you are on your own, with nothing to your name but a suit of really kinky "
"black leather.  Unfortunately, there are no safewords in the apocalypse."
msgstr ""
"We wczesnej fazy ucieczki ku bezpiecznym schronieniom zły los rozdzielił cię "
"z mistrzem. Jesteś teraz sam na własną rękę, nie mając nic przy sobie oprócz "
"skórzanego perwersyjnego kombinezonu. Niestety nie ma bezpiecznych słów "
"podczas apokalipsy."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Senior Citizen" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You haven't seen this much blood since the war.  The whole world's gone "
"crazy!  They ate your grandkids!  But dagnabbit, you'll make them all pay for "
"what they've done."
msgstr ""
"Nie widziałeś tyle krwi od czasu wojny. Cały świat zwariował! Zjedli twoje "
"wnuki! Ale niech to dunder świśnie, dasz im wszystkim popalić za to, co "
"zrobili."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Otaku" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"After many late nights with friends watching anime and eating snacks, you "
"decided to make the trip to the premier anime convention in the Northeast.  "
"Now zombies are eating everyone, and even worse, the convention is canceled!  "
"At least you were ready in case your costume tore."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Groom" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The Cataclysm struck on the big day and you escaped with nothing but your "
"wedding attire.  Cold feet?  You'd just like to keep your feet attached!"
msgstr ""
"Kataklizm wydarzył się w twój wielki dzień i uciekłeś tyko w ślubnym stroju. "
"Efekt „zimnych stóp”? Przynajmniej masz te stopy razem ze sobą!"

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Punk Rock Dude" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"All those wicked songs about the apocalypse have come to life.  Brutal!  Now "
"that the system is dead, it's time to party among the bones of the world!"
msgstr ""
"Wszystkie te pokrętne piosenki o apokalipsie się w końcu ziściły. Teraz gdy "
"system w końcu leży, czas poimprezować na kościach świata!"

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Firefighter" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"As a first responder, you were a direct witness to the gut-wrenching horrors "
"of the apocalypse.  Separated from most of your equipment and your unit while "
"on call, you were forced to fight your way to safety with little more than "
"your trusty iron and your bunker gear to protect you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Rude Boy" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your ska band broke up after the drummer became a zombie.  Now you're alone "
"in the Cataclysm with some cigarettes and your mp3 player."
msgstr ""
"Twoja grupa ska rozpadła się gdy perkusista zmienił się w zombie i teraz "
"jesteś sam pośród apokalipsy z paroma fajkami i odtwarzaczem MP3."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Mail Carrier" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Neither snow nor rain nor heat nor gloom of night stays you from the swift "
"completion of your appointed rounds, but nobody said anything about zombies."
msgstr ""
"Ani śnieg, ani deszcz, ani upał, ani mrok nocy nie powstrzymuje cię przed "
"szybkim wykonaniem wyznaczonych obchodów, ale nikt nie mówił nic o zombie."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Convict" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your trial was contentious, but ultimately you found yourself behind bars.  "
"The Cataclysm has offered you a chance to escape, but freedom may come with a "
"steep price."
msgstr ""
"Twój proces był kontrowersyjny, ale ostatecznie znalazłeś się za kratkami. "
"Kataklizm zaoferował ci szansę ucieczki, ale cena wolności może być wysoka."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Hardened Convict" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Most of your adult life has been spent in prison doing hard time.  It's been "
"rough but you've learned a few tricks to keep them on their toes.  Time to "
"see how tough these zombies are."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Death Row Convict" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were a serial killer, ready to walk the green mile, but in a twist of "
"fate you're one of the few still alive.  True death comes only from your "
"hands, so you're in for a job."
msgstr ""
"Byłeś seryjnym mordercą gotowym na ostatnią drogę, ale dzięki pokrętnemu "
"szczęściu jesteś jednym z nielicznych żyjących. A ponieważ prawdziwa śmierć "
"przychodzi tylko z twoich rąk, czeka cię niezła robota."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Undercover Assassin Convict" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were given a target, a mission, but killing your mark seems to have "
"become much more difficult now.  Your employer cut contact with you and now "
"you have to make do with what you have."
msgstr ""
"Otrzymałeś cel, misję, ale zabicie go stało się o wiele trudniejsze. Twój "
"pracodawca zerwał kontakt z tobą i musisz teraz sobie radzić z tym co masz."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Embezzler" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You had a genius plan to skim fractions of cents out of your company's "
"accounts.  This plan immediately failed and got you arrested.  They said you "
"were too soft for prison, but guess what?  They're dead, and you're not."
msgstr ""
"Wpadłeś na genialny plan uszczknięcia nieco fortuny jaką dysponowało "
"przedsiębiorstwo, w którym pracowałeś. Plan się od razu wydał, a ty "
"skończyłeś w kajdanach. Mówili ci, że jesteś zbyt miękki na więzienie, ale ty "
"żyjesz a oni nie."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Meth Cook" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You clawed your way out of poverty by selling products everyone wanted, and "
"they had the nerve to put you in jail for it.  Too bad you can't sell drugs "
"to zombies."
msgstr ""
"Wydarłeś sobie drogę ze slumsów sprzedając produkt, którego każdy pożądał, a "
"oni mieli czelność wrzucić cię do paki! Szkoda tylko, że zombie nie kupują "
"żadnych narkotyków."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Political Prisoner" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You did your best to expose what was going on in those labs, but they caught "
"you and threw you in prison on trumped-up charges to silence you.  Clearly, "
"they should have listened."
msgstr ""
"Zrobiłeś co w twojej mocy, żeby ujawnić co się działo w tych laboratoriach, "
"ale schwytano cię i posadzono za kraty pod sfingowanymi zarzutami by cię "
"uciszyć. I co teraz jasne jak słońce - a nie mówiłem?"

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Rat Prince" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You probably needed psychiatric help instead of a prison sentence.  At least "
"your loyal subjects have agreed to hold the line as you make your daring "
"escape."
msgstr ""
"Prawdopodobnie potrzebna ci była pomoc psychiatryczna a nie odsiadka za "
"kratkami. Przynajmniej twoi lojalni słudzy trzymają fason gdy dokonujesz swej "
"wielkiej ucieczki."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Burglar" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"This could be your lucky break.  Plenty of loot to be pilfered, and no cops "
"to be seen.  Does it count as breaking and entering if everyone in town is "
"undead?"
msgstr ""
"To może być twój szczęśliwy włam. Mnóstwo dóbr do zwędzenia i żadnych "
"gliniarzy w zasięgu wzroku. Czy to się liczy jako kradzież z włamaniem, jeśli "
"wszyscy w mieście są nieumarli?"

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Lawyer" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The jury were in the palm of your hand, but after the defendant tried to eat "
"your brain, you were forced to flee the courtroom in disgrace.  Now nobody "
"seems to care about your objections."
msgstr ""
"Miałeś ławę przysięgłych w garści, ale po tym jak pozwany chciał zejść ci "
"mózg, musiałeś haniebnie uciekać z sali sądowej. Nikt nie reagował na twoje "
"sprzeciwy."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Pastor" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Armageddon has come!  You did everything you could to protect your community, "
"but it appears that prayers were not enough.  Now that they are all dead, you "
"should probably find something more tangible to protect you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Catholic Priest" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"For your entire time as a servant of God, you helped, protected and listened "
"to your parish faithful.  But the Rapture has come, and your parish turned "
"against you.  Now all you can do is pray to the Holy Virgin, and prepare to "
"maintain your wellbeing."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Kannushi" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the maintainers of a Shinto shrine, performing rituals and "
"sacred tasks.  You preferred it when only the spirits of the dead inhabited "
"your shrine, and not their rotting corpses."
msgstr ""
"Byłeś jednym z opiekunów chramu Shinto, odprawiającym rytuały i święte "
"czynności. Wolałeś jak duchy zmarłych nawiedzały tylko świątynie, a nie ich "
"gnijące ciała."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Bhikkhu" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your life was simple at the Vihara, doing household chores and meditating.  "
"Your Sangha wanted to attain liberation from suffering, now their rotting "
"corpses will suffer forever."
msgstr ""
"Wiodłeś proste życie w zakonie, wykonując codzienne obowiązki domowe i "
"medytując. Twoje zgromadzenie chciało osiągnąć wolność od cierpienia, a teraz "
"ich gnijące trupy będą cierpieć wiecznie."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Imam" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You spent much of your time prior to the apocalypse at the local mosque, "
"studying the words of the Prophet and the Quran and guiding your community in "
"prayer.  Back then they came from far and wide to listen to you; now they "
"come to eat your brains."
msgstr ""
"Spędzałeś wiele czasu sprzed apokalipsy w miejscowym meczecie, studiując "
"słowa Proroka i Koranu, i prowadząc swoją społeczność w modlitwach. Wtedy "
"przybywali zewsząd by słuchać twoich słów, teraz przybywają by wyżreć ci mózg."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Rabbi" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were davening Shacharit in shul when the Cataclysm struck.  You had "
"always taught that God will restore life to the dead after Moshiach has come, "
"but not like this!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json data/mods/MindOverMatter/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Guru" for male
#. ~ Description of profession "guru" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You spent many years traveling through the world, becoming wise and learned.  "
"Normally you can answer any question, but even you are not quite sure what to "
"do about the ravenous undead."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Traveling Preacher" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You devoted your life to spreading the good word, always on the road, "
"traveling from town to town.  Now everything has gone to hell, you can't host "
"your daily podcast, and the undead don't seem particularly moved by your "
"sermons."
msgstr ""
"Poświęciłeś życie, by głosić dobrą nowinę, zawsze w drodze, z miasta do "
"miasta. Teraz wszystko poszło do diabła, nie możesz prowadzić swojej "
"codziennej audycji, a zombie nie są zbytnio poruszeni twoimi kazaniami."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Novice Martial Artist" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've decided today is the day to take your first lesson at the local dojo.  "
"You'll be great at it, you're sure of it."
msgstr ""
"Zdecydowałeś, że dziś weźmiesz pierwszą lekcję w lokalnym dojo. Będziesz w "
"tym świetny, tego jesteś pewien."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Martial Artist" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"'Drop the martial arts!', they said.  'Learn a skill for the REAL world!', "
"they said.  Well, you're about to show them!  SHOW THEM ALL!"
msgstr ""
"„Rzuć sztuki walki!” mówili. „Naucz się czegoś przydatnego w PRAWDZIWYM "
"świecie!” mówili. No to teraz im pokażesz! WSZYSTKIM IM POKAŻESZ!"

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Black Belt" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"As the world ends, you alone stand against the coming darkness with your "
"fists of steel."
msgstr ""
"Gdy kończy się świat, ty jeden stoisz naprzeciw zapadającej ciemności ze "
"swoimi stalowymi pięściami."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Pizza Delivery Boy" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were delivering the last pizza of the night to one of your common patrons "
"when hungry zombies attempted to make a meal out of you.  Fleeing for safety, "
"you find yourself with only your wits and some leftover pizza.  And they "
"didn't even leave a tip!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Archaeologist" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Following a clue from your dead grandfather's journal, you made your way to a "
"long-lost temple, but then the ground started to shake uncontrollably.  You "
"had a bad feeling about that, so you got out of there quickly."
msgstr ""
"Idąc za śladem znalezionym w dzienniku zmarłego dziadka, dotarłeś do dawno "
"zapomnianej świątyni, po czym ziemia zaczęła się trząść. Masz co do tego złe "
"przeczucia, więc się szybko stamtąd wydostałeś."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Paperboy" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You set out this morning to deliver the news of the apocalypse.  The undead "
"hordes don't seem to value the latest news, but at least your trusty bicycle "
"is still in working order."
msgstr ""
"Doręczałeś poranne gazety z wieściami o apokalipsie. Hordy nieumarłych nie "
"cenią świeżych wiadomości, ale przynajmniej twój zaufany rower jest nadal na "
"chodzie."

#: data/json/professions.json data/mods/innawood/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Farmer" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"A patch of soil, some water, and sunlight were all you ever needed; why "
"should things be any different now?  With a handful of seeds and your trusty "
"hoe, it's time to rebuild the Earth, one plant at a time."
msgstr ""
"Poletko ziemi, nieco wody i słońca to wszystko czego ci trzeba, więc czemu "
"sprawy miałyby się mieć inaczej obecnie? Garść nasion i niezawodna motyka i "
"na Ziemi nastanie czas odbudowy, roślina po roślinie."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "National Guardsman" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The government activated your National Guard unit to deal with the growing "
"epidemics.  Despite your best efforts, you were unable to form up before all "
"communications ceased and you found yourself alone among the dead."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Hardened Scavenger" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"One of the lucky few who escaped the Cataclysm, you made a life for yourself "
"amidst the ruins of civilization.  Whether through force, guile, or luck, "
"you've obtained the best gear you could find."
msgstr ""
"Jako jeden z nielicznych, którzy uciekli przed Kataklizmem, zorganizowałeś "
"sobie życie na ruinie cywilizacji. Czy z użyciem siły, sprytu, czy też przez "
"szczęśliwy traf, pozyskałeś najlepszy sprzęt jaki tylko mogłeś znaleźć."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Military Holdout" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You must have paid attention to your survival training in boot camp; "
"otherwise, you would never have lived long enough to outlast the chain of "
"command and find yourself in this predicament.  The only mission now is to "
"survive."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Mall Security" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You spent dull nights guarding the local mall against teen hooligans and "
"petty thieves.  Your job training didn't provide any terribly useful skills, "
"but you do have your trusty stun gun, baton, and pocket knife."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json data/mods/MindOverMatter/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Naturalist" for male
#. ~ Description of profession "naturalist" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Over long years of self-imposed exile in the wilderness, you have come to an "
"understanding with Mother Nature.  The world as they knew it might have ended "
"for your forsaken species, but you can hardly tell the difference."
msgstr ""
"Przez wiele tat narzuconego sobie wygnania w dziczy całkowicie zrozumiałeś "
"Matkę Naturę. Świat jakim go znano mógł się skończyć dla twoich pobratymców, "
"lecz ty ledwo zauważasz zmianę."

#: data/json/professions.json data/mods/innawood/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Fisher" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You spent most of your days fishing in the swamp, getting by quietly on your "
"catch.  You found the buzzing of insects enjoyable, but recently they've "
"gotten bigger and meaner.  Now their horrible noises have you spooked - you "
"just hope the fish aren't as nasty."
msgstr ""
"Spędzałeś większość swych dni po prostu wędkując na bagnach i po cichu żyjąc "
"ze zdobyczy. Radowało cię bzyczenie owadów, ale te urosły i stały się "
"groźniejsze. Teraz ich okropne dźwięki powodują u ciebie strach - masz "
"nadzieję żeby ryby nie okazały się równie paskudne."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Historical Reenactor" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were on your way to the Annual All New England Revolutionary War Living "
"History exhibition when the end of the world permanently derailed your plans."
msgstr ""
"Byłaś w drodze na doroczną wystawę Żywej Historii Wojny Rewolucyjnej Nowej "
"Anglii, gdy wybuch kataklizmu permanentnie wykoleił twoje plany."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Ahistorical Reenactor" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were on your way to the Annual All New England Revolutionary War Living "
"History exhibition when the end of the world made traditional gender roles "
"obsolete."
msgstr ""
"Byłaś w drodze na doroczną wystawę Żywej Historii Wojny Rewolucyjnej Nowej "
"Anglii, gdy koniec świata wysłał tradycyjne podziały płciowe do historii."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Skater Boy (Rollerblades)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You love to skate!  You've probably spent more time on a pair of blades than "
"off.  Things have gotten pretty bad, but at least the grown-ups aren't "
"telling you where you can't roll."
msgstr ""
"Kochasz rolki. Spędzasz w nich chyba więcej czasu niż bez nich. Sprawy się "
"mocno skomplikowały, ale przynajmniej dorośli nie mówią ci gdzie nie możesz "
"jeździć."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Skater Boy (Skateboard)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You love to skate!  You've probably spent more time on a skateboard than off. "
" Things have gotten pretty bad, but at least the grown-ups aren't telling you "
"where you can't roll."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Juvenile Delinquent" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You never cared for grown-ups telling you what to do, so you ended up "
"spending quite a few days in the principal's office.  Now, not needing "
"grown-ups to tell you what to do is the only reason you're alive.  Man, you "
"really should've played hooky today."
msgstr ""
"Nie obchodziło cię nigdy co każą dorośli, i dzięki temu spędzałeś całe dnie w "
"gabinecie dyrektora. Teraz okazuje się, że brak potrzeby słuchania dorosłych "
"mówiących ci co masz robić jest jedynym powodem dla którego żyjesz. Stary, "
"trzeba było dziś pójść na wagary."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Survivalist Jr." for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your parents were crazy preppers who thought some \"Cataclysm\" was coming, "
"and insisted on preparing you for it.  Turns out they were right.  You didn't "
"get a chance to thank them.  The only thing you can do for them now is what "
"they always hoped you would do in the dark days ahead: survive."
msgstr ""
"Twoi rodzice byli zwariowanymi preppersami, którzy sądzili, że jakiś "
"„Kataklizm” się zbliża i nalegali na przygotowanie cię do niego. Wyszło na "
"to, że mieli rację. Nie miałeś okazji im podziękować. Jedyną rzeczą jako "
"możesz dla nich zrobić to to, o czym zawsze marzyli, że zrobisz w mrocznych "
"dniach przed tobą: przeżyjesz."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dodgeball Player" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"In dodgeball, failing to dodge meant taking a ball to the head and being out "
"of the game.  In the Cataclysm, it means getting eaten by monsters.  Don't "
"slip up."
msgstr ""
"W dwóch ogniach jak się nie uchylisz to dostajesz piłką w łeb i wypadasz z "
"gry. W Kataklizmie to znaczy bycie zjedzonym przez potwory. Lepiej się wiec "
"nie pośliznąć."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Science Club Member" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The school never let your club play with the really fun chemicals, the kind "
"that make things go boom, but there aren't any teachers around to enforce the "
"rules anymore."
msgstr ""
"Szkoła nie pozwalała twojemu klubowi na naprawdę fajne eksperymenty "
"chemiczne, takie które robią bum, ale teraz nie ma już nauczycieli, którzy "
"pilnowaliby przestrzegania zasad."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "A/V Club Member" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were a member of the school A/V club.  You're sure there's some way you "
"can use your technical skills to help you stay alive.  You just haven't "
"figured out how to make an awesome death ray yet."
msgstr ""
"Byłeś członkiem szkolnego klubu audio wideo. Jesteś pewien, że jest sposób "
"aby twoje umiejętności techniczne pomogły ci przeżyć. Nie wymyśliłeś tylko "
"jeszcze jak zrobić wspaniały promień śmierci."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Teacher" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've been teaching kids all your life, experiencing the joy and aggravation "
"of imparting knowledge to young minds.  If zombies have any interest in "
"education, they're not showing it."
msgstr ""
"Uczyłeś dzieciaki całe życie, doświadczając radości i trudów nauczania "
"młodych umysłów. Jeżeli zombie są zainteresowane nauką, to nie okazują tego."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Photojournalist" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Covering the apocalypse up close could make your career, though finding a "
"publisher seems more difficult a prospect than usual.  You managed to hold "
"onto your camera - hopefully you can get some fantastic shots."
msgstr ""
"Masz szansę być pierwszym dziennikarzem, który udokumentuje apokalipsę, choć "
"znalezienie wydawcy może okazać się większym wyzwaniem niż dotąd. Udało ci "
"się zachować aparat, więc masz nadzieję na zrobienie kilku fantastycznych "
"fotek."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Gym Teacher" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"It was hard enough getting kids to run laps without having to worry about "
"them trying to eat your brains.  Zombies won't even line up when you blow "
"your whistle."
msgstr ""
"Wystarczająco trudne było spowodowanie by dzieciaki przebiegły okrążenie bez "
"martwienia się o to, że wyżrą ci mózg. Zombie nawet nie chcą ustawić się w "
"szeregu gdy dmuchasz w gwizdek."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Miner" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You're a miner, not a minor!  Your canteen is dry, your jackhammer is out of "
"gas, and you're on your last pair of batteries for your mining helmet…"
msgstr ""
"Jesteś górnikiem nie góralem! Twoja menażka jest pusta, młot pneumatyczny nie "
"ma zasilania i jedziesz na ostatniej parze baterii do swojego kasku "
"górniczego…"

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Demolition Expert" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Before this all began, you were having the time of your life at your dream "
"job: blowing stuff up.  The Cataclysm means you're finally allowed to do it "
"full time."
msgstr ""
"Zanim to się zaczęło miałeś wymarzoną pracę. w której wysadzałeś rzeczy w "
"powietrze. Kataklizm spowodował, że przechodzisz na pełen etat."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Traceur" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've practiced parkour for many years, and made the world your playground.  "
"It wouldn't be a lie to say that running is your life.  Which is good, "
"because now that the end has come, you're running FOR your life."
msgstr ""
"Praktykowałeś parkour całe życie i uczyniłeś ze świata swój plac zabaw. Nie "
"byłoby kłamstwem powiedzieć, że bieganie to twoje życie. Co dobrze się "
"składa, bo po końcu świata to bieg PO życie."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Tourist" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"This seemed like a great place for a vacation, but you're starting to regret "
"ever leaving home.  You came here to get a taste of New England, but New "
"England keeps trying to get a taste of you!"
msgstr ""
"To wydawało się wymarzone miejsce na wakacje, ale zaczynasz żałować, że "
"opuściłeś dom. Przybyłeś tu poznać smak Nowej Anglii, a tym czasem Nowa "
"Anglia próbuje poznać jak ty smakujesz!."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Naked and Afraid" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The apocalypse has caught you completely naked!  Maybe you were robbed, maybe "
"you were at a nudist beach, or maybe you just enjoy the feeling of liberation "
"brought by the wind touching your skin.  Whatever the reason, you lack "
"clothes in a time when everyone wants a piece of you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Zoo Keeper" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were called in on your day off to feed the animals at the zoo.  For some "
"reason, none of your coworkers bothered showing up for work today."
msgstr ""
"Byłeś wezwany jak miałeś dzień wolny by nakarmić zwierzęta w zoo. Z jakiegoś "
"powodu żaden z twoich współpracowników nie pojawił się dziś w pracy."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Urban Samurai" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were always an inexplicable sight in town, with your funny hair and odd "
"Japanese clothes.  Little of this concerned you, but last week the grocery "
"service stopped coming and now the TV no longer turns on.  This displeases "
"you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Competitive Fencer" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Years of training prepared you for the competitive fencing circuit, but your "
"latest tournament was cut short when zombies invaded the piste.  The referee "
"was eaten, so you're not sure if the rules are still in play."
msgstr ""
"Lata treningu przygotowały cię do rywalizacji w szermierce, ale twój ostatni "
"turniej został przerwany, gdy zombie zaatakowały miejsce turnieju. Sędzia "
"został zjedzony, więc nie masz pewności, czy nadal obowiązują zasady."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Career Politician" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've spent your life appealing to the people, persuading many and promising "
"much throughout your time in office.  Now that your voting base wants to eat "
"you alive, winning hearts and minds just got that much harder."
msgstr ""
"Spędziłeś swoje życie wychodząc do ludzi, przekonując wielu i obiecując dużo "
"przez cały czas pełnienia urzędu. Teraz, gdy twoi wyborcy chcą cię zjeść "
"żywcem, zdobywanie serc i głosów stało się jeszcze trudniejsze."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Rancher" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Taking care of cows, horses, and other animals is your passion, but the ways "
"things are going, this isn't going to be just another day at the ranch."
msgstr ""
"Opieka nad krowami, końmi i innymi zwierzętami jest twoją pasją, ale to, co "
"się dzieje, to nie będzie kolejny dzień na ranczo."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Roadie" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've always worked just outside of the limelight, carrying and fixing the "
"equipment and ensuring that the performers got what they needed.  The show "
"must go on."
msgstr ""
"Zawsze pracowałeś poza centrum uwagi, niosąc i naprawiając sprzęt i "
"upewniając się, że wykonawcy dostali to, czego potrzebowali. Przedstawienie "
"musi trwać."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Musician" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You nailed your solo, but the audience erupted into screams instead of "
"applause.  You weren't able to grab much during the panic, but at least you "
"have your loaded six string on your back."
msgstr ""
"Udało ci się zagrać solo, ale publiczność zamiast oklasków wybuchnęła "
"krzykiem. Nie byłeś w stanie zbyt wiele chwycić podczas paniki, ale "
"przynajmniej masz na plecach swoją gitarę."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Kitted Survivor" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You saw a sign at the local mall advertising a discount on survival kits.  "
"You bought one, more for show than for actual use.  Now it's all you have."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Wild West Gunslinger" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You made your living on Wild West exhibitions and shows, impressing tourists "
"with your displays of marksmanship.  But that world has ended, so you took "
"your trusty six-shooter and wandered into a world where it's always high noon."
msgstr ""
"Utrzymywałeś się z wystaw i pokazów na Dzikim Zachodzie, imponując turystom "
"pokazami strzelectwa. Ale ten świat się skończył, więc wziąłeś swojego "
"wiernego sześciostrzałowca i zawędrowałeś do świata, w którym zawsze jest "
"południe."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Frat Boy" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were living the high life, spending your parents' money without a care in "
"the world.  At one of your usual crazy parties, the guests became hungry for "
"more than drugs and booze, but you still have a chance to use the last symbol "
"of your luxurious life - your sports car - and get far away."
msgstr ""
"Żyłeś wysoko wydając pieniądze swoich rodziców bez uwagi na świat. Na jednej "
"z twoich zwykłych, szalonych imprez goście poczuli głód nie tylko narkotyków "
"i alkoholu, ale ty wciąż masz szansę użyć ostatniego symbolu twojego "
"luksusowego życia - swojego sportowego samochodu - i oddalić się daleko."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Military Marksman" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You like to think of yourself as a sniper, but really you're just infantry "
"with a bigger gun.  That said, a big gun is a definite advantage now."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Military Automatic Rifleman" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were trusted with a big-ass, belt-fed machine gun and plenty of ammo to "
"lay down suppressing fire for your team.  Now that it's going to be much "
"harder to resupply, you should probably be more selective with the ol' "
"spray-and-pray."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Military Grenadier" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"There's no kill like overkill, and not many people in this world can boast "
"that they have a grenade launcher and know how to use it.  Just try not to "
"blow yourself up, that would be really embarrassing."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Military Breacher" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Doors and windows everywhere dare not speak your name.  You're going to be "
"breaking into buildings for supplies rather than combat operations now, but "
"the principle is about the same."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Military Sniper" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You're a crack shot with a rifle, and the farther you can stay away from "
"zombies, the better.  The only thing stopping you is limited ammo, so you "
"should try to find a place to restock sooner or later."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Military Hacker" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"'Hacker' is a silly pop-culture name, popularized by Hollywood and people "
"with little to no knowledge of what your job entails.  You prefer 'Electronic "
"Warfare Specialist,' though nobody's really left to make the distinction."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Undercover Operative" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've been tailing your target for months, and now he's a zombie.  So much "
"for that lead.  Command isn't responding to your calls for an evac, so you'll "
"have to make do with what you have on you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Military Pilot" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You got to see things fall apart from the sky, transporting soldiers and "
"survivors from one holdout to the next.  You knew it was only a matter of "
"time before the horrors patrolling the skies shot you down."
msgstr ""
"Widziałeś, jak rzeczy rozpadają się w przestworzach, przenosząc żołnierzy i "
"ocalałych z jednej bazy do drugiej. Wiedziałeś, że to tylko kwestia czasu, "
"zanim zestrzelą cię horrory patrolujące niebo."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "EMT" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were responding to a call with your partner before you got separated.  "
"Now all you have is your trusty ambulance, ready to transport patients "
"through the apocalypse."
msgstr ""
"Odpowiadałeś na wezwanie ze swoim partnerem, zanim się rozdzieliliście. Teraz "
"wszystko, co masz, to zaufany ambulans, gotowy do transportu pacjentów przez "
"apokalipsę."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Paramedic" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were separated from your partner while out on a call.  You managed to "
"hang onto some medical supplies, but it's looking like the only life that "
"needs saving now is yours."
msgstr ""
"Zostałeś oddzielony od partnera podczas wezwania. Udało ci się zatrzymać "
"trochę środków medycznych, ale wygląda na to, że jedyne życie, które teraz "
"wymaga ratowania, to twoje."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Combat Medic" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were on the front lines when everything happened, patching up the wounded "
"and providing support.  But they wouldn't stop coming.  Now you're on your "
"own."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Relief Volunteer" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were a member of a nonprofit organization dedicated to helping out where "
"help was needed.  When the riots happened, you were eager to lend a hand.  "
"But you had to cut your plans short when everyone was less interested in "
"handouts, and more interested in eating you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Speed King" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You used to rule the roads before they were filled with wrecks, undead, and "
"unspeakable horrors.  At least there's no speed limits in the apocalypse!"
msgstr ""
"Kiedyś rządziłeś drogami, zanim wypełniły się wrakami, nieumarłymi i "
"niewypowiedzianymi okropnościami. Przynajmniej w apokalipsie nie ma "
"ograniczeń prędkości!"

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Hazmat Unit" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were deployed to autopsy one of the rioters showing feral behavior before "
"being put down.  When they got back up, you knew this was out of your pay "
"grade."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Drug Dealer" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were about to make your biggest sale yet, but when you met the buyer he "
"tried to bite you.  To top it off, it seems that this wasn't some sort of bad "
"trip, as the whole town tried going for your throat too."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Mafia Boss" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Born into poverty, you joined one of the organized crime families to make a "
"living.  There, you quickly made it to the top and became the boss.  The "
"government was building a RICO case against you, but doomsday arrived first.  "
"Your crew is gone, but your past life has prepared you for a world where "
"violence is common currency."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json data/mods/MindOverMatter/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Paranormal Investigator" for male
#. ~ Description of profession "paranormal_investigator" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were dismissed from your position as a parapsychology professor at the "
"local university and started your own business as a paranormal investigator.  "
"Your former colleagues didn't approve of your research, but it looks like "
"it's paying off now."
msgstr ""
"Zostałeś zwolniony z posady profesora parapsychologii na lokalnym "
"uniwersytecie i rozpocząłeś własną działalność jako badacz zjawisk "
"paranormalnych. Twoi dawni koledzy nie pochwalali twoich badań, ale wygląda "
"na to, że teraz ci się to opłaciło."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Bird Watcher" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were at your favorite park looking at the robins when the Cataclysm "
"struck.  Now all you have are your binoculars and a lot of trivia about local "
"birds to share with any survivors you may find."
msgstr ""
"Byłeś w swoim ulubionym parku i przyglądałeś się drozdom, kiedy nastąpił "
"Kataklizm. Teraz wszystko co masz to lornetka i mnóstwo ciekawostek o "
"lokalnych ptakach, którymi możesz się podzielić z ocalałymi, których "
"znajdziesz."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Portal Traveler" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were abducted from your home, taken hostage, and used as a test subject "
"in a lab.  For the last test, you were dressed in strange clothes and put in "
"a room where you started to feel… different.  You lost consciousness and woke "
"up somewhere unfamiliar."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Ninja" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You are obsessed with the techniques and aesthetics of the ninja, so you "
"practiced your movements, dressed all in black, and spent big bucks to "
"acquire some tools of the trade.  Some may question your historical "
"authenticity, but you're perfectly happy living out your fantasy regardless."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Cheerleader" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your last cheerleader routine ended abruptly after your partners switched "
"sides to the undead team.  Let's hope your quick reflexes and flexibility "
"help you to find new members for the squad."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Patriot" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You are a true American patriot, dressed with star-spangled clothing from "
"head to toe.  The government has fallen, but the nation lives on with its "
"people."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Prepped Patriot" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Does the American dream still exist?  Well, recent events have put that to "
"the test.  Does it still proudly live in your beating heart?  Yes.  Yes, it "
"does.  A patriot to the bitter end, you've readied yourself to go toe to toe "
"with the Cataclysm that would seek to do harm to your darling USA.  That is "
"to say, you grabbed your gun… and nothing more.  God bless America, soldier."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Cowboy" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You liked to spend your days taking care of the horses and cows, searching "
"the perimeter of the ranch on your steed and looking out for anything "
"suspicious, that's why you managed to escape in time when shit hit the fan."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Tourist Swimmer" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were looking forward to a nice, relaxing day at the beach.  You had to "
"run when some lunatics tried to rip your head off and play beach volleyball "
"with it, but at least you managed to grab your bag on the way out."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Professional Swimmer" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"After much practice you were sure the next competition would be your big "
"break, but your rivals started killing each other and you had to escape with "
"only your competition gear on you.  Will your athleticism alone be enough to "
"keep you alive?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Surfer" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You went to ride the waves, but the waves ended up riding you instead when a "
"putrid hand appeared from underwater and grabbed you by the ankle.  You had "
"to ditch your surfboard in favor of a kickboard, and now you'll fight every "
"day to stay ahead of the wave of the undead."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Lifeguard" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your job was to safeguard the lives of everyone at the beach, but when the "
"swimmers started drowning each other, you knew the situation was out of your "
"hands."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Diver" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were exploring below the waves close to shore when you noticed something "
"weird on the nearby beach, you decided to swim away when you heard the "
"screams."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Ship Captain" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were the captain of your small ship, making a living by ferrying divers "
"and tourists across the waves.  The last excursion went bad after your "
"passengers tried to mutiny, but you managed to escape.  Will you ever sail "
"the open ocean again?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Hitman" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You did the wet work for a gang, mafia, or whatever person had enough money.  "
"You were no trained assassin, but you know how to shoot a gun and get out of "
"dodge quickly."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Assassin" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were the best undercover agent they had, with a mission so vital that you "
"had to take it even with the riots going on.  Your target seems to have "
"turned feral as well as your contact, you are all alone now."
msgstr ""
"Byłeś najlepszym tajnym agentem jakiego mieli, z misją tak ważną, że musiałeś "
"podjąć ją w czasie zamieszek. Wygląda na to, że twój cel stał się dziki, "
"podobnie jak twój kontakt, jesteś teraz zupełnie sam."

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Old Veteran" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've been through hell once before.  Hopefully those weekend range trips "
"have kept your skills sharp."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Urban Explorer" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've always admired the beauty of urban desolation, and were ready for your "
"next excursion when the end of the world hit.  You suppose that pretty much "
"every building could be considered abandoned now."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Office Worker" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You felt years of your life being sapped away, slaving at your computer as "
"you subsisted on a daily pot of coffee, microwave burritos and an endless "
"supply of crumpled paper to toss.  Perhaps the Cataclysm is a refreshing "
"change of pace…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "RV Hunter" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Ever since you were a child you loved hunting and traveling; so when you "
"scraped enough money, you bought yourself an old RV, a gun, and hit the road. "
" You've been all over the country, hunting for good game.  Unfortunately the "
"country is all over this time, and even more unfortunately you've lost your "
"ol' reliable in the chaos.  Now you gotta find a new reliable."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Heist Driver" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"For as long as you can remember, you have lived a double life: a normal "
"driver by the day and a heist driver in the night.  Now there are no cops and "
"no law, but even after the Cataclysm, you drive."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Explosive Ordnance Disposal Technician" for
#. male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Ever since you were a child you were fascinated with explosives and all "
"things that go boom.  As soon as you turned 18 you joined the army to become "
"an EOD technician.  While out on a call about a potential explosive in the "
"neighboring county, your team was overrun by hordes of the undead.  You are "
"alone, with nothing but your precious training, gear and love of explosives."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Mixed Martial Artist" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've spent plenty of time training to become the next big thing.  But now "
"it looks like you will be fighting your life from now on.  At least that "
"training won't go to waste!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "FBI Special Agent" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"As a member of the FBI, you dealt with crime that crossed state lines.  You "
"had gotten the go-ahead to make the biggest bust of your career; before you "
"kicked down the door, you yelled \"FBI, open up!\" and then the sky broke "
"open."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Futile Fighter" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The cataclysm may have caught you off guard, but you're not going down "
"without a fight!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/profession_groups.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Standard Bionic Interface" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Like most people on Earth you have previously received cybernetic enhancement "
"to make life easier.  Your enhancements include a universal data link, some "
"basic power storage, and a charging cable to top up."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/hobbies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Speed Freak" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Were you a mercenary, a criminal, a pirate or a very dedicated adrenaline "
"junkie?  Whatever you were before, now you've got a speed freak rig pumping "
"drugs into your veins 24/7.  Statistically you'll die young, your body burned "
"out by all the drugs, but what other chance did you have to become an "
"immortal legend?  None."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/hobbies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Earth born" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your mannerisms and accent are a dead giveaway that you were raised on Earth. "
" Whatever your thoughts about the homeworld might be, the simple fact that "
"you can call it home is likely to affect relationships with people liable to "
"care about such things."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/hobbies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Armament License" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You have a license to own and operate military grade weaponry and can legally "
"purchase such items without any difficulty.  A privilege usually reserved for "
"the politically or economically favored."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/hobbies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Space Operations" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You have ample experience working in space, either on a station or on a ship. "
" You are familiar with safety protocols, capable of piloting small "
"shuttlecraft and can operate and perform maintenance on a variety of space "
"equipment and colony systems."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/hobbies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Empathic Leadership" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You have a natural talent for leadership and can easily see yourself in "
"others.  Quite literally.  In fact, you can swap control to any other "
"character that follows you."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/hobbies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Genemod: Physical Ability" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Much more common in the Hyperspace Era, the rich or those from Earth still "
"have access to genemodding technology designed to make humanity better.  This "
"is the suite of improvements to increase strength, coordination, and sensory "
"ability as well as fix problems such as nearsightedness."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/hobbies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Genemod: Mental Acuity" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Much more common in the Hyperspace Era, the rich or those from Earth still "
"have access to genemodding technology designed to make humanity better.  This "
"is the suite of improvements to increase mental flexibility and memorization."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/hobbies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Genemod: Improved Health" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Much more common in the Hyperspace Era, the rich or those from Earth still "
"have access to genemodding technology designed to make humanity better.  This "
"is the suite of improvements to health, providing increased healing speed and "
"resistance to disease and infection."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/hobbies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Genemod: Efficient System" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Much more common in the Hyperspace Era, the rich or those from Earth still "
"have access to genemodding technology designed to make humanity better.  This "
"is the suite of improvements to recovery, allowing a quicker sleep cycle and "
"faster return to baseline after exertion."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/hobbies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Genemod: Beauty" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Much more common in the Hyperspace Era, the rich or those from Earth still "
"have access to genemodding technology designed to make humanity better.  This "
"is the suite of improvements to physical appearance, offering clearer skin, "
"more striking features, increased facial symmetry, and removing signs of "
"aging."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/hobbies.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Esper Inheritance (Spark)" for male
#. ~ Description of profession "Esper Inheritance (Whisper)" for male
#. ~ Description of profession "Esper Inheritance (Geist)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Some long-distant member of your family received psi treatments during the "
"Hyperspace Era and somehow it stuck in their DNA.  Always unpredictable, "
"skipping multiple generations at a time, that inheritance has been passed "
"down to you.  You have no training and little idea what you're doing, but "
"you've developed a trick or two."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Deck Engineer" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "A skilled ship technician, turned to independent salvage work."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Rating" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were a junior crewmember on a freight spaceship.  Without any "
"exceptionally valuable abilities, you spent your workshifts performing "
"miscellaneous maintenance tasks within the ship.  As such, you are moderately "
"skilled at performing all sorts of minor electrical and mechanical repairs, a "
"skillset you hope remains useful planetside…"
msgstr ""
"Byłeś młodszym członkiem załogi na statku towarowym. Bez żadnych wyjątkowo "
"cennych umiejętności spędzałeś swoje zmiany wykonując różne zadania "
"konserwacyjne na statku. W związku z tym jesteś mniej-więcej wykwalifikowany "
"w wykonywaniu wszelkiego rodzaju drobnych napraw elektrycznych i "
"mechanicznych, zestaw umiejętności, który masz nadzieję, pozostanie przydatny "
"na planecie…"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Espatier" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You are a well experienced mercenary espatier, a soldier rated for both "
"orbital and planetary combat.  Until the crash, you were part of a minor "
"mercenary outfit that provided on-board and landing-site security for freight "
"corporations, although it seems that your last contractor required more "
"protection than what you could provide.  Unfortunately, most of your more "
"specialized gear was left behind in your hasty evacuation…"
msgstr ""
"Jesteś doświadczonym najemnym espatierem, żołnierzem przystosowanym do walki "
"zarówno na orbicie jak i na planecie. Do czasu katastrofy byłeś częścią "
"niewielkiej grupy najemników, którzy zapewniali ochronę na pokładzie i w "
"miejscu lądowania dla korporacji transportowych, choć wydaje się, że twój "
"ostatni kontrahent wymagał większej ochrony niż ta, którą mogłeś zapewnić. "
"Niestety, większość twojego bardziej specjalistycznego ekwipunku została "
"pozostawiona podczas pośpiesznej ewakuacji…"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Captain Schwarz Walder, Cannibal" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Several years ago, you were newly stationed at a remote corporate facility "
"when it came under a personality rewrite attack that affected all of your "
"human coworkers.  It had seemed likely that the few Uplifted staff would "
"perish and most did.  But you disappeared into the wilderness surrounding the "
"facilities and began hunting the things that had been your friends, eating "
"them to stay alive and to power your bionics.  Recapturing the facility "
"earned you a buyout of the remainder of your contract, but most people are "
"uncomfortable around you once they realize how very different you are.  Now "
"you are here on a mostly abandoned planet hunting a bounty."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Cryosleep Survivor" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"A sudden power failure woke you from the cryosleep sarcophagus in which you "
"had entombed yourself lifetimes ago.  It seems the emergency reanimation "
"procedure has damaged your memory, and now, bearing almost no knowledge of "
"your past life, you must find a way to survive in a ruined and alien world."
msgstr ""
"Nagła awaria zasilania wybudziła cię z sarkofagu, w którym zapadłeś w "
"kriogeniczny sen przed wiekami. Wygląda na to, że procedura awaryjnej "
"reanimacji uszkodziła twoją pamięć i teraz, nie mając prawie żadnej wiedzy o "
"swoim poprzednim życiu, musisz znaleźć sposób na przetrwanie w zrujnowanym i "
"obcym świecie."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Atomic Pitchman" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were hired to market Rivtech's products through TV and were on your way "
"to the studio when the bombs hit.  You now enter the end of the world with "
"nothing but the snazzy clothes on your back and a bunch of plutonium-powered "
"toys."
msgstr ""
"Zostałeś zatrudniony do sprzedaży produktów Rivtech w telewizji i byłeś w "
"drodze do studia, gdy spadły bomby. Teraz wkraczasz w świat końca świata, nie "
"mając nic poza eleganckim ubraniem na grzbiecie i mnóstwem zabawek "
"napędzanych plutonem."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Planar Frontiersman" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"When the Cataclysm came, you were getting into your gear, prepared for the "
"first manned entrance through a stabilized portal in the lab - just a quick "
"five-minute scouting trip.  You were the last one left in the room when the "
"portal snapped shut and all hell broke loose.  Now that you know what was on "
"the other end, maybe that was a mercy."
msgstr ""
"Kiedy nadszedł Kataklizm, pakowałeś się do swojego ekwipunku, przygotowany do "
"pierwszego załogowego wejścia przez ustabilizowany portal w laboratorium - "
"był to tylko szybki, pięciominutowy wypad zwiadowczy. Byłeś ostatnim, który "
"pozostał w pomieszczeniu, kiedy portal się zamknął i rozpętało się piekło. "
"Teraz, gdy wiesz, co było na drugim końcu, może to było błogosławieństwo."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Vatgrown Bodyguard" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Grown in some corporate laboratory to provide the perfect bodyguard, with "
"nothing to live for but your client.  The Cataclysm ignored social strata and "
"somehow you outlived your master.  Now no one knows the conditioning words to "
"force your obedience.  While the world burns, you get your first taste of "
"life."
msgstr ""
"Wyhodowano cię w jakimś korporacyjnym laboratorium, byś był idealnym "
"ochroniarzem, dla którego nie ma nic poza twoim klientem. Kataklizm "
"zignorował warstwy społeczne i w jakiś sposób przeżyłeś swojego pana. Teraz "
"nikt nie zna słów, którymi można wymusić twoje posłuszeństwo. Podczas gdy "
"świat płonie, ty po raz pierwszy poznajesz smak życia."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "CBM Engineer" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You worked as a technician in a sterile, high-security facility concerned "
"with the fabrication of bionic implants.  The final evacuation order caught "
"you in the middle of your 16 hour extended shift, and you barely managed to "
"escape the building, tools in hand."
msgstr ""
"Pracowałeś jako technik w sterylnym, ściśle strzeżonym zakładzie zajmującym "
"się produkcją bionicznych implantów. Ostateczny rozkaz ewakuacji dopadł Cię w "
"połowie Twojej 16-godzinnej zmiany i ledwo udało Ci się uciec z budynku z "
"narzędziami w ręku."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Wraitheon Executive" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The exiled scion of an unfavorable seat within the Wraitheon board of "
"directors, wealthy beyond measure even in their estrangement.  Sent to the "
"frontier in a last-ditch effort to salvage their reputation, or more likely, "
"to find a silent and politically convenient death."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Corporate Infiltrator" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"A spy and mercenary at the direct service of the Solar Corporations.  Touring "
"the frontier in search of intelligence gathering and sabotage contracts.  "
"Equipped with a set of irreplaceable holographic technology that borders on "
"the miraculous."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Assistant Sub-Executive" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Through a lifetime of hard work, dedication, boot-licking and immense luck, "
"you achieved the almost impossible, and were promoted from an indentured "
"clerk to a minor managerial position.  Although you were still an expendable "
"peon among the ranks of the corporation, you earned numbers most people could "
"only dream of, and you savored it."
msgstr ""
"Przez całe życie ciężkiej pracy, poświęcenia, lizania butów i ogromnego "
"szczęścia, osiągnąłeś prawie niemożliwe i awansowałeś z urzędnika na "
"pomniejsze stanowisko kierownicze. Chociaż nadal byłeś zbędnym pionkiem w "
"szeregach korporacji, zarabiałeś kwoty, o których większość ludzi może tylko "
"pomarzyć i delektowałeś się tym."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Uplifted Enforcer" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You are an uplifted elephant hybrid, a precisely engineered enforcer creature "
"created by combining human, elephant and mastodon DNA.  Unlike most of your "
"war-minded kin, you sought a peaceful retirement after completing your "
"compulsive service period, and even earned the right to be considered a full "
"citizen.  Now, with the end of the world in the horizon, it seems that your "
"combat skills might come useful once again."
msgstr ""
"Jesteś wzniesioną hybrydą słonia, precyzyjnie zaprojektowaną istotą "
"egzekwującą prawo, powstałą z połączenia DNA człowieka, słonia i mastodonta. "
"W przeciwieństwie do większości swoich wojowniczych krewnych, po zakończeniu "
"okresu przymusowej służby szukałeś spokojnej emerytury, a nawet uzyskałeś "
"prawo do bycia uznanym za pełnoprawnego obywatela. Teraz, gdy na horyzoncie "
"widać koniec świata, wydaje się, że twoje umiejętności bojowe mogą się "
"jeszcze przydać."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Rogue Operator" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You worked as a mercenary across six continents for a dozen corps.  A VP at "
"the last corp decided he wanted to put you on retainer and you agreed to a "
"three month gig in return for some additional bionics.  You woke up with an "
"extra bionic, a cranial bomb that needed to be reset every month or so or it "
"blows up.  Now you have days until the bomb goes off.  Maybe you'll find "
"someone who can remove it.  Can you even sleep, for fear of death?"
msgstr ""
"Pracowałeś jako najemnik na sześciu kontynentach dla kilkunastu korporacji. "
"Wiceprezes ostatniej korporacji zdecydował, że chce cię zatrudnić, a ty "
"zgodziłeś się na trzymiesięczny kontrakt w zamian za kilka dodatkowych "
"bionik. Obudziłeś się z dodatkową bioniką, bombą czaszkową, którą trzeba "
"resetować co około miesiąc, bo inaczej wybuchnie. Teraz masz kilka dni, zanim "
"bomba wybuchnie. Może znajdziesz kogoś, kto będzie umiał ją usunąć. Czy "
"możesz w ogóle spać, ze strachu przed śmiercią?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Engineered Deep Sea Explorer" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Created with the exploration of the deep sea in mind, Cecaelia are hybridized "
"from cephalopod and fish DNA.  While you were mostly spared from the "
"corporate wars by your scientific proclivities, the polite niceties of the "
"surface are mostly forgotten underwater.  You were on dry land when the "
"Cataclysm occurred and you have no idea if it's safer here or beneath the "
"seas."
msgstr ""
"Stworzone z myślą o eksploracji morskich głębin, Cecaelia są hybrydą DNA "
"głowonoga i ryby. Chociaż dzięki swoim naukowym skłonnościom udało ci się "
"uniknąć wojen korporacyjnych, pod wodą zapomina się o grzecznościowych "
"zwyczajach panujących na powierzchni. Byłeś na suchym lądzie, gdy nastąpił "
"Kataklizm i nie masz pojęcia, czy bezpieczniej jest tutaj, czy pod "
"powierzchnią morza."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Roboticist" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Scavenging and reselling abandoned robotics is what you call your \"job.\" It "
"certainly isn't official in any means of the word, but it rakes in the dough "
"and that is all that matters to you, even if it involves dangerous "
"activities, be it cracking old Wraitheon security cyphers or crossing "
"well-worn wires on ancient mining drones."
msgstr ""
"Zbieranie i odsprzedawanie porzuconych robotów to coś, co nazywasz swoją "
"„pracą”. Z pewnością nie jest ona oficjalna w żadnym tego słowa znaczeniu, "
"ale przynosi zyski i tylko to się dla ciebie liczy, nawet jeśli wiąże się to "
"z niebezpiecznymi działaniami, takimi jak łamanie starych szyfrów "
"bezpieczeństwa Wraitheon lub przecinanie zużytych przewodów na starych "
"dronach górniczych."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Academy Technologist" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"A senior technologist from the Planetary Academy of Khorat, sent to Salus IV "
"to oversee the procurement of valuable technological artifacts.  Although "
"generously equipped, you are neither a fighter nor a good fit for life in the "
"frontier.  You'd feel far more comfortable and capable commanding this "
"salvage operation from the faraway safety of your office."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Salvor" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"A scavenger by necessity, born and raised in between ruins and slums.  Some "
"might be lured to your profession by romantic notions of wealth, adventure or "
"scientific discovery.  You know better."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Rocket Jumper" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"A skilled airborne scout and salvager equipped with a rocket pack, eking out "
"a living on the edge of legality."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Escaping Crew" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You awake in your cabin to the sound of emergency sirens and the ship's "
"computer calmly announcing in a posh English voice 'Abandon the vessel "
"immediately.', and then counting down from five minutes.  You've got just "
"enough time to hit a supply locker before you need to activate the escape pod "
"down the hall."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Whisper" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You are a telepath, able to sense minds and influence thoughts.  You aren't "
"entirely sure how you got your powers, but you seem to have an instinctive "
"sense of how to use them.  That's not sinister at all, right?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Spark" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You are an electrokinetic, able to control electricity with your mind.  You "
"aren't entirely sure how you got your powers, but you seem to have an "
"instinctive sense of how to use them.  That's not sinister at all, right?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Geist" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You are a telekinetic, able to move objects without touching them.  You "
"aren't entirely sure how you got your powers, but you seem to have an "
"instinctive sense of how to use them.  That's not sinister at all, right?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/profession.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Pizza Delivery Boy" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"A late night delivery to a lonely building, a cry for help from under the "
"elevator, and a terrible conspiracy.  You are not drunk enough for this."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/profession.json
#. ~ Description of profession "XEDRA Remediator" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The sole survivor of a XEDRA containment team, fighting to keep the horrors "
"of the lab from escaping into the world above."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/profession.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Hacktivist" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"An activist pursuing a government conspiracy.  In the end you were proven "
"right, but does it even matter now?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/profession.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Paramedic" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "A paramedic, trained to save lives in the field."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/profession.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Geas Knight" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"A warrior from a destroyed land, bound by ancient oaths sworn in the language "
"of stars and stone."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/profession.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Bionic Vampire" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "An assassin more metal than meat, driven onward by their faulty cybernetics."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/profession.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Last Scion" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The last survivor of an elder race, physically frail but in command of "
"powerful sorceries wrested from the Outer Dark."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Mutant Para-Amputee" for male
#. ~ Description of profession "Mutant Bilateral Amputee" for male
#. ~ Description of profession "Mutant Quadruple Amputee" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Many of the scientists investigating the immense power of mutation wondered "
"if it could cure limb loss and restore people.  You made the perfect subject "
"with which to test this.  Even though your day to experiment never came, you "
"might have some hope yet of seeing the potential cure to your problems."
msgstr ""
"Wielu naukowców badających ogromną moc mutacji zastanawiało się, czy może ona "
"leczyć utratę kończyn i przywracać ludzi do zdrowia. Byłeś idealnym obiektem "
"do przetestowania. Nawet jeśli twój dzień eksperymentu nigdy nie nadszedł, "
"możesz wciąż mieć nadzieję, że zobaczysz potencjalne lekarstwo na swoje "
"problemy."

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Para-Amputee" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"By some unfortunate means, you have lost both of your legs.  Since then, you "
"have learned to live with your disability and have adapted around it very "
"well, living a normal life.  Even if society has collapsed, so long as you've "
"got your trusty wheelchair, you'll be alright."
msgstr ""
"W niefortunny sposób straciłeś obie nogi. Od tego czasu nauczyłeś się żyć ze "
"swoją niepełnosprawnością i bardzo dobrze się do niej przystosowałeś, "
"prowadząc normalne życie. Nawet jeśli społeczeństwo upadło, dopóki masz swój "
"niezawodny wózek inwalidzki, dasz sobie radę."

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Bilateral Amputee" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"By some unfortunate means, you have lost both of your arms.  Since then, you "
"have learned to live with your disability and have adapted around it very "
"well, living a normal life.  You only need your legs to kick somebody's ass, "
"if it comes down to it."
msgstr ""
"W niefortunny sposób straciłeś obie ręce. Od tego czasu nauczyłeś się żyć ze "
"swoją niepełnosprawnością i bardzo dobrze się do niej przystosowałeś, "
"prowadząc normalne życie. Potrzebujesz tylko nóg, by skopać komuś tyłek, "
"jeśli zajdzie taka potrzeba."

#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Quadruple Amputee" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"By some unfortunate means, you have lost all of your limbs.  Since then, you "
"have learned to live with your disability and have adapted around it very "
"well, living a relatively normal life with a bit of help.  What are you going "
"to do now that all the doctors are dead?"
msgstr ""
"W niefortunny sposób straciłeś wszystkie kończyny. Od tego czasu nauczyłeś "
"się żyć ze swoją niepełnosprawnością i bardzo dobrze się do niej "
"przystosowałeś, prowadząc stosunkowo normalne życie z niewielką pomocą. Co "
"zamierzasz zrobić, teraz gdy wszyscy lekarze nie żyją?"

#: data/mods/MMA/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Battle Angel" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "A combat-ready cyborg once salvaged from an obscure junkyard…"
msgstr "Gotowy do walki cyborg, niegdyś ocalony z obskurnego złomowiska…"

#: data/mods/MMA/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Hylian Adventurer" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Sucked through a vortex into what appears to be a shadow realm, you will "
"continue to fight for justice."
msgstr ""
"Wessany przez wir do czegoś, co wydaje się być sferą cienia, będziesz "
"kontynuował walkę o sprawiedliwość."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Spellcraft (Beginner)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You took a few classes about magical theory before the Cataclysm and still "
"remember most of it."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Spellcraft (Intermediate)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were either a practicing mage or made a formal study of magical theory.  "
"You could have designed spells in your spare time, if you had wanted."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Spellcraft (Expert)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You could have taught magical theory to mages, whether you know any spells or "
"not."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Freshen Up)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Freshen Up, the most common spell in the pre-Cataclysm world.  "
"It saved up a lot of time before work in your old life and you've certainly "
"made a lot of use of it now that there's no more running water."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Crystallize Mana)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Crystallize Mana.  Sure, it ruined your social life and you "
"slept for 12 hours a day, but you made a tidy sum of money producing mana "
"crystals for mages who needed them.  Too bad all that money is useless now."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Magical Light)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Magical Light.  It was mostly a party trick, to be honest, and "
"the weeks learning to cast a spell that any smartphone could replicate showed "
"you how much work trying to learn real magic actually was.  But the nights "
"are dark enough nowadays that you're glad you put in the effort."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Aura of Protection)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Aura of Protection.  To be honest, you originally learned it to "
"try to replace the umbrella you kept leaving at home and were very "
"disappointed when that didn't work.  It's saved you at least once from some "
"strange gas in the air, though, so all that effort paid off."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Sound Bomb)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Sound Bomb.  You mostly used it for jokes, to play pranks on "
"your friends and annoy the neighborhood dogs, but it's proven its worth now "
"at the end of the world."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Knowing the Day and the Hour)" for
#. male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Knowing the Day and the Hour.  Your non-mage friends were "
"always asking you why you bothered learning what was widely considered to be "
"the least useful spell in the world, and sometimes you weren't sure yourself. "
" Even now that the network is done, you're still not entirely sure how "
"important it is to know that it's exactly 6:12 a.m. vs. just \"sunrise\".  "
"But if it ever is important, you'll know it."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Peaceful Rest)" for male
#, c-format
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Peaceful Rest.  Ever since you were a child, you dreaded "
"bedtime.  Falling asleep was an ordeal, a battle between you and the bed, and "
"it seemed like no matter how many sheep you counted, sleep hygiene habits you "
"practiced, or exhausted you felt, it was an hour or more until you finally "
"fell into sleep.  You became a mage because you were tired of having 5% of "
"your life stuck staring at the ceiling while waiting for sleep to come, and "
"ever since the world ended, you're even more grateful you can fall asleep "
"whenever you need to."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Ignus Fatuus)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Ignus Fatuus.  It was mostly just for your amusement, summoning "
"the will-o'-the-wisps at sundown and watching them dance, but they've proven "
"handy more than once lately by leading some monster astray while you ran for "
"your life."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Summon Watcher Spirit)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Summon Watcher Spirit.  You initially learned it to keep an eye "
"on your cat while you were doing chores around the house, but it ended up "
"being even more valuable than you thought once the world ended."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Witchsight)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Witchsight.  People asked you why you would bother learning a "
"spell that only let you know if other people were mages, but every bit of "
"information helped.  A gun you can see, an expensive suit, the size and "
"strength of a person or the way they carry themselves, but a mage's talent is "
"all hidden until they a cast spell.  Unless, of course, you knew how to look, "
"and you did."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Knit the Rent Flesh)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Knit the Rent Flesh.  Certainly no one ever asked your reasons "
"for studying biomancy, especially after you saw that guy get hit by a truck "
"running a red light and managed to stop him from bleeding out before the "
"paramedics arrived.  It was disturbing to watch, but it was undoubtedly "
"effective.  As long as you're light on your feet, you won't have to worry "
"about dying of your injuries now."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Carrion Feast)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Carrion Feast.  You had your reasons for studying it, "
"certainly, and perhaps it is best not to speculate about them now."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Water's Cooling Touch)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Water's Cooling Touch.  You always hated summer, the "
"stickiness, the heat, the sunburns, and your dislike of the weather drove you "
"to study druidic magic to overcome it.  With your water bottle handy, you'll "
"never have to worry about being too hot in the sun again."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Traverse the Wilds)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Traverse the Wilds.  Part of the joy of hiking is taking your "
"time, of being away from the tyranny of clocks and schedules and deadlines.  "
"But sometimes, it was nice to just see the miles fly by, to reach the summit "
"before sunrise and take in the view without getting up at 2 a.m., to finish "
"the entire trail and still have time to sit down and eat a leisurely dinner.  "
"And it's not like you teleported, after all.  Regardless of the magic, you "
"still had to walk every single step."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Goodberry)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"Biohacking was your passion, trying to optimize your life through diet, "
"exercise, and sleep tricks, and you turned to druidic magic to cut out wasted "
"time.  When the Pomodoro timer went off, you scurried to the fridge, grabbed "
"a handful of berries and enchanted them, scarfed them down, and then got back "
"to work.  You never had to deal with meal replacement nonsense, you just ate "
"your berries and got things done.  Your clients are dead now and everything "
"you worked on is ash and dust, but eating those berries has proven to be the "
"best habit you picked up."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Utility Molding)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Utility Molding.  You read a pamphlet once entitled, \"One "
"Spell is All You Need!\" and thought it seemed like a good idea.  And true, "
"maybe you've never needed a mining pick before, but the ability to all up a "
"knife or a shovel or a hammer whenever you want has come in handy countless "
"times."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Tremorsense)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Tremorsense.  It kept you safe, letting you know if someone was "
"nearby even if you were absorbed in a task or listening to music, but now "
"that most of the people you meet want to eat you it's proven invaluable."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (The Turning of the Earth)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, the Turning of the Earth.  Gardening was your passion and you "
"got sick of manually digging rows in early spring or mid-summer weather.  "
"After your studies you could just cast the spell and the earth neatly parted, "
"waiting for seeds to be planted.  Once the canned food runs out, you're sure "
"you'll get even more use of your powers."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Finger Firelighter)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Finger Firelighter.  You had a lot of great conversations with "
"people, late at night outside clubs and restaurants, when they'd ask for a "
"light and you'd just snap your fingers.  Lately, though, you've used it to "
"cook food more than light cigarettes and haven't had anyone to talk to, but "
"at least the fires at night are warm."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Flames of Passion)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Flames of Passion.  Alcohol is a social lubricant, and if you "
"already had a drink in your hand, why not use it to let you loosen up and "
"make it easier to talk to people?  You were out at parties almost every "
"weekend and had a wide circle of friends.  Hopefully at least a few of them "
"made it through all of this."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Slowfall)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Slowfall.  Some people become mages due to a dream, or a goal "
"they want to pursue, but for you it was the memory of falling down the stairs "
"as a child and breaking your leg.  With your magic you could jump off a roof "
"and it was no more dangerous than jumping off a low stone wall, and that's "
"been pretty useful for some of the situations you've found yourself in since "
"the Cataclysm."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Faerie Fire)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Faerie Fire.  Maybe it wasn't a great use of your time, but it "
"was fun at parties and one time when your cat ran off it made it very easy to "
"find her.  Since the Cataclysm, though, your magical powers have become much "
"more useful."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Sorcerer's Hand)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Sorcerer's Hand.  Alright, fine, you admit it, you learned "
"magic because of laziness.  It seems odd to say, with all the hours after "
"work and late at night, studying until you could make your keys twitch and "
"fall off the table and eventually until you can grab a drink from across the "
"room, but it's true.  You could reach nearly everything without having to get "
"up.  Anyway, you're way more active now, and being able to grab things from "
"across the room has come in handy more than once since the end of the world."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Spider Climb)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Spider Climb.  A lot of people in the rockclimbing community "
"said you were cheating, and, to be honest, they were right.  But every time "
"you saw one of those spectacular views from the summit, well, those "
"complaints didn't mean that much."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Windrunning)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Windrunning.  It's embarrassing to admit, but you became a mage "
"because you were always running late.  Just one spell made it much easier to "
"catch that bus, to beat that red light across the crosswalk, to make it to "
"work on time instead of a few minutes late.  Nowadays you have a lot more "
"practice at running and that speed still comes in handy."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Fire Spark)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Fire Spark.  Most people when they wanted to light a fire "
"thought of kelvinists, but electricity always fascinated you.  You used to "
"love watching the storms roll in, sitting on your porch as the lightning "
"played across the sky, and while summoning lightning bolts wouldn't have been "
"useful for anything at all, catching fires with a spark has come in handy."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Air Bubble)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Air Bubble.  It was originally because of your diving trips.  "
"You were sick of having the goggles and the respirator between you and the "
"sea, and if one simple spell would make it so you didn't have to worry about "
"that again, you were willing to put in the time to learn it.  When you had to "
"swim across that river to escape the horde a while ago, it definitely proved "
"its worth."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Lamp)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Lamp.  Sure, phones had lights, but they weren't nearly as "
"bright as a magical one was, and it was pretty nice to just recite the words "
"and light up an entire room like a high-powered flashlight.  Now that the "
"power's out, it's even more useful."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Knock)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Knock.  You originally learned it because you always forgot "
"your keys and after the third time you were locked out of your apartment, to "
"turned to magic to solve the problem.  Of course, once you did have to use "
"magic to get back in you realized that anyone else could have done the same "
"thing, so in the end it just ruined your peace of mind.  At least now you can "
"be sure there's no one home at the places you're entering."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies_fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Elf (Species)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You are one of the Firstborn, called \"alfar\" or \"sidhe\" or, more "
"recently, \"elves\" by the humans.  Your people had integrated into human "
"society before the Cataclysm, doing jobs involving animals and nature since "
"modern industry was never to your liking.  Had technological development "
"continued, you might have been forced to make some unpleasant compromises, "
"but not as unpleasant as you have during the end of the world."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies_fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dwarf (Species)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You are a Child of the Stone, called \"dwarf\" by the humans.  The legends "
"tell that long ago, your people were born of stone and mined your way up to "
"the surface world and its light, where you found the other sapient species of "
"Earth.  While the scale of the human world was always a bit of a problem, you "
"fit in well due to your people's long tradition of craftsdwarfship and hard "
"work.  Now that society has collapsed, maybe you can turn that same drive to "
"rebuilding it."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies_fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Goblin (Species)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You are a goblin.  Before the Cataclysm your people were always a little out "
"of place: the houses weren't designed for you, the shops weren't open when "
"you were awake, and your appearance sometimes gave human or elven children "
"nightmares that you were going to steal them or reminded dwarves of the "
"ancient wars your peoples fought.  As it turned out, you weren't what any of "
"them should have been worrying about."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies_fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Lizardfolk (Species)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You are one of the Scaled Ones, called \"lizardfolk\" by the warmbloods.  For "
"generations, your tribe served a dragon as its eyes and ears in the outside "
"world, until civilization encroached far enough that even all the dragon's "
"might could not hold it back.  You were sent out to integrate into the modern "
"world, but you were only there a few years before human science ended their "
"world.  Now, you have to survive in the mess they've created."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies_fantasy_species.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Ravenfolk (Species)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You are one of the Kor'uru, called \"ravenfolk\" by those who can't make the "
"appropriate clacking sound due to their lack of beak.  While your people "
"could not fly without the aid of magic, you were always drawn to explore the "
"world, and had traveled to nearly every country and continent even before "
"modern society made such travel easy.  You were well-integrated into society "
"at all levels…and that made you just as vulnerable as everyone else when it "
"fell."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Would-be Wizard" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You found a pamphlet with bright colors claiming you can be a Wizard, oddly "
"serene with the world falling down around you."
msgstr ""
"Znalazłeś broszurę w jaskrawych kolorach, w której twierdzono, że możesz "
"zostać Czarodziejem, dziwnie pogodną, gdy świat wokół ciebie się wali."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Pyromaniac Kelvinist" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You have loved fire all of your life.  You have now discovered your inner "
"fire, and want to exercise that upon the world."
msgstr ""
"Kochałeś ogień przez całe swoje życie. Teraz odkryłeś swój wewnętrzny ogień i "
"chcesz go użyć na świecie."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Druid" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "The ancient circle of druids is gone with the Cataclysm.  Nature must thrive."
msgstr "Starożytny krąg druidów odszedł wraz z Kataklizmem. Natura musi się odrodzić."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Novice Necromancer" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You always had to hide your magic, as it was generally not an acceptable type "
"of magic in the wizarding world, but with the Cataclysm you need to pull "
"every trick out of the book."
msgstr ""
"Zawsze musiałeś ukrywać swoją magię, ponieważ generalnie nie była ona "
"akceptowanym rodzajem czarów w świecie czarodziejów, ale wraz z Kataklizmem "
"musisz wykorzystać każdą sztuczkę z książki."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Novice Stormshaper" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The son of a weatherman, you were always interested in the weather.  Recently "
"you found it was possible to manipulate the weather yourself through arcane "
"means!  Unfortunately you did not have long to enjoy your power, as events "
"unfolded…"
msgstr ""
"Jako syn meteorologa, zawsze interesowałeś się pogodą. Niedawno odkryłeś, że "
"możesz sam manipulować pogodą za pomocą magicznych środków! Niestety nie było "
"ci dane długo cieszyć się swoją mocą, ponieważ wydarzenia potoczyły się dalej…"

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Novice Earthshaper" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were always tough in a fight.  Your coach managed to teach you a trick or "
"two to make you a little tougher."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Novice Technomancer" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"With the recent Cataclysm, the way you found to cheat on tests may have to "
"find some other use."
msgstr ""
"Wraz z niedawnym Kataklizmem, sposób, który znalazłeś, aby oszukiwać na "
"testach może znaleźć inne zastosowanie."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Introspectionist" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You segregated yourself from society because you wanted to concentrate on "
"improving yourself.  It was you and your best friend, but now the apocalypse "
"won't leave you alone."
msgstr ""
"Odseparowałeś się od społeczeństwa, bo chciałeś skupić się na doskonaleniu "
"siebie. To byłeś ty i twój najlepszy przyjaciel, ale teraz apokalipsa nie "
"daje ci spokoju."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Vengeful Preacher" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You lost your faith when your spouse died of illness.  You've been drinking "
"yourself to death ever since.  God is punishing everyone with this "
"apocalypse, you are going to show them your brand of mercy."
msgstr ""
"Straciłeś wiarę, gdy twój współmałżonek zmarł na chorobę. Od tamtej pory "
"zapijasz się na śmierć. Bóg karze wszystkich tą apokalipsą, a ty masz im "
"okazać swoje miłosierdzie."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Techno-Prepper" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've long suspected the world might suddenly turn over.  With your "
"training, spells, and revolver, your chances are far better than most."
msgstr ""
"Od dawna podejrzewałeś, że świat może się nagle przewrócić. Z twoim "
"wyszkoleniem, czarami i rewolwerem, twoje szanse są o wiele większe niż "
"większości."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Freezing Dancer" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You are a highly sought exotic magic dancer.  You can heat the room "
"temperature with your moves and your body, but whenever it lights too much "
"you freeze it with your magic, granting you great control over your public.  "
"They can see, but never touch."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Dimensionalist Mage" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You are an expert in dimensionalism, with its most common example being "
"teleportation magic, that is the reason why you could survive while your "
"colleagues could not.  Your only hope is that your highly specialized skills "
"will continue keeping you alive."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Shadow Burglar" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Helped by all kind of magical tools and your great talents, you were planning "
"your next great break in.  The world ended before you had time to escape with "
"all of your ill-gained plunder, but at least now nobody can stop you now from "
"breaking whatever locks you desire."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Magic Drunkard" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were lucky enough to find a weird flask that refills itself with whiskey! "
" You now spend your days just waiting for every refill and keeping it from "
"the hands of any envious neighbor of yours."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Magic Miner" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were the most prepared of them all.  The miner that never lacked tools "
"and could control the ground itself.  Sadly, you are not sure those abilities "
"will save you in what is to come."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Magic Butler" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You are a descendant of a long line of housekeepers for magical families.  "
"Trained in several spells to facilitate your job you were easily hired to "
"take care of your current job, sadly, it looks like this could be your last."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Wild Druid" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"For a long time you lived in the wild, free of interference from whatever "
"inhabited outside the woods, now that the woods are collapsing you finally "
"return to civilization."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Archer Druid" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were a skillful and committed archer druid, making constant excursions to "
"the forests in which you dedicated yourself to living off of and with what "
"nature had to offer you.  You were returning from your last travel when "
"civilization fell upon itself."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Grim Reaper" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've loved death since you can remember, always attracted to that cold and "
"fair skeletal hand, but love is often unrequited, you have not been allowed a "
"meeting yet.  One night, you had a dream, since you are not allowed to meet "
"death, why not bring that joy to everyone else instead?  After much training "
"and hardship you have now become the Grim Reaper itself."
msgstr ""
"Kochasz śmierć i odkąd pamiętasz, zawsze pociągała cię ta zimna i jasna "
"szkieletowa dłoń, ale miłość często bywa nieodwzajemniona; do tej pory nie "
"pozwolono ci się z nią spotkać. Pewnej nocy przyśnił ci się sen: skoro nie "
"możesz spotkać się ze śmiercią, dlaczego nie miałbyś dać tej radości "
"wszystkim innym? Po wielu treningach i trudach stałeś się Ponurym Żniwiarzem."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Bionic Pseudovamp" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've long had an obsession with horror novels, and used your wealth to "
"augment yourself with spells and bionics into a denizen of the night.  Your "
"neglect to your health in your pursuit has left you pale and unlively."
msgstr ""
"Od dawna masz obsesję na punkcie powieści grozy i wykorzystałeś swoje "
"bogactwo, by za pomocą czarów i bioniki stać się nocnym stworzeniem. W tej "
"pogoni zaniedbałeś swoje zdrowie, przez co jesteś blady i niemrawy."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Academy Wizard" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"A year of enrollment in a wizard's academy has taught you patience, wisdom, "
"and a handful of useful spells.  With the teachers converted into the undead "
"and classes canceled, the final lesson has begun."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Corrosive Rocker" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your metal career soared to new heights when you swapped special effects for "
"acrid gore and spiked whips.  It seems the Cataclysm is now your final tour."
msgstr ""
"Twoja metalowa kariera wzniosła się na nowe wyżyny, gdy zamieniłeś efekty "
"specjalne na cuchnące obrzydliwości i kolczaste bicze. Wygląda na to, że "
"Kataklizm jest teraz twoją ostatnią trasą koncertową."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Shock Officer" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were enrolled in an experimental law enforcement program designed to "
"decrease suspect casualties and equipment costs by substituting tasers and "
"bullets for less-lethal Stormshaping."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Earthquake Brawler" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've made a name for yourself in underground magic boxing rings as an "
"unstoppable punching machine.  Now that all your opponents are undead, "
"there's no need to hold back."
msgstr ""
"W podziemnych, magicznych ringach bokserskich zdobyłeś sławę jako "
"niepowstrzymana maszyna do zadawania ciosów. Teraz, gdy wszyscy twoi "
"przeciwnicy to nieumarli, nie ma potrzeby się powstrzymywać."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Illicit Fleshmender" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"After failing out of medical school, you took their mundane methods and "
"combined it with magic to save your patients.  Now that they all want to kill "
"you, the lack of a license is the least of your worries."
msgstr ""
"Po tym, jak nie udało ci się ukończyć szkoły medycznej, wykorzystałeś ich "
"przyziemne metody i połączyłeś je z magią, aby ratować swoich pacjentów. "
"Teraz, gdy wszyscy chcą cię zabić, brak licencji to najmniejsze z twoich "
"zmartwień."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Wildborne Rider" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Abandoned at a young age and raised by moose, you had to master the wilds to "
"survive.  While the modern world has been devoured, you and your steed are no "
"stranger to hardship."
msgstr ""
"Porzucony za młodu i wychowany przez łosie, musiałeś zapanować nad dziką "
"przyrodą, aby przetrwać. Podczas gdy współczesny świat został pożarty, tobie "
"i twojemu rumakowi nie są obce trudy życia."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Deep-Cold Marksman" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were a special operative conducting covert sniper ops in sub-zero "
"temperatures, and had just finished your tour when society was destroyed.  "
"Having retained your gear, it's time to join the new war."
msgstr ""
"Byłeś agentem specjalnym prowadzącym tajne operacje snajperskie w "
"temperaturach poniżej zera i właśnie zakończyłeś swoją misję, gdy "
"społeczeństwo zostało zniszczone. Zachowawszy swój ekwipunek, nadszedł czas, "
"aby dołączyć do nowej wojny."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Arsonist" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Penned in a cell without fuel, you've been extinguished for years for setting "
"buildings on fire.  In your escape, you grabbed your familiar tool to "
"reignite the embers."
msgstr ""
"Zamknięty w celi bez paliwa, przez lata byłeś gaszony za podpalanie budynków. "
"W czasie ucieczki chwyciłeś znajome urządzenie, aby ponownie rozniecić żar."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Ecoterrorist" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"These bastards were destroying Earth far before the undead came, and mauling "
"those execs was worth the federal charges.  Now, you may have greater "
"priorities than pollution."
msgstr ""
"Ci dranie niszczyli Ziemię na długo przed pojawieniem się nieumarłych, a "
"zmasakrowanie tych przywódców było warte federalnych zarzutów. Teraz możesz "
"mieć większe priorytety niż zanieczyszczenie środowiska."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Frost Cream Man" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You learned Kelvinist spells to keep equipment costs down on your ice cream "
"truck.  While their tastes have changed, the kids still scream for you."
msgstr ""
"Nauczyłeś się zaklęć kelwinistycznych, aby obniżyć koszty wyposażenia Twojej "
"ciężarówki z lodami. Chociaż ich gusta się zmieniły, dzieci nadal krzyczą za "
"tobą."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Knife Thrower" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You entertained the masses, displaying an expert hand tossing knives conjured "
"from nowhere.  Now, you're bringing the show to them."
msgstr ""
"Zabawiałeś masy, pokazując fachową rękę do rzucania nożami wyczarowanymi "
"znikąd. Teraz, przyniesiesz im widowisko."

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Hy-Brasilean ambassadorial honor guard" for
#. male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were a ceremonial guard for the Hy-Brasilean ambassador to the United "
"States, equipped to bring to mind the elven forest warriors of old.  You were "
"trained in archery, since you had to use your bow to impress foreign "
"dignitaries, but you never expected you'd actually have to take it into a "
"real battle.  Then the Cataclysm hit.  The ambassador and most of your fellow "
"guards are dead, and you'll probably never see home again, but hopefully your "
"skills will keep you alive."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Shifter Druid" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The ancient druidic art of taking animal forms had mostly fallen out of favor "
"by the modern era, since most people didn't need to be a bear in their daily "
"lives and even if they did transform into a raven, they still had to "
"physically fly to their destination and couldn't check the internet for "
"directions.  You, however, studied the ancient arts and gained the ability to "
"transform yourself.  It's come in very handy since the world ended."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Chess Enthusiast" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You never made master, but you did very well in chess competitions before the "
"Cataclysm.  All those hours of staring at the board, trying to keep all the "
"pieces in your mind at once, have left you with a great ability to focus your "
"attention on a single problem when you need to."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Chess Master" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm, many of your weekends were spent either competing in "
"tournaments or studying records of past games, always trying to find the "
"patterns.  All that time has also made you a master of concentrating on a "
"specific subject, despite whatever is going on around you."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Chess Grandmaster" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the best of the best, awarded a grandmaster title in your "
"early twenties.  Chess was your passion and your life, and you were good "
"enough at it to make a living competing before the Cataclysm.  You have an "
"almost-inhuman ability to focus on a task and ignore all distractions."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Newly-Awakened Biokinetic" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now "
"you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  You feel in better "
"shape than you ever have in your life, like you could run ten miles and climb "
"a mountain and then wake up and do it again.  You'll probably need it."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Arising Biokinetic" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now "
"you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  You can breathe "
"underwater and twist yourself enough to squeeze through a half-closed window. "
" You can run five meters in less than a second and shrug off a punch like "
"it's nothing.  You'd almost be worried you were becoming one of those "
"rioters, except you're definitely still sane.  Right?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Ascended Biokinetic" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now "
"you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  You can move "
"inhumanly fast, hitting zombies before they even seem to know that you're "
"there.  You can pull out nails with your bare hands and go out in winter "
"without even a shirt and not feel the cold.  You're a new breed, Homo "
"Cataclysmicus, and if anyone is equipped to survive in this new world, it's "
"you."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Newly-Awakened Clairsentient" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now "
"you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  You can read much "
"faster and can see much better in the dark, and even in total darkness you no "
"longer have any hesitation about moving.  At least once you avoided zombies "
"on the other side of a wall that you didn't hear and couldn't see, but you, "
"you just knew they were there."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Arising Clairsentient" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now "
"you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  You can see auras "
"around people that tell you what they're feeling, and you've already used it "
"to avoid someone who was feigning being injured with the hope of stealing "
"your gear.  You can see through walls, and tell where the best place to hit "
"something is to take it down for good.  That last ability will definitely get "
"plenty of use."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Ascended Clairsentient" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now "
"you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  You can finish "
"books in a few hours and remember almost everything you read, you had to fix "
"a bicycle a few weeks ago and even though you've never tried to do that "
"before in your life, everything you needed to do just…came to you.  What's "
"more, last time the Zs attacked you, you never got a scratch.  Three of them "
"came at you at once and you dodged every attack because you could see what "
"they were going to do before they did it.  If only you could see where you "
"needed to go to be safe."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Newly-Awakened Electrokinetic" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now "
"you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  While running down "
"an alleyway to escape a group of rioters, you looked back and realized you "
"were going to get caught and then there was a deafening crash of thunder and "
"your vision went white.  When your hearing and sight came back, the rioters "
"were lying in a heap, some still with smoldering clothes, and you were "
"unscathed."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Arising Electrokinetic" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now "
"you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  You an hurl "
"lightning bolts from your hands, like some kind of superhero, and your "
"smartphone still has a full charge even though you haven't plugged it in "
"weeks.  Some kind of huge wasp attacked you in the woods and there was a "
"crackle like thunder and it fell to the ground twitching.  You didn't stop to "
"check if it would move again."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Ascended Electrokinetic" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now "
"you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  You managed to "
"drive the entire week the sky broke on a single charge in your car, and while "
"you had to abandon it since then it got you out of the worst of the cities.  "
"Anything that attacks you has to face your lightning and you haven't found "
"anything yet that can withstand it."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Newly-Awakened Photokinetic" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now "
"you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  You noticed that "
"light seemed to bend at the will of your thoughts, when you were almost "
"caught by a wandering horde, light slowly dimmed enough for you to hide in "
"the shadows.  You have a sense that there's more to your newfound talents."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Arising Photokinetic" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now "
"you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  You can make the "
"air glow and fire lasers from your hands, and even sometimes hear radio "
"signals.  You haven't heard any other survivors out there yet, but you listen "
"for a bit every night, just in case."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Ascended Photokinetic" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now "
"you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  Many times a horde "
"has passed within sight of you and simply never noticed you, and the few "
"times they did, you just created illusions of yourself and all ran different "
"directions.  The few stragglers were easy to sear to ash with focused light."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Newly-Awakened Pyrokinetic" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now "
"you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  With just a "
"thought, you can start a fire or make light radiate from the very air.  It's "
"already saved your life once when you burned a zombie to ash while scavenging "
"in a ruined house.  Sure, the house burned down too, but you'll definitely "
"get more control as time goes on, right?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Arising Pyrokinetic" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now "
"you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  You don't even "
"know how many zombies you've burned at this point, and keeping warm in winter "
"certainly won't be a problem."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Ascended Pyrokinetic" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now "
"you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  You are one with "
"the flames, and they come at your command and obey your every instruction.  "
"Zombies, mutants, aliens, stranger things--no matter what is out there, you "
"will incinerate it and survive."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Newly-Awakened Telekinetic" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now "
"you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  You can lift "
"things with your mind.  Mostly just small things, but during the chaos a "
"group of rioters jumped you and you hurled them off of you just by thinking "
"about it.  This will definitely come in handy."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Arising Telekinetic" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now "
"you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  Moving things at a "
"distance is child's play.  You can pick up zombies and fling them away from "
"you, shatter doors with a thought, and jump from the fifth story and land "
"with barely a bruise.  Nothing is going to get close to you now."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Ascended Telekinetic" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now "
"you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  One ton cars lift "
"off the ground with merely a thought, bullets bounce off the air before they "
"hit you, and you can smash whole groups of zombies to paste in seconds.  You "
"can even fly from rooftop to rooftop, preventing gravity from affecting you "
"by sheer force of will."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Newly-Awakened Telepath" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now "
"you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  The crazies were "
"bad enough during the riots, but once you were stopped by a police officer "
"whose bloodshot eyes told you that he wasn't going to let you off with a "
"warning.  But you could somehow hear his thoughts, a chaotic jumble of rage "
"and hunger and fear, you just…nudged them a little bit, and he wandered off "
"and left you alone.  It doesn't work the same way with the zombies, but you "
"can't have everything."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Arising Telepath" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now "
"you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  Sure, the zombies "
"are immune to telepathy, but those rioters aren't and neither are some of the "
"monsters you've run into.  At least once, you managed to warn off another "
"survivor who you knew meant to rob you.  You left him unconscious and without "
"his weapons, and if the zombies got him, well, he shouldn't have messed with "
"you."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Ascended Telepath" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now "
"you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  Controlling human "
"minds is still too hard but at this point, animal minds are child's play.  A "
"while back, some kind of mutated wolf or dog or something jumped you in the "
"forest and after a few seconds, it was wagging its tail and jumping around "
"like a new puppy.  You wish you still had it with you, but it died fighting "
"off some kind of pink crustacean…thing, giving you time to run.  The bravest "
"dog you ever had."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Newly-Awakened Teleporter" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now "
"you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  You were fleeing "
"down a side street when you heard a crash above you.  You looked up and saw "
"something hurtling through the air down toward you, you closed your eyes and "
"wished you were anywhere but where you were, and then… you were.  Indoors, in "
"a house near the street, and you went out the back door and made good your "
"escape.  You're very, very good at escaping now."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Arising Teleporter" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now "
"you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  You can step "
"through walls, and once you were surrounded by a horde and looked up and a "
"nearby rooftop and… there you were, safe and out of the zombies' line of "
"sight.  The rule of the zombie apocalypse is \"keep moving\", and you're the "
"best you've ever been at that."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Ascended Teleporter" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now "
"you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  No wall or door is "
"a barrier to you and sometimes when you close your eyes you can travel to "
"places you've already been.  Once you were surprised by a bandit and when he "
"leveled his gun at you, you wished he was somewhere else and he "
"just…disappeared.  Nothing can keep you down now."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Gateway Initiate" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now "
"you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  But teleporting "
"through walls isn't the most impressive part.  You spent a few days in an "
"abandoned basement and on a scavenging trip, one of those rioters surprised "
"you.  Snarling, she had you by the arm and was prepared to smash in your head "
"with a pipe and then you were just…back safe in that basement.  That will "
"definitely come in handy."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Newly-Awakened Vitakinetic" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now "
"you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  You broke your leg "
"when you got caught in a riot, and when things got really bad you were "
"positive you were going to die.  But somehow, after only a few days your leg "
"didn't seem to hurt nearly as much anymore.  By the end of the week you could "
"walk on it, and by now it's like nothing ever happened.  It's not going to "
"help you fight the zombies but it'll sure help you recover afterward."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Arising Vitakinetic" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now "
"you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  Just last week you "
"were looking in an abandoned building and fell through a weak floor.  But you "
"barely bled, and after a few minutes lying there you picked yourself up and "
"managed to run away from the things that came to investigate the noise.  You "
"didn't have enough water to properly clean your wounds but it hasn't seemed "
"to have mattered.  You're already back to normal."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Ascended Vitakinetic" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now "
"you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  You've suffered "
"injuries that should have killed you multiple times over by now and recovered "
"in days every time.  You've broken your leg twice, your arm once, drank bad "
"water that had you puking your guts out, nearly been disemboweled by some "
"mutated thing…every single time, your powers kept you going.  Hopefully "
"they'll see you through to the very end of all this."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Psychic Knack (Flexibility)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm you were always surprisingly flexible, and that ability "
"has been greatly heightened after the world ended.  While you are not a fully "
"awakened psion, you have a single trick you can use.  Hopefully it helps you "
"survive."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
