"While you are not a fully awakened psion, you have a single trick you can "
"use.  Hopefully it helps you survive."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Psychic Knack (Leukocyte Accumulation)" for
#. male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
