"that ability has been greatly heightened after the world ended.  While you "
"are not a fully awakened psion, you have a single trick you can use.  "
"Hopefully it helps you survive."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Psychic Knack (Detoxification)" for male
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
