msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Psychic Knack (Telepathic Shield)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm you never had a single nightmare that you could "
