msgstr ""

#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
#. ~ Description of profession "Psychic Knack (Beastmaster)" for female
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm, animals always seemed to like you, and that ability has "
