#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Ah, a rich man I see.  I think you have yourself a deal."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/Isherwood_Rescue_NPC_Duplicates.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Barry!  Oh my god, you found him!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/Isherwood_Rescue_NPC_Duplicates.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"*eyes you up and down with a nervous smile.  \"I almost didn't expect you to "
"show up.\"  He hesitates, letting out a soft laugh.  \"That sounds bad.  I "
"just mean, I can't really believe we're doing this.  Thank you… for doing "
"this.  You ready to get Uncle Barry?\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
", looking at your marshal badge immediately.  \"You said you'd keep that "
"goddamn piece of tin out of my sight.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"I see you took the badge off.  Fine, then, but you'd better not let anyone "
"here know you've got ties to the Marshals.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"*nods slowly.  \"I understand.  You tried.  We could maybe… no, nevermind.  "
"Time is important here, we can't spend forever hoping to get everything in "
"place if we want to get Uncle Barry back alive.  Let's do it without the "
"gear.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Hello traveler, what brings you here?"
msgstr "Witaj wędrowcze, co cię tu sprowadza?"

#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Hey, who the fuck are you?  I haven't seen you 'round.  Ah, fuck it, it "
"doesn't matter.\n"
"Here's the rules.  The first and most important one: ALWAYS CLOSE THE FUCKING "
"ENTRY DOOR BEHIND YOUR ASS!  If you're okay with that, the following rules "
"are: don't fuck with us, don't steal from us, don't start a fight without a "
"reason with someone from us.  Got it, punk?  Now get lost."
msgstr ""
"Hej, a kim ty kurwa jesteś? Nie widziałem cię w okolicy. Ah, pieprzyć to, to "
"nie ma znaczenia.\n"
"Oto zasady. Pierwsza i najważniejsza: ZAWSZE ZAMYKAJ TE CHOLERNE DRZWI "
"WEJŚCIOWE ZA SWOJĄ DUPĄ! Jeśli się z tym pogodzisz, to kolejne zasady są "
"następujące: nie zadzieraj z nami, nie okradaj nas, nie wszczynaj bójki bez "
"powodu z kimkolwiek od nas. Zrozumiałeś, głąbie? A teraz spadaj."

#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Are you deaf or stupid?  I said I don't give a fuck for you and your "
"<freaking> problems.  Bother me one more time, and you'll regret that.  Get "
"outta my sight."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "You think you're immortal, huh, <name_b>?"
msgstr "Myślisz, że jesteś nieśmiertelny, hę, <name_b>?"

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "You look like you haven't eaten in days."
msgstr "Wyglądasz, jakbyś nie jadła od kilku dni."

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_fabricate.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Sure.  After what you did for me, I'd equip an army for you.  I'll need some "
"money to negotiate with the caravans and scavengers that come by.  What level "
"of protection are you thinking?  I can do 2mm, 4mm, and 6mm suits depending "
"on how much you want to resemble a tank, or I can make you a suit of "
"chainmail instead if you want a little more flexibility.  Materials costs are "
"300 merch to pay for the food I need to do the labor plus 100 merch per 2mm "
"or 50 merch for the chainmail.  Whatever I save in non-scaling bits like the "
"chain and leather, I get gouged in looking for so much bulk metal."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_fabricate.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Yeah; the designs you showed me call for 'em.  Not sure what they are myself, "
"but the pictures are real descriptive about how to use them.  To make "
"anything, I'll need one of each of those wire kits.  Got any?"
msgstr ""
"Tak, projekty, które mi pokazałeś, wymagają ich użycia. Sam nie jestem pewna, "
"co to jest, ale na zdjęciach jest opisany sposób ich użycia. Aby zrobić "
"cokolwiek, będę potrzebowała po jednym z tych zestawów przewodów. Masz jakieś?"

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_fabricate.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Thanks, sugar!  If you ever have me make some armor, just let me know if you "
"want me to use these in it."
msgstr ""
"Dzięki, cukiereczku! Jeśli kiedykolwiek będziesz mnie prosić o zrobienie "
"zbroi, daj mi znać, czy chcesz, żebym je w niej wykorzystał."

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_weaponsmith.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Sure.  After what you've done for me, I'll forge you the finest work of art.  "
"The price and waiting time depend on the size of the weapon in question, but "
"it will take me a fair amount of money to buy the quality steel I need from "
"the scavengers, and even forging a short blade will take a few days.\n"
"\n"
"I can also temper your weapon, but that will cost an additional 50 merch and "
"take an additional 2 days, but I assure you, it's worth it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_GUN_STORE_SURVIVOR.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Hey stranger.  How's life treatin' ya these days?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_APARTMENT_SURVIVOR.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_PREPPER_SURVIVOR.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Oh, you're not one of the <zombies>.  Come on in, just don't cause any "
"trouble."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_shelter_survivors.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Oh, you're not one of them.  Those <zombies>, I mean.  Come on in, just don't "
"cause any trouble."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/TALK_homeless_survivor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"I guess you probably wouldn't have noticed this place before shit hit the "
"fan, but I've been down here for quite a while."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/prisoners/mi-go_prisoners.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "How are you here?  Are you one of them, somehow?  What's going on?"
msgstr ""
"Jakim cudem tu się znalazłeś? Jesteś jakimś sposobem jednym z nich? Co tu się "
"wyprawia?"

#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Well well, another traveler.  Don't try anything, you're outnumbered here and "
"we're well armed."
msgstr ""
"No proszę, kolejny wędrowiec. Niczego nie próbuj, mamy przewagę liczebną i "
"jesteśmy dobrze uzbrojeni."

#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"No offense, but my clients definitely would not like me giving strangers "
"directions to their hideouts.  You'll have to find them on their own terms."
msgstr ""
"Bez obrazy, ale moi klienci zdecydowanie woleliby żebym nie dawał nieznajomym "
"wskazówek do ich siedzib. Będziesz musiał ich znaleźć na własnych warunkach."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry to say it after all you've done for me, but… I don't suppose you've "
"got anything to eat?"
msgstr ""
"Przykro mi to mówić po tym wszystkim, co dla mnie zrobiłeś, ale… Nie masz "
"może czegoś do jedzenia?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Well… you have shown that you can survive out there, and you've been able to "
"provide food, so I know you're thriving more than we are here.  All right, "
"I'll tell you what.  I'm not going anywhere without my friends here, we've "
"been through way too much together.  If you can convince Luo, Brandon, and "
"Yusuke to come along, then I'll go."
msgstr ""
"Cóż… pokazałeś, że potrafisz tam przetrwać i byłeś w stanie zapewnić "
"jedzenie, więc wiem, że radzisz sobie lepiej niż my tutaj. W porządku, powiem "
"ci coś. Nigdzie się nie ruszam bez moich przyjaciół, za dużo razem "
"przeszliśmy. Jeśli uda ci się przekonać Luo, Brandona i Yusuke, żeby poszli "
"ze mną, to ja pójdę."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_2_Dino_Dave.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I'm real hungry and they put drugs in most of the food.  I can see "
"you're not like that."
msgstr ""
"Tak, jestem naprawdę głodny, a oni dosypują narkotyków do większości "
"jedzenia. Widzę, że ty taki nie jesteś."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Fuck off, dickwaddle."
msgstr "Spieprzaj dziadu."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Look, I'm sorry for freaking out earlier.  You might be an asshole but I'm "
"sure you didn't mean it like that.  My blood sugar is hella low, I get a bit "
"cranky.  We cool?"
msgstr ""
"Słuchaj, przepraszam za te wcześniejsze wybryki. Może jesteś dupkiem, ale na "
"pewno nie miałeś tego na myśli. Mam cholernie niski poziom cukru we krwi, "
"robię się nieco drażliwy. Między nami wszystko w porządku?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Hey there, not-asshole.  Good to see you again."
msgstr "Hej tam, nie-dupku. Dobrze znów cię widzieć."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Oooooh.  Oh.  You did not just fucking go there.  Let's leave the fatties to "
"die, hey?  Wanna know how easy it is to find fucking *thyroid medication* "
"after the apocalypse, asshat?  Besides, there are more skills than heavy "
"lifting needed now… no, you know what?  Screw it.  You're not worth my time."
msgstr ""
"Uuuuu. Och. Ty chyba, kurwa, nie idziesz tą drogą. Zostawmy grubasów na "
"śmierć, co? Chcesz wiedzieć, jak łatwo jest znaleźć pieprzone *leki na "
"tarczycę* po apokalipsie, dupku? Poza tym, teraz bardziej potrzebne są "
"umiejętności niż podnoszenie ciężarów… nie, wiesz co? Pieprzyć to. Nie jesteś "
"wart mojego czasu."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Thanks again for the grub, my friend."
msgstr "Dzięki raz jeszcze za wyżerkę, mój przyjacielu."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Oh, wow!  You're a real gem, you know that?  Thanks for even thinking of it."
msgstr ""
"Och, łał! Jesteś prawdziwym skarbem, wiesz o tym? Dzięki, że w ogóle o tym "
"pomyślałaś."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Well… I'll be honest, I didn't even think Dave could be sorted out, and "
"you've gone and called my bluff!  It's a darn fine thing you've done for that "
"poor soul.  Listen, I wasn't… entirely serious about wanting to come with "
"you, but if you can convince the others to go, then I guess I'll come along."
msgstr ""
"Cóż… Będę szczery, nie sądziłem nawet, że problem Dave’a da się w ogóle "
"rozwiązać, a ty poszedłeś i zweryfikowałeś mój blef! To jest cholernie dobra "
"rzecz, którą zrobiłeś dla tej biednej duszy. Słuchaj, nie byłem… całkowicie "
"poważny w kwestii chęci pójścia z tobą, ale jeśli uda ci się przekonać innych "
"do podróży, to chyba również pójdę razem z tobą."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Hey there, friend."
msgstr "Witaj, przyjacielu."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Well now, that's quite a kind offer, and I appreciate you looking past my "
"full-body pubic hair.  Sorry though.  I've come to feel sort of responsible "
"for this little gaggle of squatters.  As long as I'm the only one providing "
"for them, I don't think I can leave."
msgstr ""
"No cóż, to miła uchu oferta, i cieszę się, że nie odstręczają cię moje włosy "
"łonowe na całym ciele. Ale wybacz mi. Stałem się niejako odpowiedzialny za tą "
"zgraję dzikich lokatorów. Dopóki jestem jedyny, który zapewnia im "
"przetrwanie, nie sądzę abym mógł ot tak odejść."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Aleesha_Seward.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"*seems impossibly young at first glance, her dark face nervous when she sees "
"you looking her way.  On closer inspection as you approach, you see that she "
"is likely in her early teens, but the contrast to the weary faces around "
"makes her age stand out.  \"Oh, uh… hi.  You look new.  I'm Aleesha.\""
msgstr ""
"*Wydaje się być niemożliwie młoda na pierwszy rzut oka, jej ciemna twarz "
"spina się, gdy na nią spoglądasz. Przyglądając się bliżej, gdy podchodzisz, "
"widzisz, że jest najpewniej we wczesnych latach nastoletnich, ale kontrast z "
"innymi zmęczonymi twarzami wokoło wyróżnia jej wiek. „Och, ęę… Hej. Nowa "
"twarz. Jestem Aleesha”."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Aleesha_Seward.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "You're back, and still alive!  Whoa."
msgstr "Wróciłeś i wciąż żyjesz! Hurra."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"*leans casually against the brick wall of the shelter.  \"Hello again, "
"gorgeous\""
msgstr "*Opiera się o ceglany mur schronu bez niechcenia. „Witaj ponownie, piękna”"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Yo, you're crazy hot!  I'm not stupid!"
msgstr "Joł, jesteś szalenie gorący! Nie jestem głupi!"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Well, well.  You are back."
msgstr "No, no. Witam z powrotem."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "So, you have survived."
msgstr "Więc, udało ci się przetrwać."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Well, well.  I'm glad you are back."
msgstr "No, no. Cieszę się z twojego powrotu."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "It is good to see you again, my friend."
msgstr "Dobrze ciebie ponownie widzieć, przyjacielu."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Hello, my friend."
msgstr "Witaj, przyjacielu."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Yes, my friend.  You have done so much for me, I would be glad to teach you "
"what I can.  I must ask a small amount in trade, for materials.  I hope you "
"understand."
msgstr ""
"Tak, mój przyjacielu. Zrobiłeś dla mnie tak wiele, że z chęcią nauczę cię "
"tego, co potrafię. Muszę poprosić o niewielką zapłatę w zamian za materiały. "
"Mam nadzieję, że to zrozumiesz."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Have you had a problem with memory, friend?  I was the one who asked you "
"this, I thought I explained why I could not."
msgstr ""
"Czy masz kłopoty z pamięcią, przyjacielu? To ja cię o to pytałem, myślałem, "
"że wyjaśniłem, dlaczego nie mogę."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Hmm, well it is not ideal but I appreciate you trying and being willing to "
"help.  I will have to do my best despite the bad memories.  Thank you, my "
"friend."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Thank you for trying, my friend.  With you and me that will be five, I will "
"do my best to be strong and assist in the cleanup."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"That is quite alright, four should be enough though I appreciate your offer.  "
"Four people will make the job much easier and I will do my best even if it is "
"painful.  My thanks, friend."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Have you heard anything back from the ranch about jobs yet?"
msgstr "Czy otrzymałeś już jakieś wieści z rancza na temat pracy?"

