#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Seen any good movies lately?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Are you one of them?"
msgstr "Czy jesteś jednym z nich?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "So you're back… explain yourself!"
msgstr "Więc wróciłeś… wytłumacz się!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "You're not ready for this."
msgstr "Nie jesteś na to gotów."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "What about: you prove your worth and join me as my sidekick?"
msgstr "Co ty na to: udowodnij swoją wartość i przyłącz się do mnie jako pomocnik?"

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/confused_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"I barely understand what's going on *now*.  Why do you think I'd know how the "
"world ended?"
msgstr ""
"Ledwie rozumiem, co się dzieje *teraz*. Dlaczego sądzisz, że wiedziałbym, jak "
"skończył się świat?"

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_5.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"You ever see the Matrix?  This is it.  In real life.  To keep us locked in "
"here, the creators of the simulation have to make sure we're just the right "
"level of miserable.  I think their algorithms got messed up though, and went "
"into overdrive, because all this is a little implausible.  Still, I guess "
"we're still jacked in, so maybe it's working."
msgstr ""
"Oglądałeś kiedyś Matriksa? To jest to. W prawdziwym życiu. Aby nas tu "
"zamknąć, twórcy symulacji muszą się upewnić, że jesteśmy na odpowiednim "
"poziomie nieszczęścia. Myślę, że ich algorytmy się pomieszały i poszły na "
"łatwiznę, bo to wszystko jest trochę nieprawdopodobne. Mimo to, chyba nadal "
"jesteśmy podłączeni do gniazdka, więc może to działa."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/fema_evacuee_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Woof, you ready for a real hot take?  The <freaking> government did this to "
"us.  Intentionally, or at least sort-of intentionally."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"I suppose that's true.  Still not a very nice way to break the news to "
"someone you accidentally robbed…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"I've been trying not to think about it, but you could be right.  The more "
"that I see, the less I can explain.  I don't know why humans would want this, "
"but if you're a brain-sucking alien, this is the place to be."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"You're right, but I still think there's something bigger out there.  "
"Something evil.  It doesn't matter whether science can explain it because we "
"damn sure don't seem capable of defeating it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/scavenger_merc_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"No dice.  You asked me to come along.  This is what you get.  If you don't "
"like it, I'll take my fee and go back to the center.  Ain't hard to find "
"contracts."
msgstr ""
"Nie ma mowy. Chciałeś bym się z tobą zabrał. Masz co chciałeś. Jak ci to nie "
"pasuje, biorę opłatę i wracam do centrum. Nie tak trudno znaleźć kontrakt."

#: data/json/npcs/EOC_talkers/portal_storm.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"You are limited.  Here outside there are no limits.  I could free you from "
"your bonds.  Or bring you halfway here to get a taste."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/EOC_talkers/portal_storm.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Language is too weak to describe it.  You are too limited to understand "
"freedom yet.  What is mortality when time is a choice?  What is weakness when "
"limits are an illusion?  What is up when there is no down, wrong when there "
"is no right?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/EOC_talkers/portal_storm.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"There is no me.  I don't exist yet, but time is a lie.  The barriers are weak "
"and your presence is potent enough to reflect.  I am the you that said yes."
msgstr ""

