#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Thank you for trying, my friend.  With you and me that will be five, I will "
"do my best to be strong and assist in the cleanup."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"That is quite alright, four should be enough though I appreciate your offer.  "
"Four people will make the job much easier and I will do my best even if it is "
"painful.  My thanks, friend."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Dana_Nunez.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Have you heard anything back from the ranch about jobs yet?"
msgstr "Czy otrzymałeś już jakieś wieści z rancza na temat pracy?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Always good to see you, friend."
msgstr "Zawsze miło cię widzieć, przyjacielu."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "My savior!  My patron of the arts!  You're always welcome here, friend."
msgstr "Mój bohater! Mój mecenas sztuki! Zawsze jesteś tu mile widziany przyjacielu."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Where you say you're from again?  You're not as worldly as you look.  I'm "
"talking about weed.  Marijuana.  Wondered if you've happened upon any."
msgstr ""
"A więc skąd mówisz, że pochodzisz? Nie jesteś taki światowy, na jakiego "
"wyglądasz. Mówię o trawce. Marihuana. Zastanawiałem się, czy trafiłeś na "
"jakąś."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Sold!  Thanks for helping me out, friend."
msgstr "Sprzedane! Dzięki za pomoc, przyjacielu."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Sure thing, friend!  Let's see how you can move to this one."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Oh my, am I dealing with a professional dancer here?  Sweet moves, friend."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Daym.  You're probably the best dancer I've ever had the honor of meeting.  "
"Well done.  Well done indeed."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Fatima_Al_Jadir.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Sure, I could teach you the basics, it'll cost you merch though.  Since you "
"helped me out, I can shave a bit off the price, let's say 4 merch, plus a bit "
"in trade depending on how in-depth you're looking for?"
msgstr ""
"Jasne, mogę cię nauczyć podstaw, ale to będzie cię kosztować kwity. Skoro mi "
"pomogłeś, mogę trochę zejść z ceny, powiedzmy 4 kwity, plus trochę w towarze, "
"w zależności od tego, jak bardzo chcesz się zagłębić w temat?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"&\"Holy shit, what are the odds?  OK, stand back and hold on.\"  Jenny begins "
"peppering you with questions, which you answer to the best of your ability.  "
"She seems quite satisfied.  \"Well, I can't thank you enough,\" she smiles "
"after a few minutes.  \"You probably just saved me weeks of reinventing the "
"wheel.  Here, it's not much but it's all I've got.\"  She hands you a bundle "
"of the local currency."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Things are coming along.  I have a lot of studying to do before I know how to "
"fix my design issues, but the book you brought definitely has everything I "
"need.  Now that I've got some progress to show, administration is much more "
"willing to help me get the parts I need.  You've been a great gofer, but I "
"can probably handle the rest on my own.  Check back in a week or two!"
msgstr ""
"Sprawy idą do przodu. Muszę jeszcze sporo przestudiować, zanim będę wiedział, "
"jak rozwiązać problemy z moim projektem, ale książka, którą przyniosłeś, "
"zawiera wszystko, czego potrzebuję. Teraz, kiedy mogę pochwalić się jakimiś "
"postępami, administracja jest znacznie bardziej skłonna pomóc mi w zdobyciu "
"potrzebnych części. Byłeś świetnym pomocnikiem, ale z resztą pewnie poradzę "
"sobie sam. Odwiedź nas za tydzień lub dwa!"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_John_Clemens.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"*turns to look at you, lifting an enormous cowboy hat off his eyes.  He "
"appears to be in the process of growing out a set of bushy muttonchops and a "
"handlebar mustache.  Bright blue eyes peer out from his wrinkled face.  "
"\"Howdy, pardner.  They call me Clemens.  John Clemens.  I'm an ol' cowhand.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_John_Clemens.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"*tips his cowboy hat and sets his feet far apart as he faces you.  \"Howdy, "
"pardner.\""
msgstr ""
"*Uchyla kapelusza kowbojskiego i stawia stopy daleko od siebie, stając przed "
"tobą. ”Siema, kolego”."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Mangalpreet_Singh.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"*is a well-kept middle aged woman with dark hair tied back in a long braid.  "
"She looks surprised as you approach.  \"Ah!  You are new.  I'm sorry, I'm "
"Mangalpreet.\""
msgstr ""
"*Jest to zadbana kobieta w średnim wieku, z ciemnymi włosami związanymi w "
"długi warkocz. Wygląda na zaskoczoną, gdy podchodzisz. „Ach! Jesteś nowy. "
"Przepraszam, jestem Mangalpreet”."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "*peers at you for a while before speaking.  \"Oh, you're back.\""
msgstr "*Przez chwilę wpatruje się w ciebie, zanim zacznie mówić. „Och, wróciłeś”."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard3.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "You're new here, who the hell put you up to this crap?"
msgstr "Jesteś tu nowy, kto u diabła wepchnął cię w to gówno?"

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "As if you're one to talk.  Screw You."
msgstr "Tak jakbyś miał coś do gadania. Pieprz się."

#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Screw You!"
msgstr "Pieprz się!"

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Surprise!\"  They do jazz hands.  \"Sorry.  Well, I'm told that I'm part of a "
"small group right now.  Maybe you were the first."
msgstr ""
"Niespodzianka!”. Rozkłada ręce w zdziwieniu. „Przepraszam. Powiedziano mi, że "
"należę teraz do małej grupy. Może ty byłeś pierwszy."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Yeah.  Have you noticed how they pay us in these tiny little gold coins?\"  "
"Cranberry holds one up for emphasis.  \"It's bizarre.  You'd think they have "
"a gold mine in there, but no, they don't, so they make me cross the damn "
"world grabbing gold bars.  As far as scrip goes, it seems inconvenient as "
"hell to make."
msgstr ""
"Tak. Czy zauważyłeś, że płacą nam w tych małych złotych monetach?”. Cranberry "
"trzyma jedną w górze dla podkreślenia. „To jest dziwaczne. Można by pomyśleć, "
"że mają tam kopalnię złota, ale nie, nie mają, więc każą mi przemierzać ten "
"cholerny świat, łapiąc sztabki złota. Jeśli chodzi o monety, to ich produkcja "
"wydaje się cholernie niewygodna."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Have you ever noticed how… wait no, never mind."
msgstr "Czy zauważyliście kiedyś, jak… chwila, nie, nieważne."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Hey, did you notice that there's working wi-fi here?  Not that anything else "
"is online anymore, but still."
msgstr ""
"Hej, czy zauważyłeś, że działa tu wi-fi? Nie żeby cokolwiek innego było już "
"online, ale jednak."

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_DOCTOR.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Augustmoon_Salvors/augustmoon_doctor.json
