msgid "Now try not to do whatever you did again.  No, don't tell me more."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Good thing you came back with the money.  Your mission work out?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Take it easy now.  Wouldn't want you coming back here too soon."
msgstr "Spokojnie. Nie chcę, żebyś wrócił tu zbyt wcześnie."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_generic.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Have you asked the scavenger boss if they'd have anything?"
msgstr "Czy pytałeś szefa zbieraczy, czy mają coś do zaoferowania?"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Dana_Tacoma.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"*stands in the middle of a cramped kitchen, covered in flour.  The scene "
"looks reminiscent of easier times, but the illusion is broken as he apron "
"shifts to reveal a heavy machete and holstered pistol on  her belt.  She "
"looks up as you approach, then beams in recognition.  \"Welcome to Dana's "
"Bakery, stranger!\"  She laughs brightly.  \"Glad you made out this way.  "
"What can I do for you?\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Seriously?  You've already done so much.  I won't say no, though."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Seen any good movies lately?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Are you one of them?"
msgstr "Czy jesteś jednym z nich?"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "So you're back… explain yourself!"
msgstr "Więc wróciłeś… wytłumacz się!"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "You're not ready for this."
msgstr "Nie jesteś na to gotów."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "What about: you prove your worth and join me as my sidekick?"
msgstr "Co ty na to: udowodnij swoją wartość i przyłącz się do mnie jako pomocnik?"

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/confused_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"I barely understand what's going on *now*.  Why do you think I'd know how the "
"world ended?"
msgstr ""
"Ledwie rozumiem, co się dzieje *teraz*. Dlaczego sądzisz, że wiedziałbym, jak "
"skończył się świat?"

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_5.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"You ever see the Matrix?  This is it.  In real life.  To keep us locked in "
"here, the creators of the simulation have to make sure we're just the right "
"level of miserable.  I think their algorithms got messed up though, and went "
"into overdrive, because all this is a little implausible.  Still, I guess "
"we're still jacked in, so maybe it's working."
msgstr ""
"Oglądałeś kiedyś Matriksa? To jest to. W prawdziwym życiu. Aby nas tu "
"zamknąć, twórcy symulacji muszą się upewnić, że jesteśmy na odpowiednim "
"poziomie nieszczęścia. Myślę, że ich algorytmy się pomieszały i poszły na "
"łatwiznę, bo to wszystko jest trochę nieprawdopodobne. Mimo to, chyba nadal "
"jesteśmy podłączeni do gniazdka, więc może to działa."

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/fema_evacuee_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Woof, you ready for a real hot take?  The <freaking> government did this to "
"us.  Intentionally, or at least sort-of intentionally."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"I suppose that's true.  Still not a very nice way to break the news to "
"someone you accidentally robbed…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"I've been trying not to think about it, but you could be right.  The more "
"that I see, the less I can explain.  I don't know why humans would want this, "
"but if you're a brain-sucking alien, this is the place to be."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"You're right, but I still think there's something bigger out there.  "
"Something evil.  It doesn't matter whether science can explain it because we "
"damn sure don't seem capable of defeating it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/scavenger_merc_1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"No dice.  You asked me to come along.  This is what you get.  If you don't "
"like it, I'll take my fee and go back to the center.  Ain't hard to find "
"contracts."
msgstr ""
"Nie ma mowy. Chciałeś bym się z tobą zabrał. Masz co chciałeś. Jak ci to nie "
"pasuje, biorę opłatę i wracam do centrum. Nie tak trudno znaleźć kontrakt."

#: data/json/npcs/EOC_talkers/portal_storm.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"You are limited.  Here outside there are no limits.  I could free you from "
"your bonds.  Or bring you halfway here to get a taste."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/EOC_talkers/portal_storm.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Language is too weak to describe it.  You are too limited to understand "
"freedom yet.  What is mortality when time is a choice?  What is weakness when "
"limits are an illusion?  What is up when there is no down, wrong when there "
"is no right?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/EOC_talkers/portal_storm.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"There is no me.  I don't exist yet, but time is a lie.  The barriers are weak "
"and your presence is potent enough to reflect.  I am the you that said yes."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Kindred/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Traveler."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Kindred/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "You're back.  Have you come to listen to the song?"
msgstr "Wróciłeś. Przychodzisz posłuchać pieśni?"

#: data/json/npcs/Kindred/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Your mind is open.  More than most.  Perhaps one day, you too will feel the "
"power of the song and become Kindred.  For now, traveler, listen, listen and "
"feel the song."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Kindred/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "I see.  And you live still.  Does that mean you managed to stop him?"
msgstr "Rozumiem. I nadal żyjesz. Czy to znaczy, że zdołałaś go powstrzymać?"

#: data/json/npcs/Kindred/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"It saddens me to see a talented Kindred lose his way so greatly, but I take "
"solace in the fact that you are unscathed."
msgstr ""
"Smutno mi patrzeć, jak utalentowany Przebudzony tak bardzo gubi swoją "
"ścieżkę, ale pocieszam się faktem, że nic ci się nie stało."

#: data/json/npcs/Kindred/NPC_Darren_Cooper.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"How do you do.  Name's Cooper.  What's your- wait… that's the Mark of the "
"Seer on your hand.  You're Kindred.  So I guess you know who I am, then."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/Kindred/NPC_Darren_Cooper.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"And how many people have you killed?  Maybe it was in self defense, maybe "
"because you wanted their gear.  It's all the same.  I give their death "
"meaning.  I hate that I have to do it, I truly do, but you really must "
"understand, there is no other way.  The sooner I finish my mission, the "
"sooner all this madness can end."
msgstr ""
"A ilu ludzi zabiłeś? Może w obronie własnej, może dlatego, że chciałeś ich "
"sprzęt. To bez różnicy. Nadaję ich śmierci sens. Nienawidzę tego, że muszę to "
"robić, naprawdę, ale musisz zrozumieć, że nie ma innej drogi. Im szybciej "
"zakończę swoją misję, tym szybciej skończy się całe to szaleństwo."

#: data/json/npcs/Kindred/NPC_Darren_Cooper.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"You're like me then, Kindred.  I'm glad I'm not the only one who realizes "
"what's necessary.  Perhaps one day, we'll be able to work together, but what "
"I do now, I must do alone."
msgstr ""
"Więc jesteś taki jak ja, Przebudzony. Cieszę się, że nie jestem jedynym, "
"który zdaje sobie sprawę z tego, co jest konieczne. Być może pewnego dnia "
"będziemy mogli pracować razem, ale to, co robię teraz, muszę robić sam."

#: data/json/npcs/Kindred/NPC_Darren_Cooper.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"You're Kindred, and yet you question the power the bones hold, the Song "
"itself?  This hypocrisy is why I set off on my own.  Stop wasting my time and "
"get out of my way."
msgstr ""
"Jesteś Przebudzonym, a mimo to kwestionujesz moc kości, samą Pieśń? Ta "
"hipokryzja jest powodem, dla którego wyruszyłem na własną rękę. Przestań "
"marnować mój czas i zejdź mi z drogi."

#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Did you find them, <name_g>?"
msgstr "Znalazłeś ich, <name_g>?"

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
