#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "You just asked me for stuff; ask later."
msgstr "Dopiero mnie pytałeś o sprzęt. Zapytaj później."

#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_FRIEND_CONVERSATION.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Are you sure?  This doesn't seem like a particularly safe place for small "
"talk…"
msgstr "Jesteś pewien? To nie wygląda na zbyt bezpieczne miejsce na plotkowanie…"

#: data/json/npcs/exodii/exodii_merchant_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Forgot sommat?"
msgstr "Zapōmniołś czegoś?"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Arturo_Maldonado.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Yeah, just that I sometimes see things.  I wanna be sure you're real."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Arturo_Maldonado.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"I see things sometimes, and there's no way anyone could look like you!  I "
"know you're not real, and if you are, stay away you ugly <name_b>!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Chloe_Taylor_King.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"You're creepy.  I'm sorry for your lack of friends but, like, I'm literally a "
"kid.  Everyone on Earth turned into a zombie, we're running out of toilet "
"paper and everything, and my parents are gone.  I know they're still alive "
"and they're looking for me.  I miss them.  Is that enough personal stuff for "
"you?"
msgstr ""
"Jesteś straszny. Przykro mi z powodu braku przyjaciół, ale jestem dosłownie "
"dzieckiem. Wszyscy na Ziemi zamienili się w zombie, kończy nam się papier "
"toaletowy i w ogóle, a moi rodzice zniknęli. Wiem, że jeszcze żyją i mnie "
"szukają. Tęsknię za nimi. Czy to wystarczająca ilość osobistych spraw dla "
"ciebie?"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "What the hell are you, sinner?  Get away from me."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Nice to see you again, survivor."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Well I'll be damned, a fellow survivor!  I'm Darryl, nice to meet you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Well, you got me there.  I sure ain't one to block a fellow farmer's right to "
"reclaim this God-given earth."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Gemma_Johnstone.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "The Lord isn't with you, and that's obvious.  Get out of my sight, sinner."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Gemma_Johnstone.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"It's nice to meet you too, survivor.  It's a tragedy what's become of the New "
"England Church Community, perhaps it'll flourish again someday."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Get away from here, sinner, we don't want your kind here."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "I'm glad you could make it here.  May the Lord have mercy on you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Jane_Schulz.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Always nice to meet a fellow outsider.  How can I help you?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Julian_Ray.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"You sure?  I mean, you've been traveling for a long time, haven't you?  "
"Alright, it's your decision.  Let me know when you changed your mind."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Oh well, yet another sinner.  Don't talk to me."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Oh well, yet another survivor.  Welcome to our group, I'm Katherine."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"You must be new here, nice to meet you.  They call me Kostas, I'm the local "
"herbalist."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Alright, you've convinced me.  I'll take Jeremiah on and show him the ropes."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Sonia_Greene.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Well now, good to see you again, friend."
msgstr "Cóż, dobrze cię znowu widzieć, przyjacielu."

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Ah, another survivor!  I hope you come in peace.  I'm Tom, nice to meet you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "I got my rights to be here, chum.  Squatter's rights!"
msgstr "Mam swoje prawa do bycia tutaj, chłopie. Prawa dzikiego lokatora!"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"That ain't the point here, chum.  Don'tcha get it?  This was MY territory, "
"but they took it away from me.  Now they think of us as nothin' but a "
"<freaking> nuisance."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Ha ha ha!  Think before you speak, chum.  Eight icons for an honest day's "
"work, I say the system's broken!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Ain't you heard it?  It's been screeching out in the forest during the night "
"for a while now, keeps me up sometimes.  I'm too scared to go out and see "
"what that thing is.  If you'd kill it, I'd be in your debt forever."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"After what you did for me, I'll follow you to the ends of the Earth!  No one "
"around here's stood up for me like that, I owe ya one."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/cook.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Hello stranger, I don't think we've met before.  Its nice to meet you, name's "
"Simon."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_GUARD_PREDATORY.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Ah, a rich man I see.  I think you have yourself a deal."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/Isherwood_Rescue_NPC_Duplicates.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Barry!  Oh my god, you found him!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/Isherwood_Rescue_NPC_Duplicates.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"*eyes you up and down with a nervous smile.  \"I almost didn't expect you to "
"show up.\"  He hesitates, letting out a soft laugh.  \"That sounds bad.  I "
"just mean, I can't really believe we're doing this.  Thank you… for doing "
"this.  You ready to get Uncle Barry?\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
", looking at your marshal badge immediately.  \"You said you'd keep that "
"goddamn piece of tin out of my sight.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"I see you took the badge off.  Fine, then, but you'd better not let anyone "
"here know you've got ties to the Marshals.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"*nods slowly.  \"I understand.  You tried.  We could maybe… no, nevermind.  "
"Time is important here, we can't spend forever hoping to get everything in "
"place if we want to get Uncle Barry back alive.  Let's do it without the "
"gear.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Hello traveler, what brings you here?"
msgstr "Witaj wędrowcze, co cię tu sprowadza?"

#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Hey, who the fuck are you?  I haven't seen you 'round.  Ah, fuck it, it "
"doesn't matter.\n"
"Here's the rules.  The first and most important one: ALWAYS CLOSE THE FUCKING "
"ENTRY DOOR BEHIND YOUR ASS!  If you're okay with that, the following rules "
"are: don't fuck with us, don't steal from us, don't start a fight without a "
"reason with someone from us.  Got it, punk?  Now get lost."
msgstr ""
"Hej, a kim ty kurwa jesteś? Nie widziałem cię w okolicy. Ah, pieprzyć to, to "
"nie ma znaczenia.\n"
"Oto zasady. Pierwsza i najważniejsza: ZAWSZE ZAMYKAJ TE CHOLERNE DRZWI "
"WEJŚCIOWE ZA SWOJĄ DUPĄ! Jeśli się z tym pogodzisz, to kolejne zasady są "
"następujące: nie zadzieraj z nami, nie okradaj nas, nie wszczynaj bójki bez "
"powodu z kimkolwiek od nas. Zrozumiałeś, głąbie? A teraz spadaj."

#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Are you deaf or stupid?  I said I don't give a fuck for you and your "
"<freaking> problems.  Bother me one more time, and you'll regret that.  Get "
"outta my sight."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "You think you're immortal, huh, <name_b>?"
msgstr "Myślisz, że jesteś nieśmiertelny, hę, <name_b>?"

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "You look like you haven't eaten in days."
msgstr "Wyglądasz, jakbyś nie jadła od kilku dni."

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_fabricate.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Sure.  After what you did for me, I'd equip an army for you.  I'll need some "
"money to negotiate with the caravans and scavengers that come by.  What level "
"of protection are you thinking?  I can do 2mm, 4mm, and 6mm suits depending "
"on how much you want to resemble a tank, or I can make you a suit of "
"chainmail instead if you want a little more flexibility.  Materials costs are "
"300 merch to pay for the food I need to do the labor plus 100 merch per 2mm "
"or 50 merch for the chainmail.  Whatever I save in non-scaling bits like the "
"chain and leather, I get gouged in looking for so much bulk metal."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_fabricate.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Yeah; the designs you showed me call for 'em.  Not sure what they are myself, "
"but the pictures are real descriptive about how to use them.  To make "
"anything, I'll need one of each of those wire kits.  Got any?"
msgstr ""
"Tak, projekty, które mi pokazałeś, wymagają ich użycia. Sam nie jestem pewna, "
"co to jest, ale na zdjęciach jest opisany sposób ich użycia. Aby zrobić "
"cokolwiek, będę potrzebowała po jednym z tych zestawów przewodów. Masz jakieś?"

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_fabricate.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Thanks, sugar!  If you ever have me make some armor, just let me know if you "
"want me to use these in it."
msgstr ""
"Dzięki, cukiereczku! Jeśli kiedykolwiek będziesz mnie prosić o zrobienie "
"zbroi, daj mi znać, czy chcesz, żebym je w niej wykorzystał."

#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_weaponsmith.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Sure.  After what you've done for me, I'll forge you the finest work of art.  "
"The price and waiting time depend on the size of the weapon in question, but "
"it will take me a fair amount of money to buy the quality steel I need from "
"the scavengers, and even forging a short blade will take a few days.\n"
"\n"
"I can also temper your weapon, but that will cost an additional 50 merch and "
"take an additional 2 days, but I assure you, it's worth it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_GUN_STORE_SURVIVOR.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
